(185, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI for business analysis\"}', 'ai-for-business-analysis', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-01-2026/How-AI-Will-Affect-Business-Analysis-In-2024-Blog.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-01-2026/How-AI-Will-Affect-Business-Analysis-In-2024-Blog.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<div><p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(73, 80, 87); flex-shrink: 0; width: 1154.4px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 12px; padding-left: 24px; direction: ltr; position: relative;\\\">Master AI-driven data analysis techniques to uncover actionable business insights and improve decision-making processes using AI tools and algorithms<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(73, 80, 87); flex-shrink: 0; width: 1154.4px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 12px; padding-left: 24px; direction: ltr; position: relative;\\\">Apply machine learning models to predict market trends, customer behavior, and operational outcomes for strategic planning and competitive advantage<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(73, 80, 87); flex-shrink: 0; width: 1154.4px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 12px; padding-left: 24px; direction: ltr; position: relative;\\\">Utilize natural language processing (NLP) to analyze customer feedback, reviews, and social media data for enhanced customer insights and sentiment analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(73, 80, 87); flex-shrink: 0; width: 1154.4px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 12px; padding-left: 24px; direction: ltr; position: relative;\\\">Create dynamic AI-powered dashboards with Power BI, Tableau, and Python libraries to automate reporting, visualization, and real-time data monitoring<\\/p><p style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87); flex: 0 0 50%; width: 569.333px; max-width: 50%; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; direction: ltr; position: relative; min-height: 1px; -webkit-box-flex: 0;\\\"><\\/p><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" 