6px;\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1041\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\" style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\\\">Basic computer skills (using a browser, email, files)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(101, 106, 123); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1099\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\" style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\\\">Curiosity to learn new technology<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1135\\\" data-end=\\\"1182\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(101, 106, 123); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1137\\\" data-end=\\\"1182\\\" style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\\\">Access to a laptop or desktop with internet<\\/p><\\/li><p style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\\\"><\\/p><li data-start=\\\"1183\\\" data-end=\\\"1231\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(101, 106, 123); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1185\\\" data-end=\\\"1231\\\" style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\\\">Willingness to practice with simple AI tools<\\/p><\\/li>\"}', '{\"en\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 126, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(186, NULL, NULL, 18, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 19, '{\"en\":\"Motion Design Workflow Tutorial: From Idea to Animation\"}', 'motion-design-workflow-tutorial-from-idea-to-animation', NULL, '210', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-01-2026/1233.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-01-2026/1233.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"264\\\" data-end=\\\"487\\\">This course teaches you the <strong data-start=\\\"292\\\" data-end=\\\"327\\\">complete motion design workflow<\\/strong>, step by step—from concept to final animation.<br data-start=\\\"374\\\" data-end=\\\"377\\\">\\r\\nYou’ll learn how professional motion designers plan, design, animate, and deliver motion projects efficiently.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"489\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">The focus is on <strong data-start=\\\"505\\\" data-end=\\\"529\\\">process and workflow<\\/strong>, not just tools. You’ll understand how to move from ideas and storyboards to clean animations using industry-standard practices.<br data-start=\\\"658\\\" data-end=\\\"661\\\">\\r\\nPerfect for beginners who want a <strong data-start=\\\"694\\\" data-end=\\\"710\\\">clear system<\\/strong> to create motion graphics without confusion.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-01-21 23:45:31', '2026-06-19 18:33:15', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<li data-start=\\\"1285\\\" data-end=\\\"1331\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1287\\\" data-end=\\\"1331\\\">No prior motion design experience required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1332\\\" data-end=\\\"1360\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1334\\\" data-end=\\\"1360\\\">Basic computer knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1361\\\" data-end=\\\"1391\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1363\\\" data-end=\\\"1391\\\">Laptop or desktop computer<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1392\\\" data-end=\\\"1463\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1394\\\" data-end=\\\"1463\\\">Adobe After Effects (basic familiarity is helpful but not required)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><li data-start=\\\"1464\\\" data-end=\\\"1513\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1466\\\" data-end=\\\"1513\\\">Interest in animation and visual storytelling<\\/p><\\/li>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<h2 data-start=\\\"762\\\" data-end=\\\"805\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(52, 58, 64);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">What You’ll Learn <\\/span><\\/h2><p data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-end=\\\"853\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">By the end of this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\"><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"855\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\"><li data-start=\\\"855\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\"><p data-start=\\\"857\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Understand the <span data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"903\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">full motion design workflow<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"906\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\"><p data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Plan motion projects using <span data-start=\\\"935\\\" data-end=\\\"972\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">ideas, references, and moodboards<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"975\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\"><p data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Create <span data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"1016\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">storyboards and style frames<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1068\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1021\\\" data-end=\\\"1068\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Prepare design assets correctly for animation<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1137\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1071\\\" data-end=\\\"1137\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Animate smoothly using <span data-start=\\\"1094\\\" data-end=\\\"1135\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">timing, easing, and motion principles<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1138\\\" data-end=\\\"1187\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1140\\\" data-end=\\\"1187\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Organize files and layers like a professional<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1188\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1190\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Export motion designs for <span data-start=\\\"1216\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">social media, web, and video<br><br><br><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 162, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(187, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16, 19, '{\"en\":\"C++ Programming for Beginners: Learn C++ from Scratch\"}', 'c-programming-for-beginners-learn-c-from-scratch', NULL, '310', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-01-2026/download (14).jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-01-2026/download (14).jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"270\\\" data-end=\\\"470\\\">This course is a <strong data-start=\\\"287\\\" data-end=\\\"348\\\">step-by-step introduction to the C++ programming language<\\/strong> designed for absolute beginners. You will learn how C++ works, how to write programs, and how to think like a programmer.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"472\\\" data-end=\\\"698\\\">The course starts with <strong data-start=\\\"495\\\" data-end=\\\"525\\\">basic programming concepts<\\/strong> and gradually moves to <strong data-start=\\\"549\\\" data-end=\\\"580\\\">object-oriented programming<\\/strong>, helping learners build a strong foundation for software development, competitive programming, and technical careers.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"700\\\" data-end=\\\"850\\\">By the end of the course, you will be able to <strong data-start=\\\"746\\\" data-end=\\\"774\\\">write clean C++ programs<\\/strong>, solve basic problems, and confidently move to advanced programming topics.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-01-31 18:08:08', '2026-06-20 05:25:04', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<li data-start=\\\"1333\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1335\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">No prior programming experience required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1378\\\" data-end=\\\"1406\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1380\\\" data-end=\\\"1406\\\">Basic computer knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1407\\\" data-end=\\\"1437\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1409\\\" data-end=\\\"1437\\\">Laptop or desktop computer<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1438\\\" data-end=\\\"1486\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1440\\\" data-