and digital platforms<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1173\\\"><br><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1173\\\"><br><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 118, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(196, NULL, NULL, 18, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 19, '{\"en\":\"Figma Prototyping Basics: Create Interactive UI Designs\"}', 'figma-prototyping-basics-create-interactive-ui-designs', NULL, '1000', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-02-2026/f1988ead692e1ef18ecbb6b16394ae7b.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-02-2026/f1988ead692e1ef18ecbb6b16394ae7b.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"247\\\" data-end=\\\"409\\\">This course is a <strong data-start=\\\"264\\\" data-end=\\\"319\\\">beginner-friendly introduction to Figma prototyping<\\/strong>. You will learn how to turn static UI designs into <strong data-start=\\\"371\\\" data-end=\\\"408\\\">interactive, clickable prototypes<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"411\\\" data-end=\\\"680\\\">The course focuses on understanding <strong data-start=\\\"447\\\" data-end=\\\"512\\\">frames, components, interactions, transitions, and user flows<\\/strong> using Figma’s built-in prototyping tools.<br data-start=\\\"554\\\" data-end=\\\"557\\\">\\r\\nBy the end of this course, you will be able to create <strong data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"650\\\">professional interactive prototypes<\\/strong> for websites and mobile apps.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"682\\\" data-end=\\\"793\\\">Perfect for beginners who want to learn <strong data-start=\\\"722\\\" data-end=\\\"792\\\">how real product designers present ideas to clients and developers<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-02-18 15:39:05', '2026-06-14 04:12:45', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<li data-start=\\\"1331\\\" data-end=\\\"1369\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1333\\\" data-end=\\\"1369\\\">No prior Figma experience required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1370\\\" data-end=\\\"1398\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1372\\\" data-end=\\\"1398\\\">Basic computer knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1399\\\" data-end=\\\"1429\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1401\\\" data-end=\\\"1429\\\">Laptop or desktop computer<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1430\\\" data-end=\\\"1452\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1432\\\" data-end=\\\"1452\\\">Free Figma account<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1453\\\" data-end=\\\"1481\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1455\\\" data-end=\\\"1481\\\">Interest in UI\\/UX design<\\/p><\\/li>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<h2 data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"841\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">What You’ll Learn&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/h2><p data-start=\\\"843\\\" data-end=\\\"893\\\">After completing this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"895\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\">\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"895\\\" data-end=\\\"949\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"897\\\" data-end=\\\"949\\\">Understand <strong data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"947\\\">what prototyping is in UI\\/UX design<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"950\\\" data-end=\\\"990\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"952\\\" data-end=\\\"990\\\">Create clickable prototypes in Figma<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">Use <strong data-start=\\\"997\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\">frames, components, and auto layout<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1098\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1041\\\" data-end=\\\"1098\\\">Add interactions like <strong data-start=\\\"1063\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\">hover, click, and transitions<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1099\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1101\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">Create smooth <strong data-start=\\\"1115\\\" data-end=\\\"1149\\\">page navigation and animations<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1152\\\" data-end=\\\"1196\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1154\\\" data-end=\\\"1196\\\">Build user flows for mobile and web apps<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1197\\\" data-end=\\\"1245\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1245\\\">Present prototypes professionally to clients<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1246\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1248\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\">Share prototype links for testing and feedback<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1248\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\"><br><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1248\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\"><br><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 104, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(197, NULL, NULL, 18, 0, NULL, NULL, 16, 19, '{\"en\":\"UX Design for Beginners\"}', 'ux-design-for-beginners', NULL, '120', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-03-2026/Digihub - Digital marketing app.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-03-2026/Digihub - Digital marketing app.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"260\\\" data-end=\\\"439\\\">This course is a <strong data-start=\\\"277\\\" data-end=\\\"344\\\">complete beginner’s introduction to User Experience (UX) Design<\\/strong>. You will learn how to design digital products that are easy, useful, and enjoyable for users.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"441\\\" data-end=\\\"719\\\">The course focuses on <strong data-start=\\\"463\\\" data-end=\\\"540\\\">understanding users, solving problems, and creating user-friendly designs<\\/strong> through research, wireframing, and testing.<br data-start=\\\"584\\\" data-end=\\\"587\\\">\\r\\nBy the end of the course, you will be able to design a <strong data-start=\\\"642\\\" data-end=\\\"668\\\">complete UX case study<\\/strong> and understand how professional UX designers work.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-04 20:28:59', '2026-06-19 23:28:30', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<li data-start=\\\"1214\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1216\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\">No prior UX experience required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1250\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1252\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">Basic computer knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1279\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1281\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">Laptop or desktop computer<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1310\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1312\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">Free Figma account (recommended)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"1347\\\" data-end=\\\"1389\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1349\\\" data-end=\\\"1389\\\">Interest in problem-solving and design<\\/p><\\/li>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<h2 data-start=\\\"726\\\" data-end=\\\"767\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(52, 58, 64);\\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">What You’ll Learn&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/h2><p data-start=\\\"769\\\" data-end=\\\"819\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">After completing this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\"><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"821\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\"><li data-start=\\\"821\\\" data-end=\\\"876\\\"><p data-start=\\\"823\\\" data-end=\\\"876\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Understand&nbsp;<span data-start=\\\"834\\\" data-end=\\\"874\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">what UX Design is and why it matters<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"917\\\"><p data-start=\\\"879\\\" data-end=\\\"917\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Apply&nbsp;<span data-start=\\\"885\\\" data-end=\\\"915\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">design thinking principles<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"918\\\" data-end=\\\"953\\\"><p data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"953\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Conduct basic&nbsp;<span data-start=\\\"934\\\" data-end=\\\"951\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">user research<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"954\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\"><p data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Create&nbsp;<span data-start=\\\"963\\\" data-end=\\\"998\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">user personas and user journeys<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1049\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1003\\\" data-end=\\\"1049\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Build wireframes and low-fidelity prototypes<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1050\\\" data-end=\\\"1090\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1052\\\" data-end=\\\"1090\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Perform simple&nbsp;<span data-start=\\\"1067\\\" data-end=\\\"1088\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">usability testing<\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1091\\\" data-end=\\\"1139\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1093\\\" data-end=\\\"1139\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Improve digital products using user feedback<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1140\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Present a UX project professionally<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\"><br><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\"><br><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 128, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
