(199, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 19, '{\"en\":\"Introduction to Computer Science: Foundations of Computing\"}', 'introduction-to-computer-science-foundations-of-computing', NULL, '900', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-03-2026/SMM icons.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-03-2026/SMM icons.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"223\\\" data-end=\\\"468\\\">This course provides a <strong data-start=\\\"246\\\" data-end=\\\"300\\\">beginner-friendly introduction to Computer Science<\\/strong> and the fundamental concepts behind modern technology. You will learn how computers work, how software is created, and how programming helps solve real-world problems.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"470\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">The course explains core topics like <strong data-start=\\\"507\\\" data-end=\\\"580\\\">computer systems, algorithms, programming basics, and data management<\\/strong> in a simple and practical way.<br data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"614\\\">\\r\\nBy the end of the course, learners will understand the <strong data-start=\\\"669\\\" data-end=\\\"702\\\">basic principles of computing<\\/strong> and build a strong foundation for further studies in programming, data science, or software development.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-09 02:24:56', '2026-06-19 20:41:12', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<li data-section-id=\\\"1l0aczb\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\" data-end=\\\"1449\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1403\\\" data-end=\\\"1449\\\">No prior computer science knowledge required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sp0fvb\\\" data-start=\\\"1450\\\" data-end=\\\"1491\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1452\\\" data-end=\\\"1491\\\">Basic computer and internet knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"efzqxi\\\" data-start=\\\"1492\\\" data-end=\\\"1522\\\">\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1494\\\" data-end=\\\"1522\\\">Laptop or desktop computer<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><li data-section-id=\\\"d8i