(212, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"MovilOne\"}', 'movilone', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/842fcb22-7d3b-4e4b-94a4-eb69d66bf3c6.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/842fcb22-7d3b-4e4b-94a4-eb69d66bf3c6.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>MovilOne Course: Embark on a comprehensive journey into the world of MovilOne. Explore their range of mobile<\\/p><p>devices, services, and solutions. Learn about the latest technologies, features, and advancements offered by MovilOne.<\\/p><p>Develop hands-on skills in device configuration, troubleshooting, and customer support. Dive into topics like mobile<\\/p><p>network connectivity, app optimization, and device customization. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios,<\\/p><p>gain the expertise to excel in utilizing MovilOne products and delivering exceptional service to customers. Whether<\\/p><p>you\'re a mobile enthusiast or aspiring professional, this course equips you with the knowledge to navigate the MovilOne<\\/p><p>ecosystem and provide top-notch mobile experiences. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 00:04:37', '2026-06-11 09:43:24', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master device configuration, troubleshooting, and customer support for MovilOne mobile devices and services<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize mobile apps, network connectivity, and device customization for enhanced user experience and performance<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply practical skills in diagnosing and resolving common issues with MovilOne smartphones and accessories<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Navigate the MovilOne ecosystem to deliver exceptional mobile solutions, technical support, and user satisfaction<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 40, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(213, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"OBS Studio for beginners\"}', 'obs-studio-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/b34fa268-a262-497f-9008-4b08f29782bd.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/b34fa268-a262-497f-9008-4b08f29782bd.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>OBS Studio, in this course covers everything from basic setup to advanced features, including scene creation, screen<\\/p><p>recording, audio mixing, and stream optimization. Learn how to use custom overlays, green screen effects (chroma key), multi-camera setups, and professional transitions to create high-quality content. Whether you\'re a streamer, content<\\/p><p>creator, educator, or gamer, this course will help you enhance your live streams and recordings. Discover the best<\\/p><p>settings for Twitch, YouTube, and Facebook Live to ensure smooth, high-quality broadcasts. Start your journey with OBS<\\/p><p>Studio today. Be Productive<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 01:58:53', '2026-06-18 07:21:46', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Configure OBS Studio for optimal live streaming and recording quality using Twitch, YouTube, and Facebook Live settings<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create professional scenes with custom overlays, transitions, and multi-camera setups for engaging content<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply green screen (chroma key) effects and advanced video filters to enhance visual production value<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Record high-quality videos with screen capture, audio mixing, and scene transitions for polished content<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize streaming performance by adjusting bitrate, resolution, and encoder settings for smooth broadcasts<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot common OBS Studio issues to ensure reliable and professional live streaming and recording<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 46, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(214, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Digital Product Platforms for beginners\"}', 'digital-product-platforms-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/619d6a38-511a-4d64-95ec-7f6d9c1db795.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-03-2026/619d6a38-511a-4d64-95ec-7f6d9c1db795.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Digital Product Platforms, in this course we will learn about Digital Product Platforms and how they enable businesses<\\/p><p>and creators to sell and distribute digital goods online. Youâ€™ll explore top platforms like Shopify, Gumroad, Etsy,<\\/p><p>Udemy, and Amazon KDP to understand their features, benefits, and best use cases. Learn how to choose the right<\\/p><p>platform based on your product type, set up a digital storefront, manage transactions, and optimize sales with marketing<\\/p><p>strategies. Weâ€™ll also cover automation, licensing, and customer engagement techniques. By the end of this course,<\\/p><p>youâ€™ll have the skills to successfully launch and grow your digital product business. Business Software<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 02:57:24', '2026-06-19 18:17:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Identify suitable digital product platforms like Shopify, Gumroad, Etsy, Udemy, and Amazon KDP for various digital goods<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Set up and customize digital storefronts on major platforms to enhance user experience and sales conversion<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Manage transactions, licensing, and customer engagement effectively to build trust and loyalty<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement marketing strategies and automation tools to optimize digital product sales and growth<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Analyze platform features and benefits to select the best digital distribution channels for your products<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply best practices for launching and scaling a digital product business using online platforms<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 74, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(215, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Nokia Lumia Repair\"}', 'nokia-lumia-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/a1930b93-9f3c-4a5c-9945-223a131301d8.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/a1930b93-9f3c-4a5c-9945-223a131301d8.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Nokia Lumia Repair Course: Master the art of repairing Nokia Lumia smartphones with this comprehensive course.<\\/p><p>Learn to diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems,<\\/p><p>and optimize device performance. Develop hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling Nokia Lumia phones,<\\/p><p>utilizing specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, software troubleshooting, and<\\/p><p>maintaining these discontinued devices. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll gain the skills to<\\/p><p>offer professional Nokia Lumia repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a Nokia Lumia enthusiast,<\\/p><p>this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to excel in repairing these legacy devices. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 11:40:58', '2026-06-20 00:05:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master diagnosing hardware and software issues in Nokia Lumia smartphones using specialized tools and techniques<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Perform component replacements and hardware repairs on Nokia Lumia devices efficiently and accurately<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot and resolve network connectivity problems in Nokia Lumia phones for optimal performance<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement software troubleshooting, data recovery, and firmware updates on Nokia Lumia smartphones<\\/p><p style=\\\"width: 298px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); direction: ltr; position: relative; min-height: 1px;\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><ul><ul><\\/ul><\\/ul><\\/ul><\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Disassemble and reassemble Nokia Lumia phones safely, maintaining device integrity and functionality<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply best practices for maintaining and optimizing Nokia Lumia device performance and longevity<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize practical skills to diagnose, repair, and troubleshoot common issues in Nokia Lumia smartphones<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop professional repair skills for Nokia Lumia devices, including handling discontinued models and legacy technology<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 70, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
