(216, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Lenovo Repair\"}', 'lenovo-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/c2a0c800-d424-461e-950c-4b6ed124c85f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/c2a0c800-d424-461e-950c-4b6ed124c85f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Lenovo Repair Course: Unlock the skills to repair and maintain Lenovo laptops with this comprehensive course. Learn to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems, and<\\/p><p>optimize device performance. Gain hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling Lenovo laptops, utilizing<\\/p><p>specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software troubleshooting.<\\/p><p>Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the confidence to offer professional Lenovo laptop<\\/p><p>repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a Lenovo enthusiast, this course equips you with the<\\/p><p>knowledge and skills to excel in Lenovo laptop repair and provide high-quality service for these advanced devices. MovilOne Phone Repai<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 12:29:46', '2026-06-19 09:53:03', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master diagnose and repair Lenovo laptop hardware and software issues efficiently and accurately<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Perform component replacements and upgrades on Lenovo laptops using specialized tools and techniques<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot and resolve network connectivity problems on Lenovo devices effectively<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize Lenovo laptop performance through system tuning, software updates, and firmware management<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Disassemble and reassemble Lenovo laptops safely, ensuring proper handling and reassembly skills<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement data recovery strategies and perform firmware updates to maintain device functionality<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize diagnostic tools and software troubleshooting techniques for Lenovo laptops<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Provide professional repair services, ensuring high-quality solutions for Lenovo laptop users<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 50, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(218, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Setting up thunderbird\"}', 'setting-up-thunderbird', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/thunder.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/thunder.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Setting up thunderbird, This course teaches you how to set up and configure Mozilla Thunderbird, a powerful and free<\\/p><p>email management application. You will learn how to install Thunderbird, add email accounts using IMAP or POP3, and<\\/p><p>configure outgoing SMTP settings for smooth communication. The course covers organizing your inbox with folders,<\\/p><p>filters, and tags, as well as customizing the interface for a more efficient workflow. You will also explore how to sync<\\/p><p>contacts and calendars, manage multiple email accounts, and enhance security with encryption and authentication<\\/p><p>settings. Additionally, the course introduces useful add-ons, backup options, and troubleshooting methods. By the end,<\\/p><p>you will be<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 17:02:05', '2026-06-13 04:22:34', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Configure Mozilla Thunderbird installation for optimal performance and security using latest software versions and system settings<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Set up and manage multiple email accounts with IMAP and POP3 protocols for seamless communication and synchronization<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\">Set up and manage multiple email accounts with IMAP and POP3 protocols for seamless communication and synchronization<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Organize emails efficiently using folders, filters, and tags to improve productivity and email management skills.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 111, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(219, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Create a YouTube account on Your phone\"}', 'create-a-youtube-account-on-your-phone', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/075e7fa3-2fcf-4060-9391-93d707158ae4.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-03-2026/075e7fa3-2fcf-4060-9391-93d707158ae4.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Create a YouTube account, in this course youâ€™ll learn how to create and set up a YouTube account step by step. Weâ€™ll guide you through signing up on YouTube, choosing the right channel name, and customizing your profile with<\\/p><p>a professional picture and banner. Youâ€™ll explore essential channel settings, privacy options, and branding tips to<\\/p><p>optimize your presence. Additionally, weâ€™ll cover how to upload your first video, manage playlists, and use YouTube<\\/p><p>Studio for analytics and monetization. Whether youâ€™re a beginner or aspiring content creator, this course will help<\\/p><p>you launch a successful YouTube channel and start sharing engaging content with your audience. Santrel Media<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-23 17:11:20', '2026-06-13 07:51:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create a YouTube account on your phone, mastering sign-up, profile customization, and privacy settings for a professional channel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize your YouTube channel with effective branding, including channel name, profile picture, and banner design strategies<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Navigate YouTube Studio to upload videos, manage playlists, and analyze channel performance for growth and engagement<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement monetizatio