(226, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Accessing structured web\"}', 'accessing-structured-web', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/24-03-2026/access.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/24-03-2026/access.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"176\\\" data-end=\\\"570\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"176\\\" data-end=\\\"204\\\">Accessing Structured Web<\\/strong> focuses on how data is organized, retrieved, and utilized from structured sources on the internet. This includes working with formats like databases, APIs, JSON, XML, and semantic web technologies. The category explores how machines and applications efficiently access well-defined data structures to enable automation, integration, and intelligent decision-making.<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"572\\\" data-end=\\\"778\\\">It bridges the gap between raw web content and meaningful data by emphasizing standards, protocols, and tools that allow developers and analysts to extract, process, and use structured information reliably.<\\/p><p><\\/p><p><\\/p><p><\\/p><p><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-24 15:15:35', '2026-06-17 21:37:00', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Understand the concept of <strong data-start=\\\"895\\\" data-end=\\\"930\\\">structured vs unstructured data<\\/strong> on the web\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nIdentify and work with common structured formats such as <strong data-start=\\\"1003\\\" data-end=\\\"1025\\\">JSON, XML, and CSV<\\/strong>\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nAccess data using <strong data-start=\\\"1048\\\" data-end=\\\"1093\\\">APIs (Application Programming Interfaces)<\\/strong>\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nParse and manipulate structured data programmatically\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nUnderstand basic concepts of the <strong data-start=\\\"1189\\\" data-end=\\\"1205\\\">Semantic Web<\\/strong> and linked data\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nUse tools and libraries to retrieve and process structured web data\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nIntegrate structured data into applications or workflows\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nApply best practices for data handling, validation, and transformation <\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"867\\\" data-end=\\\"1431\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/ul><ul data-start=\\\"867\\\" data-end=\\\"1431\\\">\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 71, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
