x; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Reset passwords, repair user profiles, and activate hidden admin accounts to regain system access on Windows 11<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify; direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Diagnose and fix biometric login errors including fingerprint and facial recognition problems in Windows 11<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 56, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
