(253, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Accessing your Google Drive in Web\"}', 'accessing-your-google-drive-in-web', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/53387684-32d8-478a-bde5-b31cccadd856 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/53387684-32d8-478a-bde5-b31cccadd856 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces learners to accessing and managing files using <strong data-start=\\\"226\\\" data-end=\\\"267\\\">Google Drive<\\/strong> through a web browser. It covers the fundamentals of cloud storage, navigating the Drive interface, uploading and organizing files, sharing documents, and collaborating in real time. Learners will gain practical skills to efficiently store, retrieve, and manage digital content securely from any device with internet access.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 16:09:51', '2026-06-15 02:11:26', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1nxfyza\\\" data-start=\\\"676\\\" data-end=\\\"748\\\">Access <strong data-start=\\\"686\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\"><span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Google Drive<\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong> using a web browser.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dtiv1g\\\" data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"821\\\">\\r\\nNavigate the Google Drive interface and understand its main features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cdzhuy\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\" data-end=\\\"886\\\">\\r\\nUpload, download, and organize files and folders effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ih1yix\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\" data-end=\\\"944\\\">\\r\\nUse search and filter options to quickly locate files.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bdvuiy\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\" data-end=\\\"1014\\\">\\r\\nShare files and folders with others using appropriate permissions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16r6q4t\\\" data-start=\\\"1015\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\">\\r\\nCollaborate in real-time using integrated tools like Docs, Sheets, and Slides.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15p5qyg\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1169\\\">\\r\\nManage storage space and understand file ownership and access rights.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tjnkrg\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\" data-end=\\\"1241\\\">\\r\\nApply basic security practices to protect files stored in the cloud.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 68, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(254, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Choosing the Right Fixture\"}', 'choosing-the-right-fixture', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/30429238-196c-468f-ac74-f539e43f2c4a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/30429238-196c-468f-ac74-f539e43f2c4a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Choosing the Right Fixture course, in this course we will explore the process of selecting the most suitable lighting<\\/p><p>fixture for various applications. Participants will learn about the factors to consider when choosing lighting fixtures,<\\/p><p>including light output, color temperature, beam angle, CRI, and power consumption. Through practical examples and<\\/p><p>case studies, students will understand how to match the characteristics of different fixtures with specific lighting needs,<\\/p><p>whether for photography, cinematography, stage lighting, or architectural illumination. By the end of the course,<\\/p><p>participants will have the knowledge and skills to make informed decisions when selecting lighting fixtures to achieve<\\/p><p>their desired lighting goals.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 16:35:29', '2026-06-09 22:08:46', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Identify key factors such as light output, color temperature, and beam angle for selecting appropriate lighting fixtures<\\/li><li>Evaluate fixture specifications like CRI and power consumption to match lighting needs in photography, cinematography, and architecture<\\/li><li>Apply practical knowledge through case studies to choose fixtures that optimize lighting quality and energy efficiency<\\/li><li>Make informed decisions on fixture selection to achieve specific lighting goals across various professional applications<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(255, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Headset Mics techniques\"}', 'headset-mics-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/IMG-20260325-WA0010.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/IMG-20260325-WA0010.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Headset Mics course, in this course we will explore the functionality, setup, and best practices for using headset<\\/p><p>microphones. Participants will learn about the principles behind headset mic technology, including different types of<\\/p><p>headsets and microphone capsules. Through hands-on training and demonstrations, students will discover optimal<\\/p><p>placement techniques, configuration options, and troubleshooting methods to ensure reliable performance. Additionally,<\\/p><p>the course will cover customization options and strategies for integrating headset mics into various audio setups, from<\\/p><p>live events to broadcasting and recording environments. By the end of the course, participants will have a comprehensive<\\/p><p>understanding of headset mic usage and be equipped with the skills to utilize them effectively in diverse audio<\\/p><p>applications<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 16:53:34', '2026-06-15 12:01:35', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master headset microphone setup and configuration for optimal audio quality in live, broadcast, and recording environments<\\/li><li>Identify different types of headset microphones and select appropriate capsules for specific audio applications<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for microphone placement and positioning to minimize noise and feedback<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common headset mic issues and customize settings for reliable, high-quality sound performance<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 51, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(256, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Selecting right resolution projection\"}', 'selecting-right-resolution-projection', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/41ace42d-6a81-44b6-bc5f-784b6dbab7c6.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/41ace42d-6a81-44b6-bc5f-784b6dbab7c6.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Selecting right resolution projection course, on this course we will delve into the intricacies of choosing the optimal<\\/p><p>resolution for projection systems. Participants will explore factors such as screen size, viewing distance, content type,<\\/p><p>and display technology to determine the ideal resolution for various projection scenarios. Through practical<\\/p><p>demonstrations and theoretical discussions, students will gain insights into the importance of resolution selection in<\\/p><p>achieving sharp, clear, and immersive visual experiences. Additionally, the course will cover techniques for calibrating<\\/p><p>and fine-tuning projection systems to ensure optimal image quality and viewer satisfaction. By the end of the course,<\\/p><p>participants will have the knowledge and skills to select the right resolution for projection setups, whether for<\\/p><p>presentations, entertainment, or artistic displays.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 17:02:51', '2026-06-20 21:59:07', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Identify key factors influencing resolution selection for projection systems including screen size, viewing distance, and content type<\\/li><li>Evaluate different display technologies and their impact on projection resolution quality and clarity<\\/li><li>Apply calibration techniques to optimize image sharpness, color accuracy, and overall projection performance<\\/li><li>Design projection setups tailored to specific scenarios such as presentations, entertainment, and artistic displays<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 83, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(257, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fresnel Lighting techniques\"}', 'fresnel-lighting-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/dc3b486d-5e04-4cd5-93ed-56851be59cd9.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/dc3b486d-5e04-4cd5-93ed-56851be59cd9.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Fresnel Lighting course, in this course we will delve into the principles and applications of Fresnel lighting. Participants<\\/p><p>will explore the characteristics of Fresnel lights, including their unique beam shaping abilities, intensity control, and<\\/p><p>versatility in various lighting setups. Through practical demonstrations and hands-on exercises, students will learn how<\\/p><p>to set up and configure Fresnel lights, optimize their performance for different shooting scenarios, and implement<\\/p><p>effective lighting strategies. By the end of the course, participants will have a comprehensive understanding of Fresnel<\\/p><p>lighting techniques and be equipped with the skills to utilize them creatively in photography, cinematography, stage<\\/p><p>lighting, and other visual arts.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 17:12:03', '2026-06-19 18:13:57', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master how to set up and configure Fresnel lights for diverse shooting scenarios and creative effects<\\/li><li>Apply beam shaping and intensity control techniques to enhance visual storytelling and mood creation<\\/li><li>Optimize Fresnel lighting performance through practical adjustments for photography, cinematography, and stage productions<\\/li><li>Implement effective lighting strategies using Fresnel lights to achieve desired artistic and technical outcomes<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 64, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(258, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Console Control Techniques\"}', 'console-control-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/f11fbbe2-0c84-43d4-887f-13725ed1ccd0.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/f11fbbe2-0c84-43d4-887f-13725ed1ccd0.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Console Control course, in this course we will learn about console control techniques, which encompass the skills and<\\/p><p>knowledge required to effectively operate and manage various types of console systems. Participants will explore topics<\\/p><p>such as understanding console interfaces, configuring and customizing controls to meet specific needs, optimizing<\\/p><p>performance and responsiveness, efficiently utilizing advanced functions, and performing maintenance and<\\/p><p>troubleshooting procedures. Through hands-on exercises and practical demonstrations, students will develop proficiency<\\/p><p>in controlling console systems, empowering them to efficiently manage operations and achieve high-quality performance.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 17:27:09', '2026-06-19 18:05:59', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master console interface navigation and control customization for diverse system requirements<\\/li><li>Optimize console system performance and responsiveness through effective configuration techniques<\\/li><li>Utilize advanced console functions to enhance operational efficiency and system management<\\/li><li>Perform maintenance, troubleshooting, and diagnostics to ensure high-quality console system performance<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', '{\"en\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 69, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(259, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Video Shader Positioning techniques\"}', 'video-shader-positioning-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/4298b08d-d529-47cc-be6e-016042855b95.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/4298b08d-d529-47cc-be6e-016042855b95.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Video Shader Positioning course, in this course we will learn about the principles and techniques of video shader<\\/p><p>positioning, which involves manipulating and controlling video shader effects within a digital environment. Participants<\\/p><p>will explore various aspects of video shader positioning, including understanding shader parameters, adjusting shader<\\/p><p>effects, optimizing positioning for visual impact, and implementing strategies for effective shader usage. Through<\\/p><p>practical exercises and hands-on demonstrations, students will develop the skills needed to position video shaders<\\/p><p>creatively and strategically to enhance visual compositions in digital media production. By the end of the course,<\\/p><p>participants will have a comprehensive understanding of video shader positioning and its applications in creating<\\/p><p>compelling visual effects.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 18:53:55', '2026-06-19 18:21:03', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master shader parameter adjustments to enhance visual effects in digital media projects<\\/li><li>Apply positioning techniques to create dynamic and engaging video shader effects for various media formats<\\/li><li>Optimize shader effects for performance and visual impact in digital video compositions<\\/li><li>Implement strategic shader positioning to improve visual storytelling and aesthetic appeal in digital media<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 77, 1, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(260, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Accessing Kimi AI\"}', 'accessing-kimi-ai', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/f86e5351-2046-4e98-a97f-bbd464d5ed75.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/f86e5351-2046-4e98-a97f-bbd464d5ed75.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to accessing and using <strong data-start=\\\"224\\\" data-end=\\\"235\\\">Kimi AI<\\/strong>, an advanced artificial intelligence assistant designed for research, coding, and productivity tasks. Learners will explore how to navigate the platform, interact effectively with the AI, and leverage its capabilities for solving real-world problems.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p>The course covers account access, interface overview, prompt techniques, and practical applications such as document analysis, content generation, and programming assistance. By the end of the course, learners will be able to confidently use Kimi AI to enhance efficiency and decision-making in academic and professional environments.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 21:16:31', '2026-06-19 18:07:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Understand the purpose and features of Kimi AI\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nAccess and navigate the Kimi AI platform efficiently\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nCreate effective prompts to interact with the AI system\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nUtilize Kimi AI for research and information gathering\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nApply Kimi AI in coding and problem-solving tasks\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nAnalyze documents and generate summaries using AI\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nImplement AI tools to improve productivity and workflow\\r\\n<\\/p><p>\\r\\nDemonstrate practical use cases of Kimi AI in real-world scenarios <\\/p><ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/ul><ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 105, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(261, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel VBA techniques\"}', 'excel-vba-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 25, 2026, 07_14_42 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 25, 2026, 07_14_42 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel VBA techniques, in this course is designed to take learners beyond the basics of automation and into advanced\\r\\nprogramming skills within Excel. It focuses on mastering powerful VBA techniques to build efficient, customized\\r\\nsolutions for data processing, reporting, and analysis. Participants will learn how to create dynamic macros, manipulate\\r\\nlarge datasets, automate repetitive workflows, and integrate Excel with other applications such as Outlook or Access.\\r\\nThe course covers advanced topics like event-driven programming, loops optimization, arrays, and custom functions to\\r\\nenhance performance and flexibility. Real-world projects and hands-on exercises help learners apply these techniques to\\r\\nbusiness scenarios, boosting productivity and accuracy. By the end, participants will have the skills to design\\r\\nprofessional, automated Excel systems that save time and deliver smarter results. WiseOwlTutorials<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-25 23:20:22', '2026-06-19 13:32:27', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create dynamic macros to automate complex Excel tasks efficiently and accurately<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Manipulate large datasets using advanced VBA techniques for data processing and analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop custom functions and optimize loops to enhance Excel automation performance and flexibility<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Integrate Excel with Outlook and Access to streamline workflows and improve business productivity<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 67, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
