 into different formats\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ofrshf\\\" data-start=\\\"1168\\\" data-end=\\\"1239\\\">\\r\\nضبط (adjust) audio and video settings for improved playback quality\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"v0eoyw\\\" data-start=\\\"1240\\\" data-end=\\\"1300\\\">\\r\\nStream media content over local networks or the internet\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"h47tqv\\\" data-start=\\\"1301\\\" data-end=\\\"1358\\\">\\r\\nCapture screenshots and record clips from media files\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Customize VLC preferences and settings for better performance<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 41, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 59, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(274, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel functions\"}', 'excel-functions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/excel functions.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/excel functions.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel functions, in this course teaches you how to use the most important formulas and functions to analyze, calculate,\\r\\nand manage data efficiently. Youâ€™ll learn basic functions like SUM, AVERAGE, and COUNT, as well as advanced ones\\r\\nsuch as IF, VLOOKUP, XLOOKUP, INDEX, MATCH, and TEXT functions. The course also explores logical, statistical, and\\r\\ndate functions to automate tasks and simplify complex calculations. Through real-life examples, youâ€™ll discover how to\\r\\ncombine multiple functions for professional data analysis and reporting. By the end, youâ€™ll confidently use Excelâ€™s\\r\\nfunctions to save time, reduce errors, and enhance productivity in any business or academic setting. Simon Sez IT<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-26 21:59:36', '2026-06-20 15:56:00', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master essential Excel functions like SUM, AVERAGE, and COUNT for accurate data analysis and calculation skills Excel formulas such as IF, VLOOKUP, and XLOOKUP to automate data management and reporting techniques Advanced functions including INDEX, MATCH, and TEXT to handle complex data tasks and improve productivity Practical application of logical, statistical, and date functions to streamline workflows and reduce errors in business and academic environments<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 74, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(275, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Predictive Maintenance Developer Tech\"}', 'predictive-maintenance-developer-tech', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/00318c90-daa4-44d7-a22f-7bbe9c0caee7.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/00318c90-daa4-44d7-a22f-7bbe9c0caee7.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Predictive maintenance refers to the use of data-driven, proactive maintenance methods that are designed to analyze the<\\/p><p>condition of equipment and help predict when maintenance should be performed.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 00:12:52', '2026-06-12 01:19:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Develop predictive models using machine learning algorithms for equipment maintenance optimization and fault detection<\\/li><li>Implement sensor data analysis techniques to monitor machinery health and detect anomalies in real-time<\\/li><li>Design and deploy predictive maintenance solutions leveraging IoT, big data analytics, and cloud computing technologies<\\/li><li>Evaluate maintenance strategies to reduce downtime, extend equipment lifespan, and improve operational efficiency<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 82, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(276, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Power BI and dax\"}', 'power-bi-and-dax', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/power bi.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/power bi.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Power BI and dax, in this course provides a complete understanding of how to transform raw data into interactive visual\\r\\ninsights. Youâ€™ll learn how to connect, clean, and model data using Power BI, and create stunning dashboards for\\r\\nbetter decision-making. The course also introduces DAX (Data Analysis Expressions) â€” the powerful formula language\\r\\nthat enables custom calculations, time intelligence, and performance metrics. Through hands-on examples, youâ€™ll\\r\\ndiscover how to use DAX to create measures, calculated columns, and dynamic reports. By the end, youâ€™ll be able to\\r\\ndesign data models, automate analysis, and present key business insights clearly and efficiently using Power BI and DAX\\r\\ntogether. WiseOwlTutorials&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 01:47:16', '2026-06-19 18:06:33', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create interactive dashboards and visualizations to communicate business insights effectively using Power BI and DAX keywords.<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop custom calculations, measures, and calculated columns with DAX for advanced data analysis and reporting.<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Build and optimize data models to enhance performance and enable dynamic, real-time data analysis.<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Automate data analysis processes and generate insightful reports to support strategic decision-making.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 53, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(277, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Intermediate excel 365\"}', 'intermediate-excel-365', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/excel 365.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/excel 365.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Intermediate excel 365, in this course is designed to help learners move beyond the basics and develop strong data\\r\\nmanagement and analysis skills. Youâ€™ll learn to use advanced formulas such as IF, VLOOKUP, XLOOKUP, and INDEX- MATCH, as well as apply data validation and conditional formatting for smarter automation. The course covers creating\\r\\nand managing PivotTables, linking multiple worksheets, and using named ranges to organize complex data. Youâ€™ll\\r\\nalso explore Power Query, data visualization with charts, and collaboration features through Excel 365â€™s cloud tools.\\r\\nBy the end, youâ€™ll be confident in handling professional-level spreadsheets efficiently and accurately. Simon Sez IT<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 02:12:41', '2026-06-19 01:55:26', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master advanced Excel 365 formulas like IF, VLOOKUP, XLOOKUP, and INDEX-MATCH for data analysis and automation<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply data validation and conditional formatting to enhance spreadsheet accuracy and visual clarity<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create and manage PivotTables and link multiple worksheets for complex data reporting and analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize Power Query, charts, and collaboration tools to streamline data visualization and teamwork in Excel<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 62, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(278, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google Classroom\"}', 'google-classroom', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/goolge class.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-03-2026/goolge class.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Google Classroom is a free web service developed by Google for schools that aims to simplify creating, distributing, and\\r\\ngrading assignments. The primary purpose of Google Classroom is to streamline the process of sharing files between\\r\\nteachers and students. Is Google classroom free for all? The Classroom app is available for Android, Chrome, and iOS\\r\\ndevices. For more information, see Get the Classroom app. What does Classroom cost? Classroom is free for all\\r\\nusers. Where is the class code for Google classroom? You can find your Google Classroom code on your course\'s class\\r\\ncard on the website or mobile app. Google Classroom codes allow students to find and join a class. Codes are shared by\\r\\nclass instructors with students and cannot be changed. Can students see each other\'s work in Google Classroom? As the\\r\\nteacher, locate your assignment folder in G Drive. Right click and open sharing options. Choose OFF, then SAVE. This\\r\\nway, my students can only see their own work and no one else\'s<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 02:29:20', '2026-06-15 17:14:24', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create, distribute, and grade assignments efficiently using Google Classroom tools and features<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Manage class codes and student enrollment to facilitate seamless class joining processes<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize Google Drive integration to organize and share class materials securely and privately<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement privacy settings to ensure students can only view their own work, maintaining academic integrity<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 90, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(279, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google Drive\"}', 'google-drive', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/googleS.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/googleS.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Google Drive is a file storage and synchronization service developed by Google. Launched on April 24, 2012, Google Drive allows users to store files on their servers, synchronize files across devices, and share files.How do I access my drive? You can access Drive on the web by heading to drive.google.com or via the free Android app. You can also view all your files via the Drive folder on your PC with Google Drive for Desktop, but you need to download the software first. You can get the software by visiting Drive\'s website.How do I connect Google drive to my PC? Here\'s how to set it up and get everything synced. Step One: Download and Install Backup and Sync. ... Step Two: Choose Which Folders Will Get Synced from Google Drive. ... Step Three: Choose Other Folders On You PC to Sync. ... Step Four: Tweak Your Photo Uploading Settings. What is Google Drive and how does it work? Google Drive is a cloud-based storage solution that allows you to save files online and access them anywhere from any smartphone, tablet, or computer. You can use Drive on your computer or mobile device to securely upload files and edit them online. What are the benefits of Google Drive? Check out these other advantages of Google Drive: #1: Easy to use interface. ... #2: Microsoft Office compatible. ... #3: Share your files using a custom link. ... #4: Store videos, PDFs, presentations, and photos. ... #5: SSL encryption. ... #6: Apps &amp; templates give you plenty of options. ... #7: Access your documents from anywhere in the world.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 12:35:45', '2026-06-20 09:03:23', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master how to access and navigate Google Drive across devices and platforms effectively<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement file synchronization between Google Drive and local devices for seamless data management<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize Google Drive\'s sharing features to securely share files and collaborate with others<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Organize files and folders efficiently using Google Drive\'s management tools and best practices<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%;\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><ul><\\/ul><\\/ul><\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Integrate Google Drive with Microsoft Office and other productivity apps for enhanced workflow <\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Configure and customize Google Drive settings, including backup, sync, and photo upload options<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nEnsure data security by applying SSL encryption and managing sharing permissions appropriately<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot common issues related to Google Drive access, synchronization, and sharing<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%;\\\"><br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 79, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(280, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google Slides\"}', 'google-slides', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 26, 2026, 08_58_30 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 26, 2026, 08_58_30 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Google Slides, in this course teaches you how to create professional, engaging presentations using Googleâ€™s free\\r\\ncloud-based platform. Youâ€™ll learn how to design slides with text, images, shapes, and animations, and explore the\\r\\nbest ways to structure content for visual impact. The course covers slide themes, transitions, and templates to ensure\\r\\nconsistency in style and branding. Youâ€™ll also discover how to collaborate in real time, share presentations with\\r\\nothers, and present seamlessly from any device. Advanced lessons include embedding videos, integrating charts from\\r\\nGoogle Sheets, and using speaker notes effectively. By the end, youâ€™ll be able to design creative and impactful\\r\\npresentations that communicate ideas clearly and professionally. Simon Sez IT&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 13:01:33', '2026-06-07 06:03:55', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create visually appealing presentations using Google Slides with effective design principles and multimedia integration<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply slide themes, templates, and transitions to ensure consistent style and professional branding in presentation<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Collaborate in real-time, share, and present Google Slides seamlessly across multiple devices and platforms<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Embed videos, integrate charts from Google Sheets, and utilize speaker notes for engaging, data-driven presentations<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\"><br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 75, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(281, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Uploading files to teraBox\"}', 'uploading-files-to-terabox', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/d2abb5ad-8de2-4216-bf26-d49969fd2c4a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/d2abb5ad-8de2-4216-bf26-d49969fd2c4a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a step-by-step guide to uploading, managing, and organizing files using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">TeraBox<\\/span>. Learners will explore the platform interface, understand different upload methods (mobile and desktop), and learn how to securely store photos, videos, and documents in the cloud. The course is designed for beginners and intermediate users who want to efficiently use cloud storage for personal or professional needs. By the end of the course, learners will be confident in handling file uploads, sharing, and storage optimization within TeraBox.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 15:47:37', '2026-06-18 01:04:54', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1n4juoz\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\" data-end=\\\"753\\\">Understand the basics of cloud storage and how TeraBox works\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tmwh96\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\" data-end=\\\"830\\\">\\r\\nUpload files (photos, videos, documents) from mobile and desktop devices\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sb0xiw\\\" data-start=\\\"831\\\" data-end=\\\"884\\\">\\r\\nOrganize files and folders effectively in TeraBox\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"divli3\\\" data-start=\\\"885\\\" data-end=\\\"942\\\">\\r\\nManage large file uploads and monitor upload progress\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1osm4s4\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\" data-end=\\\"995\\\">\\r\\nShare files securely using links and permissions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yx6xs5\\\" data-start=\\\"996\\\" data-end=\\\"1048\\\">\\r\\nOptimize storage space and maintain file backups\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Troubleshoot common upload issues<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 94, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(282, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Motorola\"}', 'motorola', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/0b12cf68-a9cc-4a0e-a500-5a360b4b6d5e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/0b12cf68-a9cc-4a0e-a500-5a360b4b6d5e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Motorola Course: Unlock the secrets of Motorola devices with this comprehensive course. Learn about Motorola\'s<\\/p><p>history, product lineup, and advanced features. Dive into topics like mobile phone technology, two-way radios,<\\/p><p>communication systems, and more. Develop hands-on skills through practical exercises and explore software<\\/p><p>troubleshooting, customization, and optimization. Whether you\'re a Motorola enthusiast or aspiring technician, this<\\/p><p>course equips you with the knowledge to excel in understanding and utilizing Motorola devices and provides a foundation<\\/p><p>for professional expertise in the field. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 16:32:42', '2026-06-16 18:30:36', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master Motorola device features and functionalities for enhanced user experience and troubleshooting skills<\\/li><li>Identify and differentiate Motorola product lineup, including mobile phones, two-way radios, and communication systems<\\/li><li>Apply practical skills to repair, customize, and optimize Motorola devices effectively in real-world scenarios<\\/li><li>Diagnose and resolve common software issues on Motorola smartphones and communication devices<\\/li><li>Utilize advanced troubleshooting techniques to improve device performance and user satisfaction<\\/li><li>Configure and personalize Motorola devices to meet specific user needs and preferences<\\/li><li>Understand the technological principles behind Motorola\'s mobile and communication systems for better maintenance<\\/li><li>Implement software updates and security patches to ensure device longevity and data protection<\\/li><li>Develop professional expertise in Motorola device repair, customization, and technical support<\\/li><li>Explore career opportunities in Motorola device servicing, technical support, and communication system management<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 71, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(283, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Samsung Screen repair\"}', 'samsung-screen-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/4993bb68-4321-4f36-bb5e-3c0d80dfee02.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/4993bb68-4321-4f36-bb5e-3c0d80dfee02.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<div>Samsung Screen Repair Course: Master the art of repairing Samsung smartphone screens with this comprehensive<\\/div><div>course. Learn techniques to diagnose screen issues, disassemble devices, replace damaged screens, and ensure proper<\\/div><div>reassembly. Develop hands-on expertise in working with various Samsung models and screen types. Explore<\\/div><div>troubleshooting methods, calibration, and quality control. Through practical exercises and real-world examples, gain the<\\/div><div>skills to offer professional Samsung screen repairs and deliver high-quality results. Whether you\'re an aspiring<\\/div><div>technician or a Samsung enthusiast, this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to excel in Samsung screen<\\/div><div>repair and provide top-notch service for these devices. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/div>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 19:21:49', '2026-06-12 04:00:48', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnose Samsung smartphone screen issues using advanced troubleshooting techniques and diagnostic tools<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble various Samsung models with precision, ensuring device integrity and safety<\\/li><li>Replace damaged or cracked Samsung screens efficiently, minimizing device downtime and repair costs<\\/li><li>Calibrate Samsung screens for optimal display quality, touch sensitivity, and color accuracy<\\/li><li>Implement quality control procedures to ensure high standards in Samsung screen repair services<\\/li><li>Identify and resolve common Samsung screen problems such as dead pixels, touch failure, and display flickering<\\/li><li>Utilize specialized tools and techniques for safe and effective Samsung screen disassembly and repair<\\/li><li>Provide professional Samsung screen repair services, enhancing customer satisfaction and trust<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and fix Samsung display issues related to hardware and software malfunctions<\\/li><li>Develop skills to start or grow a Samsung screen repair business with confidence and technical expertise<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 51, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(284, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Asus Repair\"}', 'asus-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/60fb0e6e-0f45-404a-a76c-4c593773699c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/60fb0e6e-0f45-404a-a76c-4c593773699c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Asus Repair Course: Gain expertise in repairing Asus devices with this comprehensive course. Learn to diagnose and fix<\\/p><p>common hardware and software issues, replace components, and troubleshoot device faults. Develop hands-on skills in<\\/p><p>disassembling and reassembling Asus laptops, desktops, and other devices. Explore techniques for data recovery,<\\/p><p>firmware updates, and optimizing device performance. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll<\\/p><p>become proficient in repairing and servicing Asus devices. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an Asus enthusiast,<\\/p><p>this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to offer professional repairs and solutions for a wide range of Asus<\\/p><p>products. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 20:35:21', '2026-06-20 18:39:35', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Diagnose and troubleshoot hardware and software issues in Asus laptops, desktops, and devices effectively<\\/li><li>Perform component replacement and hardware upgrades on Asus devices with precision<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble Asus laptops and desktops safely and efficiently<\\/li><li>Apply data recovery techniques to restore lost files and resolve storage issues on Asus devices<\\/li><li>Update firmware and optimize performance for Asus laptops and desktops<\\/li><li>Identify and fix common device faults, including screen, keyboard, and power problems<\\/li><li>Utilize diagnostic tools and software for accurate Asus device repair and maintenance<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for professional Asus device repair, servicing, and customer satisfaction<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 108, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
