(285, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Bullet points in google slides\"}', 'bullet-points-in-google-slides', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/billet.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/billet.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Bullet points in google slides course, in this course we will learn about the effective use of bullet points to organize and\\r\\npresent information clearly in your presentations. Starting with the basics, we\'ll explore how to insert bullet points and\\r\\ncreate structured lists to enhance your slides. You\'ll learn to customize bullet points by changing their shape, size, and\\r\\ncolor to match your presentation\'s theme and style. The course covers advanced techniques such as creating multi-level\\r\\nbullet points to display hierarchical information and using animations to make your points appear dynamically. We\'ll also\\r\\ndiscuss best practices for using bullet points to ensure your presentations are engaging and easy to follow. Through\\r\\npractical demonstrations and step-by-step tutorials, you\'ll gain hands-on experience in creating professional-quality\\r\\nslides. By the end of this course, you\'ll be proficient in utilizing bullet points in Google Slides to make your presentations\\r\\nmore organized, visually appealing, and impactful, enabling you to communicate your ideas effectively and capture your\\r\\naudience\'s attention. Whether you\'re a student, educator, or professional, this course will equip you with the skills to\\r\\nelevate your presentation game<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 22:19:59', '2026-06-19 18:19:21', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create and insert bullet points in Google Slides to organize presentation content effectively<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Customize bullet points by changing shape, size, and color to match presentation themes and styles<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design multi-level bullet points to display hierarchical information clearly and professionally<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply animations to bullet points for dynamic and engaging presentation delivery<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(286, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google Sheets Full data\"}', 'google-sheets-full-data', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/image_2026-03-27_065214981.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/image_2026-03-27_065214981.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Is Google sheets the same as Excel? By adding macros, Google Sheets continues to grow into a viable alternative to Excel\\r\\nfor most spreadsheet users. And unlike Excel, Sheets is free. ... Excel has more built-in formulas and functions. Simple\\r\\ntasks like sorting and filtering are easier in Excel.Is Google sheets better than Excel? In the case of Excel vs Google\\r\\nSheets, both software is great in terms of core features. ... If your business needs some serious calculations with a lot of\\r\\ndata, then Excel is a must-have. If not, you can always use Google Sheets, since it\'s free, and switch to Excel if you ever\\r\\nneed better computational power.What do Google sheets do? Google Sheets is a spreadsheet app on steroids. ... It\'s a\\r\\nweb-based spreadsheet that you can use anywhereâ€”no more forgetting your spreadsheet files at home. It works from\\r\\nany device, with mobile apps for iOS and Android along with its web-based core app.Can Google Sheets convert to Excel?\\r\\nHow to convert a Google Sheets file to Excel On your PC or Mac, open the Google Sheets spreadsheet that you want to\\r\\nconvert. In the top-left corner, click \\\"File.\\\" In the drop-down menu, hover over the option that says \\\"Download.\\\" In the\\r\\nnew menu that appears, click \\\"Microsoft Excel (.Does Google have a version of Excel? Google Sheets makes your data\\r\\npop with colorful charts and graphs. Built-in formulas, pivot tables and conditional formatting options save time and\\r\\nsimplify common spreadsheet tasks. All for free.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-27 22:57:55', '2026-06-20 07:13:43', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master how to create, edit, and format spreadsheets using Google Sheets for efficient data management and presentation<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply advanced formulas, functions, and pivot tables to analyze and interpret data effectively in Google Sheets<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize macros and automation features to streamline repetitive tasks and improve productivity in Google Sheets<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Convert and export Google Sheets data to Excel format for seamless collaboration and data sharing<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement data sorting, filtering, and conditional formatting to organize and visualize information clearly<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Collaborate in real-time with team members using Google Sheets\' sharing and commenting features<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Integrate Google Sheets with other Google Workspace tools for enhanced workflow and data integration<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot common issues and optimize Google Sheets performance for large datasets and complex calculations<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\"><br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 58, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(287, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel Dashboard\"}', 'excel-dashboard', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/dash.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/dash.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Dashboards in Excel An Excel dashboard is one-pager (mostly, but not always necessary) that helps managers and\\r\\nbusiness leaders in tracking key KPIs or metrics and take a decision based on it. It contains charts\\/tables\\/views that are\\r\\nbacked by data. A dashboard is often called a report, however, not all reports are dashboards.How do I create a\\r\\ndashboard in Excel? Here\'s a step-by-step Excel dashboard tutorial: How to Bring Data into Excel. Before creating\\r\\ndashboards in Excel, you need to import the data into Excel. ... Set Up Your Excel Dashboard File. ... Create a Table with\\r\\nRaw Data. ... Analyze the Data. ... Build the Dashboard. ... Customize with Macros, Color, and More.How do you create a\\r\\ndashboard? How to design and build a great dashboard Be clear about what you\'re trying to achieve â€“ your board\'s\\r\\npurpose will inform its design. Only include what\'s important â€“ everything should support your board\'s intent. Use size\\r\\nand position to show hierarchy â€“ make it clear to the viewer what\'s most important. How do I create a dynamic\\r\\ndashboard in Excel? Create a dynamic Excel chart and make your own dashboard Add a dynamic column to the data\\r\\nrange using a HLOOKUP() function. This column will be the chart\'s real source, not the data range. Insert a simple chart.\\r\\nAdd a scroll bar control that lets the user easily update the chart\'s source, without really knowing what\'s going on behind\\r\\nthe scenes.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-28 01:59:18', '2026-06-17 02:19:34', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"header min_height\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 1px 1px 0px inset, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07) 0px -1px 0px inset; position: fixed; right: 0px; left: 0px; z-index: 101; top: 0px; height: 60px;\\\"><div class=\\\"container-fluid\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; width: 1297px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px;\\\"><div class=\\\"header_area\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; height: 100px; display: flow-root;\\\"><div style=\\\"direction: ltr; float: left;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/\\\" title=\\\"Learnatube\\\" class=\\\"logo-mb\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 123, 255); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; display: inline-block;\\\"><img class=\\\" ls-is-cached lazyloaded\\\" alt=\\\"MindLuster Logo\\\" data-src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/resources\\/main_logo.png?d\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/resources\\/main_logo.png?d\\\" style=\\\"border-style: none; direction: ltr; height: 46px; margin-top: 6px !important;\\\"><\\/a>&nbsp;<ul style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: right; list-style: none; padding-top: 24px; display: inline-block;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: -15px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/\\\" title=\\\"MindLuster\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\">Home<\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/free-online-courses\\\" id=\\\"course-btn\\\" title=\\\"Free Online Courses\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\">Categories<\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/recent-courses\\\" title=\\\"Recent Courses\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\">Recent Courses<\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/cv\\\" title=\\\"CV Maker\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\">Create CV<\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mindluster.com\\/books-summaries\\\" title=\\\"Books Summaries\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\">Books Summaries<\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a class=\\\"nav-link header_load_more\\\" title=\\\"More\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); direction: ltr; display: table-cell; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.2s; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0rem 1rem !important;\\\">More&nbsp;<span class=\\\"fa fa-caret-down\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr;\\\"><\\/span><\\/a><\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 15px 8px; color: rgb(7, 72, 135); transition: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><a class=\\\"hidden-sm\\\" data-toggle=\\\"modal\\\" data-target=\\\"#modal_seach_view\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 72, 135); background-color: transparent; direction: ltr; cursor: pointer; float: right; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; transition-duration: 0.2s; display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle;\\\"><span class=\\\"fa fa-search\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr;\\\"><\\/span><\\/a><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><span class=\\\"login_reg\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; float: right; height: 60px; padding-top: 10px !important;\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create interactive Excel dashboards to visualize key performance indicators and metrics effectively<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design user-friendly dashboards by organizing data, charts, and tables for clear insights and decision-making<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement data import and cleaning techniques to prepare accurate and reliable Excel dashboards<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize Excel functions like HLOOKUP, VLOOKUP, and formulas to create dynamic and responsive dashboards<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Build and customize charts, tables, and views to highlight critical business data and trends<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply macros, color coding, and formatting to enhance dashboard usability and visual appeal<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop dynamic dashboards with scroll bars and controls for real-time data updates and interactivity<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Analyze raw data efficiently to identify patterns and insights for dashboard reporting<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize dashboard layout and hierarchy to prioritize important information and improve user experience<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Troubleshoot common issues in Excel dashboards to ensure accuracy, functionality, and performance<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 88, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(288, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel dashboard essentials for beginners\"}', 'excel-dashboard-essentials-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/d.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/d.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel dashboard essentials course, in this course you\'ll gain a solid foundation in creating powerful and interactive\\r\\ndashboards using Excel. We will start with the basics of data organization and then dive into key elements such as\\r\\ncharts, pivot tables, and slicers that form the backbone of effective dashboards. Youâ€™ll learn how to design visually\\r\\nappealing dashboards that provide clear and actionable insights. The course will also cover techniques for automating\\r\\ndata updates and integrating dynamic elements to enhance user interaction. By the end of this course, youâ€™ll be\\r\\nequipped with the essential skills to build professional-grade dashboards that streamline data analysis and support\\r\\ninformed decision-making. Join us to master the essentials of Excel dashboards and elevate your data visualization\\r\\ncapabilities.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-28 02:46:52', '2026-06-19 18:26:44', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create interactive Excel dashboards using charts, pivot tables, and slicers for data visualization and analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design visually appealing dashboards that communicate insights clearly and effectively in Excel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Automate data updates and integrate dynamic elements to enhance dashboard interactivity and efficiency<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply Excel dashboard techniques to streamline data analysis and support informed decision-making<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 73, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(289, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel Charting\"}', 'excel-charting', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/chart.jpg', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-03-2026/chart.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>How do charts work in Excel? Create a chart Select data for the chart. Select Insert &gt; Recommended Charts. Select a\\r\\nchart on the Recommended Charts tab, to preview the chart. Note: You can select the data you want in the chart and\\r\\npress ALT + F1 to create a chart immediately, but it might not be the best chart for the data. ... Select a chart. Select\\r\\nOK.What is advanced charting in Excel? An advanced chart is a chart that goes beyond the basic charts created by Excel.\\r\\nLet\'s say you have more than one set of data that you would like to compare on the same chart, you can create your basic\\r\\nchart with one set of data then add more datasets to it and apply other items i.e. formatting to the chart.How do I create\\r\\na chart with multiple data in Excel? To create a combo chart, select the data you want displayed, then click the dialog\\r\\nlauncher in the corner of the Charts group on the Insert tab to open the Insert Chart dialog box. Select combo from the\\r\\nAll Charts tab. Select the chart type you want for each data series from the dropdown options.What is chart MS Excel? A\\r\\nchart is a tool you can use in Excel to communicate data graphically. Charts allow your audience to see the meaning\\r\\nbehind the numbers, and they make showing comparisons and trends much easier.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-28 03:21:03', '2026-06-19 18:00:39', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create visually compelling Excel charts to communicate data effectively using various chart types and formatting techniques<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Select appropriate data ranges and utilize Excel\'s recommended charts for accurate data visualization and analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement advanced charting features, including multi-data comparison and custom formatting, for complex data presentation<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design and customize combo charts to compare multiple data series within a single visual for enhanced insights<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize keyboard shortcuts like ALT + F1 for quick chart creation, optimizing workflow efficiency in Excel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply advanced chart formatting options to improve clarity, aesthetics, and professional appearance of data visuals<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Analyze data trends and patterns through effective chart selection and customization in Excel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Integrate multiple datasets into a single chart to facilitate comprehensive data comparison and storytelling<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 88, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(290, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"skydrive in windows 7\"}', 'skydrive-in-windows-7', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-03-2026/62d4e118-5939-4682-b3b8-b02f598f2331.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-03-2026/62d4e118-5939-4682-b3b8-b02f598f2331.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to using <strong data-start=\\\"253\\\" data-end=\\\"294\\\">Microsoft SkyDrive<\\/strong> on the <strong data-start=\\\"302\\\" data-end=\\\"343\\\">Windows 7<\\/strong> platform. Learners will understand how to store, access, and manage files in the cloud using SkyDrive. The course covers setting up an account, uploading and organizing files, sharing documents, and syncing data across devices.<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Participants will also explore the benefits of cloud storage, file accessibility, and basic security practices while working with SkyDrive in a Windows 7 environment. This course is ideal for beginners who want to improve productivity and file management using cloud technology.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-28 10:12:35', '2026-06-17 20:49:37', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1nbcf96\\\" data-start=\\\"936\\\" data-end=\\\"1039\\\">Understand the concept of cloud storage and the role of <strong data-start=\\\"995\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\"><span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Microsoft SkyDrive<\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13nw0ei\\\" data-start=\\\"1040\\\" data-end=\\\"1126\\\">\\r\\nAccess and set up SkyDrive on a <strong data-start=\\\"1075\\\" data-end=\\\"1116\\\"><span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal