(300, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google docs\"}', 'google-docs', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 02_45_37 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 02_45_37 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Google docs, in this course teaches you how to create, edit, and share professional documents online using Googleâ€™s\\r\\ncloud-based platform. Youâ€™ll learn essential tools for formatting text, inserting tables, images, and links, and\\r\\nmanaging document layouts. The course also covers collaboration featuresâ€”how to comment, track changes, and work\\r\\nwith others in real time. Youâ€™ll explore templates for resumes, reports, and letters, along with tips for organizing and\\r\\nsecuring files on Google Drive. Advanced lessons include voice typing, document version history, and add-ons to enhance\\r\\nproductivity. By the end, youâ€™ll master creating polished, accessible, and shareable documents from any device.\\r\\nSimon Sez IT&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-31 18:46:54', '2026-06-12 22:57:20', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create professional documents using Google Docs with advanced formatting and layout skills<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Collaborate effectively by commenting, tracking changes, and working in real-time with team members<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize templates for resumes, reports, and letters to streamline document creation and customization<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Enhance productivity with voice typing, document version control, and useful add-ons in Google Docs<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL,