(301, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Power query in Excel\"}', 'power-query-in-excel', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 03_07_27 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 03_07_27 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Power query in excel, in this course teaches you how to collect, clean, and transform data efficiently without complex\\r\\nformulas. Youâ€™ll learn how to import data from multiple sources such as Excel files, databases, and the web, then\\r\\nreshape and combine it using intuitive tools. The course covers essential topics like removing duplicates, splitting\\r\\ncolumns, merging tables, and automating data refreshes. Youâ€™ll also explore advanced techniques like conditional\\r\\ncolumns and custom transformations using the M language. By the end, youâ€™ll master how to build repeatable\\r\\nworkflows for preparing data, saving hours of manual work and improving accuracy in reports and analysis. Simon Sez IT&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-31 19:08:05', '2026-06-13 01:20:57', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master data import from Excel, databases, and web sources using Power Query in Excel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply data cleaning techniques like removing duplicates, splitting columns, and filtering data efficiently<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create and merge tables, automate data refreshes, and build repeatable data transformation workflows<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize advanced Power Query features such as conditional columns and custom M language transformations<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL,