(302, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Account Excel toolkit\"}', 'account-excel-toolkit', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 04_01_54 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 04_01_54 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Accountant excel toolkit, in this course is designed to equip accountants and finance professionals with advanced Excel\\r\\nskills for managing and analyzing financial data efficiently. Youâ€™ll learn to use powerful formulas, PivotTables, and\\r\\nfinancial templates to prepare balance sheets, income statements, and budgets. The course also covers automating\\r\\naccounting processes with VBA, building forecasting models, and performing financial ratio and variance analysis.\\r\\nThrough practical exercises, youâ€™ll discover how to clean data, validate entries, and present results with professional\\r\\ncharts and dashboards. By the end, youâ€™ll have a complete toolkit to simplify accounting workflows, save time, and\\r\\nimprove reporting accuracy using Excel. Simon Sez IT&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-03-31 20:02:36', '2026-06-12 01:21:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master advanced Excel formulas and functions for financial data analysis and reporting in accounting contexts<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create and customize PivotTables and charts to visualize financial data and enhance decision-making processes<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Automate accounting tasks and streamline workflows using VBA macros and Excel automation techniques<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop financial models, forecasts, and variance analyses to support budgeting, financial planning, and performance evaluation<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 52, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(303, NULL, NULL, 66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"IPHONE REPAIR\"}', 'iphone-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/899842b5-cea3-4ba9-b614-0c4a2ca1fe0f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/899842b5-cea3-4ba9-b614-0c4a2ca1fe0f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>iPhone Repair Course: Unlock the skills to repair and maintain iPhones with this comprehensive course. Learn to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems, and<\\/p><p>optimize device performance. Develop hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling iPhones, utilizing<\\/p><p>specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for screen replacement, battery replacement, water damage repair,<\\/p><p>and more. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll gain the knowledge and confidence to offer<\\/p><p>professional iPhone repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an iPhone enthusiast, this course<\\/p><p>equips you with the skills to excel in iPhone repair and provide high-quality service for these devices. MovilOne Phone<\\/p><p>Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 01:06:41', '2026-06-19 13:59:45', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnose and troubleshoot iPhone hardware and software issues using specialized tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform precise screen, battery, and water damage repairs to restore iPhone functionality and performance<\\/li><li>Identify and replace faulty components such as cameras, charging ports, and logic boards efficiently<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for disassembling and reassembling iPhones to prevent damage and ensure quality repairs<\\/li><li>Utilize diagnostic software and tools to optimize iPhone performance and resolve network connectivity problems<\\/li><li>Implement water damage repair techniques to salvage and restore affected iPhones effectively<\\/li><li>Develop skills to troubleshoot and fix common iOS software issues and restore device stability<\\/li><li>Provide professional iPhone repair services with confidence, ensuring high customer satisfaction and device longevity<\\/li><li>Utilize safety protocols and proper handling procedures to protect devices and ensure technician safety<\\/li><li>Understand the use of specialized tools for iPhone repair, including screwdrivers, pry tools, and soldering equipment<\\/li><li>Diagnose and repair common hardware failures such as cracked screens, battery drain, and charging issues<\\/li><li>Apply troubleshooting strategies for network, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth connectivity problems in iPhones<\\/li><li>Implement device optimization techniques to improve iPhone speed, battery life, and overall performance<\\/li><li>Develop a systematic approach to complex repairs involving logic board and component replacements<\\/li><li>Gain practical experience through hands-on exercises simulating real-world repair scenarios<\\/li><li>Learn to document repair processes and communicate effectively with clients for professional service<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 79, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(304, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel VBA  for game\"}', 'excel-vba-for-game', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 09_46_44 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 09_46_44 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel VBA for game, in this course introduces you to the creative side of programming within Microsoft Excel. Youâ€™ll\\r\\nlearn how to use Visual Basic for Applications (VBA) to build interactive and entertaining games directly inside Excel\\r\\nsheets. The course covers essential coding concepts like loops, conditions, user input, and random number generation,\\r\\nall applied to game logic. Youâ€™ll design interactive interfaces using shapes, buttons, and forms, while learning to\\r\\ncontrol movement, scoring, and game flow. Through hands-on projects, such as Tic-Tac-Toe, Guessing Games, and\\r\\nMemory Match, youâ€™ll develop both programming and problem-solving skills. By the end, youâ€™ll be able to create\\r\\nfun, functional mini-games that showcase Excelâ€™s hidden potential. WiseOwlTutorials&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 01:47:42', '2026-06-13 09:15:39', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create interactive Excel games using VBA, including Tic-Tac-Toe, Guessing Games, and Memory Match<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement game logic with loops, conditions, and random number generation in Excel VBA<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design user interfaces with shapes, buttons, and forms for engaging Excel-based games<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply programming skills to control game flow, scoring, and user input in Excel VBA<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 90, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(305, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel VBA copy and paste techniques\"}', 'excel-vba-copy-and-paste-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 09_57_47 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 09_57_47 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel VBA copy and paste course, in this course we will delve into the powerful capabilities of VBA (Visual Basic for\\r\\nApplications) to automate copy and paste tasks in Excel, significantly enhancing your productivity and efficiency. We will\\r\\nstart with the basics of VBA, including how to access the VBA editor, write simple scripts, and understand the\\r\\nfundamental concepts of programming in VBA. Youâ€™ll learn how to create macros that can copy data from one range\\r\\nto another, paste values, formats, and formulas, and handle dynamic ranges. We will cover advanced techniques such as\\r\\nlooping through rows and columns, using conditional statements to copy and paste based on specific criteria, and\\r\\nemploying event-driven macros to automate tasks based on user actions. Practical examples and hands-on exercises will\\r\\nprovide you with the experience needed to apply these techniques to real-world scenarios, such as automating report\\r\\ngeneration, data migration, and data manipulation tasks. By the end of this course, you will be proficient in writing and\\r\\nusing VBA macros to automate copy and paste operations in Excel. Youâ€™ll be able to streamline your workflow, reduce\\r\\nmanual effort, and minimize errors, making your data management tasks more efficient and accurate. Whether you are\\r\\nnew to VBA or looking to enhance your skills<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 01:58:58', '2026-06-12 22:57:40', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master VBA scripting to automate copy, paste, and data manipulation tasks in Excel efficiently<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement macros for copying data, pasting values, formats, and formulas across dynamic ranges in Excel<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize conditional statements and loops to perform complex copy-paste operations based on specific criteria in Excel VBA<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create event-driven macros to automate Excel workflows, report generation, and data migration tasks effectively<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 74, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
