(307, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Creating a hangman game using VBA\"}', 'creating-a-hangman-game-using-vba', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 10_16_36 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 10_16_36 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Creating a hangman game using VBA, in this course youâ€™ll learn how to design and code a fun, interactive Hangman\\r\\ngame using VBA (Visual Basic for Applications) within Microsoft Excel. Weâ€™ll guide you through the basics of VBA,\\r\\nincluding creating a user-friendly interface, handling input, and implementing game logic. Discover how to use loops,\\r\\nconditional statements, and arrays to develop the core mechanics of the game. Youâ€™ll also learn to enhance the game\\r\\nwith visual elements like dynamic word displays, error counters, and progressive hangman drawings. By the end of the\\r\\ncourse, youâ€™ll have a fully functional Hangman game and a strong understanding of VBA programming fundamentals, making it ideal for beginners and those looking to expand their coding skills in a creative and practical way<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 02:19:32', '2026-06-13 19:13:51', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create an interactive Hangman game using VBA in Microsoft Excel with user-friendly interface and game mechanics<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement VBA code to handle user input, track guesses, and manage game state effectively<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design dynamic visual elements like word displays, hangman drawings, and error counters in Excel VBA<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize loops, conditional statements, and arrays to develop core game logic and improve gameplay flow<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Debug and troubleshoot VBA code to ensure smooth functionality and enhance user experience<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply VBA programming fundamentals to create engaging, practical, and customizable Excel-based games<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 90, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(308, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel VBA dynamic array functions\"}', 'excel-vba-dynamic-array-functions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 10_34_30 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-03-2026/ChatGPT Image Mar 31, 2026, 10_34_30 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel VBA dynamic array course, in this course we will learn about the Excel VBA dynamic array. This powerful feature\\r\\nof Visual Basic for Applications (VBA) allows you to create arrays whose size can be modified at runtime, providing great\\r\\nflexibility for handling data of varying sizes. You will start by understanding the basics of arrays in VBA and then move\\r\\non to dynamic arrays, which can grow or shrink as needed during the execution of your program. We will explore how to\\r\\ndeclare dynamic arrays, use the ReDim statement to allocate or resize them, and the Preserve keyword to retain existing\\r\\ndata while resizing. Practical examples will demonstrate how to efficiently manage memory and optimize the\\r\\nperformance of your VBA scripts using dynamic arrays. Through hands-on exercises, you will learn to apply dynamic\\r\\narrays in real-world scenarios, such as processing data from large datasets, automating repetitive tasks, and enhancing\\r\\nthe functionality of your Excel applications. We will cover advanced techniques like multi-dimensional dynamic arrays\\r\\nand dynamic array manipulation to sort, filter, and aggregate data. By the end of this course, you will have a solid\\r\\nunderstanding of how to implement and utilize dynamic arrays in Excel VBA, enabling you to create more robust and\\r\\nadaptable Excel solutions. This course is ideal for data analysts, developers, and anyone looking to improve their Excel\\r\\nVBA programming skills and handle dynamic data efficiently.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 02:35:22', '2026-06-19 18:27:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master dynamic array declaration, resizing, and data preservation techniques in Excel VBA for flexible data managem<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement efficient memory handling and performance optimization using ReDim and Preserve in VBA dynamic array<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply multi-dimensional dynamic arrays to sort, filter, and aggregate large datasets in Excel VBA projects<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop robust Excel VBA solutions by integrating dynamic arrays for automating tasks and managing variable data sizes<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 68, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(309, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Microsoft power pages\"}', 'microsoft-power-pages', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ccbfb353-b917-44bf-a6a0-3dff6ad40a86.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ccbfb353-b917-44bf-a6a0-3dff6ad40a86.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Microsoft Power Pages, a low-code platform for building secure, data-driven websites. Learners will explore how to design, customize, and deploy responsive web portals using Power Pages, integrate with Microsoft Dataverse, and implement authentication and security features.<\\/li><li>Through hands-on exercises and real-world scenarios, participants will gain practical experience in creating business-ready websites without extensive coding knowledge. The course also covers customization using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and integration with other Microsoft Power Platform services.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 10:37:57', '2026-06-12 01:23:27', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"6vkvdq\\\" data-start=\\\"875\\\" data-end=\\\"982\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Microsoft Power Pages and its role within the Power Platform ecosystem.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ww1cv7\\\" data-start=\\\"983\\\" data-end=\\\"1059\\\">\\r\\nDesign and build responsive web pages using templates and design tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1b2copd\\\" data-start=\\\"1060\\\" data-end=\\\"1117\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and manage data using Microsoft Dataverse.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1t11anr\\\" data-start=\\\"1118\\\" data-end=\\\"1189\\\">\\r\\nImplement authentication and authorization for secure user access.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1up6brx\\\" data-start=\\\"1190\\\" data-end=\\\"1246\\\">\\r\\nCustomize websites using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1io228e\\\" data-start=\\\"1247\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate Power Pages with other services like Power Automate and Power BI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e48hv8\\\" data-start=\\\"1328\\\" data-end=\\\"1400\\\">\\r\\nDeploy and manage Power Pages websites in a production environment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for performance, security, and user experience.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 62, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
