pt\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\">\\r\\nShare and collaborate on spreadsheets in real-time\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Use Google Sheets for practical tasks like budgeting and record-keeping<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 61, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 42, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(311, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Skype account setup\"}', 'skype-account-setup', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/fd552d64-6387-462d-963b-707acc805493.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/fd552d64-6387-462d-963b-707acc805493.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a step-by-step guide to creating and using a Skype account for communication. Learners will understand how to sign up, set up profiles, manage contacts, and use features such as voice calls, video calls, messaging, and screen sharing. The course is designed for beginners who want to use Skype for personal, educational, or professional communication.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-01 19:06:41', '2026-06-14 16:19:28', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"evbib5\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\" data-end=\\\"683\\\">Create and verify a Skype account successfully.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"584t45\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"725\\\">\\r\\nSet up and customize a user profile.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gzbi4t\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\" data-end=\\\"766\\\">\\r\\nAdd, manage, and organize contacts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5vkwf0\\\" data-start=\\\"767\\\" data-end=\\\"811\\\">\\r\\nMake voice and video calls using Skype.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1me7nzi\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"861\\\">\\r\\nSend and receive messages, files, and media.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wyiy5p\\\" data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">\\r\\nUse screen sharing and basic collaboration features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16rkkhq\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"977\\\">\\r\\nAdjust privacy and security settings for safe usage.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common issues while using Skype.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 57, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 48, 0, 0, 0,