(312, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Power BI Fundamentals\"}', 'power-bi-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ChatGPT Image Apr 1, 2026, 09_19_30 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ChatGPT Image Apr 1, 2026, 09_19_30 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Power BI Fundamentals, in this course is designed to give you a strong foundation in using Microsoft Power BI for data\\r\\nanalysis and visualization. Youâ€™ll learn how to connect to various data sources, clean and transform data with Power\\r\\nQuery, and create relationships between datasets. The course covers building interactive reports and dashboards,\\r\\nselecting the right visuals, and applying filters and slicers to enhance usability. Youâ€™ll explore the basics of DAX (Data\\r\\nAnalysis Expressions) to create calculated columns and measures, helping you perform deeper analysis. Best practices\\r\\nfor organizing your reports, maintaining consistency in design, and ensuring clarity in data storytelling are also included.\\r\\nBy the end, youâ€™ll be able to turn raw data into meaningful insights, share your reports via the Power BI Service, and\\r\\nset the stage for more advanced skills in data modeling, analytics, and performance optimization. Pavan Lalwani<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-02 01:20:45', '2026-06-17 19:47:26', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create interactive Power BI reports and dashboards using diverse data sources and visualizations<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply Power Query to clean, transform, and model data for effective analysis in Power BI<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize DAX to develop calculated columns and measures for advanced data insights and analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Share and publish Power BI reports securely via Power BI Service, ensuring data storytelling and usability<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 89, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(313, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 38, 19, '{\"en\":\"Power BI metrics fundamentals\"}', 'power-bi-metrics-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ChatGPT Image Apr 1, 2026, 09_31_32 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-04-2026/ChatGPT Image Apr 1, 2026, 09_31_32 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Powerâ€¯BI metrics, in this course we will learn about Powerâ€¯BI metrics course. Power BI is a powerful business\\r\\nanalytics tool that helps organizations visualize data and share insights across teams. This course focuses on teaching\\r\\nyou how to create, manage, and analyze key metrics that drive business decisions. You will explore how to design\\r\\neffective Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) and custom metrics using Power BIâ€™s versatile tools. The course covers\\r\\ndata modeling techniques, DAX formulas for advanced calculations, and how to build interactive dashboards that\\r\\nhighlight your metrics clearly. Additionally, you will learn to implement time intelligence metrics, set up real-time data\\r\\nmonitoring, and optimize report performance. By mastering these Power BI metrics skills, you can transform raw data\\r\\ninto actionable insights, enabling better strategic planning and decision-making for your organization. Jason Davidson\\r\\nPower B<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-02 01:32:18', '2026-05-19 15:06:21', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Create and customize key performance indicators (KPIs) using Power BI for effective business monitoring<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Design interactive dashboards that visualize critical business metrics and facilitate data-driven decisions<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply DAX formulas to develop advanced calculations and custom metrics in Power BI reports<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement time intelligence functions to analyze trends and seasonal patterns in business data<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize Power BI report performance for real-time data monitoring and efficient data analysis<\\/p><p style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize data modeling techniques to organize and connect datasets for comprehensive metric analysis<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
