(316, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fundamentos de microsoft word\"}', 'fundamentos-de-microsoft-word', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/05-04-2026/c231cf92-3995-4346-bd27-07a91db16a46.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/05-04-2026/c231cf92-3995-4346-bd27-07a91db16a46.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"206\\\" data-end=\\\"239\\\">Fundamentos de Microsoft Word<\\/strong> course provides a comprehensive introduction to using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Word<\\/span> for creating, editing, and formatting documents. This course is designed for beginners who want to develop essential word processing skills for academic, personal, or professional use.<\\/li><li>Participants will learn how to navigate the interface, create structured documents, apply formatting styles, insert tables and images, and use basic tools to improve productivity. By the end of the course, learners will be able to produce well-organized and visually appealing documents efficiently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-05 20:05:57', '2026-04-05 20:17:41', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li><strong data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"931\\\">Understand the Interface<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"935\\\" data-end=\\\"1021\\\">\\r\\n<ul><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nNavigate the ribbon, toolbar, and workspace in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Microsoft Word<\\/span><\\/span>\\r\\n<\\/li><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1e8b76o\\\" data-start=\\\"1023\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1026\\\" data-end=\\\"1057\\\">Create and Manage Documents<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1061\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1d221cj\\\" data-start=\\\"1061\\\" data-end=\\\"1102\\\">\\r\\nCreate, open, save, and print documents\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uvdwm0\\\" data-start=\\\"1106\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\">\\r\\nUse different file formats\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17snouh\\\" data-start=\\\"1136\\\" data-end=\\\"1257\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1139\\\" data-end=\\\"1169\\\">Format Text and Paragraphs<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1173\\\" data-end=\\\"1257\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"kvzn9r\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\" data-end=\\\"1226\\\">\\r\\nApply fonts, styles, alignment, spacing, and themes\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"25rmfq\\\" data-start=\\\"1230\\\" data-end=\\\"1257\\\">\\r\\nUse bullets and numbering\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jjjpch\\\" data-start=\\\"1259\\\" data-end=\\\"1378\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1262\\\" data-end=\\\"1295\\\">Insert and Customize Elements<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1299\\\" data-end=\\\"1378\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"124fmse\\\" data-start=\\\"1299\\\" data-end=\\\"1340\\\">\\r\\nAdd tables, images, shapes, and symbols\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ez9yp0\\\" data-start=\\\"1344\\\" data-end=\\\"1378\\\">\\r\\nFormat inserted objects properly\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ce5rvz\\\" data-start=\\\"1380\\\" data-end=\\\"1503\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1383\\\" data-end=\\\"1404\\\">Use Editing Tools<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1408\\\" data-end=\\\"1503\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1micm89\\\" data-start=\\\"1408\\\" data-end=\\\"1464\\\">\\r\\nPerform copy, cut, paste, find, and replace operations\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1visbv0\\\" data-start=\\\"1468\\\" data-end=\\\"1503\\\">\\r\\nUse spell check and grammar tools\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3jzsl0\\\" data-start