(318, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"HVAC certification exam prep\"}', 'hvac-certification-exam-prep', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/05-04-2026/30bc88d6-c233-4d69-a94c-49847f075d5f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/05-04-2026/30bc88d6-c233-4d69-a94c-49847f075d5f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This HVAC Certification Exam Prep course is designed to help students and technicians successfully prepare for industry certification exams. It covers essential HVAC concepts including system components, refrigeration cycles, electrical fundamentals, troubleshooting, and safety practices. The course combines theory and practical knowledge to build confidence for passing certification exams.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-05 20:56:53', '2026-06-19 18:20:46', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul data-start=\\\"626\\\" data-end=\\\"1015\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"1l6u4x2\\\" data-start=\\\"626\\\" data-end=\\\"683\\\">Understand core HVAC principles and system operations\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ni8254\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"744\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and explain HVAC components and their functions\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1fh1pca\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\" data-end=\\\"796\\\">\\r\\nApply electrical and refrigeration fundamentals\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"e482wp\\\" data-start=\\\"797\\\" data-end=\\\"852\\\">\\r\\nDiagnose and troubleshoot common HVAC system issues\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10p331w\\\" data-start=\\\"853\\\" data-end=\\\"904\\\">\\r\\nInterpret diagrams, gauges, and system readings\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"120bkl0\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\" data-end=\\\"960\\\">\\r\\nFollow safety standards and industry best practices\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"owpy18\\\" data-start=\\\"961\\\" data-end=\\\"1015\\\">\\r\\nBe fully prepared to pass HVAC certification exams&nbsp;<\\/li>