(320, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AnyDesk from basics to advanced\"}', 'anydesk-from-basics-to-advanced', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/59e9c3d3-5309-40e1-adcc-50f050f0c77e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/59e9c3d3-5309-40e1-adcc-50f050f0c77e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive guide to using AnyDesk for remote desktop access, starting from the fundamentals and progressing to advanced features. Learners will understand how to install, configure, and securely use AnyDesk for personal and professional purposes.<\\/li><li>The course covers remote connections, file transfer, unattended access, session management, and troubleshooting. It is ideal for IT support professionals, remote workers, freelancers, and anyone looking to manage systems remotely with efficiency and security.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-12 10:13:36', '2026-06-17 14:24:06', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1ubgrmg\\\" data-start=\\\"851\\\" data-end=\\\"911\\\">Understand the fundamentals of remote desktop technology\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kh6jvp\\\" data-start=\\\"912\\\" data-end=\\\"963\\\">\\r\\nInstall and set up AnyDesk on different devices\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ekzapg\\\" data-start=\\\"964\\\" data-end=\\\"1016\\\">\\r\\nConnect to remote systems securely using AnyDesk\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1zde6w\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\" data-end=\\\"1094\\\">\\r\\nConfigure unattended access for remote control without permission prompts\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17ceqyd\\\" data-start=\\\"1095\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">\\r\\nTransfer files between local and remote devices\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"i31qgm\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1198\\\">\\r\\nCustomize settings for performance and security\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1azg1m0\\\" data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1246\\\">\\r\\nManage multiple remote sessions effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vtbof5\\\" data-start=\\\"1247\\\" data-end=\\\"1306\\\">\\r\\nTroubleshoot common connectivity and performance issues\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13cre48\\\" data-start=\\\"1307\\\" data-end=\\\"1356\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for secure remote access\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5izya3\\\" data-start=\\\"1357\\\" data-end=\\\"1429\\\">\\r\\nUse AnyDesk for business support, remote work, and IT administration<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 72, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 48, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(321, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel formulas for beginners\"}', 'excel-formulas-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/dc39be08-3d9f-443d-834e-894ab2f6472f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/dc39be08-3d9f-443d-834e-894ab2f6472f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to introduce beginners to the world of Microsoft Excel formulas. You will learn how to perform calculations, analyze data, and automate tasks using essential formulas and functions. Starting from the basics, the course gradually builds your confidence in using formulas like SUM, IF, VLOOKUP, and more in real-world scenarios.<\\/li><li>By the end of this course, you will be able to work efficiently with Excel spreadsheets and apply formulas to solve everyday problems in business, education, and personal use.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-12 15:42:09', '2026-06-20 20:02:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1bjh45c\\\" data-start=\\\"759\\\" data-end=\\\"822\\\"> Understand the basics of Excel formulas and how they work\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sy65kb\\\" data-start=\\\"823\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\">\\r\\n✅ Perform calculations using functions like <strong data-start=\\\"869\\\" data-end=\\\"899\\\">SUM, AVERAGE, MIN, and MAX<\\/strong>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bj97nx\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\" data-end=\\\"964\\\">\\r\\n✅ Use logical functions such as <strong data-start=\\\"936\\\" data-end=\\\"942\\\">IF<\\/strong> for decision-making\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hmoff\\\" data-start=\\\"965\\\" data-end=\\\"1031\\\">\\r\\n✅ Apply lookup functions like <strong data-start=\\\"997\\\" data-end=\\\"1008\\\">VLOOKUP<\\/strong> to find data quickly\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jhou6x\\\" data-start=\\\"1032\\\" data-end=\\\"1087\\\">\\r\\n✅ Work with cell references (relative and absolute)\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wmvj58\\\" data-start=\\\"1088\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\n✅ Handle basic errors in formulas\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1amalu4\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1185\\\">\\r\\n✅ Create simple, automated spreadsheets for daily tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li>✅ Improve productivity and accuracy in data handling<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 46, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(322, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Master excel skills for beginners\"}', 'master-excel-skills-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/cb5c2fff-1863-4d47-9b41-e6bb292f93b7.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-04-2026/cb5c2fff-1863-4d47-9b41-e6bb292f93b7.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li><strong data-start=\\\"165\\\" data-end=\\\"202\\\">Master Excel Skills for Beginners<\\/strong> is a comprehensive course designed to help you build a strong foundation in Microsoft Excel. Whether you\'re a student, job seeker, or professional, this course will guide you through essential Excel tools and techniques used in everyday tasks.<\\/li><li>You will learn how to organize data, perform calculations, create charts, and use basic formulas to improve productivity and decision-making. With hands-on examples and practical exercises, this course ensures you gain confidence in using Excel efficiently for personal and professional purposes.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-12 20:38:14', '2026-06-20 19:18:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<li data-section-id=\\\"7z2q6f\\\" data-start=\\\"831\\\" data-end=\\\"893\\\">Understand the Excel interface, menus, and basic functions\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xgxvv\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\" data-end=\\\"950\\\">\\r\\nCreate, edit, and format spreadsheets professionally\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"t46wza\\\" data-start=\\\"951\\\" data-end=\\\"988\\\">\\r\\nEnter and manage data efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2cdb7s\\\" data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-end=\\\"1057\\\">\\r\\nUse essential formulas and functions (SUM, AVERAGE, COUNT, etc.)\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"r6v9uz\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\" data-end=\\\"1119\\\">\\r\\nApply cell formatting, conditional formatting, and styles\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ljmzqn\\\" data-start=\\\"1120\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\">\\r\\nSort and filter data to extract useful information\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1lsou5o\\\" data-start=\\\"1175\\\" data-end=\\\"1232\\\">\\r\\nCreate basic charts and graphs for data visualization\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1yc6pkb\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\" data-end=\\\"1285\\\">\\r\\nPerform simple data analysis for better insights\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"gq0x6n\\\" data-start=\\\"1286\\\" data-end=\\\"1336\\\">\\r\\nSave, print, and share Excel files confidently<\\/li>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 72, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(324, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Setting up automated invoices in shopify\"}', 'setting-up-automated-invoices-in-shopify', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-04-2026/fbe29782-1a97-4195-a7d6-2d1149efbc7f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-04-2026/fbe29782-1a97-4195-a7d6-2d1149efbc7f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a step-by-step guide to setting up automated invoicing in Shopify, helping businesses streamline their billing process and improve efficiency. You will learn how to configure invoice settings, integrate apps, customize invoice templates, and automate sending invoices to customers. By the end of this course, you will be able to reduce manual work, ensure accurate billing, and enhance customer experience using Shopify’s powerful automation tools.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-13 16:01:41', '2026-06-20 08:10:04', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul data-start=\\\"735\\\" data-end=\\\"1162\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"cqddov\\\" data-start=\\\"735\\\" data-end=\\\"805\\\">Understand the basics of invoicing and its importance in eCommerce\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"sx8thf\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-end=\\\"851\\\">\\r\\nConfigure invoice settings within Shopify\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16pocrs\\\" data-start=\\\"852\\\" data-end=\\\"902\\\">\\r\\nSet up automated invoice generation for orders\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1tyzenz\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"965\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate third-party apps for advanced invoicing features\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7kapm4\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\" data-end=\\\"1015\\\">\\r\\nCustomize invoice templates to match branding\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bnok6y\\\" data-start=\\\"1016\\\" data-end=\\\"1068\\\">\\r\\nAutomate sending invoices via email to customers\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q9pzlv\\\" data-start=\\