(325, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fix internet explorer problems\"}', 'fix-internet-explorer-problems', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-04-2026/b3290ad6-f03a-4987-bb28-1b4d9d70265d.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-04-2026/b3290ad6-f03a-4987-bb28-1b4d9d70265d.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to help users identify, troubleshoot, and fix common issues in Internet Explorer. Whether you\'re facing slow performance, page loading errors, crashes, or security warnings, this course provides step-by-step guidance to resolve them efficiently.<\\/li><li>Learners will explore browser settings, learn how to clear cache and cookies, reset configurations, manage add-ons, and handle compatibility issues. The course also introduces best practices to maintain browser performance and ensure a smooth browsing experience.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-14 01:44:56', '2026-06-20 18:49:17', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1gsvmmq\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\" data-end=\\\"890\\\">Understand common Internet Explorer problems and their causes\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2mn7hc\\\" data-start=\\\"891\\\" data-end=\\\"949\\\">\\r\\nClear cache, cookies, and browsing history effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xj0mzr\\\" data-start=\\\"950\\\" data-end=\\\"1007\\\">\\r\\nReset browser settings to default for troubleshooting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kqexh4\\\" data-start=\\\"1008\\\" data-end=\\\"1067\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and disable problematic add-ons and extensions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5b6ojv\\\" data-start=\\\"1068\\\" data-end=\\\"1122\\\">\\r\\nFix page loading, script, and compatibility errors\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"g2bcei\\\" data-start=\\\"1123\\\" data-end=\\\"1164\\\">\\r\\nImprove browser speed and performance\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hliwfy\\\" data-start=\\\"1165\\\" data-end=\\\"1222\\\">\\r\\nApply security settings to avoid threats and warnings\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Perform basic maintenance to prevent future issues<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 67, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 43, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(327, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"excel skills with power pivot data import\"}', 'excel-skills-with-power-pivot-data-import', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-04-2026/61c28c6f-13a9-4503-9b40-ab8cb402e316.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-04-2026/61c28c6f-13a9-4503-9b40-ab8cb402e316.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to help learners master advanced Excel skills by focusing on data import, transformation, and analysis using Power Pivot. Participants will learn how to efficiently import data from multiple sources such as CSV files, databases, and external systems, and build powerful data models within Excel.<\\/li><li>The course covers essential concepts like data relationships, calculated columns, measures using DAX (Data Analysis Expressions), and creating interactive reports. By the end of the course, learners will be able to handle large datasets, automate data processing, and generate meaningful insights for business decision-making.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-04-14 16:49:09', '2026-06-12 01:26:26', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"1574\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"vinys8\\\" data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\">Import data from various sources including CSV files, Excel sheets, and databases.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q24chi\\\" data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1080\\\">\\r\\nClean and transform data for analysis using Excel tools.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q79mwp\\\" data-start=\\\"1081\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage data models using Power Pivot.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"didxq\\\" data-start=\\\"1135\\\" data-end=\\\"1188\\\">\\r\\nEstablish relationships between multiple tables.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1us22y1\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\" data-end=\\\"1253\\\">\\r\\nUse DAX formulas to create calculated columns 