\"1007\\\">\\r\\nCreate accurate 2D floor plans with proper dimensions, annotations, and scaling.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ochv1v\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\" data-end=\\\"1087\\\">\\r\\nDesign and arrange furniture layouts for residential and commercial spaces.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"17zuhmt\\\" data-start=\\\"1089\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\">\\r\\nApply layer management, line types, hatching, and plotting techniques effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"43yl4\\\" data-start=\\\"1176\\\" data-end=\\\"1245\\\">\\r\\nDevelop detailed furniture drawings and reusable furniture blocks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1r4r59q\\\" data-start=\\\"1247\\\" data-end=\\\"1322\\\">\\r\\nPrepare professional architectural layouts following industry standards.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"puat19\\\" data-start=\\\"1324\\\" data-end=\\\"1398\\\">\\r\\nImprove space planning and interior arrangement skills using CAD tools.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dyjkbm\\\" data-start=\\\"1400\\\" data-end=\\\"1491\\\">\\r\\nGenerate print-ready drawings and presentation sheets for client or project submissions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2cac2d\\\" data-start=\\\"1493\\\" data-end=\\\"1578\\\">\\r\\nModify and edit existing floor plans efficiently using advanced drafting commands.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1f9fptu\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\" data-end=\\\"1670\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nComplete real-time projects involving floor planning and furniture design confidently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 93, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(352, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google Slides Microsoft PowerPoin\"}', 'google-slides-microsoft-powerpoin', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/05-05-2026/e1b1a1e9-5bea-43d3-8bdc-c9d0dabbb9de.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/05-05-2026/e1b1a1e9-5bea-43d3-8bdc-c9d0dabbb9de.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>The main difference between Google Slides and Microsoft PowerPoint is that Google Slides is an online-only tool part of<\\/p><p>the Google Workspace while Microsoft PowerPoint is an offline, downloadable tool created by Microsoft Windows ...<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-05 19:41:00', '2026-06-19 22:41:28', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Create engaging presentations using Google Slides and Microsoft PowerPoint with advanced design skills and multimedia integration<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for slide layout, typography, and visual storytelling in Google Slides and PowerPoint presentations<\\/li><li>Utilize collaboration features in Google Slides for real-time teamwork and feedback on presentation projects<\\/li><li>Design professional templates and themes to enhance branding and consistency in PowerPoint and Google Slides<\\/li><li>Incorporate animations, transitions, and multimedia elements to improve presentation engagement and clarity<\\/li><li>Optimize presentation files for sharing, exporting, and presenting across various devices and platforms<\\/li><li>Implement effective slide management and organization techniques for large and complex presentations<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common issues in Google Slides and PowerPoint to ensure smooth presentation delivery<\\/li><li>Leverage cloud storage and online sharing options for seamless collaboration and distribution of presentations<\\/li><li>Apply accessibility features in Google Slides and PowerPoint to create inclusive presentations for diverse audiences<\\/li><li>Use data visualization tools within both platforms to present complex information clearly and effectively<\\/li><li>Integrate third-party add-ons and plugins to extend the functionality of Google Slides and PowerPoint<\\/li><li>Develop skills to deliver compelling presentations with confidence using both tools<\\/li><li>Compare features, advantages, and limitations of Google Slides versus PowerPoint for different presentation needs<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for designing visually appealing and impactful presentations<\\/li><li>Utilize keyboard shortcuts and productivity tips to streamline presentation creation and editing processes<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 90, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(353, NULL, NULL, 38, 52, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Rhino furniture for beginners\"}', 'rhino-furniture-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/05-05-2026/sasi.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/05-05-2026/sasi.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<\\/p><h2 data-section-id=\\\"wgimwx\\\" data-start=\\\"669\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\"><\\/h2><p><\\/p><ul><li>Learn the fundamentals of furniture modeling in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Rhinoceros 3D<\\/span><\\/span> through a beginner-friendly, step-by-step workflow. This course introduces essential 3D modeling tools and techniques used to design modern furniture pieces with precision and creativity. Students will explore drawing basics, curves, surfaces, solid modeling, measurements, and rendering preparation while creating practical furniture models such as tables, cabinets, chairs, and storage units. The course is designed for beginners with no prior experience in 3D modeling and focuses on developing a strong foundation for furniture design and visualization.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-05 22:25:24', '2026-06-20 01:58:03', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><\\/p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><p><\\/p><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var