\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dlsa6s\\\" data-start=\\\"913\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">\\r\\nUse essential modeling commands such as Extrude, Sweep, Loft, Boolean, and Fillet.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ynfk3m\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1086\\\">\\r\\nDesign basic furniture elements including tables, cabinets, shelves, and chairs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jjv8hk\\\" data-start=\\\"1087\\\" data-end=\\\"1173\\\">\\r\\nApply dimensions, layers, and organization techniques for professional workflows.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"v83kd1\\\" data-start=\\\"1174\\\" data-end=\\\"1257\\\">\\r\\nDevelop clean and editable 3D models suitable for presentation and production.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19nyvun\\\" data-start=\\\"1258\\\" data-end=\\\"1320\\\">\\r\\nPrepare furniture models for rendering and visualization.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"coly67\\\" data-start=\\\"1321\\\" data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence in creating original furniture concepts using Rhino tools and techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 53, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
