\\\" data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"885\\\">\\r\\nCreate accurate 2D plans, elevations, and sectional views from 3D models.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xkla0d\\\" data-start=\\\"886\\\" data-end=\\\"965\\\">\\r\\nUse projection and viewport techniques effectively for technical drafting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1su7k1l\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\" data-end=\\\"1043\\\">\\r\\nManage layers, dimensions, annotations, and hidden lines professionally.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jt2qn4\\\" data-start=\\\"1044\\\" data-end=\\\"1116\\\">\\r\\nGenerate clean and industry-standard 2D documentation for projects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"3u4n1b\\\" data-start=\\\"1117\\\" data-end=\\\"1182\\\">\\r\\nApply plotting and layout settings for print-ready drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1igqlzd\\\" data-start=\\\"1183\\\" data-end=\\\"1263\\\">\\r\\nImprove drafting productivity using AutoCAD conversion tools and shortcuts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8zsd9y\\\" data-start=\\\"1264\\\" data-end=\\\"1348\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nPrepare professional architectural and mechanical drawing sheets from 3D designs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 60, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(358, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"OpenAI deep research\"}', 'openai-deep-research', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-05-2026/066e8cfa-34d4-4ed2-814d-08cb9a869923.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-05-2026/066e8cfa-34d4-4ed2-814d-08cb9a869923.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master the power of OpenAI Deep Research tools to perform advanced AI-driven research, data analysis, content generation, and intelligent automation. This course is designed for students, developers, researchers, marketers, and business professionals who want to leverage AI for faster and smarter decision-making.<\\/li><li>You will learn how to use OpenAI models for deep internet research, prompt engineering, document analysis, report generation, data summarization, AI workflows, and real-world business applications. The course includes hands-on projects, practical examples, and industry-level techniques to help you build AI-powered research solutions confidently.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, learners will be able to conduct professional-quality AI research, automate repetitive tasks, generate insights from large datasets, and integrate OpenAI tools into real-world applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-07 02:20:14', '2026-06-20 06:21:18', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1g5dpb9\\\" data-start=\\\"987\\\" data-end=\\\"1052\\\">Understand the fundamentals of OpenAI Deep Research workflows.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"gmk2kt\\\" data-start=\\\"1053\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\nUse advanced prompt engineering techniques for accurate AI responses.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"m3jq8m\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1191\\\">\\r\\nPerform AI-powered internet and document research efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13hqy52\\\" data-start=\\\"1192\\\" data-end=\\\"1259\\\">\\r\\nGenerate professional reports, summaries, and insights using AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"z5u3p6\\\" data-start=\\\"1260\\\" data-end=\\\"1311\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze large amounts of data with OpenAI tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1g0rmji\\\" data-start=\\\"1312\\\" data-end=\\\"1376\\\">\\r\\nBuild intelligent research assistants and automation systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"130se3i\\\" data-start=\\\"1377\\\" data-end=\\\"1437\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate OpenAI APIs into web applications and projects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"y8i97m\\\" data-start=\\\"1438\\\" data-end=\\\"1503\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity using AI-driven workflows and automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18g1qsu\\\" data-start=\\\"1504\\\" data-end=\\\"1584\\\">\\r\\nApply AI research methods in business, education, marketing, and development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vskuld\\\" data-start=\\\"1585\\\" data-end=\\\"1645\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nCreate real-world AI projects using OpenAI technologies.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 60, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 57, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(359, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google AI Essentials course\"}', 'google-ai-essentials-course', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/422337e0-fa8d-4727-b2ac-82959561eb56.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/422337e0-fa8d-4727-b2ac-82959561eb56.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"50\\\" data-end=\\\"74\\\">Google AI Essentials<\\/strong> course is designed for beginners who want to understand the fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence and how AI tools can improve productivity, creativity, and problem-solving in real-world scenarios. This course introduces learners to AI concepts, generative AI, machine learning basics, and practical applications using modern AI-powered tools.<\\/li><li>Students will learn how to use AI responsibly, write effective prompts, automate tasks, analyze information, and improve workflow efficiency across various industries. No prior programming or technical experience is required, making this course ideal for students, professionals, entrepreneurs, and job seekers looking to build future-ready AI skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-07 14:04:53', '2026-06-20 21:23:27', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"pquowg\\\" data-start=\\\"854\\\" data-end=\\\"930\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence and Generative AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"gcy3na\\\" data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"1006\\\">\\r\\nIdentify real-world applications of AI across industries and businesses.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"acn16s\\\" data-start=\\\"1007\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\">\\r\\nUse AI tools effectively for productivity, research, content creation, and automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1luwi21\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1169\\\">\\r\\nWrite clear and effective prompts to get better AI-generated results.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"eg2x5f\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\" data-end=\\\"1234\\\">\\r\\nApply AI techniques to solve everyday and workplace problems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"99k2ku\\\" data-start=\\\"1235\\\" data-end=\\\"1319\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand ethical AI practices, responsible AI usage, and data privacy concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16awelm\\\" data-start=\\\"1320\\\" data-end=\\\"1398\\\">\\r\\nImprove decision-making and workflow efficiency using AI-powered solutions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12nyd6o\\\" data-start=\\\"1399\\\" data-end=\\\"1483\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence in using modern AI technologies for career growth and innovation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1whprcz\\\" data-start=\\\"1484\\\" data-end=\\\"1568\\\">\\r\\nExplore Google AI tools and platforms for practical learning and experimentation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mmt6c2\\\" data-start=\\\"1569\\\" data-end=\\\"1644\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced AI and machine learning courses.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 61, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 55, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(360, NULL, NULL, 38, 54, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"PDF to word conversion methods\"}', 'pdf-to-word-conversion-methods', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/13555674-7d12-41c7-a2d3-d8125b1602dc.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/13555674-7d12-41c7-a2d3-d8125b1602dc.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"491\\\"><b>This course provides a complete guide to converting PDF files into editable Word documents using various online and offline methods. Learners will understand different PDF conversion techniques, OCR tools, formatting preservation methods, and software applications used for accurate document conversion. The course also covers troubleshooting common conversion issues, maintaining document quality, and improving workflow efficiency for professional and academic use.<\\/b><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-07 14:37:30', '2026-06-19 14:19:33', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"request-WEB:92a38d4e-ebee-4081-8f82-27b92a050002-1\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-4\\\" data-scroll-anchor=\\\"false\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\"><div class=\\\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--