(365, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI Powered devOps\"}', 'ai-powered-devops', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/d434eca1-b95b-4dd8-b124-d5cf13e56272.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/d434eca1-b95b-4dd8-b124-d5cf13e56272.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master the future of software delivery with AI Powered DevOps. This course is designed to help students, developers, and IT professionals integrate Artificial Intelligence into modern DevOps workflows. Learn how AI can automate deployments, improve monitoring, optimize CI\\/CD pipelines, predict system failures, enhance cloud infrastructure management, and accelerate software development processes.<\\/li><li>Through practical projects and real-world tools, learners will gain hands-on experience with DevOps practices such as containerization, cloud deployment, infrastructure automation, continuous integration, continuous delivery, and AI-driven operational intelligence.<\\/li><li>This course covers popular technologies including Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Terraform, AWS, monitoring tools, and AI-assisted automation platforms.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 01:34:29', '2026-06-19 04:02:36', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"17pfmcy\\\" data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1016\\\">Understand the fundamentals of DevOps and AI integration.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2q65qi\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\" data-end=\\\"1076\\\">\\r\\nBuild and manage CI\\/CD pipelines using automation tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"21hqr1\\\" data-start=\\\"1077\\\" data-end=\\\"1148\\\">\\r\\nUse AI tools to improve deployment speed and operational efficiency.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rrxhp1\\\" data-start=\\\"1149\\\" data-end=\\\"1226\\\">\\r\\nImplement containerization using Docker and orchestration with Kubernetes.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16taqt6\\\" data-start=\\\"1227\\\" data-end=\\\"1303\\\">\\r\\nAutomate infrastructure provisioning using Terraform and cloud platforms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jlhjq9\\\" data-start=\\\"1304\\\" data-end=\\\"1384\\\">\\r\\nMonitor applications and infrastructure using intelligent monitoring systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"582apz\\\" data-start=\\\"1385\\\" data-end=\\\"1448\\\">\\r\\nDetect and predict system issues using AI-powered analytics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"a59vda\\\" data-start=\\\"1449\\\" data-end=\\\"1512\\\">\\r\\nDeploy scalable applications on cloud platforms such as AWS.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14hcp3k\\\" data-start=\\\"1513\\\" data-end=\\\"1594\\\">\\r\\nImprove software delivery workflows with automation and best DevOps practices.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fci38z\\\" data-start=\\\"1595\\\" data-end=\\\"1671\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop real-world AI Powered DevOps projects for industry applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 49, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 56, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(366, NULL, NULL, 38, 55, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Induction generator from synchronous motor\"}', 'induction-generator-from-synchronous-motor', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/js.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/js.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"2h4poh\\\" data-start=\\\"691\\\" data-end=\\\"711\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\">This course explains the concept of converting a synchronous motor into an induction generator and its practical applications in electrical power systems. Learners will understand the construction, working principles, excitation requirements, and operational characteristics of both synchronous motors and induction generators. The course also covers rotor modifications, generator operation, speed-slip relationship, reactive power requirements, and industrial applications such as renewable energy systems and power generation. Practical examples and diagrams are included to help beginners clearly understand machine conversion techniques and generator behavior.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 02:15:51', '2026-06-18 07:35:16', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"request-WEB:2d5d91c9-95bf-4924-960b-a5ac26ad8cf7-3\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-4\\\" data-scroll-anchor=\\\"false\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\" style