-start=\\\"1000\\\" data-end=\\\"1088\\\">Describe the process of converting a synchronous motor into an induction generator.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14cxcfc\\\" data-start=\\\"1089\\\" data-end=\\\"1176\\\">Analyze excitation systems, rotor configurations, and reactive power requirements.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jvzm3z\\\" data-start=\\\"1177\\\" data-end=\\\"1253\\\">Understand generator operation under varying load and speed conditions.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vt37e6\\\" data-start=\\\"1254\\\" data-end=\\\"1342\\\">Apply induction generator concepts in renewable energy and industrial applications.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cyd1ho\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\" data-end=\\\"1417\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Interpret machine diagrams and operational characteristics effectively.<\\/li><\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch\\\"><\\/div><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary p-3\\\" aria-label=\\\"Dismiss rating prompt\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"icon text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary\\\"><use href=\\\"\\/cdn\\/assets\\/sprites-core-86c0e697.svg#85f94b\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\"><\\/use><\\/svg><\\/button><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 81, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(367, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI code editors for beginners\"}', 'ai-code-editors-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/c243df47-87ef-47de-bcae-281999d42eda (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/07-05-2026/c243df47-87ef-47de-bcae-281999d42eda (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to use AI-powered code editors to write code faster, debug easily, and improve programming skills even as a beginner. This course introduces modern AI coding tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor AI, Codeium, and other smart editors that help developers generate code, explain errors, and build projects efficiently.<\\/li><li>You will understand how AI assists in coding, automation, debugging, and project development using beginner-friendly examples in Python and web development. By the end of the course, students will be able to confidently use AI coding tools to improve productivity and create real-world applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 03:16:54', '2026-06-20 07:08:42', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"ll8f5v\\\" data-start=\\\"737\\\" data-end=\\\"810\\\">Understand the basics of AI-powered code editors and their features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r1v56i\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"877\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure popular AI coding tools and extensions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6dm6x5\\\" data-start=\\\"878\\\" data-end=\\\"943\\\">\\r\\nUse AI suggestions to write clean and efficient code faster.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19dh65a\\\" data-start=\\\"944\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">\\r\\nDebug programming errors with AI assistance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"iva3u6\\\" data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-end=\\\"1065\\\">\\r\\nGenerate functions, scripts, and project templates using AI tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"f17zk9\\\" data-start=\\\"1066\\\" data-end=\\\"1135\\\">\\r\\nImprove coding productivity and workflow using smart automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"174gigt\\\" data-start=\\\"1136\\\" data-end=\\\"1200\\\">\\r\\nBuild beginner-level projects with AI-assisted development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jpz16j\\\" data-start=\\\"1201\\\" data-end=\\\"1280\\\">\\r\\nCompare different AI coding editors and choose the right one for projects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17azmep\\\" data-start=\\\"1281\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">\\r\\nApply AI tools in Python, web development, and automation tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1mqv99n\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1426\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop confidence in coding even without prior programming experience.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(368, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI sales automation\"}', 'ai-sales-automation', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/cc17798e-9b1d-4e28-bd43-b634d51bc663.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/cc17798e-9b1d-4e28-bd43-b634d51bc663.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to automate modern sales processes using Artificial Intelligence tools and workflows. This course teaches you how to generate leads, automate customer communication, manage CRM systems, create AI-powered sales funnels, and improve conversions with smart automation. Whether you are a beginner, entrepreneur, freelancer, or sales professional, this course will help you save time, increase productivity, and grow revenue using AI-driven sales strategies.<\\/li><li>You will explore practical tools for email automation, chatbot integration, lead nurturing, customer engagement, analytics, and sales optimization. By the end of the course, you will be able to build intelligent sales systems that work 24\\/7 with minimal manual effort.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 04:46:00', '2026-06-20 11:28:02', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"3snwl9\\\" data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">Understand the fundamentals of AI in sales and business automation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qtnvtv\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"992\\\">\\r\\nCreate automated lead generation systems using AI tools\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"98ny8o\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1052\\\">\\r\\nBuild AI-powered email marketing and outreach campaigns\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1b747vm\\\" data-start=\\\"1053\\\" data-end=\\\"1110\\\">\\r\\nAutomate customer follow-ups and engagement workflows\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cxt1li\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nUse chatbots for customer interaction and sales support\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1n6hqjn\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\r\\nManage and integrate CRM systems effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1uq0p64\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1279\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze customer data and improve conversion strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pkmdsa\\\" data-start=\\\"1280\\\" data-end=\\\"1344\\\">\\r\\nDesign intelligent sales funnels for businesses and startups\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ac5k5h\\\" data-start=\\\"1345\\\" data-end=\\\"1405\\\">\\r\\nIncrease productivity by reducing repetitive sales tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1n17wrs\\\" data-start=\\\"1406\\\" data-end=\\\"1469\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nImplement real-world AI sales automation projects confidently<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 58, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(369, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI tools for designers and architect\"}', 'ai-tools-for-designers-and-architect', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/55e8f704-e952-4541-ada5-864439b027b8.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/55e8f704-e952-4541-ada5-864439b027b8.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Unlock the power of Artificial Intelligence to transform your design and architectural workflow. This course introduces designers, architects, interior designers, and creative professionals to the most powerful AI tools used for concept generation, 3D visualization, rendering, space planning, image enhancement, and creative automation. Learn how AI can accelerate ideation, improve productivity, create stunning visual presentations, and simplify repetitive design tasks. Through practical examples and hands-on demonstrations, you’ll discover how to integrate AI into real-world design and architectural projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 14:00:57', '2026-06-17 03:31:10', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of AI in design and architecture workflows<br data-start=\\\"833\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">\\r\\n✅ Use AI tools for concept design, mood board creation, and idea generation<br data-start=\\\"911\\\" data-end=\\\"914\\\">\\r\\n✅ Create AI-generated architectural visualizations and realistic renders<br data-start=\\\"986\\\" data-end=\\\"989\\\">\\r\\n✅ Enhance images, sketches, and design presentations using AI tools<br data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1059\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n✅ Apply AI for interior design planning and space optimization<br data-start=\\\"1121\\\" data-end=\\\"1124\\\">\\r\\n✅ Generate creative design assets faster with AI automation<br data-start=\\\"1183\\\" data-end=\\\"1186\\\">\\r\\n✅ Explore tools like Midjourney, DALL·E, Adobe Firefly, Stable Diffusion, and AI rendering platforms<br data-start=\\\"1286\\\" data-end=\\\"1289\\\">\\r\\n✅ Improve productivity and reduce manual design effort<br data-start=\\\"1343\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">\\r\\n✅ Build professional-quality visual presentations for clients<br data-start=\\\"1407\\\" data-end=\\\"1410\\\">\\r\\n✅ Integrate AI tools into modern architecture and design projects confidently<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 113, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(370, NULL, NULL, 38, 55, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Synchronous motor working principles\"}', 'synchronous-motor-working-principles', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/ss.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/08-05-2026/ss.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"553\\\">This course explains the working principles, construction, and operation of synchronous motors used in industrial and power system applications. Learners will understand the interaction between the stator magnetic field and rotor magnetic field, synchronous speed concepts, starting methods, excitation systems, and performance characteristics. The course also introduces practical applications, advantages, limitations, and maintenance basics of synchronous motors through simple theoretical explanations and real-world examples.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-08 16:11:28', '2026-06-12 01:32:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-col text-sm\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"request-WEB:fc776d10-1a5e-4367-9825-b4cc21b28329-1\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-4\\\" data-scroll-anchor=\\\"false\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\"><div class=\\\"t