for drawing and editing operations.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"t2ispn\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"879\\\">Apply navigation and view shortcuts to improve drawing efficiency.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9wbi1b\\\" data-start=\\\"880\\\" data-end=\\\"973\\\">Utilize modification shortcuts such as Move, Copy, Trim, Extend, and Offset effectively.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1csxs05\\\" data-start=\\\"974\\\" data-end=\\\"1043\\\">Create dimensions and manage layers using quick command methods.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pxwfnp\\\" data-start=\\\"1044\\\" data-end=\\\"1120\\\">Improve drafting speed, productivity, and accuracy in AutoCAD projects.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1oy0c0e\\\" data-start=\\\"1121\\\" data-end=\\\"1214\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Develop confidence in professional CAD practices for academic and industrial applications.<\\/li><\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 11, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 58, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
