(376, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"ChatGPT Techniques\"}', 'chatgpt-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/8babf47d-5ea4-4a75-96b7-27eb1b7219e9.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/8babf47d-5ea4-4a75-96b7-27eb1b7219e9.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master practical ChatGPT techniques to improve productivity, creativity, communication, and problem-solving. This course teaches learners how to use ChatGPT effectively for content creation, coding assistance, business tasks, research, learning, and automation. From beginner to advanced prompting methods, students will explore real-world use cases and learn how to get accurate, creative, and professional results using AI tools.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-09 18:30:08', '2026-06-18 02:10:43', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"a6mi8u\\\" data-start=\\\"554\\\" data-end=\\\"614\\\">Understand the fundamentals of ChatGPT and generative AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"87ly9v\\\" data-start=\\\"615\\\" data-end=\\\"666\\\">\\r\\nWrite effective prompts for better AI responses.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19zz18x\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\" data-end=\\\"731\\\">\\r\\nUse ChatGPT for content writing, brainstorming, and research.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mi7t1p\\\" data-start=\\\"732\\\" data-end=\\\"799\\\">\\r\\nApply AI techniques for coding, debugging, and automation tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p4vgcy\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"869\\\">\\r\\nGenerate professional emails, reports, and presentations using AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"k3dot8\\\" data-start=\\\"870\\\" data-end=\\\"929\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity with advanced prompting strategies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ufwbmw\\\" data-start=\\\"930\\\" data-end=\\\"983\\\">\\r\\nUse ChatGPT responsibly with ethical AI practices.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wmafj9\\\" data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">\\r\\nBuild AI-assisted workflows for personal and professional projects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1j1hkpa\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\" data-end=\\\"1119\\\">\\r\\nExplore real-world applications of ChatGPT across industries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nrgv27\\\" data-start=\\\"1120\\\" data-end=\\\"1186\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence in using AI tools for daily work and learning.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 69, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(377, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"keyboard shortcuts in excel for beginners\"}', 'keyboard-shortcuts-in-excel-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 9, 2026, 05_30_17 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 9, 2026, 05_30_17 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Enhance your efficiency and productivity with our comprehensive online course on keyboard shortcuts in Excel for\\r\\nbeginners. This training course is designed to help you master essential shortcuts that streamline your workflow, making\\r\\ndaily tasks faster and more accurate. Whether you\'re new to Excel or looking to improve your computer softwares skills,\\r\\nthis course offers valuable insights to boost your professional capabilities and support your career growth in the\\r\\ncompetitive Middle East and beyond. Throughout this course, you will learn how to navigate Excel more efficiently by\\r\\nutilizing a wide range of keyboard shortcuts. This includes shortcuts for formatting, data entry, formula creation, and\\r\\ndata management. By the end of the training, you will be able to perform common tasks swiftly, saving time and reducing\\r\\nerrors in your work. This course is ideal for professionals, students, and anyone interested in improving their computer\\r\\nsoftwares proficiency. No prior experience in Excel is necessary, making it accessible for beginners eager to develop\\r\\nessential skills that are highly valued in the job market. Choosing this course on our platform ensures you receive expert\\r\\ninstruction from industry professionals committed to your learning success. Our certified course provides a recognized\\r\\nqualification that can enhance your CV, demonstrating your commitment to acquiring valuable skills for career\\r\\nadvancement. Completing this training course will open doors to various career opportunities, including administrative\\r\\nroles, data analysis, project management, and more. Mastering keyboard shortcuts in Excel is a fundamental skill that\\r\\ncan significantly improve your efficiency and make you a more competitive candidate in the job market. Upon successful\\r\\ncompletion, you will earn a professional certificate that validates your skills and knowledge, supporting your career\\r\\ndevelopment in the Middle East, Saudi Arabia, UAE, and beyond. Invest in your future today with this essential training\\r\\ncourse designed to empower your professional journey. Ajay Anand&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-09 21:46:04', '2026-06-20 09:51:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(232, 236, 240);\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Master essential Excel keyboard shortcuts for data entry, formatting, and navigation to improve workflow efficiency and accuracy<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply shortcuts to create and edit formulas quickly, enhancing data analysis and spreadsheet management skills<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(232, 236, 240);\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize keyboard commands to manage large datasets, including sorting, filtering, and data validation tasks<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Increase productivity by mastering time-saving shortcuts for common Excel functions in professional and academic settings<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 35, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(378, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AI tools\"}', 'ai-tools', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/3cabfe44-47ad-4418-98c2-6f92128eada2.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-05-2026/3cabfe44-47ad-4418-98c2-6f92128eada2.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces learners to the most powerful and practical AI tools used for productivity, content creation, coding, design, automation, research, and business workflows. Participants will explore popular AI platforms such as chat assistants, image generators, writing tools, presentation creators, coding copilots, and automation solutions. The course focuses on hands-on learning to help beginners and professionals understand how AI tools can save time, improve efficiency, and enhance creativity in real-world tasks.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-09 22:58:16', '2026-06-19 20:54:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"u4kkv0\\\" data-start=\\\"640\\\" data-end=\\\"719\\\">Understand the fundamentals of artificial intelligence and AI-powered tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10nooo3\\\" data-start=\\\"720\\\" data-end=\\\"785\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and compare popular AI tools for different use cases.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pgfrr5\\\" data-start=\\\"786\\\" data-end=\\\"855\\\">\\r\\nUse AI chat tools for writing, brainstorming, and problem-solving.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1is3bxa\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"928\\\">\\r\\nCreate images, presentations, and digital content using AI platforms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"45rms2\\\" data-start=\\\"929\\\" data-end=\\\"997\\\">\\r\\nApply AI tools for coding, automation, and workflow optimization.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1v89war\\\" data-start=\\\"998\\\" data-end=\\\"1061\\\">\\r\\nUse AI tools for research, summarization, and data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hdebeu\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\" data-end=\\\"1121\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity by integrating AI into daily tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Follow best practices and ethical considerations while using AI tools.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 87, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
