(385, NULL, NULL, 55, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Revit electrical for beginners\"}', 'revit-electrical-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 10_42_24 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 10_42_24 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Revit electrical, in this course is designed to provide you with comprehensive skills to create, manage, and analyze\\r\\nelectrical systems in Revit. This course covers the essentials of electrical design, including the creation of circuits,\\r\\nwiring, and the placement of electrical components such as switches, outlets, and lighting fixtures. You will learn to\\r\\ndevelop electrical layouts for power, lighting, and low voltage systems, while understanding the integration of electrical\\r\\nelements with the architectural and mechanical models in Revit. The course also delves into advanced topics such as load\\r\\ncalculations, panel design, and working with electrical symbols and annotations. Additionally, you will gain knowledge in\\r\\ngenerating electrical reports and schedules, ensuring your designs meet code requirements. By the end of the course,\\r\\nyou will be proficient in using Revit for electrical design, ready to apply these skills in real-world MEP projects,\\r\\nenhancing your efficiency and accuracy in building design and documentation.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 14:49:28', '2026-06-18 09:14:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><span style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(27, 33, 47);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/font><\\/span><span style=\\\"color: var(--dynamic-text-color); text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Create detailed electrical layouts for power,\\r\\nlighting, and low voltage systems using Revit electrical tools and components<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Develop electrical circuits, wiring diagrams,\\r\\nand placement of switches, outlets, and lighting fixtures in Revit models<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Integrate electrical systems seamlessly with\\r\\narchitectural and mechanical models for comprehensive building design in Revit<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Perform load calculations and panel design to\\r\\noptimize electrical system performance and safety in Revit<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Generate accurate electrical reports, schedules,\\r\\nand annotations to meet building codes and project requirements<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Apply electrical symbols, tags, and annotations\\r\\neffectively for clear documentation in Revit projects<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Manage electrical system modifications and\\r\\nupdates efficiently within Revit to reflect design changes<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Analyze electrical system performance and\\r\\ntroubleshoot issues using Revit electrical analysis features<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Collaborate with multidisciplinary teams to\\r\\ncoordinate electrical designs within Revit BIM workflows<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\" style=\\\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\\\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:\\r\\nWingdings\\\">ü<span style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;\\r\\n<\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]-->Ensure electrical designs comply with industry\\r\\nstandards, safety codes, and best practices using Revit tools<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(386, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Basic dimensioning in autoCAD for beginners\"}', 'basic-dimensioning-in-autocad-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 12_07_14 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 12_07_14 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"491\\\">Learn the fundamentals of dimensioning in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">AutoCAD<\\/span> with this beginner-friendly course designed for students, engineers, architects, draftsmen, and design enthusiasts. This course introduces the essential tools and techniques used to create accurate dimensions in technical drawings. Participants will understand how to apply linear, angular, radial, diameter, aligned, and ordinate dimensions while following standard drafting practices.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"493\\\" data-end=\\\"797\\\">The course also covers dimension styles, text formatting, scaling, annotation settings, and best practices for producing professional engineering drawings. Through practical exercises and real-world examples, learners will gain confidence in creating clear and precise dimensions in 2D drafting projects.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 16:09:09', '2026-06-20 00:58:32', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\\\"><div class=\\\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\\\"><div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"9935f1ce-ebf9-4c09-8032-23dc5ad0a406\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-5\\\" class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\\\"><ol data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"1752\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"ar8uc1\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"966\\\">Understand the importance of dimensioning in technical and engineering drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zy3niz\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\" data-end=\\\"1067\\\">\\r\\nNavigate and use basic dimensioning tools in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">AutoCAD<\\/span><\\/span> effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"17wemam\\\" data-start=\\\"1068\\\" data-end=\\\"1149\\\">\\r\\nCreate linear, aligned, angular, radial, and diameter dimensions accurately.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1s098hd\\\" data-start=\\\"1150\\\" data-end=\\\"1225\\\">\\r\\nApply dimension styles, text settings, and annotation scales properly.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1crzyc0\\\" data-start=\\\"1226\\\" data-end=\\\"1302\\\">\\r\\nModify and edit dimensions to improve drawing clarity and presentation.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1q2k903\\\" data-start=\\\"1303\\\" data-end=\\\"1396\\\">\\r\\nFollow standard dimensioning conventions used in engineering and architectural drafting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1w4novh\\\" data-start=\\\"1397\\\" data-end=\\\"1459\\\">\\r\\nProduce neat, readable, and professional 2D CAD drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1rq66hm\\\" data-start=\\\"1460\\\" data-end=\\\"1549\\\">\\r\\nImprove drafting productivity using shortcuts and efficient dimensioning techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16ixrf8\\\" data-start=\\\"1550\\\" data-end=\\\"1652\\\">\\r\\nPrepare technical drawings suitable for academic, industrial, and project documentation purposes.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ssij76\\\" data-start=\\\"1653\\\" data-end=\\\"1752\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence to work on beginner-level CAD drafting and dimensioning projects independently.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(387, NULL, NULL, 36, 43, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"ChatGPT mobile for beginners\"}', 'chatgpt-mobile-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/74c30ab3-5a0a-49fe-8cd8-610d319693c3.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/74c30ab3-5a0a-49fe-8cd8-610d319693c3.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course is designed to help learners confidently use ChatGPT on mobile devices for everyday tasks, productivity, learning, and communication. Participants will explore the ChatGPT mobile app interface, learn how to ask effective questions, use voice and image features, generate content, and apply AI assistance for personal and professional use. No prior AI experience is required, making this course ideal for students, professionals, business owners, and anyone curious about AI on smartphones.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 16:36:49', '2026-06-13 06:48:44', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"60yozn\\\" data-start=\\\"651\\\" data-end=\\\"705\\\">Understand the basics of ChatGPT and generative AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gqyav7\\\" data-start=\\\"706\\\" data-end=\\\"770\\\">\\r\\nInstall, set up, and navigate the ChatGPT mobile application.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12vqzis\\\" data-start=\\\"771\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">\\r\\nCreate effective prompts to get accurate and useful responses.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hykjuz\\\" data-start=\\\"837\\\" data-end=\\\"907\\\">\\r\\nUse ChatGPT for writing, translations, brainstorming, and research.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12d4fdm\\\" data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"970\\\">\\r\\nUtilize voice input and image-based interactions on mobile.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"leemw4\\\" data-start=\\\"971\\\" data-end=\\\"1046\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity with AI for emails, notes, summaries, and planning.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1awto9s\\\" data-start=\\\"1047\\\" data-end=\\\"1128\\\">\\r\\nApply ChatGPT for learning, business communication, and daily problem-solving.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Follow best practices for responsible and safe AI usage.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(388, NULL, NULL, 38, 52, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Electronic Circuits\"}', 'electronic-circuits', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/bc40e621-f119-4b6f-abd4-fd06571a3628.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/bc40e621-f119-4b6f-abd4-fd06571a3628.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"xseuwx\\\" data-start=\\\"473\\\" data-end=\\\"491\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"22\\\" data-end=\\\"471\\\">This Electronic Circuits course introduces the fundamentals of analog and digital electronic components and circuit design. Learners will understand the working principles of resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, amplifiers, and integrated circuits through practical examples and circuit analysis. The course also covers circuit simulation, troubleshooting techniques, and real-world electronic applications used in modern devices and systems.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 17:25:37', '2026-06-17 22:32:08', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active\\/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:ca8e072d-2767-4966-acf5-686253a57571-3\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R