(389, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Generative AI applications\"}', 'generative-ai-applications', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/d2acc7c3-cae8-4751-b107-5f3047f61c6a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/d2acc7c3-cae8-4751-b107-5f3047f61c6a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a practical introduction to Generative AI applications and how they are transforming industries. Learners will explore how Generative AI creates text, images, audio, video, code, and intelligent conversational experiences. The course covers popular AI tools, real-world use cases, prompt engineering basics, automation workflows, ethical considerations, and hands-on application development. It is designed for beginners, professionals, creators, and business users who want to leverage Generative AI for productivity, creativity, and innovation.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 17:46:32', '2026-06-13 09:51:10', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1cgqiwp\\\" data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"763\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Generative AI and its core concepts\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"p0iinl\\\" data-start=\\\"764\\\" data-end=\\\"834\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of Generative AI applications and use cases\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1g7eutf\\\" data-start=\\\"835\\\" data-end=\\\"904\\\">\\r\\nCreate AI-generated content including text, images, audio, and code\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dbotdi\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\" data-end=\\\"962\\\">\\r\\nUse prompt engineering techniques for better AI outputs\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ujkuho\\\" data-start=\\\"963\\\" data-end=\\\"1013\\\">\\r\\nBuild AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8qzytu\\\" data-start=\\\"1014\\\" data-end=\\\"1082\\\">\\r\\nApply Generative AI tools for business automation and productivity\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"brvf3f\\\" data-start=\\\"1083\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nExplore AI applications in marketing, education, healthcare, and software development\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lby0df\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1240\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand ethical AI practices, limitations, and responsible usage\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"o92r6s\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\" data-end=\\\"1306\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate Generative AI tools into daily workflows and projects\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1j7kk9m\\\" data-start=\\\"1307\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop practical Generative AI solutions for real-world problems<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(390, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Responsible Safe AI Systems course\"}', 'responsible-safe-ai-systems-course', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 02_40_23 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 02_40_23 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><span data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"54\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">Responsible Safe AI Systems<\\/span>&nbsp;is a foundational course designed to introduce learners to the principles, practices, and technologies required to develop ethical, transparent, secure, and trustworthy Artificial Intelligence systems. The course explores key concepts such as AI ethics, fairness, accountability, privacy, bias detection, explainable AI, AI governance, safety frameworks, and responsible deployment of AI applications. Learners will understand how AI impacts society and industries while gaining practical knowledge on building AI systems that are reliable, human-centered, and aligned with legal and ethical standards. The course also covers emerging regulations, risk management, and best practices for safe AI implementation in real-world scenarios.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 18:46:07', '2026-06-20 08:00:26', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"790\\\"><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1wcy0iq\\\" data-start=\\\"874\\\" data-end=\\\"979\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"926\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Responsible AI<\\/strong> and its importance in modern technology and society.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lf8j6p\\\" data-start=\\\"981\\\" data-end=\\\"1117\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"1025\\\">Identify ethical challenges and risks<\\/strong> associated with AI systems, including bias, privacy, misinformation, and security concerns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11gd7jl\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1225\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1122\\\" data-end=\\\"1185\\\">Apply fairness, accountability, and transparency principles<\\/strong> in AI model development and deployment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hx7cxe\\\" data-start=\\\"1227\\\" data-end=\\\"1324\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1230\\\" data-end=\\\"1286\\\">Analyze AI safety frameworks and governance policies<\\/strong> used in organizations and industries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hcslbo\\\" data-start=\\\"1326\\\" data-end=\\\"1412\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1329\\\" data-end=\\\"1385\\\">Implement privacy-preserving and secure AI practices<\\/strong> to protect data and users.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3b2sj2\\\" data-start=\\\"1414\\\" data-end=\\\"1521\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1417\\\" data-end=\\\"1481\\\">Evaluate AI models for bias, reliability, and explainability<\\/strong> using appropriate techniques and tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fals6a\\\" data-start=\\\"1523\\\" data-end=\\\"1624\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1526\\\" data-end=\\\"1574\\\">Understand legal and regulatory requirements<\\/strong> related to AI systems and responsible innovation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"43unto\\\" data-start=\\\"1626\\\" data-end=\\\"1729\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1629\\\" data-end=\\\"1665\\\">Develop trustworthy AI solutions<\\/strong> that are safe, inclusive, and beneficial for users and society.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vlg6d2\\\" data-start=\\\"1731\\\" data-end=\\\"1835\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1734\\\" data-end=\\\"1787\\\">Demonstrate awareness of human-centered AI design<\\/strong> and the societal impact of intelligent systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><strong data-start=\\\"1841\\\" data-end=\\\"1891\\\" style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Prepare for careers and research opportunities<\\/strong><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\"> in ethical AI, AI governance, and safe AI system development.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(391, NULL, NULL, 54, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Stator construction for synchronous machines\"}', 'stator-construction-for-synchronous-machines', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 03_57_52 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 11, 2026, 03_57_52 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><strong data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"71\\\">Stator Construction for Synchronous Machines<\\/strong> is a technical course designed to provide learners with a comprehensive understanding of the design, construction, components, and functioning of stators used in synchronous machines. The course covers the fundamentals of synchronous machines, stator frame construction, laminated cores, slot design, insulation systems, winding arrangements, cooling methods, and assembly techniques. Learners will gain practical knowledge about materials used in stator manufacturing, electrical and mechanical considerations, and maintenance practices for efficient machine performance. The course is suitable for electrical engineering students, technicians, and professionals interested in power systems, electrical machines, and industrial applications.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-11 20:03:29', '2026-06-20 15:28:49', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1qz49lu\\\" data-start=\\\"898\\\" data-end=\\\"975\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"901\\\" data-end=\\\"950\\\">Understand the basic principles and operation<\\/strong> of synchronous machines.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2vtlat\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"980\\\" data-end=\\\"1025\\\">Identify the major components of a stator<\\/strong> and explain their functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"g0m837\\\" data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1163\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1059\\\" data-end=\\\"1133\\\">Explain the construction and design of stator frames, cores, and slots<\\/strong> used in synchronous machines.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"of5etw\\\" data-start=\\\"1165\\\" data-end=\\\"1273\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1168\\\" data-end=\\\"1235\\\">Understand stator winding configurations and insulation systems<\\/strong> for efficient electrical performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"rv6in4\\\" data-start=\\\"1275\\\" data-end=\\\"1358\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1278\\\" data-end=\\\"1329\\\">Analyze the materials and manufacturing methods<\\/strong> used in stator construction.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"bca43w\\\" data-start=\\\"1360\\\" data-end=\\\"1451\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1363\\\" data-end=\\\"1410\\\">Describe cooling and ventilation techniques<\\/strong> employed in synchronous machine stators.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1mgbcqn\\\" data-start=\\\"1453\\\" data-end=\\\"1541\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1456\\\" data-end=\\\"1513\\\">Interpret technical drawings and construction layouts<\\/strong> related to stator assembly.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"oswixv\\\" data-start=\\\"1543\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1546\\\" data-end=\\\"1599\\\">Apply safety procedures and maintenance practices<\\/strong> for stator installation and operation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cie0q5\\\" data-start=\\\"1640\\\" data-end=\\\"1732\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1643\\\" data-end=\\\"1697\\\">Evaluate common faults and troubleshooting methods<\\/strong> associated with stator components.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1myyiha\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\" data-end=\\\"1857\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1738\\\" data-end=\\\"1797\\\">Develop practical knowledge for industrial applications<\\/strong> involving synchronous machine construction and maintenance.<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0,