section-id=\\\"1t26y1c\\\" data-start=\\\"915\\\" data-end=\\\"990\\\">\\r\\nIdentify the major processes involved in oil exploration and drilling.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"o1hovk\\\" data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand petroleum refining and fuel production methods.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qpqrmp\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\" data-end=\\\"1118\\\">\\r\\nRecognize common equipment used in oil and gas operations.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ii48rz\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand pipeline transportation and storage systems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14ksx0o\\\" data-start=\\\"1180\\\" data-end=\\\"1258\\\">\\r\\nApply basic knowledge of industrial safety and environmental regulations.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"25kpq7\\\" data-start=\\\"1259\\\" data-end=\\\"1341\\\">\\r\\nDescribe the role of automation and modern technologies in the energy sector.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1wrafjg\\\" data-start=\\\"1342\\\" data-end=\\\"1423\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand global energy demand and market trends in oil and gas industries.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6wisrg\\\" data-start=\\\"1424\\\" data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop foundational industry knowledge useful for engineering and technical careers.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(396, NULL, NULL, 55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Motor Winding Connections basics\"}', 'motor-winding-connections-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_14_38 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_14_38 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>The <span data-start=\\\"62\\\" data-end=\\\"98\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">Motor Winding Connections Basics<\\/span> course introduces learners to the fundamental concepts of electric motor winding and connection techniques used in electrical machines. The course covers types of motor windings, winding layouts, coil connections, star and delta connections, single-phase and three-phase motor winding basics, and troubleshooting methods. Learners will gain practical understanding of winding diagrams, insulation practices, testing procedures, and safety precautions followed in motor rewinding and maintenance. This course is ideal for beginners, electricians, diploma students, technicians, and electrical engineering learners seeking foundational knowledge in motor winding technology.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 02:13:16', '2026-06-19 18:16:48', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\"; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(232, 236, 240);\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Understand motor winding fundamentals, configurations, and their impact on motor performance and efficiency<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Read and interpret motor winding diagrams accurately for correct motor connections<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Differentiate between star (Y) and delta (Δ) winding connections and their practical applications<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Perform single-phase and three-phase winding techniques for various motor types and sizes<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Switch motor connections safely between star and delta configurations for optimal operation<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Identify common winding issues and troubleshoot motor winding faults effectively<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\"; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(232, 236, 240);\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply correct wiring procedures to ensure safe and reliable motor operation in industrial settings<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Utilize practical skills to connect, test, and maintain motor windings in commercial environments<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Enhance troubleshooting skills to diagnose and repair winding-related motor problems efficiently<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement best practices for winding safety, handling, and maintenance in motor repair tasks<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Optimize motor performance by selecting appropriate winding configurations for specific applications<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Develop confidence in reading technical diagrams and executing precise winding connections<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 41, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(397, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google ads with AI for beginners\"}', 'google-ads-with-ai-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/cd4c0ea6-5470-47e7-b033-833e9d9cc04e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/cd4c0ea6-5470-47e7-b033-833e9d9cc04e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces learners to the fundamentals of Google Ads and how Artificial Intelligence can simplify and enhance digital advertising campaigns. Participants will learn how to create effective search, display, and video ad campaigns while using AI tools for keyword research, ad copy generation, audience targeting, bid optimization, and campaign performance analysis. No prior advertising experience is required, making this course ideal for students, entrepreneurs, marketers, and business owners.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 15:13:44', '2026-06-20 01:22:44', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"b0pw28\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\" data-end=\\\"730\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Google Ads and digital advertising.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"niz7u8\\\" data-start=\\\"731\\\" data-end=\\\"799\\\">\\r\\nCreate and set up Google Search, Display, and Video ad campaigns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7e3mc4\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"861\\\">\\r\\nUse AI tools for keyword research and competitor analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9ncphc\\\" data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"907\\\">\\r\\nGenerate high-converting ad copy using AI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16o1pzi\\\" data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"979\\\">\\r\\nOptimize bidding strategies and audience targeting with AI insights.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"p2eicj\\\" data-start=\\\"980\\\" data-end=\\\"1049\\\">\\r\\nTrack campaign performance using Google Ads analytics and reports.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1baqm1j\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\" data-end=\\\"1111\\\">\\r\\nImprove ad ROI through AI-powered optimization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Launch and manage Google Ads campaigns confidently for business growth.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 57, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(398, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Transformer working principles for beginners\"}', 'transformer-working-principles-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_40_13 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_40_13 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><strong data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"72\\\">Transformer Working Principles for Beginners<\\/strong> is an introductory course designed to help learners understand the basic concepts, construction, and operation of electrical transformers. The course explains how transformers transfer electrical energy using electromagnetic induction and covers important topics such as transformer types, winding configurations, voltage transformation, losses, efficiency, and practical applications in power systems. Through simple explanations and practical examples, learners will gain a strong foundation in transformer fundamentals suitable for students, technicians, and beginners in electrical engineering.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 16:47:04', '2026-06-19 18:25:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%;\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Understand transformer structure, including primary and secondary windings, core materials, and magnetic flux principles for electrical energy transfer<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Explain electromagnetic induction and Faraday’s Law to describe how transformers transfer energy between circuits efficiently<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Calculate turns ratio, voltage transformation, and power efficiency for various transformer types in residential, commercial, and industrial applications<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Identify different transformer types—step-up, step-down, isolation, autotransformers—and their specific uses in power distribution systems<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><div class=\\\"col-md-6\\\" style=\\\"direction: ltr; position: relative; width: 569px; min-height: 1px; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; -webkit-box-flex: 0; flex-basis: 50%; max-width: 50%;\\\"><ul class=\\\"learn-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0px; direction: ltr; list-style: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Analyze transformer performance metrics such as load handling, efficiency, and voltage regulation for optimal operation<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Apply troubleshooting techniques to diagnose and resolve common transformer issues like overheating, core saturation, and insulation failure<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Assess the role of magnetic fields and core materials in transformer operation and performance optimization<\\/li><li style=\\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\\\">Implement safety procedures and maintenance practices to ensure transformer reliability and longevity<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 44, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 58, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(399, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"AutoCAD 2D exercises for engineer\"}', 'autocad-2d-exercises-for-engineer', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_54_04 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 12_54_04 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><strong data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"62\\\">AutoCAD 2D Exercises for Engineers<\\/strong> is a practical training course designed to improve 2D drafting and drawing skills using AutoCAD software. The course focuses on hands-on exercises commonly used in engineering fields such as mechanical, civil, electrical, and architectural design. Learners will practice creating accurate technical drawings, applying dimensions, using drawing and editing tools, and following engineering drafting standards. This course helps beginners and engineering students build confidence in preparing professional 2D engineering drawings efficiently.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 16:57:31', '2026-06-19 18:18:47', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1ushjhq\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"740\\\">Understand the fundamentals of AutoCAD 2D drafting.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sy0ldk\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\r\\nCreate accurate engineering drawings using basic drawing tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1e7iorj\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"897\\\">\\r\\nUse editing commands such as trim, extend, offset, mirror, and fillet effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yhysju\\\" data-start=\\\"898\\\" data-end=\\\"975\\\">\\r\\nApply dimensions, annotations, and text according to drafting standards.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"bsggr1\\\" data-start=\\\"976\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">\\r\\nDevelop engineering sketches and convert them into detailed CAD drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"64iack\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\" data-end=\\\"1127\\\">\\r\\nWork with layers, line types, and object properties professionally.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1frw42f\\\" data-start=\\\"1128\\\" data-end=\\\"1196\\\">\\r\\nPrepare mechanical, civil, and electrical 2D exercise drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ozbdid\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\" data-end=\\\"1274\\\">\\r\\nImprove drawing speed and accuracy using AutoCAD shortcuts and commands.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wvco9h\\\" data-start=\\\"1275\\\" data-end=\\\"1348\\\">\\r\\nInterpret and create engineering layouts for practical applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Generate print-ready technical drawings following industry standards.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(400, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"AutoCAD interior design for beginners\"}', 'autocad-interior-design-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 01_01_02 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 01_01_02 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><span data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"65\\\"><b>AutoCAD Interior Design for Beginners<\\/b><\\/span> is a beginner-friendly course that introduces learners to the fundamentals of interior design drafting using AutoCAD software. The course focuses on creating professional 2D interior layouts, floor plans, furniture arrangements, dimensions, and detailed design drawings used in residential and commercial projects. Learners will gain practical knowledge of drafting techniques, space planning, annotations, layers, and plotting methods while developing real-world interior design projects step by step. This course is ideal for students, aspiring interior designers, architects, and beginners interested in interior drafting and planning.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 17:04:03', '2026-06-20 14:09:11', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"fbs2uo\\\" data-start=\\\"784\\\" data-end=\\\"855\\\">Understand the basics of AutoCAD for interior design applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1uqd8pl\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">\\r\\nCreate accurate 2D floor plans and interior layouts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"729b6e\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nUse AutoCAD drawing and editing tools effectively for interior drafting.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yxunzv\\\" data-start=\\\"992\\\" data-end=\\\"1069\\\">\\r\\nDesign furniture layouts and space planning arrangements professionally.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"v4vxx5\\\" data-start=\\\"1070\\\" data-end=\\\"1144\\\">\\r\\nApply dimensions, text, hatching, and annotations in design drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wdvyx7\\\" data-start=\\\"1145\\\" data-end=\\\"1213\\\">\\r\\nWork with layers, blocks, and templates for organized drafting.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1e7v3af\\\" data-start=\\\"1214\\\" data-end=\\\"1279\\\">\\r\\nDevelop residential and commercial interior design drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"v8nl3d\\\" data-start=\\\"1280\\\" data-end=\\\"1345\\\">\\r\\nPrepare presentation-ready and print-ready interior layouts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4u0o69\\\" data-start=\\\"1346\\\" data-end=\\\"1424\\\">\\r\\nImprove drafting speed and accuracy using AutoCAD shortcuts and commands.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Build confidence in handling beginner-level interior design projects using AutoCAD.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 39, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
