a-start=\\\"864\\\" data-end=\\\"950\\\">\\r\\nApply editing tools such as trim, offset, mirror, fillet, and extend effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1819gec\\\" data-start=\\\"951\\\" data-end=\\\"1028\\\">\\r\\nUse dimensions, annotations, hatching, and text in engineering drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"bjuw8a\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1094\\\">\\r\\nWork efficiently with layers, blocks, and object properties.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cjhc9k\\\" data-start=\\\"1095\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nComplete practical AutoCAD exercises and real-world drafting projects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"md7fwc\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\nImprove drawing speed and productivity using AutoCAD shortcuts and techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"355b4n\\\" data-start=\\\"1255\\\" data-end=\\\"1333\\\">\\r\\nDevelop engineering, architectural, and technical layouts professionally.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"g9fj7v\\\" data-start=\\\"1334\\\" data-end=\\\"1404\\\">\\r\\nPrepare print-ready drawings using layouts and plotting settings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1yrbbp4\\\" data-start=\\\"1405\\\" data-end=\\\"1486\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild confidence in handling beginner to intermediate AutoCAD drafting tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 38, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(402, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Moore s law in VLSI technology\"}', 'moore-s-law-in-vlsi-technology', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/8312788b-0616-4211-950e-0e846e63be11 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/8312788b-0616-4211-950e-0e846e63be11 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"2h4poh\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\" data-end=\\\"597\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"575\\\">This course introduces the concept of Moore’s Law and its impact on the evolution of VLSI (Very Large Scale Integration) technology. Students will learn how transistor scaling has transformed semiconductor devices, integrated circuits, and modern computing systems. The course covers CMOS scaling, fabrication technology, chip performance improvement, power consumption challenges, and future trends beyond Moore’s Law. Learners will gain foundational knowledge of semiconductor miniaturization and VLSI design advancements used in modern electronics.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 18:33:48', '2026-06-17 11:27:41', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active\\/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:6245b62f-d04a-434f-ad95-64c125cf6aaf-5\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-wri