ode=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1lqgklv\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\" data-end=\\\"723\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of Moore’s Law and VLSI technology.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1m9grr2\\\" data-start=\\\"724\\\" data-end=\\\"795\\\">\\r\\nExplain transistor scaling and semiconductor manufacturing trends.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18cmf2v\\\" data-start=\\\"796\\\" data-end=\\\"880\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze the impact of miniaturization on chip performance and power efficiency.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hp7ne1\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"950\\\">\\r\\nIdentify challenges in deep submicron and nanoscale VLSI design.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1v7x9mz\\\" data-start=\\\"951\\\" data-end=\\\"1027\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand CMOS technology evolution and modern IC fabrication methods.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"y95aoe\\\" data-start=\\\"1028\\\" data-end=\\\"1106\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nExplore future technologies beyond Moore’s Law in semiconductor industries.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 99, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(403, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"VLSI Design Fundamentals\"}', 'vlsi-design-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/f9c7116c-700b-4efc-818e-a6bd7793a5f5 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/f9c7116c-700b-4efc-818e-a6bd7793a5f5 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"531\\\"><span data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"52\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">VLSI Design Fundamentals<\\/span>&nbsp;introduces the core concepts of Very Large Scale Integration (VLSI) used in modern semiconductor and chip design industries. This course covers digital electronics basics, CMOS technology, logic gate design, combinational and sequential circuits, layout concepts, fabrication processes, and VLSI design flow. Learners will gain practical knowledge of integrated circuit development, simulation techniques, and hardware design methodologies used in real-world electronic systems.<\\/p><p><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"533\\\" data-end=\\\"824\\\">The course is designed for beginners, engineering students, electronics enthusiasts, and anyone interested in chip design and semiconductor technology. By the end of the course, learners will understand how modern processors and integrated circuits are designed, optimized, and manufactured.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 20:00:06', '2026-06-19 01:34:39', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"531\\\"><span style=\\\"color: var(--dynamic-text-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">.<\\/span><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:a819f8a0-ea9f-4fe0-8079-41b497f2110d-3\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--sha