ata-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"1465\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"bof2wx\\\" data-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"988\\\">Understand the fundamentals of VLSI technology and semiconductor concepts.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k23hyh\\\" data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">Explain CMOS logic design and digital circuit operation.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1eqvvwm\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1113\\\">Design basic combinational and sequential logic circuits.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sa7vlx\\\" data-start=\\\"1114\\\" data-end=\\\"1181\\\">Understand VLSI design flow from specification to fabrication.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1elwaud\\\" data-start=\\\"1182\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\">Analyze timing, power, and area considerations in chip design.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3liygu\\\" data-start=\\\"1250\\\" data-end=\\\"1315\\\">Create simple VLSI layouts and understand fabrication steps.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11j0m84\\\" data-start=\\\"1316\\\" data-end=\\\"1391\\\">Use basic simulation and verification techniques for digital circuits.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fw3jqa\\\" data-start=\\\"1392\\\" data-end=\\\"1465\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Gain foundational knowledge for advanced VLSI and ASIC design courses.<\\/li><\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch\\\"><\\/div><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary p-3\\\" aria-label=\\\"Dismiss rating prompt\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"icon text-token-text-secondary hover:text-to