764\\\" data-end=\\\"844\\\">\\r\\nControl different viewing angles and perspectives for better visualization.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"130a5cy\\\" data-start=\\\"845\\\" data-end=\\\"908\\\">\\r\\nNavigate complex 3D drawings with confidence and accuracy.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"c3x3vg\\\" data-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"979\\\">\\r\\nApply pan, zoom, and orbit functions for smooth model inspection.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"z9ukar\\\" data-start=\\\"980\\\" data-end=\\\"1043\\\">\\r\\nManage visual styles and display settings in 3D workspace.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ax9qzh\\\" data-start=\\\"1044\\\" data-end=\\\"1123\\\">\\r\\nImprove presentation and analysis of engineering and architectural models.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"mz18dr\\\" data-start=\\\"1124\\\" data-end=\\\"1188\\\">\\r\\nWork comfortably in AutoCAD’s 3D environment as a beginner.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1czg2tp\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\" data-end=\\\"1264\\\">\\r\\nEnhance productivity through effective 3D model navigation techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pjihbj\\\" data-start=\\\"1265\\\" data-end=\\\"1341\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced 3D modeling and design workflows.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 53, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(407, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"AutoCAD 3D dimensioning basics for beginners\"}', 'autocad-3d-dimensioning-basics-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 05_33_54 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 12, 2026, 05_33_54 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p><strong data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"72\\\">AutoCAD 3D Dimensioning Basics for Beginners<\\/strong> is an introductory course designed to help learners understand and apply 3D dimensioning techniques in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">AutoCAD<\\/span>. The course covers the fundamentals of adding accurate dimensions, annotations, measurement tools, and dimension styles to 3D models and engineering drawings. Learners will gain practical experience in dimensioning mechanical, architectural, and engineering components while improving drawing clarity, precision, and professional documentation skills.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-12 21:37:31', '2026-06-18 12:08:17', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1pswhgd\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\" data-end=\\\"713\\\">Understand the fundamentals of 3D dimensioning in AutoCAD.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"q85sxq\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\" data-end=\\\"772\\\">\\r\\nApply dimensions accurately to 3D objects and models.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2g65io\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\" data-end=\\\"865\\\">\\r\\nUse different dimension tools such as linear, angular, radius, and diameter dimensions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ek5oq1\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\" data-end=\\\"938\\\">\\r\\nCreate clear and professional annotations for engineering drawings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1o3qrxz\\\" data-start=\\\"939\\\" data-end=\\\"1015\\\">\\r\\nManage dimension styles and formatting according to drafting standards.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xbdgwx\\\" data-start=\\\"1016\\\" data-end=\\\"1077\\\">\\r\\nImprove drawing readability and technical communication.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9bixm0\\\" data-start=\\\"1078\\\" data-end=\\\"1128\\\">\\r\\nMeasure and inspect 3D models with precision.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r77n81\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\" data-end=\\\"1199\\\">\\r\\nWork efficiently with AutoCAD dimensioning commands and settings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ys2wbu\\\" data-start=\\\"1200\\\" data-end=\\\"1282\\\">\\r\\nPrepare properly dimensioned 3D drawings for engineering and design projects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Build a strong foundation for advanced 3D drafting and modeling workflows.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(408, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Basics of microsoft excel for beginners\"}', 'basics-of-microsoft-excel-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/52754d89-c1d3-4422-a6bb-184e86d14ca9.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/52754d89-c1d3-4422-a6bb-184e86d14ca9.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamentals of Microsoft Excel, one of the most essential tools for data organization, calculation, and reporting. Learners will explore the Excel interface, worksheets, formatting, formulas, functions, charts, and basic data management techniques. Through practical exercises, participants will gain confidence in creating spreadsheets, analyzing simple data, and improving workplace productivity using Excel.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 02:11:47', '2026-06-17 06:33:35', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"14lmyit\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\" data-end=\\\"652\\\">Understand the Microsoft Excel interface and workbook structure\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vsqflx\\\" data-start=\\\"653\\\" data-end=\\\"718\\\">\\r\\nCreate, save, open, and manage Excel worksheets and workbooks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hyp9tm\\\" data-start=\\\"719\\\" data-end=\\\"766\\\">\\r\\nEnter, edit, and format data professionally\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vcjd5u\\\" data-start=\\\"767\\\" data-end=\\\"835\\\">\\r\\nUse basic formulas and functions (SUM, AVERAGE, COUNT, MIN, MAX)\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tx39f\\\" data-start=\\\"836\\\" data-end=\\\"909\\\">\\r\\nApply cell formatting, borders, alignment, and conditional formatting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1tsxbnp\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\" data-end=\\\"946\\\">\\r\\nSort and filter data efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lsou5o\\\" data-start=\\\"947\\\" data-end=\\\"1004\\\">\\r\\nCreate basic charts and graphs for data visualization\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wtc5a3\\\" data-start=\\\"1005\\\" data-end=\\\"1057\\\">\\r\\nManage rows, columns, and worksheets effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1r33vv2\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\" data-end=\\\"1110\\\">\\r\\nPerform simple data analysis and reporting tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cwucvn\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity using Excel shortcuts and best practices<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 35, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(409, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Settings in Primavera P6\"}', 'settings-in-primavera-p6', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/24cb2955-7e19-483c-b8eb-d35ee5adef03.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-05-2026/24cb2955-7e19-483c-b8eb-d35ee5adef03.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to configure and customize settings in Primavera P6 to optimize project planning and control. This course covers essential application settings, user preferences, calendars, currencies, codes, resource settings, and security configurations. Designed for beginners and project professionals, it helps you set up Primavera P6 efficiently for real-world project management workflows.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 03:19:58', '2026-06-16 08:47:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"odl5i\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\" data-end=\\\"555\\\">Understand the purpose of key settings in Primavera P6\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4mbc2d\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\" data-end=\\\"623\\\">\\r\\nConfigure user preferences and application settings effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11alzrc\\\" data-start=\\\"624\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage project calendars and working time settings\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wlnsxr\\\" data-start=\\\"690\\\" data-end=\\\"744\\\">\\r\\nSet up currencies, units, and global\\/project codes\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tb8jgj\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\" data-end=\\\"806\\\">\\r\\nConfigure resource and role settings for project planning\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"s2cxm8\\\" data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nManage security profiles and access permissions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"196708\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\">\\r\\nCustomize layout and display settings for better productivity\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply Primavera P6 settings for efficient project execution<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(410, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Elevations with autoCAD floor plans\"}', 'elevations-with-autocad-floor-plans', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 12_21_30 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 12_21_30 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>“Elevations with AutoCAD Floor Plans” is a practical course designed to teach students how to create professional architectural floor plans and elevation drawings using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">AutoCAD<\\/span>. The course covers drafting techniques, dimensioning, layout planning, front and side elevations, annotations, scaling, and presentation standards used in architectural and civil engineering projects. Learners will gain hands-on experience in transforming 2D floor plans into accurate elevation views for residential and commercial building designs.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 16:27:49', '2026-06-20 13:34:57', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:34500632-337e-47e6-b916-c79f2895eb27-1\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh))