data-end=\\\"1102\\\">\\r\\nUse spell check, find & replace, and other editing tools effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Print and export professional-looking documents for personal or office use.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 18, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(413, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Microsoft planner\"}', 'microsoft-planner', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 12_52_54 PM (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 12_52_54 PM (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Microsoft Planner is a productivity and project management course designed to help learners organize tasks, manage teamwork, and improve workflow efficiency using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Planner<\\/span>. The course covers task creation, scheduling, collaboration tools, progress tracking, dashboards, notifications, and integration with Microsoft 365 applications such as Teams and Outlook. Learners will gain practical experience in planning projects, assigning responsibilities, and monitoring team performance effectively.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 16:59:28', '2026-06-20 01:56:07', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"5hy4p8\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\" data-end=\\\"717\\\">Understand the fundamentals of project and task management using Microsoft Planner.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ncasn3\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\" data-end=\\\"781\\\">\\r\\nCreate and organize plans, buckets, and tasks efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13xlwxg\\\" data-start=\\\"782\\\" data-end=\\\"847\\\">\\r\\nAssign tasks and collaborate with team members in real time.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1535arp\\\" data-start=\\\"848\\\" data-end=\\\"916\\\">\\r\\nTrack project progress using charts, schedules, and dashboards.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fukofl\\\" data-start=\\\"917\\\" data-end=\\\"982\\\">\\r\\nManage deadlines, priorities, and notifications effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vmn0ti\\\" data-start=\\\"983\\\" data-end=\\\"1067\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate Microsoft Planner with Microsoft Teams and other Microsoft 365 tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"eazjp5\\\" data-start=\\\"1068\\\" data-end=\\\"1147\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity and workflow management in professional environments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Plan and manage team projects using modern digital collaboration techniques.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 47, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(414, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"DIY 500W bicycle generator for beginners\"}', 'diy-500w-bicycle-generator-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/a2181a9b-1c52-4947-819f-403c7bf91612.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/a2181a9b-1c52-4947-819f-403c7bf91612.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"680\\\">This course introduces beginners to the design and construction of a DIY 500W bicycle generator system for generating clean and renewable electricity. Learners will understand the working principles of bicycle-powered generators, electrical energy conversion, basic wiring, voltage regulation, and power storage methods. The course provides step-by-step guidance for assembling components such as DC motors, alternators, chains, belts, batteries, and inverters. By the end of the course, students will be able to build a functional bicycle generator suitable for emergency backup power, small electronics charging, and educational renewable energy projects.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 21:15:00', '2026-06-12 03:01:38', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:1c6382cc-f70e-40ab-86fb-fb3bed78a90c-1\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response