ction-id=\\\"15rups8\\\" data-start=\\\"848\\\" data-end=\\\"921\\\">\\r\\nIdentify the components required for a 500W bicycle generator setup.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14eqimf\\\" data-start=\\\"922\\\" data-end=\\\"999\\\">\\r\\nAssemble and install a bicycle-powered generator safely and efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ydwzje\\\" data-start=\\\"1000\\\" data-end=\\\"1071\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic electrical wiring and voltage regulation techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19vt00x\\\" data-start=\\\"1072\\\" data-end=\\\"1128\\\">\\r\\nTest and troubleshoot generator output performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"g8rm7g\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\" data-end=\\\"1209\\\">\\r\\nApply renewable energy concepts for practical home or educational projects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"lckaql\\\" data-start=\\\"1210\\\" data-end=\\\"1283\\\">\\r\\nOperate and maintain the bicycle generator system for long-term use.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hdlwz4\\\" data-start=\\\"1284\\\" data-end=\\\"1353\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDemonstrate safe handling of electrical and mechanical components.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 52, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(415, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel Password generator with random numbers\"}', 'excel-password-generator-with-random-numbers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/97e25398-965b-42bd-90c3-222988625138.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/97e25398-965b-42bd-90c3-222988625138.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"2h4poh\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\" data-end=\\\"670\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"648\\\">This course introduces learners to creating secure password generators in Microsoft Excel using formulas, functions, and automation techniques. Students will learn how to generate random passwords containing numbers, uppercase letters, lowercase letters, and special characters for enhanced security. The course also explains essential Excel functions such as RAND, RANDBETWEEN, CONCAT, and TEXTJOIN, along with beginner-level VBA automation for advanced password generation. By the end of the course, learners will be able to design professional password generator tools within Excel for personal, academic, and office use.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 22:33:20', '2026-06-18 20:22:39', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active\\/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:50c97c41-d000-4645-a4b1-5af767892cb7-3\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focu