s-only-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1km634g\\\" data-start=\\\"728\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the importance of strong passwords and cybersecurity basics.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1u9zcob\\\" data-start=\\\"805\\\" data-end=\\\"876\\\">\\r\\nGenerate random numbers and secure passwords using Excel formulas.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18zhfl9\\\" data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"938\\\">\\r\\nUse RAND and RANDBETWEEN functions effectively in Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e9lnp9\\\" data-start=\\\"939\\\" data-end=\\\"1020\\\">\\r\\nCreate passwords with uppercase, lowercase, numeric, and special characters.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19zt06w\\\" data-start=\\\"1021\\\" data-end=\\\"1084\\\">\\r\\nApply CONCAT and TEXTJOIN functions for password creation.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1i0itan\\\" data-start=\\\"1085\\\" data-end=\\\"1153\\\">\\r\\nDesign an interactive Excel-based password generator worksheet.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"j8qqi1\\\" data-start=\\\"1154\\\" data-end=\\\"1216\\\">\\r\\nAutomate password generation using basic VBA programming.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"trolx9\\\" data-start=\\\"1217\\\" data-end=\\\"1291\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop secure and professional password management solutions in Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(416, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Cómo instalar windows server 11\"}', 'como-instalar-windows-server-11', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/27a09042-752e-4ce7-9552-68e2b1904bc1 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/27a09042-752e-4ce7-9552-68e2b1904bc1 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Aprende a instalar Windows Server 11 desde cero con una guía práctica y fácil de seguir. Este curso cubre la descarga de la ISO, la creación de un USB booteable, la instalación paso a paso, la configuración inicial del sistema, particiones de disco, ajustes de red y configuraciones básicas para administradores principiantes. Ideal para estudiantes de TI, técnicos y profesionales que desean dominar la instalación y configuración de servidores Windows.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-13 23:22:29', '2026-06-15 22:37:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"10yvuve\\\" data-start=\\\"505\\\" data-end=\\\"569\\\">Comprender los requisitos del sistema para Windows Server 11\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kgp58g\\\" data-start=\\\"570\\\" data-end=\\\"619\\\">\\r\\nDescargar correctamente la imagen ISO oficial\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"m6i6rl\\\" data-start=\\\"620\\\" data-end=\\\"672\\\">\\r\\nCrear una memoria USB booteable para instalación\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"p8kefh\\\" data-start=\\\"673\\\" data-end=\\\"715\\\">\\r\\nInstalar Windows Server 11 paso a paso\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5i4ijh\\\" data-start=\\\"716\\\" data-end=\\\"762\\\">\\r\\nConfigurar particiones y opciones de disco\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cci9b6\\\" data-start=\\\"763\\\" data-end=\\\"813\\\">\\r\\nRealizar la configuración inicial del servidor\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12600cu\\\" data-start=\\\"814\\\" data-end=\\\"868\\\">\\r\\nAjustar configuraciones de red y seguridad básicas\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hukp4p\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\">\\r\\nPreparar el servidor para roles y servicios futuros\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Desarrollar habilidades prácticas en administración básica de servidores<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 61, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(417, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"UX UI design for beginners\"}', 'ux-ui-design-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/be188ab4-37af-4bd2-9861-ba7b4886ee71 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/be188ab4-37af-4bd2-9861-ba7b4886ee71 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to the fundamentals of <strong data-start=\\\"108\\\" data-end=\\\"132\\\">User Experience (UX)<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"137\\\" data-end=\\\"160\\\">User Interface (UI)<\\/strong> design. Students will learn how to create user-friendly, attractive, and functional digital products such as websites and mobile applications. The course covers design principles, user research, wireframing, prototyping, color theory, typography, and basic design tools like <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Figma<\\/span> and <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Adobe XD<\\/span>.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, learners will understand the complete design process from identifying user needs to creating interactive designs and testing usability.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 00:08:30', '2026-06-18 18:49:02', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>After completing this course, students will be able to:<\\/li><\\/ul><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1twvubl\\\" data-start=\\\"763\\\" data-end=\\\"818\\\">Understand the basic concepts of UX and UI design.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17zolw9\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\" data-end=\\\"902\\\">Apply design principles such as alignment, contrast, balance, and consistency.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6jjgbq\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"968\\\">Conduct simple user research and identify user requirements.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"efsf90\\\" data-start=\\\"969\\\" data-end=\\\"1041\\\">Create wireframes and mockups for websites and mobile applications.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yva48g\\\" data-start=\\\"1042\\\" data-end=\\\"1144\\\">Use design tools like <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Figma<\\/span><\\/span> for interface design and prototyping.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1j1dccb\\\" data-start=\\\"1145\\\" data-end=\\\"1197\\\">Design responsive and user-friendly interfaces.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u26h66\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\" data-end=\\\"1264\\\">Develop interactive prototypes and perform usability testing.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vcye6m\\\" data-start=\\\"1265\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Build a basic portfolio project demonstrating UX\\/UI skills.&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(418, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Creating Certificate in microsoft word\"}', 'creating-certificate-in-microsoft-word', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 09_01_08 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 09_01_08 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Creating Certificate in Microsoft Word is a practical design and document formatting course that teaches learners how to create professional certificates using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Word<\\/span>. The course covers page setup, borders, text formatting, typography, shapes, images, logos, templates, and printing techniques. Students will learn how to design attractive certificates for schools, colleges, training programs, workshops, competitions, and corporate events using easy-to-follow Microsoft Word tools.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 01:07:58', '2026-06-20 04:32:18', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"187lca6\\\" data-start=\\\"620\\\" data-end=\\\"693\\\">Understand the fundamentals of certificate design in Microsoft Word.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vepo1b\\\" data-start=\\\"694\\\" data-end=\\\"776\\\">\\r\\nCreate professional certificate layouts with proper formatting and alignment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"o7oeno\\\" data-start=\\\"777\\\" data-end=\\\"838\\\">\\r\\nUse text effects, fonts, colors, and borders creatively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1saq6n3\\\" data-start=\\\"839\\\" data-end=\\\"914\\\">\\r\\nInsert logos, images, signatures, and decorative elements effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1nsqsdw\\\" data-start=\\\"915\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">\\r\\nDesign customized certificates for educational and professional purposes.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mc8503\\\" data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-end=\\\"1071\\\">\\r\\nApply page setup and print settings for high-quality certificate output.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dnr6qo\\\" data-start=\\\"1072\\\" data-end=\\\"1147\\\">\\r\\nUse templates and design tools to improve productivity and creativity.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Prepare print-ready and digital certificates suitable for events, courses, and organizations.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 59, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
