(419, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"UI UX design principles for better user\"}', 'ui-ux-design-principles-for-better-user', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/f8a7f5a2-ac72-45c3-81d0-0d87b496d1f1.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/f8a7f5a2-ac72-45c3-81d0-0d87b496d1f1.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course focuses on the core principles of <strong data-start=\\\"122\\\" data-end=\\\"145\\\">UI (User Interface)<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"150\\\" data-end=\\\"174\\\">UX (User Experience)<\\/strong> design to help learners create intuitive, visually appealing, and user-friendly digital products. Students will explore essential design concepts such as usability, accessibility, visual hierarchy, consistency, interaction design, color psychology, typography, and responsive design.<\\/li><li>The course also introduces industry-standard tools like <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Figma<\\/span> and <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Adobe XD<\\/span> to build wireframes, prototypes, and modern user interfaces. Through practical exercises and projects, learners will understand how to improve user satisfaction and create seamless digital experiences.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 01:25:04', '2026-06-19 14:22:25', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>After completing this course, students will be able to:<\\/li><\\/ul><ol data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"1586\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\"><ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1us6ywo\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"959\\\">Understand the importance of UI\\/UX design principles in digital products.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"zqikwp\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\" data-end=\\\"1057\\\">Apply visual design principles such as balance, contrast, alignment, spacing, and hierarchy.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p7e81j\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\" data-end=\\\"1133\\\">Create user-centered designs that improve usability and accessibility.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mdlbp\\\" data-start=\\\"1134\\\" data-end=\\\"1195\\\">Develop wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2npstq\\\" data-start=\\\"1196\\\" data-end=\\\"1286\\\">Use tools like <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\\\">Figma<\\/span><\\/span> for designing modern interfaces.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1l4lp19\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">Design responsive layouts for web and mobile applications.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1egds9n\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1432\\\">Improve user engagement through effective interaction and navigation design.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dteu32\\\" data-start=\\\"1433\\\" data-end=\\\"1514\\\">Conduct usability testing and analyze user feedback for design improvements.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4fwv17\\\" data-start=\\\"1515\\\" data-end=\\\"1586\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Create professional UI\\/UX portfolio projects for career development.&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 57, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(420, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Soldering Iron repair for beginners\"}', 'soldering-iron-repair-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/94fc4a33-b340-4ab7-b038-580868405d08.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/94fc4a33-b340-4ab7-b038-580868405d08.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"628\\\">This course introduces beginners to the fundamentals of soldering iron repair, maintenance, and troubleshooting. Learners will understand the working principles of soldering irons, identify common faults, and safely repair damaged components such as heating elements, power cords, plugs, and tips. The course also covers essential safety practices, tool handling, and preventive maintenance techniques to improve the lifespan and performance of soldering equipment. Through practical demonstrations and hands-on activities, students gain confidence in diagnosing and repairing basic soldering iron issues.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 01:26:46', '2026-06-17 00:42:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-col text-sm\\\"><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:820fb2a5-c137-4946-a469-fe30a6f9b9b4-5\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id