(421, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Add In Line row controls to excel tables\"}', 'add-in-line-row-controls-to-excel-tables', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_17_52 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_17_52 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>“Add Inline Row Controls to Excel Tables” is a practical course that teaches learners how to create interactive and user-friendly tables in <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Excel<\\/span> using inline row controls. The course covers adding buttons and controls for inserting, editing, and deleting rows directly within Excel tables. Learners will explore table formatting, data management, form controls, conditional formatting, and basic automation techniques to improve spreadsheet usability and productivity.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 02:23:13', '2026-06-20 03:54:56', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"t4sp1q\\\" data-start=\\\"605\\\" data-end=\\\"676\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Excel tables and data organization.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fz3e2r\\\" data-start=\\\"677\\\" data-end=\\\"748\\\">\\r\\nCreate professional Excel tables with inline row control features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fmx42o\\\" data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"820\\\">\\r\\nAdd buttons for inserting, editing, and deleting rows efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3unk1f\\\" data-start=\\\"821\\\" data-end=\\\"885\\\">\\r\\nUse form controls and simple automation tools within Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16u58vl\\\" data-start=\\\"886\\\" data-end=\\\"954\\\">\\r\\nImprove spreadsheet navigation and user interaction techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wvsq0u\\\" data-start=\\\"955\\\" data-end=\\\"1012\\\">\\r\\nManage and update table data quickly and accurately.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"53k9cw\\\" data-start=\\\"1013\\\" data-end=\\\"1091\\\">\\r\\nApply formatting and design techniques for clean, interactive worksheets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Build efficient Excel-based data management systems for office and business use.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 39, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(422, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Microsoft excel 365\"}', 'microsoft-excel-365', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_24_16 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_24_16 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Microsoft Excel 365 is a comprehensive course designed to help learners master spreadsheet creation, data analysis, reporting, and productivity tools using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Excel<\\/span> as part of Microsoft 365. The course covers worksheet management, formulas, functions, charts, tables, conditional formatting, PivotTables, data validation, collaboration tools, and cloud-based features. Learners will gain practical skills to organize, analyze, and present data effectively for academic, business, and professional applications.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 02:26:47', '2026-06-20 12:26:37', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"v229ck\\\" data-start=\\\"645\\\" data-end=\\\"728\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Microsoft Excel 365 and spreadsheet operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vk78xu\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage worksheets, workbooks, and professional data tables.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"75op59\\\" data-start=\\\"805\\\" data-end=\\\"874\\\">\\r\\nApply formulas and functions for calculations and data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1i5dum1\\\" data-start=\\\"875\\\" data-end=\\\"944\\\">\\r\\nGenerate charts, graphs, and PivotTables for data visualization.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"a7rvwc\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\" data-end=\\\"1024\\\">\\r\\nUse sorting, filtering, and conditional formatting techniques effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ns71b5\\\" data-start=\\\"1025\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">\\r\\nCollaborate and share Excel files using Microsoft 365 cloud features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ofawun\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1177\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity using advanced Excel tools and automation features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Prepare professional reports, dashboards, and business documents using Excel 365.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 35, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 48, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(423, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel 365 Essentials\"}', 'excel-365-essentials', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_31_14 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/13-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 13, 2026, 10_31_14 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Excel 365 Essentials is a beginner-friendly course designed to introduce learners to the core features and practical tools of <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Excel<\\/span> within Microsoft 365. The course covers workbook creation, data entry, formatting, formulas, functions, charts, tables, and basic data analysis techniques. Learners will develop essential spreadsheet skills needed for office work, academics, business reporting, and everyday productivity tasks using modern Excel 365 features.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 02:33:50', '2026-06-16 08:00:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\\\"><div class=\\\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\\\"><div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"6a8e281c-3e8b-4a05-9e3d-9c126f9c70e5\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-5\\\" class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focuse