ection-id=\\\"96pspp\\\" data-start=\\\"838\\\" data-end=\\\"906\\\">Design floor plans, furniture, and interior layouts accurately.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wzg3y6\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\" data-end=\\\"964\\\">Apply materials, textures, and colors to 3D objects.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ja82yu\\\" data-start=\\\"965\\\" data-end=\\\"1027\\\">Use measurement and dimension tools for precise modeling.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9r5zuf\\\" data-start=\\\"1028\\\" data-end=\\\"1086\\\">Work with groups, components, and layers efficiently.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18oc8f1\\\" data-start=\\\"1087\\\" data-end=\\\"1149\\\">Create realistic presentations and design visualizations.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1n3pfk\\\" data-start=\\\"1150\\\" data-end=\\\"1207\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Export and share professional-quality design projects.<\\/li><\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch\\\"><\\/div><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary p-3\\\" aria-label=\\\"Dismiss rating prompt\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"icon text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary\\\"><use href=\\\"\\/cdn\\/assets\\/sprites-core-805957d9.svg#85f94b\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\"><\\/use><\\/svg><\\/button><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(430, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel Criando planilha de Cadastros\"}', 'excel-criando-planilha-de-cadastros', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/b2792556-a1ad-4935-a847-4896a3ce4fab.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/b2792556-a1ad-4935-a847-4896a3ce4fab.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to create professional registration and data management spreadsheets in Microsoft Excel. This course covers the complete process of building cadastro (registration) sheets, organizing records, applying formulas, formatting tables, validating data, and generating reports. You will gain practical knowledge to manage customer, employee, student, or product information efficiently using Excel tools and functions.<\\/li><li>\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Perfect for beginners and office professionals who want to improve productivity and data organization skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 14:53:07', '2026-06-19 18:32:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"s41urh\\\" data-start=\\\"632\\\" data-end=\\\"682\\\">Create structured cadastro spreadsheets in Excel\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1e7lrj8\\\" data-start=\\\"683\\\" data-end=\\\"747\\\">\\r\\nDesign professional tables for storing records and information\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1irs5ix\\\" data-start=\\\"748\\\" data-end=\\\"808\\\">\\r\\nUse formulas and functions for automation and calculations\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"184olmu\\\" data-start=\\\"809\\\" data-end=\\\"851\\\">\\r\\nApply data validation and dropdown lists\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8iubcw\\\" data-start=\\\"852\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">\\r\\nFormat spreadsheets for better readability and presentation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5jzwed\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"960\\\">\\r\\nFilter, sort, and search records efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"bgoxol\\\" data-start=\\\"961\\\" data-end=\\\"999\\\">\\r\\nGenerate basic reports and summaries\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wybfcj\\\" data-start=\\\"1000\\\" data-end=\\\"1064\\\">\\r\\nManage customer, employee, or student databases professionally\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lxrbf4\\\" data-start=\\\"1065\\\" data-end=\\\"1119\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity using Excel shortcuts and tools\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13a8nd9\\\" data-start=\\\"1120\\\" data-end=\\\"1175\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild reusable Excel templates for daily office tasks<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 81, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(431, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"ISO 27001 Information Security Management\"}', 'iso-27001-information-security-management', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 05_03_52 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 05_03_52 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>ISO 27001 Information Security Management is a professional course designed to provide learners with a strong understanding of Information Security Management Systems (ISMS) based on the ISO\\/IEC 27001 standard. This course covers the principles of information security, risk assessment, security controls, compliance requirements, and implementation strategies used to protect organizational data and digital assets. Learners will explore topics such as security policies, asset management, access control, incident management, business continuity, and audit processes. The course is suitable for IT professionals, cybersecurity beginners, compliance officers, auditors, and business managers who want to understand how organizations establish and maintain effective information security practices.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 21:05:37', '2026-06-19 18:25:19', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\\\"><div class=\\\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\\\"><div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"136f94b5-29dc-4a38-8c99-dacafcd85caa\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-5\\\" class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\\\"><ol data-start=\\\"899\\\" data-end=\\\"1661\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"xz8mdg\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">Understand the fundamentals of ISO\\/IEC 27001 and Information Security Management Systems (ISMS).\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6wd0bc\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1082\\\">\\r\\nIdentify information security risks and apply risk assessment methodologies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1fjgej5\\\" data-start=\\\"1083\\\" data-end=\\\"1176\\\">\\r\\nDevelop and implement security policies and procedures aligned with ISO 27001 standards.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pxmtq7\\\" data-start=\\\"1177\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand key security controls including access management, encryption, and incident response.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vvhxhp\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\" data-end=\\\"1379\\\">\\r\\nExplain the process of ISMS implementation, monitoring, maintenance, and continual improvement.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1kc9l1y\\\" data-start=\\\"1380\\\" data-end=\\\"1466\\\">\\r\\nPerform internal audits and understand compliance and certification requirements.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1aldvwx\\\" data-start=\\\"1467\\\" data-end=\\\"1562\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for protecting organizational data, networks, and information assets.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bp2l6y\\\" data-start=\\\"1563\\\" data-end=\\\"1661\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nSupport organizations in achieving ISO 27001 certification readiness and regulatory compliance.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(432, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Linux Host Security Essentials\"}', 'linux-host-security-essentials', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 05_29_27 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 05_29_27 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Linux Host Security Essentials is a practical course designed to teach learners the fundamental techniques and best practices for securing Linux-based systems and servers. The course covers essential host security concepts including user and permission management, system hardening, firewall configuration, secure shell (SSH) protection, patch management, auditing, logging, malware prevention, and security monitoring. Learners will gain hands-on knowledge of Linux security tools and administrative practices used to protect systems from unauthorized access, vulnerabilities, and cyber threats. This course is ideal for system administrators, IT professionals, cybersecurity beginners, and anyone responsible for managing Linux environments securely.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 21:31:51', '2026-06-19 18:12:49', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-6a05b2a9-7728-8324-b1bf-9097a96665ab-1\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\