art=\\\"1018\\\" data-end=\\\"1091\\\">\\r\\nApply Linux system hardening techniques to minimize vulnerabilities.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2gt73j\\\" data-start=\\\"1092\\\" data-end=\\\"1166\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and manage firewall settings and network security controls.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jl299c\\\" data-start=\\\"1167\\\" data-end=\\\"1237\\\">\\r\\nSecure SSH access and implement remote access protection methods.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1o4n26d\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\" data-end=\\\"1321\\\">\\r\\nPerform system monitoring, auditing, and log analysis for security management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ej2xev\\\" data-start=\\\"1322\\\" data-end=\\\"1400\\\">\\r\\nManage software updates, patches, and vulnerability mitigation processes.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bxx2t3\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\" data-end=\\\"1486\\\">\\r\\nDetect and respond to common Linux security threats and unauthorized activities.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1busy65\\\" data-start=\\\"1487\\\" data-end=\\\"1571\\\">\\r\\nImplement best practices for maintaining secure Linux servers and workstations.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a6x157\\\" data-start=\\\"1572\\\" data-end=\\\"1654\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Linux security and cybersecurity roles.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
