ols used for automation, customer segmentation, and analytics.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vv2ovn\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\" data-end=\\\"860\\\">\\r\\nApply AI techniques to improve targeted advertising and campaign performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1sj4ck3\\\" data-start=\\\"861\\\" data-end=\\\"942\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze customer behavior using AI-driven insights and predictive analytics.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vxstk3\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\" data-end=\\\"1021\\\">\\r\\nCreate personalized marketing strategies using machine learning concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1mxp1tv\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">\\r\\nOptimize SEO, email marketing, and social media campaigns with AI tools.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1s7a6n9\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1184\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate the benefits and challenges of AI implementation in digital marketing.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5qhesb\\\" data-start=\\\"1185\\\" data-end=\\\"1262\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop data-driven marketing plans to improve engagement and conversions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 7, 1, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 72, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(437, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Inteligencia artificial para abogados\",\"hi\":\"Inteligencia artificial para abogados\"}', 'inteligencia-artificial-para-abogados', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/c4a0d412-2e7c-4258-ad87-b211e4df7d45.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/c4a0d412-2e7c-4258-ad87-b211e4df7d45.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"639\\\" data-end=\\\"658\\\"><\\/p><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"102\\\" data-end=\\\"637\\\">This course introduces legal professionals to the practical use of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in the legal field. Learners will explore how AI can improve legal research, contract review, document automation, case analysis, compliance monitoring, and client communication. The course also covers ethical concerns, data privacy, and responsible AI use in law practice. By combining legal knowledge with AI tools, participants will understand how technology can increase efficiency, accuracy, and productivity in modern legal services.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 21:47:08', '2026-06-19 10:42:12', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"639\\\" data-end=\\\"658\\\"><\\/p><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"102\\\" data-end=\\\"637\\\"><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active\\/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:55cd8a7f-5b5a-4119-9e0e-fbfc7fce5ae8-9\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none