of Artificial Intelligence and its role in legal practice.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vqjusu\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-end=\\\"889\\\">\\r\\nIdentify AI tools used for legal research, case analysis, and document review.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14k2jk\\\" data-start=\\\"890\\\" data-end=\\\"975\\\">\\r\\nAutomate repetitive legal tasks such as contract drafting and data organization.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1tscm75\\\" data-start=\\\"976\\\" data-end=\\\"1048\\\">\\r\\nImprove efficiency in legal documentation and compliance processes.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"80jm62\\\" data-start=\\\"1049\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze legal risks, ethics, and privacy issues related to AI adoption.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"khpjia\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1202\\\">\\r\\nApply AI solutions to enhance client service and legal decision-making.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"pijww4\\\" data-start=\\\"1203\\\" data-end=\\\"1287\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate the benefits and limitations of AI in law firms and legal departments.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6w9zbc\\\" data-start=\\\"1288\\\" data-end=\\\"1360\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop practical strategies for integrating AI into legal workflows.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 58, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(438, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fundamentos de Inteligência artificial\",\"hi\":\"Fundamentos de Inteligência artificial\"}', 'fundamentos-de-inteligencia-artificial', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/dd3550ce-71ae-4053-95cc-0d78ba0fee2a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/dd3550ce-71ae-4053-95cc-0d78ba0fee2a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1i3o70h\\\" data-start=\\\"542\\\" data-end=\\\"560\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"64\\\" data-end=\\\"540\\\">Este curso oferece uma introdução clara e prática aos fundamentos da Inteligência Artificial (IA). Os alunos aprenderão os principais conceitos de IA, incluindo aprendizado de máquina, redes neurais, algoritmos, análise de dados e aplicações reais da inteligência artificial em diferentes setores. O curso foi desenvolvido para iniciantes e foca em construir uma base sólida para compreender como sistemas inteligentes funcionam e como a IA está transformando o mundo moderno.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-14 21:48:09', '2026-06-18 01:47:30', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active\\/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:f2b763ab-9fa5-447a-8697-8ccfe38d5586-11\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-