(441, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Create a data entry form in excel\"}', 'create-a-data-entry-form-in-excel', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 08_38_07 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 08_38_07 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the power of Excel with our comprehensive online course, Create a Data Entry Form in Excel. Designed for\\r\\nprofessionals seeking to enhance their computer softwares skills, this training course provides practical knowledge that\\r\\ncan be immediately applied in real-world scenarios. Whether you\'re looking to improve your efficiency or streamline data\\r\\nmanagement processes, mastering data entry forms in Excel is a valuable skill for career growth. Throughout this course,\\r\\nyou will learn how to create and customize data entry forms in Excel, enabling easier and more accurate data input. You\\r\\nwill also gain insights into leveraging Excelâ€™s advanced features to automate data collection, organize information\\r\\neffectively, and improve overall productivity. This training course is perfect for professionals in the Middle East,\\r\\nincluding Saudi Arabia and UAE, who want to elevate their expertise in computer softwares and stay competitive in the\\r\\njob market. What you will learn: - How to create basic and advanced data entry forms in Excel - Techniques for\\r\\ncustomizing forms to meet specific data collection needs - Methods to automate data entry processes for increased\\r\\nefficiency - Best practices for organizing and validating data within Excel - Tips for integrating data entry forms with\\r\\nother Excel functions and tools Who this course is for: - Business professionals and administrative staff - Data analysts\\r\\nand managers - Students and recent graduates seeking to develop professional skills - Anyone interested in improving\\r\\ntheir proficiency with computer softwares, especially Excel Why choose this course on our platform: - Recognized as a\\r\\ncertified course, providing an official certificate upon completion - Designed by industry experts with extensive\\r\\nexperience in Excel and data management - Flexible online learning that fits into your busy schedule - Access to practical\\r\\nexercises and real-world examples for effective learning - Enhance your professional profile with a valuable skill set in\\r\\ndata management Career opportunities: Completing this course can open doors to roles such as data entry specialist,\\r\\nadministrative assistant, data analyst, or office manager. It strengthens your resume, making you more attractive to\\r\\nemployers in the Middle Eastâ€™s growing job market. With Excel expertise, you can contribute to efficient data\\r\\nhandling and decision-making processes in various industries. Enroll now to gain a certified skill in creating data entry\\r\\nforms in Excel and take a significant step toward advancing your career in computer softwares and data management.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 00:39:36', '2026-06-20 05:31:34', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"huw1ao\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\" data-end=\\\"140\\\">Understand the basics of data entry forms in Microsoft Excel\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jxv712\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\" data-end=\\\"199\\\">\\r\\nCreate professional and user-friendly data entry forms\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"a7h5i\\\" data-start=\\\"200\\\" data-end=\\\"251\\\">\\r\\nDesign form fields for accurate data collection\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"oszo1\\\" data-start=\\\"252\\\" data-end=\\\"315\\\">\\r\\nUse Excel tables to organize and manage records efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vs7b5v\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\" data-end=\\\"364\\\">\\r\\nApply data validation to reduce entry errors\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qvb0jm\\\" data-start=\\\"365\\\" data-end=\\\"420\\\">\\r\\nAdd buttons and simple controls for easy navigation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17hg08w\\\" data-start=\\\"421\\\" data-end=\\\"487\\\">\\r\\nPerform data entry, editing, updating, and deletion operations\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ddsq88\\\" data-start=\\\"488\\\" data-end=\\\"546\\\">\\r\\nUse formulas and formatting to improve data management\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dvw2gb\\\" data-start=\\\"547\\\" data-end=\\\"609\\\">\\r\\nMaintain clean and organized spreadsheets for business use\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bcsgvb\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\" data-end=\\\"676\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity and accuracy in Excel-based data handling\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14d0e7m\\\" data-start=\\\"677\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">\\r\\nCreate simple automated forms suitable for office and administrative tasks<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1l5et9w\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\" data-end=\\\"827\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nWork confidently with Excel tools for record management and reporting<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(442, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel Pivot tables step by step\"}', 'excel-pivot-tables-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 08_49_46 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 14, 2026, 08_49_46 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"490\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"24\\\" data-end=\\\"59\\\">Excel Pivot Tables Step by Step<\\/strong> is a beginner-friendly course designed to help learners analyze, summarize, and organize data efficiently using Pivot Tables in Microsoft Excel. The course provides a step-by-step approach to creating Pivot Tables, sorting and filtering information, generating reports, and visualizing data insights. Learners will work with real-world datasets to understand how Pivot Tables can simplify data analysis and improve productivity.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"492\\\" data-end=\\\"659\\\">This course is ideal for students, office staff, business professionals, accountants, and anyone who wants to master Excel data analysis tools quickly and effectively.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 00:52:56', '2026-06-20 07:13:39', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"199ago4\\\" data-start=\\\"736\\\" data-end=\\\"800\\\">Understand the purpose and benefits of Pivot Tables in Excel\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11pcsmk\\\" data-start=\\\"801\\\" data-end=\\\"851\\\">\\r\\nCreate Pivot Tables from raw data step by step\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hn3ixf\\\" data-start=\\\"852\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\">\\r\\nOrganize and summarize large datasets efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pmbc8a\\\" data-start=\\\"906\\\" data-end=\\\"958\\\">\\r\\nSort, filter, and group data within Pivot Tables\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ek42dn\\\" data-start=\\\"959\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\">\\r\\nUse calculated fields and basic calculations in reports\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uin0ze\\\" data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1077\\\">\\r\\nGenerate summary reports for business and office tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mscq4u\\\" data-start=\\\"1078\\\" data-end=\\\"1130\\\">\\r\\nCreate Pivot Charts for visual data presentation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vwdgvm\\\" data-start=\\\"1131\\\" data-end=\\\"1179\\\">\\r\\nCustomize Pivot Table layouts and formatting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hb9vqo\\\" data-start=\\\"1180\\\" data-end=\\\"1233\\\">\\r\\nRefresh and update Pivot Table data automatically\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"k1dbi4\\\" data-start=\\\"1234\\\" data-end=\\\"1295\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze trends, totals, and comparisons using Excel tools\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vcgltu\\\" data-start=\\\"1296\\\" data-end=\\\"1351\\\">\\r\\nImprove productivity in data reporting and analysis<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18n6fbp\\\" data-start=\\\"1352\\\" data-end=\\\"1415\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nWork confidently with Excel Pivot Tables for professional use<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(444, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Array functions in excel for beginners\"}', 'array-functions-in-excel-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_50_25 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_50_25 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"Learn the fundamentals of Array Functions in Microsoft Excel with this beginner-friendly course designed for students, office staff, analysts, and anyone who wants to work smarter with data. This course introduces modern Excel array functions and demonstrates how to perform calculations, filter information, sort data, and automate repetitive tasks efficiently. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will understand how dynamic arrays work and how to use powerful functions to improve productivity and data analysis skills.\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 01:15:17', '2026-06-20 13:19:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master how to create and manage arrays in Excel for efficient data organization and analysis using array functions Excel, data management, array formulas, data analysis, spreadsheet automation, professional skills, Excel functions, beginner Excel techniques<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8djpkl\\\" data-start=\\\"647\\\" data-end=\\\"718\\\">Understand the basics of array formulas and dynamic arrays in Excel<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1d62hy8\\\" data-start=\\\"719\\\" data-end=\\\"792\\\">Use common array functions such as FILTER, SORT, UNIQUE, and SEQUENCE<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9kzjyr\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\" data-end=\\\"859\\\">Perform calculations on multiple values using array operations<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"x14phw\\\" data-start=\\\"860\\\" data-end=\\\"911\\\">Analyze and organize large datasets efficiently<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"q49eh0\\\" data-start=\\\"912\\\" data-end=\\\"973\\\">Create dynamic reports and automatically updating results<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vx0t1l\\\" data-start=\\\"974\\\" data-end=\\\"1039\\\">Apply array functions to real-world business and office tasks<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1939898\\\" data-start=\\\"1040\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">Reduce manual work and improve spreadsheet productivity<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"bhcew3\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1165\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">Build confidence in using advanced Excel features for beginners<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(445, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"XLOOKUP function in microsoft excel\"}', 'xlookup-function-in-microsoft-excel', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_52_30 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_52_30 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Master the powerful XLOOKUP function in Microsoft Excel and learn how to search, retrieve, and manage data efficiently. This beginner-friendly course explains how XLOOKUP works and how it improves upon older lookup functions like VLOOKUP and HLOOKUP. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will understand how to perform accurate data lookups, handle errors, search in multiple directions, and work with dynamic datasets in Excel spreadsheets.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 01:29:23', '2026-06-20 10:49:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1urm9zk\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\" data-end=\\\"630\\\">Understand the purpose and advantages of the XLOOKUP function\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17r8mp9\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\" data-end=\\\"697\\\">\\r\\nUse XLOOKUP to search and retrieve data from tables and ranges\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fbohmc\\\" data-start=\\\"698\\\" data-end=\\\"765\\\">\\r\\nReplace VLOOKUP and HLOOKUP with more flexible XLOOKUP formulas\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1925zy4\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\" data-end=\\\"816\\\">\\r\\nPerform exact and approximate matches in Excel\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1x0nzb5\\\" data-start=\\\"817\\\" data-end=\\\"870\\\">\\r\\nSearch data vertically and horizontally with ease\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1x4rmtg\\\" data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"930\\\">\\r\\nHandle missing values and errors using built-in options\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qrzvyj\\\" data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"998\\\">\\r\\nApply XLOOKUP in reports, dashboards, and business spreadsheets\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Improve productivity and accuracy in Excel data management<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 29, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
