n Excel\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Improve business reporting and data analysis skills<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(449, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Essential excel tools every beginner\"}', 'essential-excel-tools-every-beginner', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_58_01 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_58_01 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the essential tools and features in Microsoft Excel that every beginner should know. This course provides a practical introduction to Excel’s most commonly used tools for data entry, formatting, calculations, data management, and reporting. Learners will gain hands-on experience with formulas, functions, charts, tables, sorting, filtering, and productivity tools used in everyday office and business tasks. The course is designed to build confidence and create a strong foundation for advanced Excel learning.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 02:11:52', '2026-06-20 04:35:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"99ifoz\\\" data-start=\\\"621\\\" data-end=\\\"675\\\">Navigate the Microsoft Excel interface confidently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10d7vls\\\" data-start=\\\"676\\\" data-end=\\\"745\\\">\\r\\nUse essential Excel tools for data entry and worksheet management\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11bysgw\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\" data-end=\\\"801\\\">\\r\\nApply basic formulas and functions for calculations\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"eh2ubx\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\" data-end=\\\"874\\\">\\r\\nFormat spreadsheets professionally using styles and formatting tools\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cbzmek\\\" data-start=\\\"875\\\" data-end=\\\"931\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage tables, charts, and simple reports\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jfuynp\\\" data-start=\\\"932\\\" data-end=\\\"987\\\">\\r\\nUse sorting and filtering features to organize data\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"22u2f4\\\" data-start=\\\"988\\\" data-end=\\\"1044\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic data analysis and improve productivity\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Work efficiently with rows, columns, sheets, and workbook tools<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(450, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"Planning engineer interview questions\"}', 'planning-engineer-interview-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/c235d102-71ea-4fd9-968c-04720e928acd.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-05-2026/c235d102-71ea-4fd9-968c-04720e928acd.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to help students, fresh graduates, and professionals prepare for <strong data-start=\\\"152\\\" data-end=\\\"173\\\">Planning Engineer<\\/strong> interviews in industries such as construction, oil &amp; gas, manufacturing, and infrastructure. The course covers essential concepts related to project planning, scheduling, project control, resource management, cost tracking, risk analysis, and reporting techniques.<\\/li><li>Learners will gain practical knowledge of industry tools like <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Microsoft Project<\\/span> and <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Oracle Primavera P6<\\/span> while practicing commonly asked interview questions, real-world scenarios, and problem-solving techniques. The course also focuses on communication skills, resume preparation, and interview confidence building.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 02:46:13', '2026-06-11 10:41:11', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:886a76ca-1dc4-45d0-97e8-486ba58d2c74-6\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block