and responsibilities of a Planning Engineer.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1po4qhx\\\" data-start=\\\"947\\\" data-end=\\\"1027\\\">\\r\\nExplain project planning and scheduling concepts effectively in interviews.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tl700j\\\" data-start=\\\"1028\\\" data-end=\\\"1156\\\">\\r\\nCreate and analyze project schedules using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Oracle Primavera P6<\\/span><\\/span> and <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Microsoft Project<\\/span><\\/span>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gdb2m5\\\" data-start=\\\"1157\\\" data-end=\\\"1222\\\">\\r\\nAnswer technical and HR interview questions with confidence.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2abcao\\\" data-start=\\\"1223\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Work Breakdown Structure (WBS), CPM, resource allocation, and project tracking concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ydvrkd\\\" data-start=\\\"1328\\\" data-end=\\\"1394\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze project delays, risks, and recovery planning methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qv1pd9\\\" data-start=\\\"1395\\\" data-end=\\\"1485\\\">\\r\\nPrepare professional resumes and interview presentations for planning engineer roles.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4wo27g\\\" data-start=\\\"1486\\\" data-end=\\\"1565\\\">\\r\\nImprove communication, problem-solving, and professional interview skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ln8f6l\\\" data-start=\\\"1566\\\" data-end=\\\"1656\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence to attend interviews in construction and project management industries.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><div class=\\\"contents\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 18, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(451, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python programming language\"}', 'python-programming-language', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/57983bf4-3f45-49b0-bc3c-51a2f9a448c1.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/57983bf4-3f45-49b0-bc3c-51a2f9a448c1.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to provide a strong foundation in Python programming, one of the most popular and versatile programming languages used in software development, data science, automation, artificial intelligence, and web development. Learners will start with Python basics such as syntax, variables, data types, operators, and control statements, then progress to functions, object-oriented programming, file handling, modules, exception handling, and real-world project development. The course focuses on practical coding skills with hands-on examples and exercises to help learners confidently build Python applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 15:06:21', '2026-06-19 18:08:32', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"gvpa8b\\\" data-start=\\\"790\\\" data-end=\\\"856\\\">Understand Python syntax, variables, data types, and operators\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ob60rw\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\" data-end=\\\"921\\\">\\r\\nWrite Python programs using conditional statements and loops\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qbic1n\\\" data-start=\\\"922\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use functions for modular programming\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1o1ngn5\\\" data-start=\\\"975\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">\\r\\nWork with lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10xh4lq\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">\\r\\nImplement file handling and exception handling in Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"grop1j\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1161\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand object-oriented programming concepts in Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"n5ibvp\\\" data-start=\\\"1162\\\" data-end=\\\"1210\\\">\\r\\nUse Python modules and libraries in projects\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"d3ds4k\\\" data-start=\\\"1211\\\" data-end=\\\"1274\\\">\\r\\nBuild automation scripts and simple real-world applications\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8co901\\\" data-start=\\\"1275\\\" data-end=\\\"1317\\\">\\r\\nDebug and test Python code efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"156n7f6\\\" data-start=\\\"1318\\\" data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop confidence to start careers in software development, data analysis, or AI programming<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 23, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(452, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Use promises in JavaScript\"}', 'use-promises-in-javascript', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/6792e581-15df-4aac-bc1e-22e9f8efd5f8.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/6792e581-15df-4aac-bc1e-22e9f8efd5f8.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed for beginners and aspiring JavaScript developers who want to understand and use Promises for handling asynchronous operations effectively. Learners will explore the fundamentals of asynchronous JavaScript, the purpose of Promises, and how they improve code readability compared to callbacks. The course covers creating Promises, handling success and failure using <code data-start=\\\"440\\\" data-end=\\\"449\\\">.then()<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"451\\\" data-end=\\\"461\\\">.catch()<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"467\\\" data-end=\\\"479\\\">.finally()<\\/code>, chaining multiple Promises, and working with real-world examples such as API calls and delayed operations. By the end of the course, participants will be able to write cleaner, more maintainable asynchronous JavaScript code confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 16:38:53', '2026-06-19 07:18:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"yiads6\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\" data-end=\\\"855\\\">Understand asynchronous programming concepts in JavaScript\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hxnaam\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"925\\\">\\r\\nExplain the role and benefits of Promises over callback functions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p39z5v\\\" data-start=\\\"926\\\" data-end=\\\"976\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use JavaScript Promises effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p2ilxn\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1055\\\">\\r\\nHandle resolved and rejected Promise states using <code data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">.then()<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"1043\\\" data-end=\\\"1053\\\">.catch()<\\/code>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11k99kw\\\" data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">\\r\\nUse <code data-start=\\\"1062\\\" data-end=\\\"1074\\\">.finally()<\\/code> for cleanup operations\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lcxh3t\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1152\\\">\\r\\nChain multiple Promises for sequential execution\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vjjm74\\\" data-start=\\\"1153\\\" data-end=\\\"1213\\\">\\r\\nWork with Promise-based API calls and asynchronous tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1t9j19y\\\" data-start=\\\"1214\\\" data-end=\\\"1267\\\">\\r\\nDebug common Promise-related errors in JavaScript\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ossdd4\\\" data-start=\\\"1268\\\" data-end=\\\"1330\\\">\\r\\nWrite clean, efficient, and maintainable asynchronous code\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1plhqf\\\" data-start=\\\"1331\\\" data-end=\\\"1394\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nApply Promise concepts in real-world web development projects<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 92, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(453, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Time blocking productivity method\"}', 'time-blocking-productivity-method', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_29_31 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_29_31 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Time Blocking Productivity Method is a practical course designed to help learners improve focus, productivity, and time management using structured scheduling techniques. The course teaches how to organize daily tasks into dedicated time blocks, prioritize important activities, minimize distractions, and create efficient work routines. Learners will explore productivity planning methods, digital scheduling tools, and strategies for maintaining work-life balance while achieving personal and professional goals.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 18:32:12', '2026-06-18 23:31:19', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1w6ce3i\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\" data-end=\\\"691\\\">Understand the fundamentals of the time blocking productivity method.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gjngiy\\\" data-start=\\\"692\\\" data-end=\\\"752\\\">\\r\\nCreate structured daily, weekly, and monthly schedules.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ndiu4j\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\r\\nPrioritize tasks based on importance and deadlines.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fmryti\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"877\\\">\\r\\nImprove focus and concentration through dedicated work blocks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"t2hgaz\\\" data-start=\\\"878\\\" data-end=\\\"940\\\">\\r\\nReduce distractions and manage interruptions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8emo5k\\\" data-start=\\\"941\\\" data-end=\\\"1009\\\">\\r\\nUse productivity tools and digital calendars for time planning.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qun3xq\\\" data-start=\\\"1010\\\" data-end=\\\"1072\\\">\\r\\nBalance work, study, and personal activities efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Develop consistent habits for long-term productivity improvement.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 41, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(454, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Origami for christmas decoration\"}', 'origami-for-christmas-decoration', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_37_54 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_37_54 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Origami for christmas decoration course, in this course teaches you how to create beautiful Christmas decorations using\\r\\norigami techniques. You will learn step by step how to fold paper into festive shapes such as stars, ornaments, trees, and\\r\\nother seasonal designs that bring a handmade touch to your holiday dÃ©cor. The lessons explain basic and intermediate\\r\\nfolds in a clear and simple way, helping you achieve neat and symmetrical results without using glue or scissors. You will\\r\\nalso discover tips for choosing the right paper colors, patterns, and sizes to match Christmas themes and enhance visual\\r\\nappeal. By the end of the course, you will be able to make a variety of origami Christmas decorations for your home,\\r\\nclassroom, or gifts, and personalize them with creative ideas. This course is suitable for beginners, kids, teachers, and\\r\\nanyone who enjoys festive crafts, creative paper art, and holiday decorations made by hand. Origami Easy<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 18:40:46', '2026-06-18 20:51:46', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Create festive origami Christmas stars, ornaments, and trees with precise folding techniques for holiday decor\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply basic and intermediate origami folds to craft seasonal Christmas decorations without glue or scissors\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select appropriate paper colors, patterns, and sizes to enhance the visual appeal of handmade Christmas origami decorations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design personalized Christmas decorations for home, classroom, or gifts using creative origami techniques<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
