(455, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Origami basics\"}', 'origami-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_45_33 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_45_33 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Origami basics course, in this course introduces you to the fundamental skills and techniques of origami, the traditional\\r\\nart of paper folding. You will learn step by step how to make basic folds, understand folding symbols, and follow simple\\r\\ndiagrams with confidence. The lessons focus on accuracy, symmetry, and clean creases, helping you build a strong\\r\\nfoundation for more advanced origami projects. You will practice creating simple shapes and models while learning how\\r\\npaper size, thickness, and direction affect the final result. No glue or scissors are neededâ€”only paper and careful\\r\\nfolding. By the end of the course, you will be comfortable with essential origami techniques, ready to create beginner\\r\\nmodels, and prepared to explore more complex designs. This course is perfect for beginners, kids, students, teachers,\\r\\nand anyone who wants to start origami in an easy, clear, and enjoyable way.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 18:48:44', '2026-06-18 12:01:53', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li data-section-id=\\\"1lqajx9\\\" data-start=\\\"551\\\" data-end=\\\"609\\\">Understand the history and principles of origami art.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fkujas\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\" data-end=\\\"667\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of origami paper and tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14v8u28\\\" data-start=\\\"668\\\" data-end=\\\"717\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic folding techniques accurately.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mis8f4\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nCreate simple origami models using step-by-step methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k39f2i\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"840\\\">\\r\\nImprove hand-eye coordination and concentration skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pjrzji\\\" data-start=\\\"841\\\" data-end=\\\"900\\\">\\r\\nRead and follow standard origami symbols and diagrams.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vfll9e\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\" data-end=\\\"966\\\">\\r\\nDesign decorative paper crafts for personal and festive use.\\r\\n<\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color: var(--theme-default-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\\\">Build confidence in creating creative origami projects independently.<\\/span><br><\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(456, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Making origami number\"}', 'making-origami-number', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_50_46 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_50_46 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Making origami number course, in this course teaches you how to create numbers using origami techniques in a simple\\r\\nand creative way. You will learn step by step how to fold paper into clear and recognizable numeric shapes, focusing on\\r\\naccuracy, proportions, and clean folds. The lessons explain basic and intermediate origami folds that help transform a\\r\\nflat sheet of paper into stylish numbers without using glue or scissors. You will also discover tips for choosing the right\\r\\npaper size, keeping folds neat, and adjusting shapes to make each number easy to read. By the end of the course, you\\r\\nwill be able to create different origami numbers, combine them for dates, ages, math activities, or decorative projects,\\r\\nand experiment with colors and patterns. This course is suitable for beginners, students, teachers, and origami lovers\\r\\nwho want to enhance creativity, support learning through hands-on activities, and enjoy fun paper craft ideas.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 18:52:57', '2026-06-19 07:52:41', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master precise origami folds to create clear and recognizable numeric shapes for decorative and educational purposes\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply basic and intermediate origami techniques to craft accurate and proportionate numbers without scissors or glue\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select appropriate paper sizes and materials to enhance the neatness and readability of origami numbers\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Combine and customize origami numbers for dates, ages, math activities, and creative projects to support hands-on learning<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(457, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Making origami letters\"}', 'making-origami-letters', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_55_02 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 02_55_02 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Making origami letters course, in this course introduces you to the creative art of making letters using origami\\r\\ntechniques. You will learn step by step how to fold paper into clear and recognizable alphabet letters, focusing on shape,\\r\\nbalance, and clean edges. The lessons explain basic and intermediate folds that help transform a flat sheet of paper into\\r\\nstylish letter forms without using glue or scissors. You will also discover tips for choosing the right paper size, improving\\r\\naccuracy, and keeping your folds neat for a professional look. By the end of the course, you will be able to create\\r\\ndifferent origami letters, combine them to form names or words, and experiment with colors and patterns for decorative\\r\\nprojects. This course is suitable for beginners, students, teachers, and origami lovers who want to enhance creativity,\\r\\nimprove hand skills, and enjoy fun paper craft ideas for learning and decoration.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 18:57:29', '2026-06-20 13:56:36', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master precise origami folds to create clear and recognizable alphabet letters for decorative projects and crafts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply basic and intermediate origami techniques to transform flat paper into stylish, professional-looking letters\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select appropriate paper sizes, colors, and patterns to enhance the visual appeal of origami letters in various designs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Combine individual origami letters to form words, names, and personalized decorations for creative expression<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 40, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(458, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Create a movie website with laravel Livewire\"}', 'create-a-movie-website-with-laravel-livewire', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/fd514b44-48b5-48d3-ae2e-4e75c12fa497.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/fd514b44-48b5-48d3-ae2e-4e75c12fa497.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed for beginners and aspiring web developers who want to build a dynamic movie website using <strong data-start=\\\"188\\\" data-end=\\\"199\\\">Laravel<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"204\\\" data-end=\\\"216\\\">Livewire<\\/strong>. You will learn how to create a modern, responsive movie web application with features like movie listings, search functionality, category filtering, movie detail pages, user interactions, and database integration. The course covers Laravel fundamentals, Livewire components, routing, Blade templating, database migrations, CRUD operations, authentication basics, and UI design best practices. By the end of this course, you will have built a fully functional movie website project that can be included in your portfolio.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 19:23:01', '2026-06-20 21:06:14', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"jgab8v\\\" data-start=\\\"815\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">Understand the fundamentals of <strong data-start=\\\"848\\\" data-end=\\\"869\\\">Laravel framework<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"874\\\" data-end=\\\"886\\\">Livewire<\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xlsofc\\\" data-start=\\\"888\\\" data-end=\\\"957\\\">\\r\\nSet up a Laravel project and configure the development environment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"d9k7iq\\\" data-start=\\\"958\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\">\\r\\nDesign and build a responsive <strong data-start=\\\"990\\\" data-end=\\\"1017\\\">movie website interface<\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vrhywa\\\" data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1084\\\">\\r\\nCreate reusable <strong data-start=\\\"1037\\\" data-end=\\\"1060\\\">Livewire components<\\/strong> for dynamic UI updates.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13592pp\\\" data-start=\\\"1085\\\" data-end=\\\"1152\\\">\\r\\nImplement <strong data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1137\\\">movie listing, search, and filtering<\\/strong> functionality.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1memaz5\\\" data-start=\\\"1153\\\" data-end=\\\"1209\\\">\\r\\nPerform <strong data-start=\\\"1163\\\" data-end=\\\"1182\\\">CRUD operations<\\/strong> for movie data management.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1v06ksl\\\" data-start=\\\"1210\\\" data-end=\\\"1279\\\">\\r\\nWork with <strong data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">MySQL database migrations, models, and relationships<\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1iatk99\\\" data-start=\\\"1280\\\" data-end=\\\"1342\\\">\\r\\nBuild <strong data-start=\\\"1288\\\" data-end=\\\"1310\\\">movie detail pages<\\/strong> with dynamic content rendering.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"894led\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\" data-end=\\\"1408\\\">\\r\\nImplement basic <strong data-start=\\\"1361\\\" data-end=\\\"1407\\\">user authentication and navigation systems<\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xpskpd\\\" data-start=\\\"1409\\\" data-end=\\\"1471\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDeploy the completed Laravel Livewire movie website project.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 61, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(459, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS redesign essentials for beginners\"}', 'saas-redesign-essentials-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/e8bbe357-115d-4c40-b25e-523fc35c1364.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/e8bbe357-115d-4c40-b25e-523fc35c1364.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to redesign SaaS (Software as a Service) products with a modern, user-friendly, and business-focused approach. This beginner-friendly course teaches the complete redesign process — from identifying UX problems to creating clean UI screens and improving user experience. You’ll understand SaaS workflows, dashboard layouts, user journeys, wireframing, prototyping, and redesign strategies used by real product designers.<\\/li><li>The course focuses on practical redesign projects, helping students build confidence in improving existing SaaS applications using industry-standard design thinking methods and modern UI\\/UX principles. By the end of the course, learners will be able to redesign web dashboards, optimize usability, and create professional SaaS product experiences suitable for portfolios and freelance projects.<\\/li><\\/ul><hr data-start=\\\"891\\\" data-end=\\\"894\\\">\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 23:14:30', '2026-06-18 07:01:19', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"43c52aa2-ccd9-4f70-801a-0bb837da92b7\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-5\\\" class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\" data-turn-start-message=\\\"true\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-ne