3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 45, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(460, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"Hygraph with next js\"}', 'hygraph-with-next-js', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/88d5e4cb-ce6a-4237-9bcd-98f0731b01eb.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/88d5e4cb-ce6a-4237-9bcd-98f0731b01eb.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to build modern, fast, and scalable web applications using Hygraph and Next.js. This beginner-to-intermediate course teaches how to create dynamic websites with a headless CMS architecture using Hygraph for content management and Next.js for frontend development.<\\/li><li>Students will learn how to connect APIs, manage content models, fetch data using GraphQL, and build responsive web applications with real-world project workflows. The course covers everything from project setup and routing to content management, deployment, and performance optimization.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, learners will be able to develop professional CMS-powered websites such as blogs, portfolios, SaaS landing pages, and content-driven applications using modern JAMstack development practices.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-15 23:35:32', '2026-06-19 18:15:05', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<div><br><\\/div>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:7be75bbb-8bf6-4cbe-9037-95b38f63acf7-2\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"relative w-full overflow-visible\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[ca