(461, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"Best AI tool for software developers\"}', 'best-ai-tool-for-software-developers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/12b78ae5-5f50-4f52-b635-cceb006b02ca.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/12b78ae5-5f50-4f52-b635-cceb006b02ca.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Discover the most powerful AI tools transforming modern software development workflows. This course is designed for beginners, students, and developers who want to improve coding speed, debugging, productivity, and project development using AI-powered tools.<\\/li><li>You’ll learn how AI assistants help with code generation, autocomplete, debugging, documentation, testing, UI creation, and full-stack development. The course explores popular AI development tools such as <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">OpenAI<\\/span> Codex, <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">GitHub<\\/span> Copilot, <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Anthropic<\\/span> Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, and other modern AI coding platforms widely used by developers in 2026. Recent industry reports show growing adoption of AI-native IDEs and coding assistants among professional developers. <span class=\\\"\\\" data-state=\\\"closed\\\"><\\/span><\\/li><li>Students will explore real-world workflows, prompt engineering for coding, AI-assisted debugging, frontend and backend development, and best practices for safely using AI-generated code in projects. The course also explains the limitations and risks of AI coding tools, including code quality and debugging challenges highlighted in recent research.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, learners will understand how to combine AI tools effectively to build faster, smarter, and more scalable software applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-16 00:07:41', '2026-06-18 11:10:48', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1485\\\" data-end=\\\"1540\\\">After completing this course, students will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2168\\\" data-end=\\\"2400\\\"><\\/p><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"1542\\\" data-end=\\\"2166\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1uxkxmp\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\" data-end=\\\"1608\\\">&nbsp;Understand how AI coding assistants work in software development\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1kg6yck\\\" data-start=\\\"1609\\\" data-end=\\\"1672\\\">\\r\\nUse AI tools for code generation, debugging, and optimization\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"detj7f\\\" data-start=\\\"1673\\\" data-end=\\\"1727\\\">\\r\\nImprove development speed using AI-powered workflows\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ae1sh7\\\" data-start=\\\"1728\\\" data-end=\\\"1782\\\">\\r\\nWrite better prompts for coding and automation tasks\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fgaenp\\\" data-start=\\\"1783\\\" data-end=\\\"1839\\\">\\r\\nBuild frontend and backend projects with AI assistance\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"193ng37\\\" data-start=\\\"1840\\\" data-end=\\\"1893\\\">\\r\\nUse AI for documentation, testing, and code reviews\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"dpwgy2\\\" data-start=\\\"1894\\\" data-end=\\\"1978\\\">\\r\\nCompare popular AI developer tools like Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code, and Windsurf\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"bx4si4\\\" data-start=\\\"1979\\\" data-end=\\\"2046\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand AI limitations, code quality risks, and best practices\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8198un\\\" data-start=\\\"2047\\\" data-end=\\\"2098\\\">\\r\\nCreate productivity-focused development workflows\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ac3h5j\\\" data-start=\\\"2099\\\" data-end=\\\"2166\\\">\\r\\nBuild real-world projects faster with modern AI development tools\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 44, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(462, NULL, NULL, 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Making origami ninja star\"}', 'making-origami-ninja-star', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 08_49_31 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 08_49_31 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Making origami ninja star course, in this course teaches you how to create a classic origami ninja star using simple and\\r\\nfun folding techniques. You will learn step by step how to fold identical paper pieces and assemble them into a strong,\\r\\nbalanced star without using glue or scissors. The lessons explain basic origami folds, symmetry, and alignment, helping\\r\\nyou achieve a clean and professional result. You will also discover tips for choosing the right paper size, combining colors\\r\\nfor a striking design, and improving accuracy during assembly. By the end of the course, you will be able to make\\r\\ndifferent origami ninja star variations, experiment with patterns, and understand the principles of modular origami. This\\r\\ncourse is suitable for beginners, kids, and origami lovers who enjoy creative paper crafts and hands-on projects that are\\r\\nboth fun and skill-building.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-16 00:48:13', '2026-06-20 02:30:15', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master precise folding techniques to create symmetrical and balanced origami ninja stars using paper.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply modular origami principles to assemble strong, interlocking ninja star designs without glue or scissors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select appropriate paper sizes and colors to enhance visual appeal and achieve professional-looking origami ninja stars.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop skills to experiment with patterns and variations, fostering creativity in paper craft and origami projects.<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(463, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"ChatGPT for designers\"}', 'chatgpt-for-designers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/832a108a-6e23-4e09-b7e3-1156baaf26b8.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/832a108a-6e23-4e09-b7e3-1156baaf26b8.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to use <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">OpenAI<\\/span>’s <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">ChatGPT<\\/span> to improve creativity, productivity, and workflow efficiency in modern design projects. This course is designed for UI\\/UX designers, graphic designers, product designers, content creators, and beginners who want to integrate AI into their daily design process.<\\/li><li>Students will learn how to use ChatGPT for brainstorming ideas, generating UX copy, creating design systems, writing case studies, improving user flows, generating creative prompts, and accelerating research tasks. The course also explores how AI can assist with wireframing concepts, accessibility suggestions, branding ideas, presentation writing, and client communication.<\\/li><li>Through practical exercises and real-world examples, learners will discover how to combine design thinking with AI-powered tools to speed up workflows while maintaining creativity and human-centered design principles.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, students will be able to confidently use ChatGPT as a creative assistant for UI\\/UX, branding, product design, and digital content creation projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-16 01:15:28', '2026-06-20 00:12:57', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<div><br><\\/div>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1200\\\" data-end=\\\"1255\\\">After completing this course, students will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"1257\\\" data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"e3fxh9\\\" data-start=\\\"1257\\\" data-end=\\\"1314\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand how AI tools support modern design workflows\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1lwz7e1\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\" data-end=\\\"1368\\\">\\r\\nUse ChatGPT for brainstorming and creative ideation\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1wicca9\\\" data-start=\\\"1369\\\" data-end=\\\"1420\\\">\\r\\nGenerate UX writing, microcopy, and content ideas\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11u513p\\\" data-start=\\\"1421\\\" data-end=\\\"1482\\\">\\r\\nCreate design prompts for UI\\/UX and graphic design projects\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ev4ktm\\\" data-start=\\\"1483\\\" data-end=\\\"1543\\\">\\r\\nImprove research, user personas, and user journey planning\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zd13hs\\\" data-start=\\\"1544\\\" data-end=\\\"1600\\\">\\r\\nUse AI for design documentation and case study writing\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1w0k96n\\\" data-start=\\\"1601\\\" data-end=\\\"1654\\\">\\r\\nGenerate branding, naming, and visual concept ideas\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dhgtm7\\\" data-start=\\\"1655\\\" data-end=\\\"1711\\\">\\r\\nSpeed up workflow efficiency using AI-assisted methods\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1jgc4bt\\\" data-start=\\\"1712\\\" data-end=\\\"1777\\\">\\r\\nCombine human creativity with AI-generated insights effectively\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"mol2fv\\\" data-start=\\\"1778\\\" data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild portfolio-ready design projects using AI-enhanced workflows<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 41, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(464, NULL, NULL, 68, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Making a paper airplane origami\"}', 'making-a-paper-airplane-origami', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_18_46 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 15, 2026, 09_18_46 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Making a paper airplane origami course, in this course teaches you how to create classic and creative paper airplanes\\r\\nusing origami techniques. You will learn step by step how to fold paper accurately to design airplanes that fly smoothly\\r\\nand look well balanced. The lessons explain basic folds, symmetry, and alignment, helping you understand how each fold\\r\\naffects the airplaneâ€™s shape and flight performance. You will also discover tips for adjusting wings, noses, and angles\\r\\nto improve stability, distance, and control. No glue or scissors are neededâ€”only paper and careful folding. By the end of\\r\\nthe course, you will be able to make different origami paper airplanes, test their flight, and modify designs using various\\r\\npaper types and sizes. This course is suitable for beginners, kids, and anyone who enjoys hands-on learning, creative\\r\\npaper crafts, and fun experiments with simple materials.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-16 01:21:12', '2026-06-18 20:07:03', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master precise folding techniques to create balanced and aerodynamic paper airplanes using origami principles\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply symmetry and alignment skills to enhance flight stability and distance of paper airplanes\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Adjust wing angles, noses, and tails to improve control, speed, and flight performance of paper airplanes\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Experiment with different paper types and sizes to optimize flight distance, stability, and creative design<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(465, NULL, NULL, 36, 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google gemini for beginners\"}', 'google-gemini-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/68265e0d-48a6-4c76-841c-084bbe13f418.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-05-2026/68265e0d-48a6-4c76-841c-084bbe13f418.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to use <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Google<\\/span>’s <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Google Gemini<\\/span> effectively for productivity, creativity, learning, and everyday tasks. This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamentals of AI tools and teaches how Gemini can help with writing, research, coding, brainstorming, content creation, and workflow automation.<\\/li><li>Students will explore Gemini’s features, including AI conversations, document assistance, image understanding, idea generation, summarization, and integration with Google services. The course also covers prompt-writing techniques, AI productivity strategies, and practical real-world use cases for students, freelancers, creators, and professionals.<\\/li><li>Through hands-on exercises and guided examples, learners will understand how to use Gemini safely and efficiently while improving creativity and productivity with AI-powered workflows.<\\/li><li>By the end of the course, students will confidently use Google Gemini for personal, educational, and professional tasks.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-16 01:45:10', '2026-06-18 22:23:01', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:7be75bbb-8bf6-4cbe-9037-95b38f63acf7-