(468, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS product management step by step\"}', 'saas-product-management-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 11_54_14 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 11_54_14 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the full potential of your business career with our comprehensive SaaS Product Management Step by Step online\\r\\ncourse. Designed for aspiring professionals and industry veterans alike, this training course offers a structured approach\\r\\nto mastering the essentials of SaaS product management. Gain practical skills, strategic insights, and confidence to lead\\r\\nproduct initiatives and drive business growth in competitive markets. Throughout this course, you will learn how to: -\\r\\nDevelop and execute effective SaaS product strategies aligned with business objectives - Manage the product lifecycle\\r\\nfrom ideation to launch and beyond - Conduct market research and customer analysis to inform product decisions -\\r\\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams including engineering, marketing, and sales - Utilize key tools and methodologies\\r\\nfor agile product management - Measure success and optimize product performance continuously - Navigate the\\r\\nchallenges unique to SaaS platforms and subscription-based models This training course is ideal for business\\r\\nprofessionals, product managers, entrepreneurs, and anyone interested in advancing their career in the SaaS industry. Whether you are seeking to enhance your professional skills or aiming to transition into product management roles, this\\r\\ncourse provides the foundational knowledge and practical techniques to succeed. Choosing this certified course on our\\r\\nplatform ensures you receive high-quality, industry-relevant training with globally recognized certification. Our expert\\r\\ninstructors bring real-world experience, helping you build the confidence to implement learned concepts immediately.\\r\\nCompleting this course opens doors to exciting career opportunities in SaaS product management, including roles such\\r\\nas Product Manager, Business Analyst, Product Owner, and Strategic Consultant. Strengthen your professional profile\\r\\nand accelerate your career growth with this industry-recognized certification. Enroll today to gain the skills, certification,\\r\\nand confidence needed to excel in the dynamic world of SaaS product management and propel your business career\\r\\nforward.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 00:12:14', '2026-06-11 10:39:30', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop effective SaaS product strategies aligned with business goals and market needs using industry best practices\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Manage the entire SaaS product lifecycle from ideation through launch and ongoing optimization with agile methodologies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Conduct comprehensive market research and customer analysis to inform data-driven product decisions and enhance user experience\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Collaborate efficiently with cross-functional teams including engineering, marketing, and sales to drive product success and business growth<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 11_54_14 AM.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(469, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS growth strategy for startups\"}', 'saas-growth-strategy-for-startups', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 11_47_57 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 11_47_57 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets to scaling a successful SaaS startup with our comprehensive online course on SaaS Growth Strategy\\r\\nfor Startups. Designed for entrepreneurs and business professionals in the Middle East and beyond, this training course\\r\\nprovides essential insights and proven strategies to accelerate your company\'s growth and achieve sustainable success. Whether you\'re launching a new SaaS product or looking to expand your existing business, this certified course equips\\r\\nyou with the skills needed to navigate the competitive SaaS landscape effectively. What you will learn: - Key principles of\\r\\nSaaS business models and revenue streams - Effective customer acquisition and retention techniques - Strategies for\\r\\npricing, packaging, and positioning your SaaS product - Data-driven decision making for business growth - Building and\\r\\nscaling your sales and marketing teams - Leveraging technology and analytics for continuous improvement - Best\\r\\npractices for funding and investor relations - Developing a growth roadmap tailored to your startupâ€™s needs This\\r\\ncourse is ideal for startup founders, business managers, marketing professionals, and aspiring entrepreneurs in the\\r\\nMiddle East who want to enhance their professional skills and drive business expansion. If you are seeking to deepen\\r\\nyour understanding of SaaS growth strategies and improve your leadership capabilities, this training course is perfect for\\r\\nyou. Why choose this course on our platform: - Trusted by industry leaders and entrepreneurs across the Middle East -\\r\\nDelivered by experienced instructors with real-world SaaS expertise - Flexible online format to fit your busy schedule -\\r\\nAccess to exclusive resources and case studies - Earn a globally recognized certificate to validate your skills and boost\\r\\nyour career growth Career opportunities: Completing this certified course opens doors to roles such as SaaS Business\\r\\nDevelopment Manager, Growth Strategist, Product Manager, Marketing Director, and Startup Founder. Gain the\\r\\nprofessional skills necessary to lead SaaS initiatives, attract investment, and scale operations effectively in the\\r\\ncompetitive Middle East and global markets. Enroll today to elevate your business acumen, earn a reputable certificate,\\r\\nand propel your career forward in the dynamic SaaS industry.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 00:38:59', '2026-06-19 18:15:22', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop effective SaaS business models and revenue streams for startup growth and sustainability\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement customer acquisition and retention strategies to increase user engagement and lifetime value\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply data analytics and performance metrics to optimize SaaS product positioning and pricing strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build and scale sales and marketing teams to accelerate SaaS startup expansion and market penetration<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(470, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Selenium with Java from zero\"}', 'selenium-with-java-from-zero', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master web automation testing with Selenium and Java from the ground up. This beginner-friendly course is designed for students, software testers, and developers who want to build strong automation testing skills using real-world examples and practical projects. You will learn Java basics, Selenium WebDriver, browser automation, locators, waits, handling web elements, frameworks, TestNG, Maven, and automation best practices. By the end of the course, you will be able to create and execute professional automation test scripts confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 01:19:03', '2026-06-20 18:54:00', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1gckqpw\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\" data-end=\\\"715\\\">Understand the fundamentals of automation testing and Selenium.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u6fmb1\\\" data-start=\\\"716\\\" data-end=\\\"771\\\">\\r\\nWrite Java programs required for Selenium automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cj2533\\\" data-start=\\\"772\\\" data-end=\\\"827\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure Selenium WebDriver environment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"33mgnp\\\" data-start=\\\"828\\\" data-end=\\\"881\\\">\\r\\nAutomate web applications using Selenium with Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xwqduc\\\" data-start=\\\"882\\\" data-end=\\\"943\\\">\\r\\nWork with locators, XPath, CSS selectors, and web elements.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mlsmsa\\\" data-start=\\\"944\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">\\r\\nHandle alerts, dropdowns, frames, windows, and popups.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"bz4spz\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nImplement waits and synchronization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4ro5y0\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1117\\\">\\r\\nPerform mouse and keyboard actions using Selenium Actions class.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"is80fm\\\" data-start=\\\"1118\\\" data-end=\\\"1158\\\">\\r\\nGenerate test reports and screenshots.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"d2grzw\\\" data-start=\\\"1159\\\" data-end=\\\"1215\\\">\\r\\nUse TestNG framework for test execution and reporting.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nx9mwm\\\" data-start=\\\"1216\\\" data-end=\\\"1246\\\">\\r\\nManage projects using Maven.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ep6g1c\\\" data-start=\\\"1247\\\" data-end=\\\"1311\\\">\\r\\nApply automation testing best practices in real-time projects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qiphce\\\" data-start=\\\"1312\\\" data-end=\\\"1372\\\">\\r\\nBuild end-to-end automation testing projects from scratch.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hg1zbk\\\" data-start=\\\"1373\\\" data-end=\\\"1435\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nPrepare for Selenium automation testing interviews and jobs.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 42, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 57, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(471, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"JavaScript Programming for Beginners\"}', 'javascript-programming-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/4941270c-d50f-4d57-bca7-a4728acf1a92.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/4941270c-d50f-4d57-bca7-a4728acf1a92.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn the fundamentals of JavaScript programming from scratch in this beginner-friendly course. This course is designed for students, aspiring web developers, and anyone interested in learning how websites become interactive. You will understand JavaScript syntax, variables, functions, loops, arrays, DOM manipulation, events, and basic project development through practical examples and hands-on exercises. By the end of the course, you will be able to build simple interactive web applications confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 01:34:26', '2026-06-19 18:18:12', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"16byxht\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"671\\\">Understand the basics of JavaScript programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xtlnj3\\\" data-start=\\\"672\\\" data-end=\\\"743\\\">\\r\\nWrite and execute JavaScript code using modern browsers and editors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"90mwsf\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\" data-end=\\\"824\\\">\\r\\nUse variables, data types, operators, and conditional statements effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hunsfv\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\" data-end=\\\"878\\\">\\r\\nCreate loops and functions to build reusable code.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fi7lq8\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\" data-end=\\\"925\\\">\\r\\nWork with arrays and objects in JavaScript.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xlfipk\\\" data-start=\\\"926\\\" data-end=\\\"967\\\">\\r\\nHandle user interactions using events.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"197m4sz\\\" data-start=\\\"968\\\" data-end=\\\"1012\\\">\\r\\nManipulate webpage content using the DOM.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3n0hyd\\\" data-start=\\\"1013\\\" data-end=\\\"1055\\\">\\r\\nDebug and fix common JavaScript errors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"aux7tt\\\" data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1114\\\">\\r\\nBuild simple real-world mini projects using JavaScript.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e0e3t9\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\" data-end=\\\"1199\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain a strong foundation for advanced JavaScript frameworks and web development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(472, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Desarrollo web con spring Boot\"}', 'desarrollo-web-con-spring-boot', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/d165e904-a2df-45f7-bc84-3c272612f252.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/d165e904-a2df-45f7-bc84-3c272612f252.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Aprende a desarrollar aplicaciones web modernas y escalables utilizando <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Spring Boot<\\/span> desde cero. Este curso está diseñado para principiantes y desarrolladores que desean crear APIs REST, aplicaciones empresariales y sistemas web robustos con Java.<\\/li><li>Durante el curso trabajarás con tecnologías esenciales como Spring MVC, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate, bases de datos MySQL y herramientas de desarrollo modernas. También aprenderás a estructurar proyectos profesionales siguiendo buenas prácticas de desarrollo backend.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 01:44:34', '2026-06-19 18:18:30', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1qke9vl\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\" data-end=\\\"724\\\">omprender la arquitectura y el funcionamiento de <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Spring Boot<\\/span><\\/span>.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1it0uad\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\" data-end=\\\"790\\\">\\r\\nCrear aplicaciones web completas utilizando Java y Spring Boot.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k5hevi\\\" data-start=\\\"791\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">\\r\\nDesarrollar APIs REST seguras y escalables.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xdbvfa\\\" data-start=\\\"837\\\" data-end=\\\"886\\\">\\r\\nIntegrar bases de datos usando JPA y Hibernate.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14yiqoy\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\" data-end=\\\"941\\\">\\r\\nImplementar operaciones CRUD en aplicaciones reales.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kkbjq1\\\" data-start=\\\"942\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">\\r\\nGestionar autenticación y seguridad con Spring Security.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dfb0uj\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1056\\\">\\r\\nConectar aplicaciones frontend con servicios backend.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qn4pzj\\\" data-start=\\\"1057\\\" data-end=\\\"1120\\\">\\r\\nDesplegar aplicaciones web en servidores o plataformas cloud.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"axn4xh\\\" data-start=\\\"1121\\\" data-end=\\\"1190\\\">\\r\\nAplicar buenas prácticas de programación y estructura de proyectos.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xwbvr3\\\" data-start=\\\"1191\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nConstruir proyectos profesionales listos para producción.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 90, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(473, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fundamentos de unreal engine 4 11\"}', 'fundamentos-de-unreal-engine-4-11', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/e43d2032-ea7b-4904-aa00-fdaba8bb87c1 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-05-2026/e43d2032-ea7b-4904-aa00-fdaba8bb87c1 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li><strong data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"60\\\">Fundamentos de Unreal Engine 4.11<\\/strong> is a beginner-friendly course designed to introduce students to the powerful world of game development using <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\">Unreal Engine 4<\\/span>. In this course, learners will explore the Unreal Engine 4.11 interface, understand core game development concepts, and create interactive 3D environments using Blueprints, materials, lighting, and animations.<\\/li><li>The course focuses on practical learning with hands-on projects that help students build real-time experiences and understand the workflow used in professional game development studios. By the end of the course, students will have the confidence to create basic games and interactive applications using Unreal Engine 4.11.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 01:54:10', '2026-06-19 18:28:43', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1008amh\\\" data-start=\\\"827\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">Understand the fundamentals of <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Unreal Engine 4<\\/span><\\/span> and its interface.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jcj0lo\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"980\\\">\\r\\nNavigate and manage projects within Unreal Engine 4.11.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1aynm6l\\\" data-start=\\\"981\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">\\r\\nCreate and organize 3D environments and game assets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5c118z\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1095\\\">\\r\\nUse Blueprints for gameplay logic and interactions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18ome2b\\\" data-start=\\\"1096\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">\\r\\nApply lighting, materials, and textures to scenes.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yamlms\\\" data-start=\\\"1152\\\" data-end=\\\"1207\\\">\\r\\nWork with cameras, animations, and visual effects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lk4yqr\\\" data-start=\\\"1208\\\" data-end=\\\"1259\\\">\\r\\nImport and manage external assets effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r26lcg\\\" data-start=\\\"1260\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\">\\r\\nBuild and export simple game projects for different platforms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yul18j\\\" data-start=\\\"1328\\\" data-end=\\\"1391\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand basic level design and optimization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cfhw18\\\" data-start=\\\"1392\\\" data-end=\\\"1491\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop foundational skills for advanced game development and real-time visualization projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(474, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Xiaomi Repair\"}', 'xiaomi-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/17-05-2026/d862ae7d-b96d-4497-b68a-2e8dbb189a20.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/17-05-2026/d862ae7d-b96d-4497-b68a-2e8dbb189a20.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Nokia Lumia Repair Course: Unlock the skills to repair and maintain Nokia Lumia smartphones with this comprehensive<\\/p><p>course. Learn to diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network<\\/p><p>problems, and optimize device performance. Gain hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling Nokia Lumia<\\/p><p>devices, utilizing specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software<\\/p><p>troubleshooting specific to Nokia Lumia models. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the<\\/p><p>confidence to offer professional Nokia Lumia repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a Nokia<\\/p><p>Lumia enthusiast, this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to excel in Nokia Lumia phone repair and provide<\\/p><p>high-quality service for these legacy devices. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-17 15:24:55', '2026-06-19 11:28:58', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnostic techniques for Nokia Lumia hardware and software issues using specialized repair tools and methods<\\/li><li>Perform precise component replacements and reassembly of Nokia Lumia smartphones to restore device functionality<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve common network connectivity problems on Nokia Lumia devices effectively<\\/li><li>Implement firmware updates and software troubleshooting procedures to optimize Nokia Lumia performance<\\/li><li>Apply data recovery techniques to retrieve lost or corrupted data from Nokia Lumia smartphones<\\/li><li>Utilize troubleshooting strategies for resolving software crashes, boot loops, and system errors on Nokia Lumia<\\/li><li>Identify and fix charging, battery, and power management issues in Nokia Lumia phones<\\/li><li>Provide professional repair services by diagnosing and fixing display, touchscreen, and camera problems<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
