(482, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Spring Boot Full data\",\"hi\":\"Spring Boot Full data\"}', 'spring-boot-full-data', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/0f9a11b4-1797-4592-b39f-9752ecccfc43.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/22-05-2026/0f9a11b4-1797-4592-b39f-9752ecccfc43.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1bveo1u\\\" data-start=\\\"609\\\" data-end=\\\"632\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"53\\\" data-end=\\\"607\\\">This course provides a complete introduction to Spring Boot for building modern Java-based web applications and microservices. Learners will explore core concepts such as auto-configuration, dependency injection, REST API development, database integration, security, testing, and deployment. The course also covers real-world application structure, best practices, and production-ready features like monitoring and logging. By the end of this course, students will be able to create scalable, secure, and efficient backend applications using Spring Boot.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1bveo1u\\\" data-start=\\\"609\\\" data-end=\\\"632\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"53\\\" data-end=\\\"607\\\">This course provides a complete introduction to Spring Boot for building modern Java-based web applications and microservices. Learners will explore core concepts such as auto-configuration, dependency injection, REST API development, database integration, security, testing, and deployment. The course also covers real-world application structure, best practices, and production-ready features like monitoring and logging. By the end of this course, students will be able to create scalable, secure, and efficient backend applications using Spring Boot.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 14:27:50', '2026-06-12 10:22:20', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[ca