\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"845\\\">\\r\\nImplement dependency injection and bean management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"hpdvbj\\\" data-start=\\\"846\\\" data-end=\\\"909\\\">\\r\\nConnect applications with databases using Spring Data JPA.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1q4mx8d\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\" data-end=\\\"972\\\">\\r\\nHandle application security using Spring Security basics.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"s8gsvl\\\" data-start=\\\"973\\\" data-end=\\\"1040\\\">\\r\\nManage configuration, profiles, and properties in Spring Boot.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1n3ux1n\\\" data-start=\\\"1041\\\" data-end=\\\"1094\\\">\\r\\nTest and deploy Spring applications effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"x2911n\\\" data-start=\\\"1095\\\" data-end=\\\"1150\\\">\\r\\nDevelop scalable microservices-based applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qsvs01\\\" data-start=\\\"1151\\\" data-end=\\\"1222\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild production-ready enterprise applications with best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(484, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS pricing strategy step by step\"}', 'saas-pricing-strategy-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 12_08_37 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 12_08_37 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the essential strategies behind SaaS pricing with our comprehensive online course. Designed for marketing\\r\\nprofessionals and business leaders in the Middle East, this training course offers valuable insights into crafting effective\\r\\npricing models that drive revenue and maximize customer value. Whether you\'re aiming to enhance your professional\\r\\nskills or seeking to advance your career in the competitive SaaS industry, this certified course provides the knowledge\\r\\nand practical tools needed to succeed. Throughout this training course, you will learn how to develop a strategic SaaS\\r\\npricing framework, analyze market trends, and implement data-driven pricing tactics. Key topics include understanding\\r\\ndifferent SaaS pricing models, optimizing for customer acquisition and retention, and leveraging pricing as a competitive\\r\\nadvantage. This course is ideal for marketing professionals, product managers, business owners, and anyone involved in\\r\\nSaaS or subscription-based services. If you\'re looking to refine your marketing strategies and gain a competitive edge in\\r\\nthe SaaS landscape, this online course is tailored for your professional growth. Why choose this online course? Our\\r\\nplatform offers expert-led training, flexible learning schedules, and a recognized Certificate of Completion that enhances\\r\\nyour professional profile. Completing this course will empower you with the skills to make informed pricing decisions,\\r\\nimprove your company\'s profitability, and excel in your career. Upon finishing this certified course, you will receive a\\r\\nvaluable certification that validates your expertise in SaaS pricing strategy. This credential can open doors to new career\\r\\nopportunities, promotions, and leadership roles within the Middle Eastâ€™s growing technology and SaaS sectors. Join\\r\\nnow to elevate your marketing skills, earn a professional certification, and position yourself for success in the dynamic\\r\\nSaaS industry.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 16:11:29', '2026-06-19 18:19:55', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop a strategic SaaS pricing framework to maximize revenue and customer value in competitive markets\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze market trends and customer data to inform effective SaaS pricing decisions and models\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement data-driven pricing tactics to optimize customer acquisition, retention, and profitability\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Leverage SaaS pricing as a competitive advantage to enhance market positioning and business growth<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(485, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS growth strategy step by step\"}', 'saas-growth-strategy-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 12_29_48 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 12_29_48 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets to accelerating the growth of Software as a Service (SaaS) businesses with our comprehensive SaaS\\r\\nGrowth Strategy Step by Step online course. Designed for marketing professionals and entrepreneurs in the Middle East\\r\\nand beyond, this training course provides practical insights and proven techniques to drive customer acquisition,\\r\\nretention, and revenue growth. By mastering these strategies, you will enhance your professional skills and position\\r\\nyourself for advanced career opportunities in the competitive SaaS industry. In this course, you will learn: - Key\\r\\nprinciples of SaaS growth and customer lifecycle management - How to develop effective marketing funnels tailored for\\r\\nSaaS products - Strategies for inbound and outbound marketing to maximize reach - Techniques for optimizing customer\\r\\nonboarding and engagement - Data-driven decision-making and analytics for continuous improvement - Best practices for\\r\\nscaling SaaS businesses sustainably This course is ideal for marketing managers, digital strategists, startup founders,\\r\\nand professionals seeking to elevate their expertise in SaaS growth strategies. Whether you are new to SaaS marketing\\r\\nor looking to refine your skills, this training course offers actionable insights to help you succeed. Why choose this course\\r\\non our platform? We provide expert-led content, real-world case studies, and interactive modules designed to ensure you\\r\\ngain practical knowledge. Our Certified Course enhances your professional profile and demonstrates your commitment to\\r\\nongoing career development. Completing this course will open doors to exciting career opportunities within the SaaS\\r\\necosystem, including roles in growth marketing, product management, and strategic planning. Gain the confidence and\\r\\nskills needed to make a tangible impact in your organizationâ€™s growth trajectory. Upon successful completion, you\\r\\nwill earn a recognized Certificate that validates your expertise in SaaS growth strategy. This credential will support your\\r\\nprofessional development and increase your value in the dynamic Middle East and global tech markets.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 16:31:04', '2026-06-19 18:20:12', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop effective SaaS marketing funnels to increase customer acquisition and retention in competitive markets\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply inbound and outbound marketing strategies to maximize SaaS product reach and brand visibility\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize data analytics and customer lifecycle management techniques to optimize SaaS growth and revenue streams\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement sustainable scaling practices to ensure long-term success and business growth in the SaaS industry<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(486, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Best selling digital product ideas\"}', 'best-selling-digital-product-ideas', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_05_34 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_05_34 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the potential of the digital marketplace with our comprehensive training course on Best Selling Digital Product\\r\\nIdeas. This online course is designed to equip entrepreneurs, business owners, and aspiring digital creators with the\\r\\nessential knowledge and strategic insights needed to identify and develop profitable digital products. Whether you are\\r\\nlooking to start a new business or expand your existing portfolio, this certified course provides valuable tools to\\r\\naccelerate your career growth in the competitive world of online business. What you will learn in this course: - How to\\r\\nidentify trending and profitable digital product ideas tailored to various markets - Techniques for validating digital\\r\\nproduct concepts before launch - Strategies for creating compelling digital products, including eBooks, courses,\\r\\ntemplates, and more - Effective marketing and sales tactics to maximize revenue - Ways to build a sustainable online\\r\\nbusiness model around digital products - Best practices for scaling your digital offerings and increasing customer loyalty\\r\\nThis course is ideal for entrepreneurs, digital marketers, content creators, and business professionals seeking to enhance\\r\\ntheir professional skills and succeed in the online business environment. Whether you\'re a beginner or looking to refine\\r\\nyour strategy, this training course provides practical insights and actionable steps to turn innovative ideas into profitable\\r\\ndigital products. Why choose this course on our platform? We are committed to delivering high-quality, professional\\r\\ntraining courses that prioritize your career development. Our expert instructors bring real-world experience, ensuring\\r\\nyou gain applicable knowledge that directly impacts your success. Upon completion, you\'ll earn a recognized certificate\\r\\nthat highlights your skills and enhances your professional profile. Career opportunities after completing this course\\r\\ninclude launching your own digital product business, working as a digital product strategist, or consulting for companies\\r\\nlooking to expand their online offerings. This certification opens doors to diverse roles within the growing online\\r\\nbusiness landscape, especially in the Middle East and beyond. Enroll now to gain the skills, knowledge, and certification\\r\\nneeded to excel in the dynamic world of digital products. Empower your career with our trusted training course and take\\r\\nthe first step toward becoming a successful digital entrepreneur.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 17:09:57', '2026-06-19 18:13:06', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Identify trending digital product ideas using market research and consumer demand analysis\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Validate digital product concepts through customer feedback and prototype testing techniques\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create compelling digital products such as eBooks, online courses, and customizable templates effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement marketing and sales strategies to maximize revenue and build a sustainable online business<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 32, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
