(487, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS business essentials for beginners\"}', 'saas-business-essentials-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_11_53 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_11_53 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the fundamental principles of SaaS (Software as a Service) business models with our comprehensive online\\r\\ncourse designed for beginners. This training course offers valuable insights into building and managing successful SaaS\\r\\nventures, equipping you with essential professional skills to enhance your career growth. Whether you\'re new to the tech\\r\\nindustry or looking to expand your business expertise, this certified course provides a solid foundation for understanding\\r\\nthe unique dynamics of SaaS businesses in the Middle East, including Saudi Arabia and the UAE. Throughout this online\\r\\ncourse, you will learn how to: - Identify key components of a SaaS business model - Develop effective strategies for\\r\\ncustomer acquisition and retention - Understand pricing, revenue models, and subscription management - Implement\\r\\nessential marketing and sales techniques specific to SaaS - Analyze performance metrics for continuous improvement -\\r\\nNavigate legal and compliance considerations relevant to SaaS in the Middle East This training course is ideal for\\r\\nentrepreneurs, business professionals, IT specialists, and anyone interested in expanding their knowledge of SaaS\\r\\nbusiness operations. No prior experience is required, making it accessible to beginners eager to develop their\\r\\nprofessional skills and gain industry-relevant expertise. Choosing this course on our platform guarantees a high-quality,\\r\\nprofessionally curated learning experience. Our platform is trusted for delivering training courses that lead to recognized\\r\\ncertificates, helping learners stand out in the competitive job market. With flexible online access, you can learn at your\\r\\nown pace and revisit content as needed. Completing this certified course opens up a variety of career opportunities in the\\r\\nrapidly growing SaaS industry across the Middle East. Graduates can pursue roles such as SaaS Business Analyst,\\r\\nProduct Manager, Sales Strategist, or Entrepreneur in the cloud-based services sector. Upon successful completion, you\\r\\nwill receive a professional certificate validating your knowledge and skills in SaaS business essentials, supporting your\\r\\ncareer growth and professional development in the dynamic technology landscape.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 17:16:47', '2026-06-19 18:27:52', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Identify key components of SaaS business models for strategic planning and growth opportunities in cloud services\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop effective customer acquisition and retention strategies using targeted marketing and sales techniques in SaaS industry\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze SaaS performance metrics to optimize revenue, subscription management, and overall business efficiency\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Navigate legal, compliance, and regulatory considerations specific to SaaS operations in the Middle East market<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 32, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 42, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(488, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS business to product market fit\"}', 'saas-business-to-product-market-fit', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_17_29 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 18, 2026, 01_17_29 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets to transforming your SaaS business into a thriving product that perfectly fits the market with our\\r\\ncomprehensive online training course. Designed for aspiring entrepreneurs and business professionals in the Middle East\\r\\nand beyond, this course provides essential insights and practical strategies to help you achieve product-market fit and\\r\\naccelerate your business growth. Throughout this training course, you will learn how to identify customer needs, refine\\r\\nyour value proposition, and develop a scalable business model that resonates with your target audience. Gain hands-on\\r\\nknowledge in market research, customer validation, and product positioning to ensure your SaaS solution stands out in a\\r\\ncompetitive landscape. This course is ideal for those seeking to enhance their professional skills and make informed\\r\\ndecisions that drive success. This course is perfect for startup founders, business managers, product managers, and\\r\\nanyone interested in scaling a SaaS business. Whether you are at the beginning of your journey or looking to optimize an\\r\\nexisting product, this training provides valuable tools and insights to support your goals. Why choose this course on our\\r\\nplatform? We offer a professionally developed program with a focus on practical application and real-world cases. Our\\r\\ncertified course ensures that you gain recognized credentials that bolster your career growth and professional reputation\\r\\nin the business industry. Enjoy flexible learning options and access to expert instructors dedicated to your success.\\r\\nCompleting this course opens doors to various career opportunities, including product management, business\\r\\ndevelopment, and strategic consulting within the SaaS industry. Enhance your professional profile with a recognized\\r\\ncertification that demonstrates your expertise in achieving product-market fit. Enroll today to get started on your journey\\r\\ntoward business excellence and secure a competitive edge in the fast-evolving SaaS market. This certified course is your\\r\\ngateway to mastering the skills necessary for sustainable growth and long-term success in the business world.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 17:20:42', '2026-06-20 09:23:07', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Identify customer needs and pain points to tailor SaaS solutions effectively in competitive markets\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop compelling value propositions that resonate with target audiences and enhance product-market fit\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply market research and customer validation techniques to optimize SaaS product positioning and growth strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design scalable business models that align with customer demands and drive sustainable SaaS business success<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 38, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(489, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Financial markets coursera quiz answer\"}', 'financial-markets-coursera-quiz-answer', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/33a7137a-8256-4d36-8cd5-65e92b9054af.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/18-05-2026/33a7137a-8256-4d36-8cd5-65e92b9054af.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This <strong data-start=\\\"31\\\" data-end=\\\"67\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">Financial Markets Quiz Solutions<\\/strong> course is designed to help learners understand key concepts in financial markets while improving their problem-solving skills through quiz-based learning. The course covers essential topics such as stocks, bonds, interest rates, risk management, portfolio diversification, market instruments, financial institutions, and investment fundamentals. Through structured explanations and practice-based assessments, learners will strengthen their understanding of how financial markets operate in the real world.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 22:27:07', '2026-06-17 18:25:12', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"tmkaau\\\" data-start=\\\"653\\\" data-end=\\\"734\\\">Understand the fundamentals of financial markets and investment instruments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"107co56\\\" data-start=\\\"735\\\" data-end=\\\"813\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze concepts related to stocks, bonds, derivatives, and mutual funds.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dnldis\\\" data-start=\\\"814\\\" data-end=\\\"894\\\">\\r\\nExplain risk, return, diversification, and portfolio management principles.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13qpl1o\\\" data-start=\\\"895\\\" data-end=\\\"967\\\">\\r\\nInterpret interest rates, inflation, and market trends effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1a2o1es\\\" data-start=\\\"968\\\" data-end=\\\"1040\\\">\\r\\nSolve financial market quiz questions with confidence and accuracy.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1stb7gi\\\" data-start=\\\"1041\\\" data-end=\\\"1121\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the role of financial institutions and global financial systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kzs2ex\\\" data-start=\\\"1122\\\" data-end=\\\"1206\\\">\\r\\nApply financial concepts to practical investment and decision-making scenarios.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>improve exam preparation and financial knowledge through quiz practice.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 90, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(490, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Seed funding for startups step by step\"}', 'seed-funding-for-startups-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_14 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_14 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the essential skills needed to secure seed funding and launch a successful startup with our comprehensive online\\r\\ncourse, Seed Funding for Startups Step by Step. Designed for aspiring entrepreneurs and early-stage founders, this\\r\\ntraining course provides a clear and practical roadmap to navigate the complexities of raising initial capital. Gain the\\r\\nconfidence and knowledge necessary to attract investors, develop compelling pitches, and build a solid foundation for\\r\\nbusiness growth. Throughout this professional training course, you will learn how to: - Understand the fundamentals of\\r\\nseed funding and startup financing - Prepare effective pitch decks and investor presentations - Identify and approach\\r\\npotential investors in the Middle East and beyond - Develop a compelling business model that appeals to early-stage\\r\\ninvestors - Manage negotiations and due diligence processes - Build a scalable business plan aligned with investor\\r\\nexpectations - Leverage online resources and networks for funding opportunities This course is ideal for entrepreneurs,\\r\\nstartup founders, business students, and professionals looking to enhance their skills in startup financing and funding\\r\\nstrategies. Whether you are at the idea stage or seeking to scale your existing business, this training will equip you with\\r\\nthe tools needed for success. Why choose this course on our platform? We offer a trusted learning environment with\\r\\nexpert instructors who have real-world experience in startup funding and investment. This certified course ensures you\\r\\ngain practical insights and professional skills that are highly valued in the job market, fostering your career growth in the\\r\\ncompetitive business landscape. Completing this course opens doors to numerous career opportunities in venture capital,\\r\\nstartup consulting, business development, and entrepreneurship. It is an invaluable step toward building a strong\\r\\nfoundation for your professional journey and becoming a confident startup investor or founder. Upon successful\\r\\ncompletion, you will receive a recognized certificate that validates your expertise in seed funding strategies, enhancing\\r\\nyour credibility and career prospects in the business and startup ecosystem. Enroll today and take the first step toward\\r\\nturning your startup vision into reality.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 22:41:43', '2026-06-20 20:54:57', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master how to craft compelling pitch decks and investor presentations for startup funding opportunities\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and approach potential investors effectively in the Middle East and global markets using targeted strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop scalable business models and detailed business plans aligned with investor expectations and funding criteria\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Navigate negotiations, due diligence, and funding processes confidently to secure seed capital and grow startups<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 30, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(491, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"How to start a saas business from scratch\"}', 'how-to-start-a-saas-business-from-scratch', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_45 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_45 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Launching a successful SaaS (Software as a Service) business from scratch requires a strategic approach, technical\\r\\nknowledge, and a solid understanding of the market. This comprehensive online course provides aspiring entrepreneurs\\r\\nand business professionals with the essential skills and insights needed to build, launch, and grow a profitable SaaS\\r\\nenterprise. Designed for those in the Middle East, including Saudi Arabia and the UAE, this training course combines\\r\\npractical knowledge with industry best practices, ensuring you gain the confidence to turn your ideas into a thriving\\r\\nbusiness. Throughout this course, you will learn how to identify market opportunities, develop a scalable SaaS product,\\r\\nestablish a competitive pricing strategy, and implement effective marketing techniques. Additionally, you will explore key\\r\\naspects such as customer acquisition, retention strategies, and scaling your business sustainably. This course is ideal for\\r\\nentrepreneurs, business managers, IT professionals, and anyone interested in starting an online SaaS business. Whether\\r\\nyou are new to the industry or looking to enhance your professional skills, this training course offers valuable insights\\r\\ntailored to the dynamic Middle East market. Why choose this course on our platform? We provide expert-led training,\\r\\npractical case studies, and a certified course that enhances your professional portfolio. Our platform is trusted by\\r\\nthousands of learners seeking to advance their careers and develop their business acumen. With flexible learning\\r\\noptions, you can study at your own pace and access valuable resources designed to maximize your learning experience.\\r\\nCompleting this course opens up a variety of career opportunities, including roles such as SaaS product manager, startup\\r\\nfounder, business development manager, or digital transformation consultant. It also provides a solid foundation for\\r\\nlaunching your own SaaS venture, supporting your entrepreneurial ambitions in the competitive Middle East market.\\r\\nUpon successful completion, you will receive a professional certification that validates your expertise in starting and\\r\\nmanaging a SaaS business. This certified course is a valuable asset for your career growth and professional development\\r\\nin the ever-evolving online business landscape. <br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 22:58:51', '2026-06-19 10:57:27', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-pm-slice=\\\"0 0 []\\\">Identify market opportunities and customer needs for SaaS products in the Middle East market using industry research and analysis keywords SaaS, market research, customer needs, Middle East, SaaS products, industry analysis, business opportunities, online business Develop a scalable SaaS product by applying best practices in software development, user experience, and cloud infrastructure keywords SaaS development, scalability, user experience, cloud infrastructure, software engineering, product design, technical skills, SaaS platform Create effective marketing strategies to attract and retain SaaS customers through digital marketing, content creation, and customer engagement keywords SaaS marketing, customer acquisition, retention strategies, digital marketing, content marketing, customer engagement, online growth, SaaS sales Implement sustainable growth and scaling techniques by analyzing key performance metrics, customer feedback, and market trends keywords SaaS growth, scaling strategies, KPIs, customer feedback, market trends, business expansion, revenue growth, SaaS success<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(492, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Startup fundraising and saas growth strategy\"}', 'startup-fundraising-and-saas-growth-strategy', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_28 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 20, 2026, 02_17_28 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the essential skills needed to drive startup success with our comprehensive online course on Startup Fundraising\\r\\nand SaaS Growth Strategy. This professional training course is designed to equip entrepreneurs, business professionals,\\r\\nand aspiring startup founders with the strategic insights and practical techniques necessary for effective fundraising and\\r\\nscalable growth. Whether you\'re launching a new venture or seeking to expand an existing SaaS business, this certified\\r\\ncourse offers valuable knowledge to accelerate your career and strengthen your business acumen. In this training\\r\\ncourse, you will learn how to develop compelling fundraising strategies, identify the right investors, and craft persuasive\\r\\npitch decks. You will also gain expertise in SaaS growth tactics, including customer acquisition, retention strategies, and\\r\\nleveraging data-driven decision making. Key topics include market analysis, revenue models, pricing strategies, and\\r\\nscaling operations to ensure sustainable growth. This course is ideal for startup founders, business development\\r\\nprofessionals, investors, and anyone interested in advancing their professional skills in the startup ecosystem. Whether\\r\\nyou\'re in Saudi Arabia, the UAE, or the broader Middle East region, this training provides the strategic tools needed to\\r\\nsucceed in competitive markets. Choosing this course on our platform means access to expert-led instruction, flexible\\r\\nlearning options, and a recognized certification that enhances your professional profile. Our platform is dedicated to\\r\\nsupporting your career growth by offering high-quality, industry-relevant training courses designed to meet the needs of\\r\\nambitious professionals and entrepreneurs. Completing this certified course can open doors to new career opportunities\\r\\nin startup management, venture capital, product development, and business consulting. Gain the confidence and skills to\\r\\nlead successful fundraising initiatives and implement growth strategies that make a lasting impact. Enroll today to\\r\\nelevate your business knowledge and take the next step in your professional journey with a trusted online course\\r\\ndesigned for future-ready entrepreneurs and business leaders.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-18 23:16:33', '2026-06-12 04:05:20', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop compelling startup fundraising strategies to attract investors and secure capital effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and engage the right investors for SaaS startups to maximize funding opportunities and strategic partnerships\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design persuasive pitch decks that communicate value propositions and drive investor interest in SaaS ventures\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement data-driven SaaS growth tactics, including customer acquisition, retention, and scaling operations for sustainable expansion<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 59, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(493, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Selenium with Python from Scratch\"}', 'selenium-with-python-from-scratch', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/1bb8bdb1-fe87-4149-b27d-761447822ff4.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/1bb8bdb1-fe87-4149-b27d-761447822ff4.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn web automation and browser testing with Python using the powerful Selenium framework. This beginner-friendly course takes you from the fundamentals of Selenium to advanced browser automation techniques used in real-world projects. You will learn how to automate websites, interact with web elements, handle forms, manage waits, perform testing, and build automation scripts using Python.<\\/li><li>The course is designed for students, developers, testers, and automation enthusiasts who want hands-on experience in Selenium WebDriver with Python. Through practical examples and mini projects, you will gain the skills needed to create professional automation and testing solutions.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-19 20:47:05', '2026-06-20 03:52:15', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1qtrws0\\\" data-start=\\\"782\\\" data-end=\\\"846\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Selenium and browser automation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qne14i\\\" data-start=\\\"847\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure Selenium WebDriver with Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1o5gp38\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\" data-end=\\\"978\\\">\\r\\nAutomate browser actions such as clicks, typing, scrolling, and navigation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cf5cks\\\" data-start=\\\"979\\\" data-end=\\\"1041\\\">\\r\\nLocate web elements using ID, XPath, CSS selectors, and more\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"o3eejs\\\" data-start=\\\"1042\\\" data-end=\\\"1097\\\">\\r\\nHandle forms, buttons, dropdowns, alerts, and pop-ups\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ev2dzl\\\" data-start=\\\"1098\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">\\r\\nWork with waits, frames, windows, and multiple tabs\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4q4ebz\\\" data-start=\\\"1152\\\" data-end=\\\"1198\\\">\\r\\nPerform automated web testing using Selenium\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"zp5tdd\\\" data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1252\\\">\\r\\nCapture screenshots and generate automation reports\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8fm06c\\\" data-start=\\\"1253\\\" data-end=\\\"1303\\\">\\r\\nBuild real-world automation projects with Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"339tkz\\\" data-start=\\\"1304\\\" data-end=\\\"1375\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for scalable and maintainable automation scripts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fokvpa\\\" data-start=\\\"1376\\\" data-end=\\\"1441\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence for Selenium automation interviews and projects<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 32, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(494, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java technical interview questions and answer\"}', 'java-technical-interview-questions-and-answer', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/b48011e8-dbaf-4af4-8584-a0698a5ce8ff.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/b48011e8-dbaf-4af4-8584-a0698a5ce8ff.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master the most commonly asked Java technical interview questions with detailed explanations and practical coding examples. This course is designed for students, freshers, and software developers preparing for Java developer interviews in top IT companies. You will learn core Java concepts, object-oriented programming principles, collections, exception handling, multithreading, JDBC, Java 8 features, and real-world coding challenges. The course also includes HR interview tips, problem-solving strategies, and mock interview practice to boost your confidence and technical skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-19 23:46:30', '2026-06-20 00:08:51', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1j74rab\\\" data-start=\\\"688\\\" data-end=\\\"742\\\">Understand core Java programming concepts and syntax\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17qg9el\\\" data-start=\\\"743\\\" data-end=\\\"833\\\">\\r\\nExplain OOP principles such as inheritance, polymorphism, abstraction, and encapsulation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mzwnsc\\\" data-start=\\\"834\\\" data-end=\\\"890\\\">\\r\\nSolve frequently asked Java coding interview questions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1avt3d4\\\" data-start=\\\"891\\\" data-end=\\\"960\\\">\\r\\nWork with collections, arrays, strings, and data structures in Java\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13vvpwu\\\" data-start=\\\"961\\\" data-end=\\\"1030\\\">\\r\\nHandle exceptions and implement multithreading concepts effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18amfbs\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\">\\r\\nUse Java 8 features including Lambda Expressions and Stream API\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1f4jkda\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1150\\\">\\r\\nConnect Java applications with databases using JDBC\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"gkrdke\\\" data-start=\\\"1151\\\" data-end=\\\"1207\\\">\\r\\nImprove logical thinking and problem-solving abilities\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"c3ckln\\\" data-start=\\\"1208\\\" data-end=\\\"1267\\\">\\r\\nPrepare confidently for technical and HR interview rounds\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e5yco4\\\" data-start=\\\"1268\\\" data-end=\\\"1323\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild strong foundations for Java developer job roles<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(495, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Design pattern catalog for beginners\"}', 'design-pattern-catalog-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/ad6a5ac2-8bb7-484e-9b7b-0196aa948fdb.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/ad6a5ac2-8bb7-484e-9b7b-0196aa948fdb.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"30\\\" data-end=\\\"70\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">Design Pattern Catalog for Beginners<\\/strong> course introduces learners to the most essential software design patterns used in modern application development. This beginner-friendly course explains core object-oriented design principles and demonstrates how design patterns solve common software design problems. You will explore creational, structural, and behavioral design patterns with practical examples, making it easier to write scalable, maintainable, and reusable code. Perfect for aspiring developers, software engineers, and programming students.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-20 01:55:31', '2026-06-20 22:04:04', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1b6e7z4\\\" data-start=\\\"664\\\" data-end=\\\"761\\\">Understand the fundamentals of software design patterns and object-oriented design principles\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vibe90\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\" data-end=\\\"842\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between creational, structural, and behavioral design patterns\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3omixt\\\" data-start=\\\"843\\\" data-end=\\\"957\\\">\\r\\nImplement commonly used design patterns such as Singleton, Factory, Observer, Strategy, Adapter, and Decorator\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yj4smz\\\" data-start=\\\"958\\\" data-end=\\\"1042\\\">\\r\\nRecognize real-world software design problems and apply suitable design patterns\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5hipsg\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" data-end=\\\"1098\\\">\\r\\nWrite cleaner, more maintainable, and scalable code\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"otinle\\\" data-start=\\\"1099\\\" data-end=\\\"1182\\\">\\r\\nImprove problem-solving skills for software architecture and application design\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vs5rnx\\\" data-start=\\\"1183\\\" data-end=\\\"1256\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence in using design patterns in real development projects\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build a strong foundation for advanced software engineering concepts<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(496, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Backend y frontend\"}', 'backend-y-frontend', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/18ae5f05-fab0-48bc-8363-1d50b895fa30 (1).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-05-2026/18ae5f05-fab0-48bc-8363-1d50b895fa30 (1).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a complete introduction to both Frontend and Backend web development, helping learners understand how modern web applications are built from start to finish. You will explore frontend technologies used to create interactive user interfaces, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and popular frameworks, along with backend concepts such as servers, databases, APIs, authentication, and application logic. By the end of the course, learners will understand how frontend and backend systems work together to create full-stack applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-20 03:09:41', '2026-06-20 02:21:22', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1juhi9m\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\" data-end=\\\"725\\\">Understand the difference between frontend and backend development\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3yp8a6\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\" data-end=\\\"806\\\">\\r\\nBuild responsive and interactive user interfaces using frontend technologies\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qkxgdu\\\" data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"861\\\">\\r\\nWork with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and UI frameworks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1iclies\\\" data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"929\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand backend architecture, servers, and application logic\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1chvc9n\\\" data-start=\\\"930\\\" data-end=\\\"985\\\">\\r\\nCreate and consume REST APIs for data communication\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"inmd2u\\\" data-start=\\\"986\\\" data-end=\\\"1053\\\">\\r\\nWork with databases for storing and retrieving application data\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xu8awy\\\" data-start=\\\"1054\\\" data-end=\\\"1107\\\">\\r\\nImplement user authentication and security basics\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14f04gp\\\" data-start=\\\"1108\\\" data-end=\\\"1163\\\">\\r\\nConnect frontend applications with backend services\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dsw090\\\" data-start=\\\"1164\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand deployment concepts for web applications\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ls1bg4\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1284\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a simple full-stack web application project from scratch<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 46, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 43, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(497, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Como aprender programação do zero\"}', 'como-aprender-programacao-do-zero', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/c99b58af-1a3e-484c-9b22-7e3ea921a258.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/c99b58af-1a3e-484c-9b22-7e3ea921a258.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li><strong data-start=\\\"46\\\" data-end=\\\"83\\\">Como aprender programação do zero<\\/strong> é um curso completo para iniciantes que desejam entrar no mundo da programação sem experiência prévia. O curso apresenta os conceitos fundamentais de lógica de programação, algoritmos, variáveis, estruturas condicionais, loops, funções e noções básicas de desenvolvimento de software. Com exemplos práticos e exercícios passo a passo, os alunos desenvolverão raciocínio lógico e habilidades para criar seus primeiros programas com confiança.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-20 13:28:00', '2026-06-19 19:16:55', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"6l1wxj\\\" data-start=\\\"624\\\" data-end=\\\"698\\\">Compreender os conceitos básicos de programação e lógica computacional\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tfiz4q\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\" data-end=\\\"767\\\">\\r\\nEscrever algoritmos simples para resolver problemas do dia a dia\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fla3ss\\\" data-start=\\\"768\\\" data-end=\\\"824\\\">\\r\\nTrabalhar com variáveis, tipos de dados e operadores\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ftqjzl\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\" data-end=\\\"888\\\">\\r\\nUtilizar estruturas condicionais e loops de forma eficiente\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1iu70f6\\\" data-start=\\\"889\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nCriar e reutilizar funções em programas\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"rx7ps7\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">\\r\\nIdentificar e corrigir erros básicos de programação (debugging)\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kzcu9t\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1051\\\">\\r\\nDesenvolver pequenos projetos práticos do zero\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Construir uma base sólida para aprender linguagens como Python, Java ou JavaScript<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 63, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(498, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Loops and formatting in python\"}', 'loops-and-formatting-in-python', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/28fa72e2-ce68-4fe3-8d6a-04484a5b4ea0.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/20-05-2026/28fa72e2-ce68-4fe3-8d6a-04484a5b4ea0.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master two essential Python programming concepts: loops and string formatting. This course is designed for beginners who want to write cleaner, more efficient, and dynamic Python code. You’ll learn how to automate repetitive tasks using <code data-start=\\\"294\\\" data-end=\\\"299\\\">for<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"304\\\" data-end=\\\"311\\\">while<\\/code> loops, control loop execution with break and continue statements, and format output professionally using f-strings, format methods, and string manipulation techniques. Through practical examples and coding exercises, you’ll build confidence in writing Python programs used in real-world development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-20 13:53:06', '2026-06-19 08:42:30', 0, '0', '{\"en\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"bk3fqo\\\" data-start=\\\"683\\\" data-end=\\\"736\\\">Understand the purpose and usage of loops in Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"g6xtwc\\\" data-start=\\\"737\\\" data-end=\\\"790\\\">\\r\\nWork with <code data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"754\\\">for<\\/code> loops and <code data-start=\\\"765\\\" data-end=\\\"772\\\">while<\\/code> loops effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"evklp5\\\" data-start=\\\"791\\\" data-end=\\\"856\\\">\\r\\nUse <code data-start=\\\"797\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\">break<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-end=\\\"816\\\">continue<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"822\\\" data-end=\\\"828\\\">pass<\\/code> statements for loop control\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hx4ry7\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">\\r\\nImplement nested loops for solving complex programming tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qgm2b0\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"978\\\">\\r\\nIterate through strings, lists, tuples, and dictionaries\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wsgo8u\\\" data-start=\\\"979\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nFormat strings using f-strings, <code data-start=\\\"1013\\\" data-end=\\\"1024\\\">.format()<\\/code>, and string interpolation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1i4qeuj\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1101\\\">\\r\\nAlign, pad, and customize text output formatting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"efbz1q\\\" data-start=\\\"1102\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nBuild interactive Python programs using loops and formatted output\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wnlcx8\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1226\\\">\\r\\nDebug common mistakes related to loops and formatting\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pnd38j\\\" data-start=\\\"1227\\\" data-end=\\\"1277\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nWrite clean, efficient, and readable Python code<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(499, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Logo design in illustrator for beginner\",\"hi\":\"Logo design in illustrator for beginner\"}', 'logo-design-in-illustrator-for-beginner', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 28, 2026, 09_42_06 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 28, 2026, 09_42_06 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the fundamentals of logo design with our comprehensive online course, Logo Design in Illustrator for Beginners.\\r\\nThis training course is designed to equip aspiring designers and business professionals with essential skills to create\\r\\nimpactful logos that enhance brand identity. Whether you\'re looking to develop your creative portfolio or advance your\\r\\ncareer in the competitive business landscape of the Middle East, this course offers valuable expertise to help you\\r\\nsucceed. Throughout this professional training course, you will learn how to utilize Adobe Illustrator to craft professional\\r\\nlogos from scratch. Gain practical knowledge of design principles, color theory, typography, and branding strategies that\\r\\nare vital for effective logo creation. The course provides step-by-step guidance, ensuring a clear understanding of the\\r\\nentire design process, from concept development to final execution. What you will learn: - Fundamentals of logo design\\r\\nand branding - How to use Adobe Illustrator for professional logo creation - Techniques for developing unique and\\r\\nmemorable logo concepts - Color theory and typography best practices - Tips for creating versatile logo files suitable for\\r\\nvarious business needs - Best practices to prepare your logo for print and digital media Who this course is for: -\\r\\nEntrepreneurs and business owners in the Middle East seeking to strengthen their brand identity - Aspiring graphic\\r\\ndesigners aiming to build a career in logo design - Marketing professionals involved in branding projects - Anyone\\r\\ninterested in developing professional skills in logo creation using Illustrator Why choose this course on our platform: -\\r\\nAccess to expert-led training tailored for beginners - Flexible online learning suited to busy schedules - Receive a\\r\\ncertified course that adds value to your professional profile - Enhance your skills for career growth in the competitive\\r\\nbusiness environment - Join a community of learners committed to professional development Career opportunities:\\r\\nCompleting this certified course opens doors to various career paths, including freelance logo designer, branding\\r\\nspecialist, or in-house graphic designer for businesses. Build a strong portfolio and demonstrate your ability to deliver\\r\\nprofessional logo solutions that meet client and business needs. A certificate of completion will be awarded upon\\r\\nfinishing this training course, validating your new skills and supporting your career advancement in the dynamic field of\\r\\nbusiness branding and design. <br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Unlock the fundamentals of logo design with our comprehensive online course, Logo Design in Illustrator for Beginners.\\r\\nThis training course is designed to equip aspiring designers and business professionals with essential skills to create\\r\\nimpactful logos that enhance brand identity. Whether you\'re looking to develop your creative portfolio or advance your\\r\\ncareer in the competitive business landscape of the Middle East, this course offers valuable expertise to help you\\r\\nsucceed. Throughout this professional training course, you will learn how to utilize Adobe Illustrator to craft professional\\r\\nlogos from scratch. Gain practical knowledge of design principles, color theory, typography, and branding strategies that\\r\\nare vital for effective logo creation. The course provides step-by-step guidance, ensuring a clear understanding of the\\r\\nentire design process, from concept development to final execution. What you will learn: - Fundamentals of logo design\\r\\nand branding - How to use Adobe Illustrator for professional logo creation - Techniques for developing unique and\\r\\nmemorable logo concepts - Color theory and typography best practices - Tips for creating versatile logo files suitable for\\r\\nvarious business needs - Best practices to prepare your logo for print and digital media Who this course is for: -\\r\\nEntrepreneurs and business owners in the Middle East seeking to strengthen their brand identity - Aspiring graphic\\r\\ndesigners aiming to build a career in logo design - Marketing professionals involved in branding projects - Anyone\\r\\ninterested in developing professional skills in logo creation using Illustrator Why choose this course on our platform: -\\r\\nAccess to expert-led training tailored for beginners - Flexible online learning suited to busy schedules - Receive a\\r\\ncertified course that adds value to your professional profile - Enhance your skills for career growth in the competitive\\r\\nbusiness environment - Join a community of learners committed to professional development Career opportunities:\\r\\nCompleting this certified course opens doors to various career paths, including freelance logo designer, branding\\r\\nspecialist, or in-house graphic designer for businesses. Build a strong portfolio and demonstrate your ability to deliver\\r\\nprofessional logo solutions that meet client and business needs. A certificate of completion will be awarded upon\\r\\nfinishing this training course, validating your new skills and supporting your career advancement in the dynamic field of\\r\\nbusiness branding and design. <br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-20 15:21:41', '2026-06-20 05:42:32', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Create professional logos using Adobe Illustrator with practical design techniques and branding principles\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply color theory and typography best practices to enhance logo effectiveness and brand identity\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop unique, memorable logo concepts tailored for various business needs and media formats\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Prepare versatile logo files optimized for print, digital media, and diverse branding applications<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":\"<ol><li>Create professional logos using Adobe Illustrator with practical design techniques and branding principles\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply color theory and typography best practices to enhance logo effectiveness and brand identity\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop unique, memorable logo concepts tailored for various business needs and media formats\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Prepare versatile logo files optimized for print, digital media, and diverse branding applications<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
