\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">break<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"781\\\" data-end=\\\"791\\\">continue<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"797\\\" data-end=\\\"803\\\">pass<\\/code> statements\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sf6oba\\\" data-start=\\\"817\\\" data-end=\\\"870\\\">\\r\\nSolve real-world programming problems using loops\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hy6nw\\\" data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"938\\\">\\r\\nWrite efficient and readable Python code with proper loop logic\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Debug common loop-related errors in Python programs<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(540, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Basic Structure of a Java Program\",\"hi\":\"Basic Structure of a Java Program\"}', 'basic-structure-of-a-java-program', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/9662d3a1-4347-48df-8b30-6db09fea56c7.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/9662d3a1-4347-48df-8b30-6db09fea56c7.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn the basic structure of a Java program from scratch in this beginner-friendly course. Understand the essential building blocks of Java applications, including class declarations, the <code data-start=\\\"214\\\" data-end=\\\"222\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">main()<\\/code> method, package statements, import statements, comments, variables, and program execution flow. Through practical examples, learners will gain a strong foundation in writing and understanding Java programs efficiently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>Learn the basic structure of a Java program from scratch in this beginner-friendly course. Understand the essential building blocks of Java applications, including class declarations, the <code data-start=\\\"214\\\" data-end=\\\"222\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">main()<\\/code> method, package statements, import statements, comments, variables, and program execution flow. Through practical examples, learners will gain a strong foundation in writing and understanding Java programs efficiently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-23 23:36:09', '2026-06-20 14:10:30', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"5av9d3\\\" data-start=\\\"521\\\" data-end=\\\"579\\\">Understand the fundamental structure of a Java program\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"j3mdym\\\" data-start=\\\"580\\\" data-end=\\\"634\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use Java class declarations correctly\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ixueie\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\">\\r\\nExplain the purpose of the <code data-start=