(543, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python string formatting essentials\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-string-formatting-essentials', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-05-2026/37aa5c7b-8d10-42e2-9a19-64baf1412d9d.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-05-2026/37aa5c7b-8d10-42e2-9a19-64baf1412d9d.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn the essentials of Python string formatting in this practical beginner-friendly course. Explore different methods of formatting strings, including concatenation, <code data-start=\\\"193\\\" data-end=\\\"196\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">%<\\/code> formatting, <code data-start=\\\"209\\\" data-end=\\\"223\\\">str.format()<\\/code>, and modern f-strings for creating clean, readable, and dynamic output. Through hands-on examples, learners will understand how to display variables, numbers, text alignment, precision formatting, and build professional Python programs with properly formatted output.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-23 23:49:24', '2026-06-20 02:24:14', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"12bzmu8\\\" data-start=\\\"571\\\" data-end=\\\"643\\\">Understand the importance of string formatting in Python programming\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14xydpb\\\" data-start=\\\"644\\\" data-end=\\\"694\\\">\\r\\nUse string concatenation for basic text output\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1quzi9o\\\" data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"754\\\">\\r\\nApply <code data-start=\\\"703\\\" data-end=\\\"706\\\">%<\\/code> formatting for legacy string formatting tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15w59j2\\\" data-start=\\\"755\\\" data-end=\\\"814\\\">\\r\\nWork with <code data-start=\\\"767\\\" data-end=\\\"781\\\">str.format()<\\/code> for flexible string formatting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18865f7\\\" data-start=\\\"815\\\" data-end=\\\"868\\\">\\r\\nUse Python f-strings for clean and efficient code\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p6hl3b\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\" data-end=\\\"930\\\">\\r\\nFormat numbers, decimals, and aligned text professionally\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"khfgh3\\\" data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">\\r\\nCreate dynamic user-friendly output in Python applications\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Write cleaner and more readable Python code using formatting techniques<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 93, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(544, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Variables in Python for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'variables-in-python-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/23-05-2026/e2062f01-99cc-4350-8886-9e7034d19cf5.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/23-05-2026/e2062f01-99cc-4350-8886-9e7034d19cf5.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces Python variables, the fundamental building blocks of programming. Learn how to create, assign, and use variables to store different types of data such as numbers, text, and boolean values. Through practical examples and hands-on coding exercises, learners will understand variable naming rules, data types, dynamic typing, and how variables are used in real Python programs.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-23 23:57:00', '2026-06-19 18:20:29', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"156nrnz\\\" data-start=\\\"521\\\" data-end=\\\"582\\\">Understand the concept and purpose of variables in Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14ywgdr\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" data-end=\\\"641\\\">\\r\\nCreate and assign values to Python variables correctly\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k32m8a\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\" data-end=\\\"724\\\">\\r\\nWork with different data types such as strings, integers, floats, and booleans\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1g446qi\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\" data-end=\\\"789\\\">\\r\\nFollow Python variable naming conventions and best practices\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"s366dz\\\" data-start=\\\"790\\\" data-end=\\\"829\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand dynamic typing in Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"121fgqg\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"878\\\">\\r\\nUpdate and reuse variable values in programs\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yjvz9t\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\" data-end=\\\"940\\\">\\r\\nUse variables effectively in expressions and calculations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build a strong foundation for advanced Python programming concepts<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 56, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 77, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(545, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"LG Phone Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'lg-phone-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/24-05-2026/884f9101-dce6-430d-a68b-5329c8f86dc5.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/24-05-2026/884f9101-dce6-430d-a68b-5329c8f86dc5.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>LG Phone Repair Course: Gain expertise in repairing LG smartphones with this comprehensive course. Learn to diagnose<\\/p><p>and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems, and optimize device<\\/p><p>performance. Develop hands-on skills in disassembling and reassembling LG phones using specialized tools and<\\/p><p>techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software troubleshooting specific to LG devices.<\\/p><p>Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll acquire the knowledge and confidence to offer professional<\\/p><p>LG phone repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an LG enthusiast, this course equips you with<\\/p><p>the skills to excel in LG phone repair and provide high-quality service for these devices. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-24 15:44:36', '2026-06-20 17:42:37', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnosing hardware issues in LG smartphones using specialized tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform effective component replacements, including screens, batteries, and internal modules on LG phones<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve common software problems such as boot loops, crashes, and app errors in LG devices<\\/li><li>Implement firmware updates and software troubleshooting to enhance LG phone performance and stability<\\/li><li>Apply data recovery methods to retrieve lost data from damaged or malfunctioning LG smartphones<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble LG phones safely, maintaining device integrity and functionality<\\/li><li>Identify and fix network connectivity issues, including Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and cellular problems in LG devices<\\/li><li>Optimize LG smartphone performance through system cleaning, software tuning, and hardware upgrades<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 73, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
