(547, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Scripts for Automation\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-scripts-for-automation', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/02aa1290-9153-4e1f-873b-66d5feb4dfe1.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/02aa1290-9153-4e1f-873b-66d5feb4dfe1.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces Python scripting for automation, helping learners automate repetitive tasks and improve productivity. You will learn how to write Python scripts for file handling, data processing, email automation, web scraping, task scheduling, and system administration. Through practical examples and real-world projects, you’ll gain hands-on experience in building automation solutions using Python libraries and tools.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 18:30:20', '2026-06-19 18:14:31', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"zgipv0\\\" data-start=\\\"536\\\" data-end=\\\"598\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Python automation scripting\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jj2i5z\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\" data-end=\\\"664\\\">\\r\\nWrite Python scripts to automate repetitive tasks efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ssd0df\\\" data-start=\\\"665\\\" data-end=\\\"716\\\">\\r\\nPerform file and folder management using Python\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yl5gzw\\\" data-start=\\\"717\\\" data-end=\\\"789\\\">\\r\\nAutomate email sending, report generation, and data processing tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2a55qe\\\" data-start=\\\"790\\\" data-end=\\\"854\\\">\\r\\nUse Python libraries for web scraping and browser automation\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r6okjw\\\" data-start=\\\"855\\\" data-end=\\\"915\\\">\\r\\nSchedule and execute automated scripts for regular tasks\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wrjx9h\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"981\\\">\\r\\nInteract with APIs and external services using Python scripts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build real-world automation projects to improve workflow productivity<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 43, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(548, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"CMS for marketers for beginners\",\"hi\":\"CMS for marketers for beginners\"}', 'cms-for-marketers-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 25, 2026, 02_55_42 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 25, 2026, 02_55_42 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>CMS for marketers, in this course we will learn about CMS for Marketers and how to use content management systems\\r\\nto enhance digital marketing strategies. We will explore popular CMS platforms like WordPress, HubSpot, Shopify, and\\r\\nWix, covering their features, customization options, and marketing integrations. You\'ll learn how to create and manage\\r\\ncontent, optimize SEO, track performance, and integrate CMS with email marketing, analytics, and automation tools. Weâ€™ll also cover best practices for improving user experience, increasing engagement, and boosting conversions\\r\\nthrough CMS. Whether you\'re a marketer, entrepreneur, or business owner, this course will equip you with the skills to\\r\\nchoose the right CMS, implement content strategies, and maximize digital marketing success. By the end, you\'ll be able\\r\\nto efficiently manage websites, optimize content, and enhance brand visibility using CMS tools.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>CMS for marketers, in this course we will learn about CMS for Marketers and how to use content management systems\\r\\nto enhance digital marketing strategies. We will explore popular CMS platforms like WordPress, HubSpot, Shopify, and\\r\\nWix, covering their features, customization options, and marketing integrations. You\'ll learn how to create and manage\\r\\ncontent, optimize SEO, track performance, and integrate CMS with email marketing, analytics, and automation tools. Weâ€™ll also cover best practices for improving user experience, increasing engagement, and boosting conversions\\r\\nthrough CMS. Whether you\'re a marketer, entrepreneur, or business owner, this course will equip you with the skills to\\r\\nchoose the right CMS, implement content strategies, and maximize digital marketing success. By the end, you\'ll be able\\r\\nto efficiently manage websites, optimize content, and enhance brand visibility using CMS tools.<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 18:51:08', '2026-06-19 23:49:12', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master CMS platforms like WordPress, HubSpot, Shopify, and Wix for effective digital marketing campaigns\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Customize and optimize content management systems to improve website user experience and engagement\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Integrate CMS with email marketing, analytics, and automation tools to boost marketing efficiency\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement SEO best practices within CMS to increase website visibility and organic traffic\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create, manage, and update website content to support marketing strategies and brand messaging\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Track and analyze website performance metrics using CMS analytics tools for data-driven decisions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Enhance conversions by applying CMS features to optimize landing pages and call-to-action elements\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select the appropriate CMS platform based on business needs and marketing goals\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize CMS plugins and extensions to expand website functionality and marketing capabilities\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop content strategies within CMS to attract and retain target audiences effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve website security and performance to ensure a seamless user experience and trust\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Leverage CMS customization options to align website design with brand identity and marketing campaigns\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement automation workflows within CMS to streamline marketing processes and customer interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Use CMS tools to create multilingual websites for global marketing outreach\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for website accessibility and compliance within CMS platforms\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Manage website updates and backups efficiently to maintain website integrity and security<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":\"<ol><li>Master CMS platforms like WordPress, HubSpot, Shopify, and Wix for effective digital marketing campaigns\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Customize and optimize content management systems to improve website user experience and engagement\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Integrate CMS with email marketing, analytics, and automation tools to boost marketing efficiency\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement SEO best practices within CMS to increase website visibility and organic traffic\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create, manage, and update website content to support marketing strategies and brand messaging\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Track and analyze website performance metrics using CMS analytics tools for data-driven decisions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Enhance conversions by applying CMS features to optimize landing pages and call-to-action elements\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Select the appropriate CMS platform based on business needs and marketing goals\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize CMS plugins and extensions to expand website functionality and marketing capabilities\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop content strategies within CMS to attract and retain target audiences effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve website security and performance to ensure a seamless user experience and trust\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Leverage CMS customization options to align website design with brand identity and marketing campaigns\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement automation workflows within CMS to streamline marketing processes and customer interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Use CMS tools to create multilingual websites for global marketing outreach\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for website accessibility and compliance within CMS platforms\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Manage website updates and backups efficiently to maintain website integrity and security<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0