(549, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Angles Unity 3D game development\",\"hi\":null}', 'angles-unity-3d-game-development', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/a37b3dd8-eb9e-4ba4-952a-a75dffe96821.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/a37b3dd8-eb9e-4ba4-952a-a75dffe96821.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces Unity 3D game development with a focus on creating interactive games using the Unity engine. Learners will explore game design principles, scene creation, object manipulation, physics, animation, scripting with C#, UI development, and gameplay mechanics. Through practical projects, this course helps beginners build engaging 3D games while understanding the core concepts of game development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 18:59:43', '2026-06-19 18:27:18', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"rkn5jx\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\" data-end=\\\"582\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Unity 3D game development\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jdrzo8\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" data-end=\\\"632\\\">\\r\\nNavigate and use the Unity Editor effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u4q4ik\\\" data-start=\\\"633\\\" data-end=\\\"690\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage 3D scenes, game objects, and assets\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pdwdny\\\" data-start=\\\"691\\\" data-end=\\\"756\\\">\\r\\nApply physics, collisions, and animations in game development\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wvd3ag\\\" data-start=\\\"757\\\" data-end=\\\"824\\\">\\r\\nWrite C# scripts to control gameplay mechanics and interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ohw9fo\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\" data-end=\\\"886\\\">\\r\\nDesign user interfaces, menus, and HUD elements for games\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"180h585\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\" data-end=\\\"947\\\">\\r\\nImplement player movement, enemy AI, and scoring systems\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build, test, and deploy complete 3D game projects using Unity<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 65, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(550, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Generate Business Leads\",\"hi\":null}', 'generate-business-leads', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 25, 2026, 02_58_56 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 25, 2026, 02_58_56 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Growth hacking, in this course is your gateway to mastering innovative strategies for rapid and sustainable business\\r\\ngrowth. In this course, youâ€™ll learn how to analyze customer data, experiment with creative marketing techniques,\\r\\nand optimize the customer journey for maximum results. Discover how to leverage SEO, social media, content marketing,\\r\\nand paid advertising to drive customer acquisition. Gain hands-on experience with A\\/B testing, funnel optimization, and\\r\\nautomation tools to streamline processes and improve ROI. Perfect for marketers, entrepreneurs, and professionals, this\\r\\ncourse provides actionable insights and practical skills to create impactful campaigns and scale your business effectively. Whether you\'re new to growth hacking or looking to refine your expertise, this course equips you with the tools to\\r\\nsucceed in todayâ€™s competitive landscape.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 19:01:16', '2026-06-19 18:09:40', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop targeted lead generation strategies using growth hacking techniques and customer data analysis\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement creative marketing campaigns leveraging SEO, social media, and content marketing for business growth\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Optimize customer journey and sales funnels to maximize lead conversion and customer acquisition\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize paid advertising and automation tools to enhance marketing efficiency and ROI\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Conduct A\\/B testing to refine marketing messages and improve campaign performance\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze customer behavior and data to identify high-potential leads and market segments\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design and execute scalable growth hacking tactics for sustainable business expansion\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Leverage social media platforms to generate quality leads and increase brand visibility\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply content marketing strategies to attract and nurture potential customers effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Use analytics and tracking tools to measure campaign success and optimize marketing efforts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement lead nurturing workflows to convert prospects into loyal customers\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop actionable plans for continuous growth and competitive advantage in digital marketing<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 33, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(551, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Build Realistic 3D video game development\",\"hi\":null}', 'build-realistic-3d-video-game-development', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/f3e155a3-4e87-435e-ace3-cad9691628a5.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/f3e155a3-4e87-435e-ace3-cad9691628a5.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course focuses on building realistic 3D video games from concept to completion using modern game development tools and techniques. Learners will explore 3D environment design, character creation, realistic physics, lighting, animations, AI behaviors, sound integration, and gameplay mechanics. Through hands-on projects, the course provides practical experience in creating immersive, high-quality 3D gaming experiences for desktop and mobile platforms.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 19:05:37', '2026-06-19 18:30:25', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1e7kqqk\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\" data-end=\\\"628\\\">Understand the fundamentals of realistic 3D game development\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3sv2kq\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\" data-end=\\\"696\\\">\\r\\nDesign immersive 3D game environments and realistic game assets\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15vezyj\\\" data-start=\\\"697\\\" data-end=\\\"771\\\">\\r\\nCreate and animate characters with lifelike movements and interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13cfbby\\\" data-start=\\\"772\\\" data-end=\\\"847\\\">\\r\\nImplement physics, collisions, lighting, and visual effects for realism\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rn1778\\\" data-start=\\\"848\\\" data-end=\\\"909\\\">\\r\\nDevelop gameplay mechanics using scripting and game logic\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1tj4cw1\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\" data-end=\\\"984\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate sound effects, background music, and user interface elements\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"106v529\\\" data-start=\\\"985\\\" data-end=\\\"1051\\\">\\r\\nBuild enemy AI, player controls, and interactive game features\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Optimize and deploy complete 3D video games for multiple platforms<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 62, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
