(553, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Laravel REST API essentia\'ls\",\"hi\":null}', 'laravel-rest-api-essentia-ls', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ff624db3-0dd0-46ef-a285-b6a1e4a5c70c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/ff624db3-0dd0-46ef-a285-b6a1e4a5c70c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"485\\\" data-end=\\\"562\\\"><\\/p><\\/p><ul><li>This course covers the essentials of building RESTful APIs using Laravel, one of the most popular PHP frameworks for modern web development. Learners will understand API architecture, routing, controllers, middleware, authentication, request validation, database integration, JSON responses, and API security. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, this course helps developers build scalable and secure REST APIs for web and mobile applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 19:19:21', '2026-06-18 06:28:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1kqqner\\\" data-start=\\\"563\\\" data-end=\\\"641\\\">Understand the fundamentals of REST API architecture and Laravel framework\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pyuk6i\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\" data-end=\\\"705\\\">\\r\\nCreate and configure Laravel REST API projects from scratch\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jkukke\\\" data-start=\\\"706\\\" data-end=\\\"775\\\">\\r\\nBuild API routes, controllers, and resource endpoints efficiently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kw86el\\\" data-start=\\\"776\\\" data-end=\\\"848\\\">\\r\\nPerform CRUD operations with database integration using Eloquent ORM\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"n3vay5\\\" data-start=\\\"849\\\" data-end=\\\"908\\\">\\r\\nImplement request validation and error handling in APIs\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hcmm4m\\\" data-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"976\\\">\\r\\nSecure APIs using authentication methods such as Sanctum or JWT\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18l6ndm\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1053\\\">\\r\\nReturn structured JSON responses for frontend and mobile app integration\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop and deploy complete RESTful API applications using Laravel<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 95, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(554, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Basics for Calculations for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-basics-for-calculations-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/bde44cde-97c1-4b67-9264-533fc3b09b50.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/bde44cde-97c1-4b67-9264-533fc3b09b50.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces Python fundamentals with a focus on performing calculations and solving basic mathematical problems. Learners will explore numbers, variables, arithmetic operators, mathematical expressions, built-in math functions, and simple programming logic using Python. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, this course helps beginners build a strong foundation in Python programming for calculations and problem-solving.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 19:36:06', '2026-06-17 19:43:11', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p><div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\\\"><\\/div><\\/p><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:7b736015-c207-4085-b20f-8949eb21a2af-10\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"request-WEB:7b736015-c207-4085-b20f-8949eb21a2af-10\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:7b736015-c207-4085-b20f-8949eb21a2af-10\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-24\\\" data-scroll-anchor=\\\"false\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\