(555, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"JavaScript Algorithms Fundamentals\",\"hi\":null}', 'javascript-algorithms-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/67bbd39d-94ec-441e-b51f-52523040ff39.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/67bbd39d-94ec-441e-b51f-52523040ff39.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the core fundamentals of JavaScript algorithms for beginners who want to build strong problem-solving and programming skills. Learners will explore algorithm concepts such as searching, sorting, recursion, arrays, strings, loops, and logical problem-solving using JavaScript. The course focuses on practical coding examples and step-by-step explanations to help beginners understand how algorithms work in real-world development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 21:13:38', '2026-06-17 23:02:36', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1hb43lj\\\" data-start=\\\"558\\\" data-end=\\\"633\\\">Understand the fundamentals of algorithms and their role in programming\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ls6gj5\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\" data-end=\\\"695\\\">\\r\\nWrite efficient JavaScript code to solve logical problems\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wnvs4d\\\" data-start=\\\"696\\\" data-end=\\\"763\\\">\\r\\nImplement common searching and sorting algorithms in JavaScript\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yelqjj\\\" data-start=\\\"764\\\" data-end=\\\"840\\\">\\r\\nWork with arrays, strings, loops, and conditional statements effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"55w983\\\" data-start=\\\"841\\\" data-end=\\\"906\\\">\\r\\nApply recursion techniques for solving algorithmic challenges\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"u3jpfs\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\" data-end=\\\"975\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze basic algorithm performance and time complexity concepts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build problem-solving confidence for coding interviews and web development tasks<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(556, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"React JS Functional for Beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'react-js-functional-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/922c09ab-2354-49ec-8422-eb3ae4006127.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/922c09ab-2354-49ec-8422-eb3ae4006127.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces React JS functional programming concepts for building modern, interactive web applications. Learners will understand functional components, JSX syntax, props, state management, event handling, hooks, and component-based UI development. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, beginners will gain the confidence to create responsive React applications from scratch.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 21:20:11', '2026-06-17 19:45:06', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1c3s05k\\\" data-start=\\\"521\\\" data-end=\\\"590\\\">Understand the fundamentals of React JS and functional components\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"x1ro6s\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\" data-end=\\\"651\\\">\\r\\nCreate and structure React applications using JSX syntax\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6h6f7f\\\" data-start=\\\"652\\\" data-end=\\\"713\\\">\\r\\nWork with props and state effectively in React components\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cpstik\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\" data-end=\\\"765\\\">\\r\\nHandle user events and interactive UI behaviors\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"li9wlx\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">\\r\\nUse React Hooks such as <code data-start=\\\"792\\\" data-end=\\\"802\\\">useState<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"818\\\">useEffect<\\/code> in real projects\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pmnuqq\\\" data-start=\\\"838\\\" data-end=\\\"882\\\">\\r\\nBuild reusable and modular UI components\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop beginner-level dynamic web applications using React JS confidently<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 15, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(557, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"JavaScript Concepts basics for Beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'javascript-concepts-basics-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/06066402-ce61-4a61-ae7a-825452c480cd.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/25-05-2026/06066402-ce61-4a61-ae7a-825452c480cd.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamental concepts of JavaScript programming, helping learners build a strong foundation in web development. The course covers essential topics such as variables, data types, operators, functions, arrays, objects, loops, conditional statements, DOM basics, and event handling. Through practical coding examples and hands-on exercises, beginners will gain the confidence to understand and write JavaScript code effectively.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-25 21:41:52', '2026-06-17 20:32:15', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"gqm1kc\\\" data-start=\\\"575\\\" data-end=\\\"637\\\">Understand core JavaScript programming concepts and syntax\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15rlr8z\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\" data-end=\\\"713\\\">\\r\\nWork with variables, data types, operators, and expressions confidently\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cd8kza\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\" data-end=\\\"766\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use functions for reusable code logic\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1y8wcqz\\\" data-start=\\\"767\\\" data-end=\\\"829\\\">\\r\\nApply loops and conditional statements for problem-solving\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nbri3i\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"889\\\">\\r\\nWork with arrays and objects to manage data effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lg0df8\\\" data-start=\\\"890\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand basic DOM manipulation and event handling concepts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build beginner-level interactive JavaScript programs with confidence<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 15, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 96, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
