(561, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Programming language basics\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-programming-language-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/26-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 26, 2026, 07_43_45 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/26-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 26, 2026, 07_43_45 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the fundamentals of Python programming with this comprehensive online course designed for beginners and\\r\\naspiring professionals in the Middle East. Python is one of the most versatile and in-demand programming languages,\\r\\nessential for career growth in technology, data analysis, web development, and automation. This training course offers a\\r\\nstructured approach to mastering core programming concepts, enabling you to build a strong foundation for your\\r\\nprofessional skills. Throughout this course, you will learn how to write efficient Python code, understand key\\r\\nprogramming principles, and apply problem-solving techniques. The curriculum covers essential topics including data\\r\\ntypes, control structures, functions, modules, and basic data handling. By the end of this training, you\'ll be equipped with\\r\\nthe practical skills needed to develop simple applications and scripts, setting the stage for advanced learning or\\r\\nimmediate career opportunities. This course is ideal for beginners with little to no prior programming experience,\\r\\nprofessionals seeking to expand their technical skills, or students preparing for a future in software development, data\\r\\nscience, or automation. If you\'re looking to enhance your resume with a certified skill and boost your career prospects in\\r\\nthe Middle East or globally, this course is the perfect choice. Why choose this professional training course on our\\r\\nplatform? Our courses are designed by industry experts, ensuring you receive high-quality content aligned with current\\r\\nmarket demands. The certified course provides an official recognition of your skills, helping you stand out in a\\r\\ncompetitive job market and opening doors to new career opportunities. Upon successful completion, you will receive a\\r\\nverified certificate that demonstrates your proficiency in Python programming. This credential can be added to your\\r\\nprofessional profile, showcasing your commitment to continuous learning and career advancement in the tech industry.\\r\\nStart your journey into programming today with this expert-led online course and take a significant step towards\\r\\nachieving your career growth goals in the Middle East. Techyance<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-27 00:28:48', '2026-06-19 18:14:49', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6\\\"><span class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text xkrh14z\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Write efficient Python code using data types, control structures, and functions for real-world applications<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6\\\"><span class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text xkrh14z\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Apply Python programming principles to develop simple scripts and automation tools for business tasks<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6\\\"><span class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text xkrh14z\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Utilize Python modules and data handling techniques to analyze data and create basic data-driven solutions<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6\\\"><span class=\\\"_aupe copyable-text xkrh14z\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Implement problem-solving strategies in Python to troubleshoot code and optimize program performance<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0,