(563, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Export settings for YouTube\",\"hi\":null}', 'export-settings-for-youtube', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/6960272d-5048-4d2f-ab33-c2f5706dd0fc.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/6960272d-5048-4d2f-ab33-c2f5706dd0fc.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Export settings for YouTube, in this course youâ€™ll learn the best export settings for YouTube to ensure your videos<\\/p><p>maintain high quality while optimizing file size for faster uploads. Weâ€™ll cover video resolution, frame rates, bitrate<\\/p><p>settings, and audio configurations to achieve the best results. Youâ€™ll explore exporting in Adobe Premiere Pro,<\\/p><p>DaVinci Resolve, and Final Cut Pro, learning how to set up H.264 encoding, bitrate control, and color grading for<\\/p><p>YouTube compression. Additionally, weâ€™ll discuss reducing file size without quality loss, fixing common export issues,<\\/p><p>and improving video clarity. By the end, youâ€™ll master professional export techniques to make your YouTube videos<\\/p><p>look sharp and professional. Santrel Media<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-27 16:15:05', '2026-06-18 00:34:27', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Optimize YouTube video quality through expert export settings for high-resolution, frame rate, and bitrate control<\\/li><li>Apply Adobe Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, and Final Cut Pro export techniques for YouTube video formats<\\/li><li>Configure H.264 encoding, audio settings, and color grading to enhance YouTube video clarity and professionalism<\\/li><li>Reduce file size without compromising video quality for faster YouTube uploads and better viewer experience<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common export issues to ensure seamless YouTube video rendering and playback<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for YouTube video resolution, frame rate, and aspect ratio for optimal viewing<\\/li><li>Adjust bitrate settings to balance video quality and file size for YouTube compression standards<\\/li><li>Enhance video sharpness and color accuracy through advanced export configurations for YouTube<\\/li><li>Utilize export presets and custom settings to streamline YouTube video production workflows<\\/li><li>Ensure consistent export quality across different editing software for professional YouTube content<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(564, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Meizu Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'meizu-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/e2a4d179-7a21-4637-a7cf-30f71ecc703f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/e2a4d179-7a21-4637-a7cf-30f71ecc703f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Meizu Repair Course: Master the art of repairing Meizu smartphones with this comprehensive course. Learn to diagnose<\\/p><p>and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems, and optimize device<\\/p><p>performance. Develop hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling Meizu phones, utilizing specialized tools<\\/p><p>and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software troubleshooting specific to Meizu<\\/p><p>devices. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll gain the skills to offer professional Meizu phone<\\/p><p>repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a Meizu enthusiast, this course equips you with the<\\/p><p>knowledge and skills to excel in Meizu phone repair and provide high-quality service for these devices. MovilOne Phone<\\/p><p>Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-27 17:20:24', '2026-06-19 17:59:48', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Diagnose and troubleshoot common hardware issues in Meizu smartphones effectively using specialized tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform precise component replacements, including screens, batteries, and internal parts, on Meizu devices<\\/li><li>Identify and resolve software problems such as system crashes, boot loops, and firmware errors in Meizu phones<\\/li><li>Implement data recovery methods to retrieve lost or corrupted data from Meizu smartphones safely and efficiently<\\/li><li>Update and reinstall firmware to optimize device performance and fix software bugs on Meizu devices<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot network connectivity issues, including Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and cellular problems in Meizu smartphones<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble Meizu phones safely, maintaining device integrity and preventing damage<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for diagnosing and repairing Meizu-specific hardware and software faults in real-world scenarios<\\/li><li>Utilize specialized tools and techniques for effective Meizu device repair, ensuring high-quality service delivery<\\/li><li>Develop professional skills to offer reliable Meizu phone repair services, enhancing customer satisfaction<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(565, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Chrome devtools for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'chrome-devtools-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 27, 2026, 09_30_49 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 27, 2026, 09_30_49 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the power of Chrome DevTools and enhance your programming skills with this comprehensive online training\\r\\ncourse for beginners. Designed specifically for aspiring developers in the Middle East, including Saudi Arabia and the\\r\\nUAE, this course offers valuable insights into browser-based debugging and performance optimization. Mastering\\r\\nChrome DevTools is essential for improving your professional skills, advancing your career, and gaining a competitive\\r\\nedge in the tech industry. Throughout this training course, you will learn how to efficiently debug web applications,\\r\\nanalyze network activity, optimize website performance, and troubleshoot CSS and JavaScript issues. The course covers\\r\\nfoundational concepts, practical techniques, and best practices to help you become confident in using Chrome DevTools\\r\\nfor real-world programming projects. This course is ideal for beginners who want to develop a strong foundation in web\\r\\ndevelopment, software testing, or digital troubleshooting. It is also suitable for professionals seeking to upgrade their\\r\\ntechnical skills and stay competitive in the rapidly evolving programming landscape. No prior experience is required, making it accessible for anyone eager to learn and grow in the tech field. Why choose this online platform? Our training\\r\\ncourse offers a flexible, self-paced learning environment with expert guidance from industry professionals. You will gain\\r\\nhands-on experience through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, ensuring you can apply your knowledge\\r\\nimmediately. Upon completion, you will receive a certified course certificate, validating your skills and boosting your\\r\\nprofessional profile. Successful completion of this course opens doors to various career opportunities, including front-end\\r\\ndeveloper, web developer, quality assurance analyst, and technical support specialist. The skills acquired will serve as a\\r\\nsolid foundation for further specialization in programming, debugging, and web performance optimization. Enroll today\\r\\nand take a significant step toward advancing your programming career with a recognized certified course. Equip yourself\\r\\nwith essential technical skills, enhance your job prospects, and achieve your professional goals in the digital age.\\r\\nTechyance&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 01:38:35', '2026-06-20 04:09:16', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Master how to debug web applications using Chrome DevTools for efficient troubleshooting and error resolution<\\/p><p>Analyze network activity to optimize website performance and reduce load times effectively<\\/p><p>Identify and fix CSS and JavaScript issues to enhance website functionality and user experience<\\/p><p>Apply best practices in Chrome DevTools for real-world web development, testing, and performance improvement<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 25, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(566, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python basics for absolute beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-basics-for-absolute-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 27, 2026, 10_22_41 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/27-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 27, 2026, 10_22_41 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>This comprehensive online training course is designed specifically for absolute beginners seeking to build a strong\\r\\nfoundation in programming through Python. As one of the most versatile and widely used programming languages,\\r\\nPython offers valuable skills for advancing your career in technology, data analysis, automation, and software\\r\\ndevelopment. Enroll now to gain practical knowledge that will boost your professional skills and open new career\\r\\nopportunities in the rapidly evolving tech industry across the Middle East and beyond. Throughout this course, you will\\r\\nlearn essential Python programming concepts, including syntax, data types, control structures, functions, and basic data\\r\\nmanipulation. The course is structured to ensure an engaging and effective learning experience, enabling you to write\\r\\nyour own Python scripts confidently and efficiently. What you will learn: - The fundamentals of Python programming\\r\\nlanguage - How to write, test, and debug Python code - Using variables, operators, and data types effectively - Control\\r\\nflow statements such as loops and conditionals - Creating functions and understanding code modularity - Basic file\\r\\nhandling and data input\\/output - Applying Python to solve real-world problems This course is ideal for beginners with\\r\\nlittle to no prior coding experience who want to develop professional skills in programming. It is also suitable for\\r\\nstudents, career changers, and professionals in the Middle East aiming to enhance their technical expertise and increase\\r\\nemployability. Why choose this course on our platform: - Expert-led training with practical, real-world examples - Flexible\\r\\nonline learning tailored to your schedule - Access to a certified course that enhances your professional profile -\\r\\nSupportive learning environment with interactive assessments - A trusted platform dedicated to quality education and\\r\\ncareer growth Upon completion, you will receive a recognized certificate that validates your programming skills. This\\r\\ncertification can serve as a valuable asset for your resume, helping you stand out in the competitive job market across\\r\\nSaudi Arabia, UAE, and the broader Middle East region. Start your programming journey today with this professional\\r\\ntraining course and take a significant step toward achieving your career goals in technology and software development.\\r\\nG C Reddy Software Testing&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 02:27:48', '2026-06-19 18:23:20', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Write Python scripts using syntax, data types, and control structures effectively for automation and data analysis<\\/p><p>Debug and test Python code to ensure functionality and optimize performance in real-world applications<\\/p><p>Create reusable functions and modular code to improve efficiency and maintainability of Python programs<\\/p><p>Handle files and perform data input\\/output operations to manage data processing tasks efficiently<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 32, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(567, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"iPad Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'ipad-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/6be2e10f-00f5-4de3-81b8-ae43a38524db.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/6be2e10f-00f5-4de3-81b8-ae43a38524db.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>iPad Repair Course: Acquire the skills to repair and maintain iPads with this comprehensive course. Learn to diagnose<\\/p><p>and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot connectivity problems, and optimize<\\/p><p>device performance. Develop hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling iPads, utilizing specialized tools and<\\/p><p>techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, battery replacement, screen repair, and software troubleshooting<\\/p><p>specific to iPad models. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll gain the knowledge and confidence<\\/p><p>to offer professional iPad repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an iPad enthusiast, this course<\\/p><p>equips you with the skills to excel in iPad repair and provide high-quality service for these versatile devices. MovilOne<\\/p><p>Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 16:33:20', '2026-06-17 23:59:01', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnosing iPad hardware issues using specialized tools and techniques for accurate repairs<\\/li><li>Perform effective iPad screen replacements, battery swaps, and component repairs with precision and safety<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve common iPad software problems, including OS errors and app malfunctions<\\/li><li>Implement data recovery strategies to retrieve lost files and restore device functionality efficiently<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble various iPad models while maintaining device integrity and warranty compliance<\\/li><li>Identify and fix connectivity issues related to Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and cellular networks on iPads<\\/li><li>Optimize iPad performance through software updates, cache clearing, and system diagnostics<\\/li><li>Utilize professional repair tools and safety protocols to ensure high-quality service and customer satisfaction<\\/li><li>Apply troubleshooting skills to resolve iPad charging, power, and hardware connectivity problems<\\/li><li>Develop comprehensive repair workflows to streamline iPad servicing and enhance technical proficiency<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(568, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"WordPress Multisite\",\"hi\":\"WordPress Multisite\"}', 'wordpress-multisite', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/5c7b82d4-cf67-454f-8b2e-d257445a25d9.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/5c7b82d4-cf67-454f-8b2e-d257445a25d9.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"45\\\" data-end=\\\"444\\\">Learn how to build and manage multiple websites using a single WordPress installation with WordPress Multisite. This course covers the fundamentals of network setup, site management, themes, plugins, user roles, and performance optimization for multisite environments. Students will gain practical experience in creating scalable website networks for businesses, schools, blogs, and client projects.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p data-start=\\\"45\\\" data-end=\\\"444\\\">Learn how to build and manage multiple websites using a single WordPress installation with WordPress Multisite. This course covers the fundamentals of network setup, site management, themes, plugins, user roles, and performance optimization for multisite environments. Students will gain practical experience in creating scalable website networks for businesses, schools, blogs, and client projects.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 17:21:24', '2026-06-20 19:07:25', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"ybs381\\\" data-start=\\\"525\\\" data-end=\\\"592\\\">Understand the architecture and benefits of WordPress Multisite.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17iif5\\\" data-start=\\\"593\\\" data-end=\\\"648\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure a WordPress Multisite network.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1xsx2w9\\\" data-start=\\\"649\\\" data-end=\\\"712\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage multiple websites from a single dashboard.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qrdwtp\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\" data-end=\\\"768\\\">\\r\\nConfigure network settings, domains, and subdomains.\\r\