(570, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Introduction to C coding Language\",\"hi\":null}', 'introduction-to-c-coding-language', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/2171346d-e8f9-4ac1-a647-5d9d2cfb632b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/2171346d-e8f9-4ac1-a647-5d9d2cfb632b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces learners to the fundamentals of the C programming language, one of the most powerful and widely used programming languages in software development. Students will learn basic programming concepts such as variables, data types, operators, input\\/output operations, conditional statements, loops, functions, and arrays. Through practical coding examples and exercises, learners will build a strong foundation in programming logic and problem-solving skills essential for future software development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 17:31:19', '2026-06-15 09:49:25', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1sludqw\\\" data-start=\\\"658\\\" data-end=\\\"713\\\">Understand the basics of the C programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"45d2vx\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\" data-end=\\\"766\\\">\\r\\nWrite and execute simple C programs successfully.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1iq664l\\\" data-start=\\\"767\\\" data-end=\\\"823\\\">\\r\\nUse variables, constants, and data types effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ia2x4s\\\" data-start=\\\"824\\\" data-end=\\\"880\\\">\\r\\nApply operators and expressions in programming tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vdo2zv\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"939\\\">\\r\\nImplement decision-making using conditional statements.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sth30q\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nUse loops for repetitive programming operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r3a9z5\\\" data-start=\\\"992\\\" data-end=\\\"1044\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use functions for modular programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ipivst\\\" data-start=\\\"1045\\\" data-end=\\\"1082\\\">\\r\\nWork with arrays and strings in C.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8v0jyf\\\" data-start=\\\"1083\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">\\r\\nDevelop logical thinking and problem-solving skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dfja1h\\\" data-start=\\\"1139\\\" data-end=\\\"1205\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild beginner-level console applications using C programming.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 52, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(571, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"HTC Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'htc-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/f7a4573f-ec18-4e1d-8115-55cc6a25f2d4.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/f7a4573f-ec18-4e1d-8115-55cc6a25f2d4.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>HTC Repair Course: Elevate your repair skills with this comprehensive course focused on HTC smartphones. Learn to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network problems, and<\\/p><p>optimize device performance. Develop hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling HTC phones, utilizing<\\/p><p>specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software troubleshooting<\\/p><p>specific to HTC devices. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll gain the knowledge and skills to<\\/p><p>confidently offer professional HTC phone repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an HTC<\\/p><p>enthusiast, this course equips you with the expertise to excel in HTC phone repair and provide high-quality service for<\\/p><p>these advanced devices MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-28 22:18:56', '2026-06-17 17:08:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnosing hardware issues in HTC smartphones using specialized tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform precise component replacements, including screens, batteries, and internal parts on HTC devices<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve common software problems, firmware errors, and system crashes in HTC phones<\\/li><li>Implement effective data recovery strategies for damaged or corrupted HTC device data<\\/li><li>Conduct network troubleshooting to fix connectivity, signal, and network-related issues on HTC smartphones<\\/li><li>Optimize HTC device performance through software updates, cache clearing, and system tuning<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble HTC phones safely, maintaining device integrity and warranty compliance<\\/li><li>Utilize diagnostic software and tools to identify hardware failures and software malfunctions in HTC devices<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for troubleshooting and repairing HTC smartphones in real-world scenarios<\\/li><li>Provide professional repair services, ensuring high-quality, reliable, and efficient HTC phone repairs<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 25, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(572, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"ZTE Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'zte-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/587380a0-c7fe-4527-a7cb-20529798fc68.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/28-05-2026/587380a0-c7fe-4527-a7cb-20529798fc68.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>ZTE Repair Course: Deepen your knowledge of ZTE smartphone repairs with this comprehensive course. Learn to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, troubleshoot network connectivity, and<\\/p><p>optimize device performance. Gain hands-on expertise in disassembling and reassembling ZTE phones, utilizing<\\/p><p>specialized tools and techniques. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and software troubleshooting<\\/p><p>specific to ZTE devices. Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the skills to confidently offer<\\/p><p>professional ZTE phone repairs and solutions. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a ZTE enthusiast, this course<\\/p><p>equips you with the knowledge and skills to excel in ZTE phone repair and provide high-quality service for these devices. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 03:21:50', '2026-06-20 19:40:50', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Master diagnosing hardware issues in ZTE smartphones using specialized tools and techniques<\\/p><p>Perform effective component replacements and reassemblies on ZTE devices with precision and safety<\\/p><p>Troubleshoot and resolve common software problems, including firmware updates and software crashes in ZTE phones<\\/p><p>Implement network connectivity solutions and troubleshoot Wi-Fi, LTE, and signal issues in ZTE smartphones<\\/p><p>Apply data recovery methods to retrieve lost data from damaged or malfunctioning ZTE devices<\\/p><p>Utilize diagnostic software to identify and fix hardware and software faults in ZTE smartphones<\\/p><p>Optimize ZTE device performance through software tuning, cleaning, and system management techniques<\\/p><p>Follow safety protocols and best practices for disassembling and repairing ZTE smartphones<\\/p><p>Provide professional repair services by accurately diagnosing issues and executing effective solutions<\\/p><p>Develop troubleshooting skills for real-world ZTE repair scenarios to enhance technical proficiency<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 32, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(573, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Mastering Web Development\",\"hi\":null}', 'mastering-web-development', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/2a14ec05-0e65-4146-9084-326e364dcfef.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/2a14ec05-0e65-4146-9084-326e364dcfef.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Mastering Web Development” is a complete hands-on course designed to help learners build modern, responsive, and dynamic websites from scratch. This course covers front-end and back-end development concepts using the latest web technologies including HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, Bootstrap, React, Node.js, databases, and deployment techniques. Students will gain practical experience through real-world projects, responsive layouts, interactive UI design, API integration, and full-stack web application development.<\\/li><li>Whether you are a beginner or an aspiring professional developer, this course provides the skills required to create professional websites and web applications for businesses, startups, and personal projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 04:46:04', '2026-06-17 19:16:29', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1g20x7s\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">Understand the fundamentals of modern web development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e0tc74\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"964\\\">\\r\\nBuild responsive websites using HTML5 and CSS3.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dg1izf\\\" data-start=\\\"965\\\" data-end=\\\"1013\\\">\\r\\nCreate interactive web pages with JavaScript.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gfyqfo\\\" data-start=\\\"1014\\\" data-end=\\\"1064\\\">\\r\\nDesign mobile-friendly layouts using Bootstrap.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ernpao\\\" data-start=\\\"1065\\\" data-end=\\\"1122\\\">\\r\\nDevelop dynamic front-end applications using React JS.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17de5um\\\" data-start=\\\"1123\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nWork with APIs and handle asynchronous data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"wk5dt0\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1228\\\">\\r\\nBuild back-end applications using Node.js and Express.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"d78lsc\\\" data-start=\\\"1229\\\" data-end=\\\"1285\\\">\\r\\nConnect applications with databases for data storage.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"yl5u24\\\" data-start=\\\"1286\\\" data-end=\\\"1342\\\">\\r\\nImplement authentication and user management systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8703j7\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\" data-end=\\\"1400\\\">\\r\\nDeploy and manage full-stack web applications online.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4z5wsk\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\" data-end=\\\"1449\\\">\\r\\nOptimize website performance and SEO basics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"65ve9p\\\" data-start=\\\"1450\\\" data-end=\\\"1519\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nDevelop complete real-world web development projects confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 35, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(574, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"CS642 | Data Visualization\",\"hi\":null}', 'cs642-data-visualization', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/c085ccf8-46aa-4dd5-8bdb-97127fe48c9b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/c085ccf8-46aa-4dd5-8bdb-97127fe48c9b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>CS642 | Data Visualization is a practical and industry-focused course that introduces students to the concepts, tools, and techniques used to transform raw data into meaningful visual insights. The course covers data representation, chart design principles, dashboards, storytelling with data, and modern visualization tools such as Tableau, Power BI, Python Matplotlib, Seaborn, and interactive web-based visualization libraries.<\\/li><li>\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Students will learn how to analyze datasets, identify patterns, and communicate information effectively using compelling visual elements. Through hands-on projects and real-world case studies, learners will develop the ability to create professional dashboards and data-driven reports for business intelligence and analytics applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 04:49:57', '2026-06-17 11:36:29', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"ud7v2v\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"977\\\">Understand the fundamentals of data visualization and visual analytics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4pldv5\\\" data-start=\\\"978\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">\\r\\nInterpret and present complex datasets using effective visual techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1nj1fh5\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\" data-end=\\\"1122\\\">\\r\\nCreate charts, graphs, and dashboards using visualization tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vru9b4\\\" data-start=\\\"1123\\\" data-end=\\\"1192\\\">\\r\\nApply design principles for clear and impactful data presentation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1f0uwyd\\\" data-start=\\\"1193\\\" data-end=\\\"1266\\\">\\r\\nUse Python libraries such as Matplotlib and Seaborn for visualization.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8q6mhr\\\" data-start=\\\"1267\\\" data-end=\\\"1325\\\">\\r\\nBuild interactive dashboards using Tableau or Power BI.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"m3whmr\\\" data-start=\\\"1326\\\" data-end=\\\"1388\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze trends, patterns, and insights from large datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"176y57i\\\" data-start=\\\"1389\\\" data-end=\\\"1451\\\">\\r\\nImplement data storytelling techniques for decision-making.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17e6idp\\\" data-start=\\\"1452\\\" data-end=\\\"1524\\\">\\r\\nWork with real-world datasets for business and research applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1btdpir\\\" data-start=\\\"1525\\\" data-end=\\\"1579\\\">\\r\\nDevelop interactive and responsive visual reports.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"89pjhi\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\" data-end=\\\"1641\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate visualization effectiveness and user experience.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fnnrqe\\\" data-start=\\\"1642\\\" data-end=\\\"1706\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nCreate professional data visualization projects confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 46, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(575, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Open Source Database\",\"hi\":null}', 'open-source-database', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/6c7d5a43-933a-4125-b6ac-b296b7a92ab0.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/6c7d5a43-933a-4125-b6ac-b296b7a92ab0.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"28\\\" data-end=\\\"52\\\">Open Source Database<\\/strong> course introduces learners to the fundamentals of modern open-source database systems used in web applications, enterprise software, and cloud platforms. Students will explore relational and NoSQL databases, database design, SQL querying, data management, performance optimization, and security practices using popular technologies such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB. The course focuses on practical implementation, real-world database administration, and efficient data handling techniques for scalable applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 04:56:39', '2026-06-19 06:11:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1bmw5dk\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\" data-end=\\\"744\\\">Understand the fundamentals of open-source database technologies and architectures.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qpp6du\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">\\r\\nDesign and create relational databases using SQL commands and normalization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kgy1ve\\\" data-start=\\\"838\\\" data-end=\\\"904\\\">\\r\\nPerform CRUD operations and advanced SQL queries efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12c96bz\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\" data-end=\\\"989\\\">\\r\\nWork with popular open-source databases such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cgna3b\\\" data-start=\\\"990\\\" data-end=\\\"1056\\\">\\r\\nImplement database security, backup, and recovery strategies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pehcsj\\\" data-start=\\\"1057\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">\\r\\nOptimize database performance using indexing and query optimization methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hrrb6w\\\" data-start=\\\"1139\\\" data-end=\\\"1199\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate databases with web and software applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Manage and maintain scalable database systems for real-world projects<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 6, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(576, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"SQL Server Interview Questions\",\"hi\":null}', 'sql-server-interview-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/b87d4c5f-9dc7-4bad-9144-14160aba590a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/b87d4c5f-9dc7-4bad-9144-14160aba590a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"28\\\" data-end=\\\"62\\\">SQL Server Interview Questions<\\/strong> course is designed to help learners and job seekers prepare for technical interviews focused on Microsoft SQL Server and database management concepts. This course covers essential SQL Server topics including database design, SQL queries, joins, stored procedures, indexing, normalization, performance tuning, transactions, triggers, views, and real-world interview scenarios. Learners will gain practical knowledge and confidence to answer beginner to advanced SQL Server interview questions effectively.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 05:00:56', '2026-06-19 04:55:48', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand core SQL Server concepts and database architecture.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite efficient SQL queries using joins, subqueries, and aggregate functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nExplain normalization, indexing, and database optimization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWork with stored procedures, triggers, views, and transactions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nSolve real-world SQL Server interview coding and query challenges.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUnderstand backup, recovery, and security concepts in SQL Server.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDifferentiate between clustered and non-clustered indexes.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Prepare confidently for SQL Server technical interviews and database-related job roles.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 6, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(577, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Scientific with Python Programming\",\"hi\":null}', 'scientific-with-python-programming', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/d858efd6-7119-4a86-bae4-ecc843ba4abb.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/d858efd6-7119-4a86-bae4-ecc843ba4abb.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"28\\\" data-end=\\\"66\\\">Scientific with Python Programming<\\/strong> course introduces learners to scientific computing and data analysis using Python. This course focuses on applying Python programming to solve mathematical, engineering, and scientific problems efficiently. Students will explore numerical computing, data visualization, statistical analysis, and scientific libraries such as NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, and SciPy. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, learners will develop the skills needed for research, analytics, automation, and scientific application development.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 05:06:16', '2026-06-18 13:09:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"172r0bg\\\" data-start=\\\"678\\\" data-end=\\\"750\\\">Understand the fundamentals of scientific programming using Python.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1c4xigt\\\" data-start=\\\"751\\\" data-end=\\\"833\\\">\\r\\nPerform numerical computations using NumPy arrays and mathematical functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fjgjgl\\\" data-start=\\\"834\\\" data-end=\\\"884\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze and manipulate datasets using Pandas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"byl5b2\\\" data-start=\\\"885\\\" data-end=\\\"964\\\">\\r\\nCreate professional scientific graphs and visualizations using Matplotlib.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vuwn6f\\\" data-start=\\\"965\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">\\r\\nApply statistical and mathematical operations using SciPy libraries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qbu485\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1124\\\">\\r\\nDevelop Python programs to solve real-world scientific and engineering problems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"j38r1f\\\" data-start=\\\"1125\\\" data-end=\\\"1205\\\">\\r\\nWork with data analysis, automation, and simulation techniques effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build practical scientific computing projects using Python tools and libraries.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 7, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 95, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
