ploy scalable and reliable cloud-based applications on AWS.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Gain foundational knowledge required for AWS certification and cloud careers.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 5, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 84, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(583, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python language for Beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-language-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/19f972c4-0167-4437-9367-8316a0745290.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/19f972c4-0167-4437-9367-8316a0745290.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"28\\\" data-end=\\\"61\\\">Python Language for Beginners<\\/strong> course is designed to introduce learners to the fundamentals of Python programming in a simple and practical way. This course covers basic programming concepts such as variables, data types, operators, conditional statements, loops, functions, lists, dictionaries, and file handling. Through hands-on exercises and beginner-friendly projects, learners will develop problem-solving skills and gain confidence in writing Python programs for automation, web development, data analysis, and software applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 05:41:06', '2026-06-14 13:23:49', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"jfhp63\\\" data-start=\\\"653\\\" data-end=\\\"717\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Python programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gubvah\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\" data-end=\\\"788\\\">\\r\\nWrite Python programs using variables, operators, and data types.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1r8hotp\\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"849\\\">\\r\\nImplement conditional statements and loops effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hdutfl\\\" data-start=\\\"850\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\">\\r\\nCreate reusable functions and modular Python code.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lg5gbp\\\" data-start=\\\"906\\\" data-end=\\\"977\\\">\\r\\nWork with lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets for data handling.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1v057xz\\\" data-start=\\\"978\\\" data-end=\\\"1042\\\">\\r\\nPerform file operations and basic error handling in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xcl7vj\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\nDevelop logical thinking and problem-solving skills through coding exercises.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build beginner-level Python projects and applications confidently.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 5, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(584, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"How Java Works\",\"hi\":null}', 'how-java-works', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/8635bb56-8a81-4736-a9b2-b905baec18c7.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/8635bb56-8a81-4736-a9b2-b905baec18c7.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The <strong data-start=\\\"28\\\" data-end=\\\"46\\\">How Java Works<\\/strong> course provides a comprehensive introduction to the internal working process of the Java programming language and the Java Virtual Machine (JVM). Learners will understand how Java code is compiled, executed, and managed across different platforms. The course covers Java architecture, bytecode, JVM, JRE, JDK, memory management, garbage collection, class loading, and execution flow. Through practical examples and visual explanations, students will gain a strong foundation in how Java applications run efficiently and securely.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 05:47:37', '2026-06-14 12:18:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"if6sj\\\" data-start=\\\"658\\\" data-end=\\\"737\\\">Understand the architecture and workflow of the Java programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"165rhp2\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"812\\\">\\r\\nExplain the roles of JVM, JRE, and JDK in Java application execution.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ia8cbe\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"876\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand how Java source code is compiled into bytecode.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ejfl1l\\\" data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"948\\\">\\r\\nDescribe the process of class loading and bytecode interpretation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2nk15t\\\" data-start=\\\"949\\\" data-end=\\\"1017\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze Java memory management and garbage collection concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3rtgvk\\\" data-start=\\\"1018\\\" data-end=\\\"1102\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand platform independence and Java’s “Write Once, Run Anywhere” feature.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pk4gfr\\\" data-start=\\\"1103\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\">\\r\\nWork with Java execution flow and runtime environment effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build a strong foundation for advanced Java development and performance optimization.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 6, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(585, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java programming language for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'java-programming-language-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/Logo.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/Logo.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the fundamentals of Java programming with this comprehensive online course designed for beginners. Whether\\r\\nyou are looking to enhance your professional skills, start a career in software development, or simply expand your\\r\\nknowledge in programming, this training course offers a solid foundation to succeed. Through engaging lessons and\\r\\npractical exercises, you\'ll gain the essential skills needed to develop Java applications and understand core programming\\r\\nconcepts. What you will learn: - The basic syntax and structure of Java programming language - How to write, compile,\\r\\nand run Java programs - Object-oriented programming principles and how to apply them - Exception handling, data\\r\\ntypes, and control structures - Building simple Java applications and understanding their practical use - Best practices for\\r\\nefficient and maintainable code This course is ideal for beginners with little to no prior experience in programming. It is\\r\\nperfect for students, aspiring developers, IT professionals, or anyone interested in entering the world of software\\r\\ndevelopment. No prior coding knowledge is required to start this professional training course. Why choose this course on\\r\\nour platform: - Expert-led instruction from experienced Java developers - Flexible online learning to fit your schedule -\\r\\nHands-on projects that reinforce practical skills - Access to a supportive learning community - A certified course that\\r\\nenhances your professional profile - Proven track record of helping learners achieve career growth in tech fields Upon\\r\\ncompletion, you will receive a recognized certificate that validates your Java programming skills. This certification can\\r\\nsignificantly improve your employability, open doors to new career opportunities, and demonstrate your commitment to\\r\\nprofessional development in the competitive job market of the Middle East and beyond. Enroll today to advance your\\r\\nprogramming journey with a trusted online training course and take a step closer to a successful career in software\\r\\ndevelopment. G C Reddy Software Testing<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 13:54:37', '2026-06-19 23:52:34', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-pm-slice=\\\"1 1 []\\\">Write, compile, and run Java programs using proper syntax and structure to develop functional applications.\\r\\n<\\/p><p>Apply object-oriented programming principles such as inheritance, encapsulation, and polymorphism in Java projects.\\r\\n<\\/p><p>Implement exception handling, data types, and control structures to create robust and error-resistant Java applications.\\r\\n<\\/p><p>Develop simple Java applications demonstrating practical use, efficiency, and maintainability for real-world scenarios.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(586, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Phrasal verbs for Job interviews\",\"hi\":null}', 'phrasal-verbs-for-job-interviews', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_02_42 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_02_42 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Phrasal verbs for Job interviews course, in this course is tailored to help you master phrasal verbs commonly used in job\\r\\ninterviews, giving you the tools to sound professional and confident. Youâ€™ll learn essential phrases like \\\"follow up,\\\"\\r\\n\\\"point out,\\\" and \\\"bring up,\\\" and how to use them effectively in responses. Through interactive lessons, role-playing\\r\\nscenarios, and practical exercises, youâ€™ll gain the skills to understand and use phrasal verbs naturally, making your\\r\\ncommunication more engaging and impactful. Whether you\'re preparing for your first interview or looking to refine your\\r\\nEnglish, this course ensures you stand out with polished language skills. Build confidence and impress potential\\r\\nemployers with your ability to use professional English seamlessly!&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 17:05:33', '2026-06-14 22:03:19', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Enhance interview responses by accurately using common phrasal verbs like \\\"follow up\\\" and \\\"bring up\\\"\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve professional communication skills with practical application of interview-specific phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop confidence in incorporating phrasal verbs naturally during job interview conversations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Master the use of key interview phrases such as \\\"point out\\\" and \\\"bring up\\\" for impactful answers\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply role-playing scenarios to practice and refine phrasal verb usage in real interview settings\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify appropriate contexts for using phrasal verbs to demonstrate professionalism and clarity\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build fluency in using phrasal verbs to articulate achievements and experiences effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Boost interview performance by integrating relevant phrasal verbs seamlessly into responses\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Understand the nuances of phrasal verbs to avoid miscommunication during interviews\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize interactive exercises to reinforce the correct usage of interview-related phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Gain strategies to sound confident and polished when discussing skills and qualifications\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Learn to tailor phrasal verb usage to different interview questions and situations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve overall English communication skills with a focus on professional interview language\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Prepare for diverse interview scenarios by practicing a wide range of phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Increase chances of interview success through polished, professional language skills\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop the ability to respond confidently to behavioral and situational interview questions<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 8, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(587, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"PMP exam\",\"hi\":null}', 'pmp-exam', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_07_57 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_07_57 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>PMP exam , in this course is designed to fully prepare professionals for the Project Management Professional (PMP)\\r\\ncertification by PMI. It covers all domains of the PMBOK Guide, including project initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, and closure. Learners will master key concepts such as scope, schedule, cost, quality, communication, and\\r\\nrisk management. The course provides practical examples, real project scenarios, and interactive exercises that help\\r\\nreinforce understanding and application of project management principles. It also includes strategies for answering\\r\\nsituational exam questions and managing exam time efficiently. By the end, participants gain the confidence, knowledge,\\r\\nand practical skills required to pass the PMP exam and lead successful projects across industries with a globally\\r\\nrecognized certification<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 17:08:50', '2026-06-18 02:00:43', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master project initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, and closure using PMI and PMBOK Guide principles\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply scope, schedule, cost, and quality management techniques to real-world projects effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop risk management strategies and communication plans to ensure project success and stakeholder engagement\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Prepare for PMP exam with practical strategies, situational question analysis, and time management skills<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(588, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"PMP drag and drop questions\",\"hi\":null}', 'pmp-drag-and-drop-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_11_55 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_11_55 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>PMP drag and drop questions, in this course focuses on mastering one of the most interactive and practical formats in\\r\\nthe PMP exam. It helps learners understand how to analyze project scenarios, identify correct process sequences, and\\r\\nmatch project management concepts according to PMIâ€™s PMBOK standards. Through visual exercises, learners\\r\\npractice organizing project phases, aligning tools and techniques with their corresponding processes, and connecting key\\r\\noutputs to the right domains. The course includes realistic drag-and-drop simulations that mirror actual exam conditions,\\r\\nhelping participants build confidence and accuracy. It emphasizes critical thinking rather than memorization, ensuring a\\r\\ndeep understanding of how project components interrelate. By the end, students will be able to approach complex PMP\\r\\ndrag-and-drop questions efficiently and enhance their overall exam readiness.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 17:14:22', '2026-06-17 16:40:07', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Identify correct project process sequences using drag-and-drop techniques for PMP exam success\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze project scenarios to match tools, techniques, and outputs with PMI PMBOK standards effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Organize project phases and activities accurately to improve project management skills and exam performance\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply critical thinking to solve complex PMP drag-and-drop questions, enhancing overall exam readiness<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL,