(589, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Coordination in management\",\"hi\":null}', 'coordination-in-management', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_20_58 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 01_20_58 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Coordination in management course, in this course delves into the fundamentals of coordination in management,\\r\\nfocusing on how to align efforts, resources, and goals across teams and departments to achieve organizational success.\\r\\nParticipants will explore key techniques, tools, and strategies to streamline workflows, enhance communication, and\\r\\nfoster collaboration. The course covers practical approaches to managing interdepartmental coordination, resolving\\r\\nconflicts, and ensuring smooth operations in dynamic environments. Whether you\'re leading a small team or overseeing\\r\\nlarge projects, this course equips you with the skills to harmonize activities, boost efficiency, and drive productivity. Join\\r\\nus to master the art of effective coordination and create synergy within your organization.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-29 17:22:31', '2026-06-17 22:04:48', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop effective strategies for interdepartmental coordination to improve organizational efficiency and teamwork\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply communication tools and techniques to enhance collaboration and information sharing across teams\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement workflow management practices to streamline processes and reduce operational bottlenecks\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and resolve conflicts within teams and departments to foster a collaborative work environment\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize project management tools to coordinate tasks, resources, and deadlines effectively\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Assess organizational structures to optimize resource allocation and co