(594, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"SIM Card Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'sim-card-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ebc3700d-8db7-4e01-b14c-0c2c8c4a3d8b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ebc3700d-8db7-4e01-b14c-0c2c8c4a3d8b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>SIM Card Repair Course: Explore the intricacies of SIM card troubleshooting and repair with this comprehensive course.<\\/p><p>Learn to diagnose and fix common issues like connectivity problems, SIM card recognition errors, and network signal<\\/p><p>fluctuations. Gain hands-on skills in cleaning and reseating SIM cards, identifying hardware faults, and utilizing SIM card<\\/p><p>tools. Dive into the world of SIM card readers, data recovery, and activation processes. Through practical exercises and<\\/p><p>real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the expertise to confidently repair and resolve SIM card problems. Whether you\'re an<\\/p><p>aspiring technician or a mobile enthusiast, this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to offer professional SIM<\\/p><p>card repairs and solutions. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 01:47:23', '2026-06-19 18:06:39', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnose and troubleshoot SIM card connectivity issues and recognition errors using advanced tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform cleaning, reseating, and hardware inspection to resolve SIM card signal fluctuations and physical faults effectively<\\/li><li>Utilize SIM card readers and data recovery tools to retrieve lost information and repair damaged SIM cards accurately<\\/li><li>Identify and repair common hardware faults in SIM cards, including contact issues and internal component failures<\\/li><li>Apply proper activation and deactivation procedures to ensure seamless network connectivity and user authentication<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for SIM card troubleshooting in 