(596, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Business english communication for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'business-english-communication-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 11_06_32 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/29-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 29, 2026, 11_06_32 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Business english communication course, in this course is designed to develop your proficiency in Business English\\r\\ncommunication, focusing on the skills you need for success in professional settings. Learn how to craft clear and effective\\r\\nemails, engage in productive meetings, and deliver impactful presentations. Improve your vocabulary, grammar, and\\r\\nfluency to confidently navigate workplace conversations. The course also covers essential skills such as active listening,\\r\\nnegotiation strategies, and adapting to cross-cultural communication challenges. By the end, you\'ll be equipped to\\r\\ncommunicate with clarity and professionalism, making you an asset in any business environment. Perfect for anyone\\r\\nlooking to boost their career prospects.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 03:09:17', '2026-06-20 09:48:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Enhance business English vocabulary for professional communication and workplace interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop effective email writing skills for clear, concise, and professional correspondence\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Master meeting participation techniques to contribute confidently and facilitate productive discussions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Deliver impactful presentations with clarity, confidence, and persuasive language skills\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve grammar and fluency for seamless, error-free business communication\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply active listening strategies to understand and respond appropriately in workplace conversations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement negotiation tac