\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1058\\\">✅ Understand Trees, Graphs, and Hash Tables and their applications.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1060\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">✅ Perform basic operations such as insertion, deletion, searching, and traversal.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1143\\\" data-end=\\\"1213\\\">✅ Analyze the advantages and limitations of different data structures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1215\\\" data-end=\\\"1286\\\">✅ Choose appropriate data structures for specific programming problems.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1288\\\" data-end=\\\"1365\\\">✅ Build a strong foundation for advanced algorithms and software development.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1367\\\" data-end=\\\"1425\\\">✅ Improve coding efficiency and problem-solving abilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1427\\\" data-end=\\\"1494\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">✅ Apply data structure concepts in real-world programming projects.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 53, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(601, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Chart types in excel for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Chart types in excel for beginners\"}', 'chart-types-in-excel-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/fe150782-d9b3-4671-9ae0-dadada809c9f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/fe150782-d9b3-4671-9ae0-dadada809c9f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"59\\\" data-end=\\\"519\\\">Learn how to create and use the most important chart types in Microsoft Excel to transform raw data into meaningful visual insights. This beginner-friendly course introduces column charts, bar charts, line charts, pie charts, area charts, scatter plots, and combo charts. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will understand when to use each chart type and how to customize charts for professional reports, presentations, and dashboards.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"521\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\">Whether you are a student, office professional, business analyst, or entrepreneur, this course will help you present data clearly and make better data-driven decisions.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 15:54:35', '2026-06-17 06:44:33', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"716\\\" data-end=\\\"768\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"770\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dsfh7d\\\" data-start=\\\"770\\\" data-end=\\\"839\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the purpose and benefits of data visualization in Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dgm7a6\\\" data-start=\\\"840\\\" data-end=\\\"898\\\">\\r\\nCreate Column, Bar, Line, Pie, Area, and Scatter charts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"e1ibv2\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\" data-end=\\\"958\\\">\\r\\nChoose the appropriate chart type for different datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7r14i9\\\" data-start=\\\"959\\\" data-end=\\\"1019\\\">\\r\\nCustomize chart titles, axes, legends, labels, and colors.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"lkwp21\\\" data-start=\\\"1020\\\" data-end=\\\"1075\\\">\\r\\nFormat charts to create professional-looking reports.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14wp90t\\\" data-start=\\\"1076\\\" data-end=\\\"1136\\\">\\r\\nCompare data trends, patterns, and relationships visually.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7oap02\\\" data-start=\\\"1137\\\" data-end=\\\"1190\\\">\\r\\nCreate Combo Charts for advanced data presentation.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"186stj4\\\" data-start=\\\"1191\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\nAvoid common charting mistakes and improve chart readability.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16busew\\\" data-start=\\\"1255\\\" data-end=\\\"1308\\\">\\r\\nBuild simple dashboards using multiple chart types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1l5plxf\\\" data-start=\\\"1309\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\nPresent business and academic data effectively using Excel charts.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 67, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(602, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Computer networks types for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Computer networks types for beginners\"}', 'computer-networks-types-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b309e5e6-ff2d-41a0-815d-35e4cf744e03.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b309e5e6-ff2d-41a0-815d-35e4cf744e03.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"61\\\" data-end=\\\"606\\\">This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamental types of computer networks and explains how devices communicate and share data. You will learn about Personal Area Networks (PAN), Local Area Networks (LAN), Campus Area Networks (CAN), Metropolitan Area Networks (MAN), Wide Area Networks (WAN), and Global Area Networks (GAN). Through simple explanations, real-world examples, and practical illustrations, you\'ll gain a solid understanding of networking concepts that form the foundation of modern communication systems and the internet.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 15:55:23', '2026-06-18 01:00:00', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div data-voice-floating-orb-focus-background=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-col text-sm\\\"><div class=\\\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\" data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-WEB:f96ee3f1-7e43-44d5-90c0-2ca60889bbb4-1\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><section class=\\\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-tur