(603, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Data Types and Variables\",\"hi\":\"Python Data Types and Variables\"}', 'python-data-types-and-variables', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/32448ee0-6350-4c3d-a60c-c618789a6fb3.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/32448ee0-6350-4c3d-a60c-c618789a6fb3.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"56\\\" data-end=\\\"523\\\">This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamental building blocks of Python programming: data types and variables. Students will learn how to store, manage, and manipulate data using Python variables and understand the different data types such as integers, floats, strings, booleans, lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will develop the skills needed to write clear and efficient Python programs.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 15:56:29', '2026-06-20 07:04:19', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"552\\\" data-end=\\\"604\\\">By the end of this course, students will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"606\\\" data-end=\\\"1266\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2was6f\\\" data-start=\\\"606\\\" data-end=\\\"670\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the purpose and importance of variables in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"bs9h4h\\\" data-start=\\\"671\\\" data-end=\\\"744\\\">\\r\\nCreate and assign values to variables using proper naming conventions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1stj9xp\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\" data-end=\\\"794\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use Python\'s built-in data types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"lg1qc3\\\" data-start=\\\"795\\\" data-end=\\\"853\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between mutable and immutable data types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1c8v8wc\\\" data-start=\\\"854\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">\\r\\nPerform operations on numeric, string, and boolean data types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"pm22ns\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nWork with collections such as lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"94v8u2\\\" data-start=\\\"992\\\" data-end=\\\"1056\\\">\\r\\nConvert data between different data types using type casting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6680pu\\\" data-start=\\\"1057\\\" data-end=\\\"1131\\\">\\r\\nUse variables and data types effectively in real-world Python programs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4c9q3w\\\" data-start=\\\"1132\\\" data-end=\\\"1196\\\">\\r\\nDebug common errors related to variables and data type usage.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1j43k6p\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\" data-end=\\\"1266\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Python programming topics.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 44, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(604, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Data Types in Java for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Data Types in Java for beginners\"}', 'data-types-in-java-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/fb417801-7a9f-467e-804a-9f9956fc5a17.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/fb417801-7a9f-467e-804a-9f9956fc5a17.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"57\\\" data-end=\\\"588\\\">This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamental concept of data types in Java programming. Students will learn how Java stores and manages different kinds of data, including numbers, characters, and logical values. The course covers primitive and non-primitive data types, variable declarations, memory usage, and practical coding examples. Through hands-on exercises, learners will gain the confidence to choose the correct data type for different programming scenarios and build a strong foundation for Java development.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 16:00:20', '2026-06-19 20:44:12', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"617\\\" data-end=\\\"669\\\">By the end of this course, students will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"671\\\" data-end=\\\"1329\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"iu7h8f\\\" data-start=\\\"671\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the role of data types in Java programming.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11my9ia\\\" data-start=\\\"728\\\" data-end=\\\"791\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between primitive and non-primitive data types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1jcvlm4\\\" data-start=\\\"792\\\" data-end=\\\"903\\\">\\r\\nUse all eight primitive data types: <code data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">byte<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"838\\\" data-end=\\\"845\\\">short<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"847\\\" data-end=\\\"852\\\">int<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"854\\\" data-end=\\\"860\\\">long<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"869\\\">float<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"879\\\">double<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">char<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"893\\\" data-end=\\\"902\\\">boolean<\\/code>.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"k4x1s3\\\" data-start=\\\"904\\\" data-end=\\\"949\\\">\\r\\nDeclare and initialize variables correctly.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4oyev8\\\" data-start=\\\"950\\\" data-end=\\\"1028\\\">\\r\\nSelect appropriate data types based on storage and performance requirements.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"nqnjj\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1095\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic operations using numeric and character data types.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pkdwxr\\\" data-start=\\\"1096\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand type conversion and casting concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5nsmg6\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1207\\\">\\r\\nWork with non-primitive types such as <code data-start=\\\"1187\\\" data-end=\\\"1195\\\">String<\\/code> and arrays.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1nt4qdj\\\" data-start=\\\"1208\\\" data-end=\\\"1260\\\">\\r\\nIdentify common data type errors and resolve them.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1mu2p1a\\\" data-start=\\\"1261\\\" data-end=\\\"1329\\\">\\r\\nBuild simple Java programs using different data types confidently<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 38, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(605, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Testing in selenium with Java from scratch\",\"hi\":\"Testing in selenium with Java from scratch\"}', 'testing-in-selenium-with-java-from-scratch', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 30, 2026, 02_25_14 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/30-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 30, 2026, 02_25_14 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Enhance your programming skills and accelerate your career growth with our comprehensive online training course,\\r\\nTesting in Selenium with Java from Scratch. Designed for aspiring QA professionals and developers in the Middle East\\r\\nand beyond, this course offers a practical and in-depth approach to mastering automated testing using Selenium\\r\\nWebDriver and Java. Whether you\'re starting your journey in software testing or seeking to upgrade your professional\\r\\nskills, this certified course provides the essential knowledge to succeed in the competitive tech industry. Throughout this\\r\\nonline course, you will learn to develop and execute automated test scripts efficiently. The program covers fundamental\\r\\nconcepts and advanced techniques, ensuring you gain a thorough understanding of Selenium testing frameworks. By the\\r\\nend of the training, you\'ll be equipped to implement automated testing solutions that improve testing accuracy and\\r\\nefficiency. What you will learn: - Fundamentals of programming with Java for automation testing - Setting up Selenium\\r\\nWebDriver for browser automation - Writing effective test scripts from scratch - Implementing test automation\\r\\nframeworks - Managing test data and generating reports - Best practices for debugging and maintaining test scripts -\\r\\nIntegrating Selenium with other tools like TestNG and Jenkins for continuous integration This course is ideal for\\r\\nbeginners in testing and programming, QA professionals, software developers, and IT students in the Middle East who\\r\\nwant to gain practical skills in automation testing. No prior experience in Selenium or Java is required, making it\\r\\naccessible for all learners committed to advancing their careers. Why choose this course on our platform: - Industryrelevant content designed by experienced professionals - Flexible online learning with lifetime access to course materials\\r\\n- Interactive sessions and practical exercises to reinforce learning - Certified course recognized by industry employers -\\r\\nSupportive community and expert guidance throughout your training Career opportunities after completing this course\\r\\ninclude roles such as Automated QA Engineer, Software Tester, Test Automation Developer, and Quality Assurance\\r\\nAnalyst. Mastering Selenium with Java opens pathways to higher salaries and increased responsibility within the\\r\\nsoftware testing domain. Upon successful completion, you will receive a professional certificate that validates your\\r\\nexpertise in Selenium testing with Java. This certification enhances your profile, making you a competitive candidate in\\r\\nthe Middle East tech market and beyond. Enroll now to unlock your potential and take a significant step towards a\\r\\nrewarding career in software testing and automation. SDET QA <\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Enhance your programming skills and accelerate your career growth with our comprehensive online training course,\\r\\nTesting in Selenium with Java from Scratch. Designed for aspiring QA professionals and developers in the Middle East\\r\\nand beyond, this course offers a practical and in-depth approach to mastering automated testing using Selenium\\r\\nWebDriver and Java. Whether you\'re starting your journey in software testing or seeking to upgrade your professional\\r\\nskills, this certified course provides the essential knowledge to succeed in the competitive tech industry. Throughout this\\r\\nonline course, you will learn to develop and execute automated test scripts efficiently. The program covers fundamental\\r\\nconcepts and advanced techniques, ensuring you gain a thorough understanding of Selenium testing frameworks. By the\\r\\nend of the training, you\'ll be equipped to implement automated testing solutions that improve testing accuracy and\\r\\nefficiency. What you will learn: - Fundamentals of programming with Java for automation testing - Setting up Selenium\\r\\nWebDriver for browser automation - Writing effective test scripts from scratch - Implementing test automation\\r\\nframeworks - Managing test data and generating reports - Best practices for debugging and maintaining test scripts -\\r\\nIntegrating Selenium with other tools like TestNG and Jenkins for continuous integration This course is ideal for\\r\\nbeginners in testing and programming, QA professionals, software developers, and IT students in the Middle East who\\r\\nwant to gain practical skills in automation testing. No prior experience in Selenium or Java is required, making it\\r\\naccessible for all learners committed to advancing their careers. Why choose this course on our platform: - Industryrelevant content designed by experienced professionals - Flexible online learning with lifetime access to course materials\\r\\n- Interactive sessions and practical exercises to reinforce learning - Certified course recognized by industry employers -\\r\\nSupportive community and expert guidance throughout your training Career opportunities after completing this course\\r\\ninclude roles such as Automated QA Engineer, Software Tester, Test Automation Developer, and Quality Assurance\\r\\nAnalyst. Mastering Selenium with Java opens pathways to higher salaries and increased responsibility within the\\r\\nsoftware testing domain. Upon successful completion, you will receive a professional certificate that validates your\\r\\nexpertise in Selenium testing with Java. This certification enhances your profile, making you a competitive candidate in\\r\\nthe Middle East tech market and beyond. Enroll now to unlock your potential and take a significant step towards a\\r\\nrewarding career in software testing and automation. SDET QA <\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-05-30 18:23:53', '2026-06-20 03:22:39', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Develop automated test scripts using Java and Selenium WebDriver for browser testing and validation.<\\/p><p>Implement test automation frameworks to improve testing efficiency and maintainability.<\\/p><p>Integrate Selenium with TestNG and Jenkins for continuous integration and automated testing workflows.<\\/p><p>Apply best practices for debugging, managing test data, and generating comprehensive test reports.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Develop automated test scripts using Java and Selenium WebDriver for browser testing and validation.<\\/p><p>Implement test automation frameworks to improve testing efficiency and maintainability.<\\/p><p>Integrate Selenium with TestNG and Jenkins for continuous integration and automated testing workflows.<\\/p><p>Apply best practices for debugging, managing test data, and generating comprehensive test reports.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
