(606, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Phrasal verbs in business english\",\"hi\":\"Phrasal verbs in business english\"}', 'phrasal-verbs-in-business-english', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 31, 2026, 10_51_06 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 31, 2026, 10_51_06 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Phrasal verbs in business course, in this course explores commonly used phrasal verbs like \\\"set up,\\\" \\\"follow up,\\\" \\\"take\\r\\nover,\\\" and more, empowering you to handle meetings, emails, negotiations, and professional conversations with\\r\\nconfidence. Through practical examples, exercises, and real-world scenarios, you\'ll learn how to seamlessly integrate\\r\\nthese phrases into your vocabulary. Whether you\'re writing business reports, presenting ideas, or collaborating with\\r\\nteams, this course equips you with the tools to sound fluent and professional. Ideal for professionals, students, or anyone\\r\\nlooking to excel in workplace communication. <br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Phrasal verbs in business course, in this course explores commonly used phrasal verbs like \\\"set up,\\\" \\\"follow up,\\\" \\\"take\\r\\nover,\\\" and more, empowering you to handle meetings, emails, negotiations, and professional conversations with\\r\\nconfidence. Through practical examples, exercises, and real-world scenarios, you\'ll learn how to seamlessly integrate\\r\\nthese phrases into your vocabulary. Whether you\'re writing business reports, presenting ideas, or collaborating with\\r\\nteams, this course equips you with the tools to sound fluent and professional. Ideal for professionals, students, or anyone\\r\\nlooking to excel in workplace communication. <br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 02:49:20', '2026-06-20 15:16:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Master business communication by accurately using key phrasal verbs like \\\"set up,\\\" \\\"follow up,\\\" and \\\"take over\\\" in professional contexts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Enhance email writing skills with appropriate phrasal verbs for clarity, professionalism, and effective message delivery\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply phrasal verbs confidently during meetings, negotiations, and presentations to improve workplace interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Integrate common business phrasal verbs into reports, proposals, and documentation for a polished professional tone\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop negotiation skills by using relevant phrasal verbs to influence and persuade colleagues and clients\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve collaboration and teamwork through the correct use of phrasal verbs in workplace conversations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and correct common errors in using business-related phrasal verbs for clearer communication\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build fluency in business English by practicing real-world scenarios involving essential phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Increase confidence in professional conversations by mastering the contextual use of business phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize learned phrasal verbs to sound more natural, fluent, and professional in diverse workplace situations<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":\"<ol><li>Master business communication by accurately using key phrasal verbs like \\\"set up,\\\" \\\"follow up,\\\" and \\\"take over\\\" in professional contexts\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Enhance email writing skills with appropriate phrasal verbs for clarity, professionalism, and effective message delivery\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply phrasal verbs confidently during meetings, negotiations, and presentations to improve workplace interactions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Integrate common business phrasal verbs into reports, proposals, and documentation for a polished professional tone\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop negotiation skills by using relevant phrasal verbs to influence and persuade colleagues and clients\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Improve collaboration and teamwork through the correct use of phrasal verbs in workplace conversations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and correct common errors in using business-related phrasal verbs for clearer communication\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build fluency in business English by practicing real-world scenarios involving essential phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Increase confidence in professional conversations by mastering the contextual use of business phrasal verbs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize learned phrasal verbs to sound more natural, fluent, and professional in diverse workplace situations<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(607, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Business english writing for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'business-english-writing-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 31, 2026, 10_52_52 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/31-05-2026/ChatGPT Image May 31, 2026, 10_52_52 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Business english writing course, in this course is designed to improve your ability to write clear, concise, and effective\\r\\nbusiness documents, including emails, reports, proposals, and memos. Learn the essentials of professional tone, proper\\r\\nformatting, and persuasive language to create impactful content. Master techniques for organizing ideas, avoiding\\r\\ncommon grammatical errors, and tailoring your writing to different audiences and purposes. Through practical exercises\\r\\nand real-world scenarios, youâ€™ll develop the confidence to craft polished and professional business writing. Whether\\r\\nyou\'re a beginner or seeking to refine your skills, this course is ideal for elevating your career communication!<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 02:56:13', '2026-06-20 03:56:23', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Write clear, concise business emails using professional tone and proper formatting for effective communication\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create persuasive business proposals and reports tailored to different audiences and purposes\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply organizational techniques to structure business documents for clarity and impact\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify and correct common grammatical errors in business writing to enhance professionalism\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize appropriate vocabulary and language to convey professionalism and credibility in business documents\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop confidence in crafting polished memos, emails, and business correspondence for career advancement<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(608, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Computer networks features for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Computer networks features for beginners\"}', 'computer-networks-features-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/26601ba1-ae01-4af9-93e8-c73196f6b041.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/26601ba1-ae01-4af9-93e8-c73196f6b041.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"10irhbc\\\" data-start=\\\"501\\\" data-end=\\\"521\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"64\\\" data-end=\\\"499\\\">This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamental features of computer networks and how devices communicate with each other. Students will learn about network types, network components, communication protocols, data transmission methods, network security basics, and real-world networking applications. The course uses simple explanations and practical examples to help learners build a strong foundation in networking concepts.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 15:01:51', '2026-06-20 16:57:22', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"523\\\" data-end=\\\"575\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"577\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bri93t\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\" data-end=\\\"638\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the purpose and importance of computer networks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1n9gfkz\\\" data-start=\\\"639\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of networks (LAN, MAN, WAN, PAN).\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1wbb4mt\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nRecognize key networking devices such as routers, switches, hubs, and modems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gw847q\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"830\\\">\\r\\nExplain how data is transmitted across networks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"78xi4\\\" data-start=\\\"831\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand basic networking protocols such as TCP\\/IP, HTTP, and FTP.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12dx2tv\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\" data-end=\\\"953\\\">\\r\\nDescribe wired and wireless network technologies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ixlpjl\\\" data-start=\\\"954\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand IP addresses and basic network addressing concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16erfyn\\\" data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1109\\\">\\r\\nIdentify common network features such as resource sharing, scalability, and reliability.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1goyp9x\\\" data-start=\\\"1110\\\" data-end=\\\"1183\\\">\\r\\nApply basic troubleshooting techniques for network connectivity issues.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10bo4t9\\\" data-start=\\\"1184\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand fundamental network security concepts and best practices<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(609, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Computer Networks Basic\",\"hi\":\"Computer Networks Basic\"}', 'computer-networks-basic', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/472845a0-e837-43da-a137-d406fe4690ed.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/472845a0-e837-43da-a137-d406fe4690ed.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\" data-end=\\\"639\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"84\\\" data-end=\\\"616\\\">This course introduces the fundamental concepts of computer networking. Students will learn how computers communicate, how data travels across networks, and the essential networking devices used in homes, businesses, and the internet. The course covers network types, topologies, protocols, IP addressing, network hardware, and basic troubleshooting techniques. It is designed for beginners with no prior networking experience and provides a strong foundation for further studies in networking, cybersecurity, and IT infrastructure.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\" data-end=\\\"639\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"84\\\" data-end=\\\"616\\\">This course introduces the fundamental concepts of computer networking. Students will learn how computers communicate, how data travels across networks, and the essential networking devices used in homes, businesses, and the internet. The course covers network types, topologies, protocols, IP addressing, network hardware, and basic troubleshooting techniques. It is designed for beginners with no prior networking experience and provides a strong foundation for further studies in networking, cybersecurity, and IT infrastructure.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 15:02:53', '2026-06-17 22:02:47', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"640\\\" data-end=\\\"692\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-s