data-start=\\\"694\\\" data-end=\\\"756\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the purpose and importance of computer networks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"igjscn\\\" data-start=\\\"757\\\" data-end=\\\"828\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of networks such as LAN, MAN, WAN, and PAN.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"tiplkc\\\" data-start=\\\"829\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">\\r\\nExplain common network topologies and their advantages.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"105d0kk\\\" data-start=\\\"888\\\" data-end=\\\"981\\\">\\r\\nRecognize networking devices including routers, switches, hubs, modems, and access points.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jqyihh\\\" data-start=\\\"982\\\" data-end=\\\"1048\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the basics of IP addressing and subnetting concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qb2w84\\\" data-start=\\\"1049\\\" data-end=\\\"1148\\\">\\r\\nDescribe the functions of common networking protocols such as TCP\\/IP, HTTP, HTTPS, FTP, and DNS.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pvligy\\\" data-start=\\\"1149\\\" data-end=\\\"1200\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the OSI and TCP\\/IP networking models.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2j5o01\\\" data-start=\\\"1201\\\" data-end=\\\"1262\\\">\\r\\nConfigure basic network settings on computers and devices.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"av4z1n\\\" data-start=\\\"1263\\\" data-end=\\\"1333\\\">\\r\\nIdentify common network problems and perform basic troubleshooting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1t5cbhh\\\" data-start=\\\"1334\\\" data-end=\\\"1413\\\">\\r\\nBuild a solid foundation for advanced networking and cybersecurity studies.<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 34, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(610, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Link Layer Services in Computer Networks\",\"hi\":\"Link Layer Services in Computer Networks\"}', 'link-layer-services-in-computer-networks', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/af6c594e-7991-4cde-bf52-cb6c17526900.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/af6c594e-7991-4cde-bf52-cb6c17526900.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>This course introduces the Link Layer (Data Link Layer), the second layer of the OSI model, and its essential services in computer networks. Students will learn how data is framed, addressed, transmitted, and protected from errors during communication between directly connected devices. The course covers framing, MAC addressing, error detection and correction, flow control, access control, and link-layer protocols such as Ethernet and Wi-Fi. Through practical examples and network scenarios, learners will gain a strong understanding of how reliable node-to-node communication is achieved<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>This course introduces the Link Layer (Data Link Layer), the second layer of the OSI model, and its essential services in computer networks. Students will learn how data is framed, addressed, transmitted, and protected from errors during communication between directly connected devices. The course covers framing, MAC addressing, error detection and correction, flow control, access control, and link-layer protocols such as Ethernet and Wi-Fi. Through practical examples and network scenarios, learners will gain a strong understanding of how reliable node-to-node communication is achieved<br><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 15:04:34', '2026-06-19 18:50:00', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"736\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wyrx7d\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"798\\\">\\r\\nExplain the role of the Data Link Layer in the OSI model.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ev36q4\\\" data-start=\\\"799\\\" data-end=\\\"855\\\">\\r\\nDescribe the key services provided by the Link Layer.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1i86myu\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"909\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand framing techniques and frame structure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1su16q3\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\" data-end=\\\"969\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use MAC addresses in network communication.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"rfcqgk\\\" data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"1031\\\">\\r\\nExplain error detection methods such as CRC and checksums.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5ptvg2\\\" data-start=\\\"1032\\\" data-end=\\\"1097\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand flow control mechanisms for reliable data transfer.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uuijjn\\\" data-start=\\\"1098\\\" data-end=\\\"1166\\\">\\r\\nDescribe media access control techniques used in shared networks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"chkl9b\\\" data-start=\\\"1167\\\" data-end=\\\"1240\\\">\\r\\nCompare wired (Ethernet) and wireless (Wi-Fi) link-layer technologies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hbkn79\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze how link-layer protocols support efficient communication.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16ppxr4\\\" data-start=\\\"1310\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\nApply link-layer concepts to troubleshoot basic network issues.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":\"<p data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"736\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wyrx7d\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"798\\\">\\r\\nExplain the role of the Data Link Layer in the OSI model.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ev36q4\\\" data-start=\\\"799\\\" data-end=\\\"855\\\">\\r\\nDescribe the key services provided by the Link Layer.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1i86myu\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"909\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand framing techniques and frame structure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1su16q3\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\" data-end=\\\"969\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use MAC addresses in network communication.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"rfcqgk\\\" data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"1031\\\">\\r\\nExplain error detection methods such as CRC and checksums.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5ptvg2\\\" data-start=\\\"1032\\\" data-end=\\\"1097\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand flow control mechanisms for reliable data transfer.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uuijjn\\\" data-start=\\\"1098\\\" data-end=\\\"1166\\\">\\r\\nDescribe media access control techniques used in shared networks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"chkl9b\\\" data-start=\\\"1167\\\" data-end=\\\"1240\\\">\\r\\nCompare wired (Ethernet) and wireless (Wi-Fi) link-layer technologies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hbkn79\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze how link-layer protocols support efficient communication.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16ppxr4\\\" data-start=\\\"1310\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\nApply link-layer concepts to troubleshoot basic network issues.<\\/li><\\/ol>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(613, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Creating dramatic stage washes fundamentals\",\"hi\":null}', 'creating-dramatic-stage-washes-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/dc093c1f-f45c-48a6-9282-5f8b83a3c4a2.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/dc093c1f-f45c-48a6-9282-5f8b83a3c4a2.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Creating dramatic stage washes course, in this course we will learn about the art of crafting captivating stage lighting<\\/p><p>designs that evoke emotion and enhance theatrical performances. Through a comprehensive exploration of lighting<\\/p><p>techniques, color theory, and creative use of light angles and intensity, participants will gain the skills needed to create<\\/p><p>immersive stage washes that amplify the mood and atmosphere on stage. This course provides practical insights and<\\/p><p>hands-on exercises to empower participants to elevate their lighting design capabilities and bring dramatic visions to life<\\/p><p>on the stage.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 15:36:32', '2026-06-19 12:58:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master how to design immersive stage washes that evoke emotion and enhance theatrical storytelling using advanced lighting techniques<\\/li><li>Apply color theory and light angles to create mood, atmosphere, and dramatic effects in stage lighting design<\\/li><li>Utilize lighting intensity and positioning to craft dynamic stage washes that support theatrical performances and audience engagement<\\/li><li>Implement practical lighting exercises to develop skills in creating compelling stage washes for various theatrical genres<\\/li><li>Analyze stage lighting needs to select appropriate equipment and techniques for dramatic stage washes<\\/li><li>Integrate creative use of light angles and color to amplify emotional impact and visual storytelling on stage<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common lighting challenges to ensure seamless execution of dramatic stage washes during performances<\\/li><li>Develop comprehensive lighting plans that align with directorial vision and enhance overall theatrical production<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 25, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(614, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"MOBILE REPAIRING\",\"hi\":null}', 'mobile-repairing', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/f074367d-c73a-4ccf-80d0-f6a13d9f7569.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/f074367d-c73a-4ccf-80d0-f6a13d9f7569.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Mobile Repairing Course: Dive into the world of mobile phone repairs with this comprehensive course. Learn how to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common hardware and software issues, replace components, and troubleshoot complex problems. Gain<\\/p><p>hands-on skills in disassembling and reassembling mobile devices, utilizing specialized tools and techniques. Explore<\\/p><p>techniques for data recovery, software updates, and optimizing device performance. Through practical exercises and<\\/p><p>real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the expertise to confidently repair and service a wide range of mobile phones. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or a smartphone enthusiast, this course equips you with the knowledge and skills<\\/p><p>to excel in mobile repairing and offer professional solutions for various mobile phone issues. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 16:45:00', '2026-06-19 10:05:44', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnose and repair common mobile hardware issues using specialized tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform software updates, data recovery, and optimize mobile device performance effectively<\\/li><li>Disassemble and reassemble various mobile phone models with precision and safety<\\/li><li>Identify and replace faulty components such as screens, batteries, and motherboards accurately<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot complex hardware and software problems with practical troubleshooting skills<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for mobile device safety, handling, and maintenance during repairs<\\/li><li>Utilize diagnostic tools and software to efficiently identify mobile phone issues<\\/li><li>Provide professional mobile repair services, ensuring quality and customer satisfaction<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 41, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(615, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"OPPO Repair\",\"hi\":null}', 'oppo-repair', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/bab5cd9d-1418-403b-afb0-b77872220d41.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/bab5cd9d-1418-403b-afb0-b77872220d41.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>OPPO Repair Course: Delve into the world of OPPO smartphone repairs with this comprehensive course. Learn how to<\\/p><p>diagnose and fix common issues, including screen damage, battery problems, and software glitches. Gain hands-on skills<\\/p><p>in disassembling and reassembling OPPO devices, replacing components, and troubleshooting hardware and software<\\/p><p>faults. Explore techniques for data recovery, firmware updates, and optimizing device performance. Through practical<\\/p><p>exercises and real-world scenarios, you\'ll develop the expertise to confidently repair and service OPPO smartphones of<\\/p><p>various models. Whether you\'re an aspiring technician or an OPPO enthusiast, this course equips you with the knowledge<\\/p><p>and skills to offer professional OPPO repairs and solutions to device-related problems. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 19:41:16', '2026-06-20 04:26:29', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master diagnose and repair common OPPO smartphone hardware issues including screens, batteries, and charging ports<\\/li><li>Perform disassembly, reassembly, and component replacement on various OPPO smartphone models with precision<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve software glitches, firmware errors, and system crashes on OPPO devices effectively<\\/li><li>Apply data recovery techniques to retrieve lost data from damaged or malfunctioning OPPO smartphones<\\/li><li>Update firmware and optimize device performance to enhance speed, stability, and user experience<\\/li><li>Identify and fix hardware faults such as water damage, faulty connectors, and defective sensors in OPPO phones<\\/li><li>Utilize diagnostic tools and software to accurately identify hardware and software problems in OPPO smartphones<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for safe repair procedures, including static precautions and proper handling of delicate components<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 39, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(616, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Data Science for Beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'data-science-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b45ec8d7-9d82-4bda-b29d-95af88dec598.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b45ec8d7-9d82-4bda-b29d-95af88dec598.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the fundamentals of Data Science, covering data collection, cleaning, analysis, visualization, and basic machine learning concepts. Students will learn how to work with datasets, extract meaningful insights, and make data-driven decisions using popular tools and techniques. The course focuses on practical examples and real-world applications, making it ideal for beginners with little or no prior experience in data science.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 21:09:48', '2026-06-14 20:45:49', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"yc99pw\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\" data-end=\\\"660\\\">Understand the core concepts and workflow of Data Science.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7qd9g1\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\" data-end=\\\"714\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of data and data sources.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"a0vnk\\\" data-start=\\\"715\\\" data-end=\\\"775\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic data cleaning and preprocessing techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hle7li\\\" data-start=\\\"776\\\" data-end=\\\"828\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze datasets to discover patterns and trends.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1s4hpua\\\" data-start=\\\"829\\\" data-end=\\\"901\\\">\\r\\nCreate charts and visualizations to communicate insights effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16d740k\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\" data-end=\\\"969\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of statistics used in data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1830i7d\\\" data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\">\\r\\nApply basic machine learning concepts and algorithms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nkgo6n\\\" data-start=\\\"1027\\\" data-end=\\\"1081\\\">\\r\\nUse Python libraries commonly used in Data Science.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cty4hj\\\" data-start=\\\"1082\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">\\r\\nInterpret analytical results to support decision-making.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ni2a91\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\r\\nBuild a simple end-to-end data science project using real-world datasets.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 86, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(617, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python variable techniques for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'python-variable-techniques-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/6a9813f0-8dac-4153-a4a7-1ebe2762ce5d.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/6a9813f0-8dac-4153-a4a7-1ebe2762ce5d.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the concept of variables in Python and demonstrates how they are used to store, manage, and manipulate data within programs. Learners will explore different data types, variable naming conventions, assignment techniques, type conversion, and best practices for writing clean and efficient Python code. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, students will gain confidence in working with variables and building foundational programming skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 21:19:13', '2026-06-17 18:07:10', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"vqm5oe\\\" data-start=\\\"641\\\" data-end=\\\"717\\\">Understand the purpose and importance of variables in Python programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"t5850q\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nCreate and assign values to variables using proper syntax.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vaqilm\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"831\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between various Python data types.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p8nanu\\\" data-start=\\\"832\\\" data-end=\\\"890\\\">\\r\\nApply variable naming conventions and coding standards.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k49792\\\" data-start=\\\"891\\\" data-end=\\\"956\\\">\\r\\nPerform multiple assignments and variable swapping techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1v0tvtu\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\" data-end=\\\"1021\\\">\\r\\nUse type conversion to change data between different formats.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6c8whr\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\" data-end=\\\"1073\\\">\\r\\nWork with user input and store data dynamically.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uhqw8p\\\" data-start=\\\"1074\\\" data-end=\\\"1137\\\">\\r\\nManipulate variables in mathematical and logical operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"d553yz\\\" data-start=\\\"1138\\\" data-end=\\\"1197\\\">\\r\\nDebug common variable-related errors in Python programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19bst31\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\" data-end=\\\"1265\\\">\\r\\nDevelop simple Python applications using variables effectively.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(618, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"HTML5 Features for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'html5-features-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/89538d2c-8bc1-4c1d-9689-d8d8c4558e6a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/89538d2c-8bc1-4c1d-9689-d8d8c4558e6a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the powerful features of HTML5, the latest standard for web page development. Learners will explore modern HTML5 elements, multimedia integration, forms, semantic tags, graphics, local storage, and responsive web design concepts. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, students will learn how to create modern, interactive, and standards-compliant websites using HTML5.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 21:25:13', '2026-06-03 19:19:25', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"etb2kv\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\" data-end=\\\"611\\\">Understand the fundamentals and advantages of HTML5.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pegdt0\\\" data-start=\\\"612\\\" data-end=\\\"678\\\">\\r\\nCreate well-structured web pages using semantic HTML5 elements.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lzydwu\\\" data-start=\\\"679\\\" data-end=\\\"740\\\">\\r\\nEmbed audio and video content without third-party plugins.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3ld1yl\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"812\\\">\\r\\nDesign modern forms using HTML5 input types and validation features.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1anhs7p\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"866\\\">\\r\\nUtilize HTML5 graphics with Canvas and SVG basics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jbr9qp\\\" data-start=\\\"867\\\" data-end=\\\"927\\\">\\r\\nImplement local storage for storing data in web browsers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ugcdk0\\\" data-start=\\\"928\\\" data-end=\\\"980\\\">\\r\\nBuild responsive and mobile-friendly web layouts.