(619, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Typecasting in python with execution\",\"hi\":\"Typecasting in python with execution\"}', 'typecasting-in-python-with-execution', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/fe3f8721-1c75-44f2-a81c-48250354c003.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/fe3f8721-1c75-44f2-a81c-48250354c003.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course teaches the concept of typecasting (type conversion) in Python and demonstrates how different data types can be converted and used in real-world programming scenarios. Learners will understand implicit and explicit type conversion, execute practical examples, and explore how typecasting helps in handling user input, calculations, and data processing. The course emphasizes hands-on coding exercises to strengthen programming fundamentals.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course teaches the concept of typecasting (type conversion) in Python and demonstrates how different data types can be converted and used in real-world programming scenarios. Learners will understand implicit and explicit type conversion, execute practical examples, and explore how typecasting helps in handling user input, calculations, and data processing. The course emphasizes hands-on coding exercises to strengthen programming fundamentals.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 21:33:31', '2026-06-20 20:20:35', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"5mwdip\\\" data-start=\\\"612\\\" data-end=\\\"678\\\">Understand the concept and importance of typecasting in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1s0dv4j\\\" data-start=\\\"679\\\" data-end=\\\"742\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between implicit and explicit type conversion.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pmo5gb\\\" data-start=\\\"743\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nConvert data between integers, floats, strings, and booleans.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"134brcn\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"871\\\">\\r\\nUse Python\'s built-in type conversion functions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cz6yr8\\\" data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nHandle user input and convert data into required formats.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"57fs48\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"983\\\">\\r\\nPrevent common type-related programming errors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15weevc\\\" data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"1056\\\">\\r\\nApply typecasting in mathematical calculations and data manipulation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1mp4s4a\\\" data-start=\\\"1057\\\" data-end=\\\"1122\\\">\\r\\nExecute and analyze Python programs involving type conversion.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17cw4hs\\\" data-start=\\\"1123\\\" data-end=\\\"1176\\\">\\r\\nDebug type mismatch errors in Python applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1w8wo37\\\" data-start=\\\"1177\\\" data-end=\\\"1239\\\">\\r\\nBuild simple projects that utilize typecasting techniques.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"5mwdip\\\" data-start=\\\"612\\\" data-end=\\\"678\\\">Understand the concept and importance of typecasting in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1s0dv4j\\\" data-start=\\\"679\\\" data-end=\\\"742\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between implicit and explicit type conversion.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pmo5gb\\\" data-start=\\\"743\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nConvert data between integers, floats, strings, and booleans.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"134brcn\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"871\\\">\\r\\nUse Python\'s built-in type conversion functions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cz6yr8\\\" data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nHandle user input and convert data into required formats.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"