(621, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel VBA sorting table columns for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Excel VBA sorting table columns for beginners\"}', 'excel-vba-sorting-table-columns-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/aa650543-a2d2-44cd-a065-6aa9de38e1fb.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/aa650543-a2d2-44cd-a065-6aa9de38e1fb.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces learners to sorting data efficiently using Excel VBA (Visual Basic for Applications). Students will learn how to automate column sorting tasks, organize datasets, write VBA macros, and improve spreadsheet productivity. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to sort tables dynamically and automate repetitive data management tasks in Microsoft Excel.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces learners to sorting data efficiently using Excel VBA (Visual Basic for Applications). Students will learn how to automate column sorting tasks, organize datasets, write VBA macros, and improve spreadsheet productivity. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to sort tables dynamically and automate repetitive data management tasks in Microsoft Excel.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 23:10:46', '2026-06-20 19:09:31', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"18h8okv\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\" data-end=\\\"647\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Excel VBA programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"blbrz6\\\" data-start=\\\"648\\\" data-end=\\\"698\\\">\\r\\nCreate and execute VBA macros for sorting data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17mk67p\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">\\r\\nSort table columns in ascending and descending order.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"63nzq9\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nAutomate repetitive spreadsheet tasks using VBA.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e90rrn\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nWork with Excel ranges, tables, and worksheets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ycltog\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"900\\\">\\r\\nApply multi-column sorting techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1g0tpdg\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\" data-end=\\\"956\\\">\\r\\nCreate dynamic sorting solutions for large datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1tkm5di\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\" data-end=\\\"1009\\\">\\r\\nDebug and troubleshoot common VBA sorting errors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"w0rn7f\\\" data-start=\\\"1010\\\" data-end=\\\"1063\\\">\\r\\nEnhance spreadsheet efficiency through automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qz19ey\\\" data-start=\\\"1064\\\" data-end=\\\"1131\\\">\\r\\nBuild practical Excel VBA projects involving data organization<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"18h8okv\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\" data-end=\\\"647\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Excel VBA programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"blbrz6\\\" data-start=\\\"648\\\" data-end=\\\"698\\\">\\r\\nCreate and execute VBA macros for sorting data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17mk67p\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">\\r\\nSort table columns in ascending and descending order.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"63nzq9\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nAutomate repetitive spreadsheet tasks using VBA.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"e90rrn\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nWork with Excel ranges, tables, and worksheets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ycltog\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"900\\\">\\r\\nApply multi-column sorting techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1g0tpdg\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\" data-end=\\\"956\\\">\\r\\nCreate dynamic sorting solutions for large datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1tkm5di\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\" data-end=\\\"1009\\\">\\r\\nDebug and troubleshoot common VBA sorting errors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"w0rn7f\\\" data-start=\\\"1010\\\" data-end=\\\"1063\\\">\\r\\nEnhance spreadsheet efficiency through automation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qz19ey\\\" data-start=\\\"1064\\\" data-end=\\\"1131\\\">\\r\\nBuild practical Excel VBA projects involving data organization<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 9, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 89, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(622, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"JavaScript Object Notation Fundamentals\",\"hi\":null}', 'javascript-object-notation-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/e998e4c6-504b-4dd0-9cec-925fcbb3535e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/e998e4c6-504b-4dd0-9cec-925fcbb3535e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces JavaScript Object Notation (JSON), the most widely used format for data exchange in modern web applications. Learners will explore JSON syntax, objects, arrays, parsing, stringification, and data handling techniques used in web development, APIs, and databases. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, students will gain the skills needed to work with JSON confidently in real-world applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 23:16:32', '2026-06-12 01:31:44', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1l1c9yg\\\" data-start=\\\"600\\\" data-end=\\\"672\\\">Understand the purpose and importance of JSON in modern applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1se8670\\\" data-start=\\\"673\\\" data-end=\\\"723\\\">\\r\\nIdentify the structure and syntax of JSON data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cbfjq3\\\" data-start=\\\"724\\\" data-end=\\\"764\\\">\\r\\nCreate valid JSON objects and arrays.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uz21z5\\\" data-start=\\\"765\\\" data-end=\\\"818\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between JSON and JavaScript objects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"jyu0f8\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\" data-end=\\\"862\\\">\\r\\nParse JSON data into JavaScript objects.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"zpz20j\\\" data-start=\\\"863\\\" data-end=\\\"911\\\">\\r\\nConvert JavaScript objects into JSON strings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kr8ibn\\\" data-start=\\\"912\\\" data-end=\\\"956\\\">\\r\\nWork with nested JSON objects and arrays.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"q36s31\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\" data-end=\\\"996\\\">\\r\\nHandle JSON data received from APIs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1y0zkjx\\\" data-start=\\\"997\\\" data-end=\\\"1049\\\">\\r\\nValidate and troubleshoot JSON formatting errors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"p5nff8\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\" data-end=\\\"1113\\\">\\r\\nBuild practical applications that exchange data using JSON<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 88, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(623, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"AVR Programming\",\"hi\":null}', 'avr-programming', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b0438d01-3d86-41fd-a240-8190dd07273d.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/b0438d01-3d86-41fd-a240-8190dd07273d.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-to-intermediate course introduces AVR microcontroller programming and embedded systems development. Learners will explore AVR architecture, programming concepts, input\\/output interfacing, timers, interrupts, serial communication, and peripheral control. Through practical examples and real-world projects, students will gain hands-on experience in developing embedded applications using AVR microcontrollers and programming tools.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 23:21:42', '2026-06-04 15:58:17', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"jqk4zt\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\" data-end=\\\"633\\\">Understand the architecture and features of AVR microcontrollers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1y6ezz3\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\" data-end=\\\"689\\\">\\r\\nSet up and configure an AVR development environment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1mgpiuu\\\" data-start=\\\"690\\\" data-end=\\\"741\\\">\\r\\nWrite and execute AVR programs using Embedded C.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"v8rxbm\\\" data-start=\\\"742\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\r\\nInterface LEDs, switches, and sensors with AVR microcontrollers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"hjjz0m\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and use digital input\\/output ports.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15vrxl9\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"903\\\">\\r\\nImplement timer and counter applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"gx5xbp\\\" data-start=\\\"904\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">\\r\\nUtilize interrupts for efficient event handling.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"f5iyd2\\\" data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1001\\\">\\r\\nEstablish serial communication using UART.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lwe6w9\\\" data-start=\\\"1002\\\" data-end=\\\"1053\\\">\\r\\nDevelop embedded projects using AVR peripherals.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"18g5s53\\\" data-start=\\\"1054\\\" data-end=\\\"1100\\\">\\r\\nDebug and optimize AVR-based applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 44, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(624, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java OOPs Concepts basics\",\"hi\":null}', 'java-oops-concepts-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/4ff9ad9e-542b-4e9c-90f1-8a39ab93bb6b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/4ff9ad9e-542b-4e9c-90f1-8a39ab93bb6b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the core Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts in Java. Learners will explore classes, objects, inheritance, polymorphism, encapsulation, and abstraction through practical coding examples. The course focuses on building a strong foundation in Java programming and understanding how OOP principles help create reusable, maintainable, and scalable software applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-01 23:28:46', '2026-06-12 01:32:09', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of Object-Oriented Programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate and use classes and objects in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nImplement encapsulation using access modifiers and getter\\/setter methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nApply inheritance to reuse code effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUnderstand and implement polymorphism in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUse abstraction through abstract classes and interfaces.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDesign modular and maintainable Java applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDifferentiate between procedural and object-oriented programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDevelop real-world applications using OOP principles.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite clean, reusable, and efficient Java code.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 87, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(625, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"App Features Android Programming\",\"hi\":null}', 'app-features-android-programming', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/f41bfd26-a4cb-4c23-bf09-6c441b3e77de.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/f41bfd26-a4cb-4c23-bf09-6c441b3e77de.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the essential features and functionalities used in Android application development. Learners will explore Android app components, user interface design, navigation, notifications, data storage, multimedia integration, location services, and modern Android development practices. Through hands-on projects and practical examples, students will learn how to build feature-rich Android applications that provide engaging user experiences.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 00:28:25', '2026-06-12 01:32:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"u8ely4\\\" data-start=\\\"614\\\" data-end=\\\"674\\\">Understand the core architecture of Android applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9jtaoh\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"735\\\">\\r\\nDesign attractive and responsive Android user interfaces.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"98tnes\\\" data-start=\\\"736\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\">\\r\\nImplement common app features used in modern mobile applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r5gucw\\\" data-start=\\\"805\\\" data-end=\\\"867\\\">\\r\\nCreate navigation systems between activities and fragments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ja5xly\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">\\r\\nWork with notifications and background services.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"111cvgu\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"992\\\">\\r\\nStore and retrieve data using local databases and shared preferences.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"22tkh8\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1059\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate multimedia features such as audio, video, and images.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p08nxk\\\" data-start=\\\"1060\\\" data-end=\\\"1117\\\">\\r\\nUtilize device features like camera, GPS, and sensors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"176b5sn\\\" data-start=\\\"1118\\\" data-end=\\\"1169\\\">\\r\\nConnect Android apps with web services and APIs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17gkbpe\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\" data-end=\\\"1242\\\">\\r\\nDevelop complete Android applications with real-world functionality.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(626, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"MSBI Interview Questions\",\"hi\":\"MSBI Interview Questions\"}', 'msbi-interview-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/c32000f7-0f5f-44cf-bba6-1fdda49729c1.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/01-06-2026/c32000f7-0f5f-44cf-bba6-1fdda49729c1.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to help aspiring Business Intelligence professionals prepare for Microsoft Business Intelligence (MSBI) interviews. It covers the most frequently asked interview questions and practical scenarios related to SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS), SQL Server Analysis Services (SSAS), SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS), SQL Server, Data Warehousing, ETL processes, and Business Intelligence concepts. Through detailed explanations and real-world examples, learners will gain the confidence needed to succeed in technical interviews and advance their careers in data and BI domains.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed to help aspiring Business Intelligence professionals prepare for Microsoft Business Intelligence (MSBI) interviews. It covers the most frequently asked interview questions and practical scenarios related to SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS), SQL Server Analysis Services (SSAS), SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS), SQL Server, Data Warehousing, ETL processes, and Business Intelligence concepts. Through detailed explanations and real-world examples, learners will gain the confidence needed to succeed in technical interviews and advance their careers in data and BI domains.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 00:45:02', '2026-06-12 01:32:11', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"162rv3g\\\" data-start=\\\"737\\\" data-end=\\\"798\\\">Understand the core concepts of the MSBI technology stack.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7f922x\\\" data-start=\\\"799\\\" data-end=\\\"861\\\">\\r\\