\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15c7170\\\" data-start=\\\"1559\\\" data-end=\\\"1648\\\">\\r\\nGain hands-on experience with industry-relevant data science tools and methodologies.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 4, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 86, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(630, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"CS442 | Introduction to Data Science\",\"hi\":\"CS442 | Introduction to Data Science\"}', 'cs442-introduction-to-data-science', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/9d128b3f-1cac-4403-9162-9c6c1b2dc43c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/9d128b3f-1cac-4403-9162-9c6c1b2dc43c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>CS442: Introduction to Data Science provides a comprehensive introduction to the fundamental concepts, tools, and techniques used in modern data science. Students learn how to collect, process, analyze, visualize, and interpret data to support data-driven decision-making. The course covers data manipulation, exploratory data analysis, statistical methods, machine learning basics, and data visualization using industry-standard tools such as Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Jupyter Notebook. Through practical exercises and real-world case studies, learners gain hands-on experience in transforming raw data into meaningful insights. <\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>CS442: Introduction to Data Science provides a comprehensive introduction to the fundamental concepts, tools, and techniques used in modern data science. Students learn how to collect, process, analyze, visualize, and interpret data to support data-driven decision-making. The course covers data manipulation, exploratory data analysis, statistical methods, machine learning basics, and data visualization using industry-standard tools such as Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Jupyter Notebook. Through practical exercises and real-world case studies, learners gain hands-on experience in transforming raw data into meaningful insights. <\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 16:16:22', '2026-06-05 04:37:12', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"107alwu\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"878\\\">Understand the core concepts and applications of data science.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16xe7pq\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nCollect, clean, and prepare datasets for analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1l53ra3\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"1005\\\">\\r\\nPerform exploratory data analysis (EDA) using statistical techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5u51hz\\\" data-start=\\\"1006\\\" data-end=\\\"1071\\\">\\r\\nCreate meaningful visualizations to communicate data insights.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ndgxpx\\\" data-start=\\\"1072\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">\\r\\nApply basic probability and statistical concepts in data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vxf63z\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1203\\\">\\r\\nUse Python and popular data science libraries effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sv50rt\\\" data-start=\\\"1204\\\" data-end=\\\"1270\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand machine learning fundamentals and common algorithms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1d4mzbv\\\" data-start=\\\"1271\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">\\r\\nInterpret analytical results to support business and research decisions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gpsa6m\\\" data-start=\\\"1347\\\" data-end=\\\"1397\\\">\\r\\nWork with structured and unstructured datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9mq59z\\\" data-start=\\\"1398\\\" data-end=\\\"1464\\\">\\r\\nDevelop practical data science projects using real-world data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tcxtwh\\\" data-start=\\\"1465\\\" data-end=\\\"1537\\\">\\r\\nCommunicate findings through reports, dashboards, and presentations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lvrz9\\\" data-start=\\\"1538\\\" data-end=\\\"1609\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced data science and AI courses.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"107alwu\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"878\\\">Understand the core concepts and applications of data science.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16xe7pq\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nCollect, clean, and prepare datasets for analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1l53ra3\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"1005\\\">\\r\\nPerform exploratory data analysis (EDA) using statistical techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"5u51hz\\\" data-start=\\\"1006\\\" data-end=\\\"1071\\\">\\r\\nCreate meaningful visualizations to communicate data insights.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ndgxpx\\\" data-start=\\\"1072\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">\\r\\nApply basic probability and statistical concepts in data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vxf63z\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1203\\\">\\r\\nUse Python and popular data science libraries effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sv50rt\\\" data-start=\\\"1204\\\" data-end=\\\"1270\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand machine learning fundamentals and common algorithms.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1d4mzbv\\\" data-start=\\\"1271\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">\\r\\nInterpret analytical results to support business and research decisions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gpsa6m\\\" data-start=\\\"1347\\\" data-end=\\\"1397\\\">\\r\\nWork with structured and unstructured datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9mq59z\\\" data-start=\\\"1398\\\" data-end=\\\"1464\\\">\\r\\nDevelop practical data science projects using real-world data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tcxtwh\\\" data-start=\\\"1465\\\" data-end=\\\"1537\\\">\\r\\nCommunicate findings through reports, dashboards, and presentations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lvrz9\\\" data-start=\\\"1538\\\" data-end=\\\"1609\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced data science and AI courses.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(631, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure For Beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'azure-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/e1afd513-a0e9-4b9d-8087-bcf30a6c2c7b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/e1afd513-a0e9-4b9d-8087-bcf30a6c2c7b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Azure for Beginners is an introductory course designed to help learners understand the fundamentals of cloud computing and the core services offered by Microsoft Azure. The course covers cloud concepts, Azure architecture, virtual machines, storage solutions, networking, security, identity management, and deployment services. Through hands-on demonstrations and practical exercises, students will learn how to build, deploy, and manage cloud-based applications using Azure. This course is ideal for beginners who want to start a career in cloud computing or prepare for Azure certification exams.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 16:20:44', '2026-06-19 07:39:30', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"ypb1bd\\\" data-start=\\\"752\\\" data-end=\\\"821\\\">Understand the fundamentals of cloud computing and Azure services.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15b9wok\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\" data-end=\\\"871\\\">\\r\\nNavigate and use the Azure Portal effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hvq0pr\\\" data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"922\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage Azure Virtual Machines (VMs).\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tmrguy\\\" data-start=\\\"923\\\" data-end=\\\"976\\\">\\r\\nConfigure Azure Storage Accounts and Blob Storage.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16i1nnr\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1038\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Azure networking concepts and virtual networks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1m0xplw\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1120\\\">\\r\\nImplement basic security and identity management using Azure Active Directory.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ec8vhv\\\" data-start=\\\"1121\\\" data-end=\\\"1170\\\">\\r\\nDeploy and manage cloud applications on Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pnqpza\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" data-end=\\\"1224\\\">\\r\\nMonitor and optimize Azure resources and services.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"58553l\\\" data-start=\\\"1225\\\" data-end=\\\"1283\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Azure pricing, billing, and cost management.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11f9x1d\\\" data-start=\\\"1284\\\" data-end=\\\"1342\\\">\\r\\nWork with Azure databases and cloud storage solutions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"16ij8rk\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\" data-end=\\\"1402\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for cloud security and governance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"l6phf7\\\" data-start=\\\"1403\\\" data-end=\\\"1471\\\">\\r\\nPrepare for Microsoft Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900) certification.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 10, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 86, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
