r\\nSolve real-world testing interview challenges and scenario-based questions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jkxz8k\\\" data-start=\\\"1235\\\" data-end=\\\"1304\\\">\\r\\nImprove communication and problem-solving skills for QA interviews.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19u04kv\\\" data-start=\\\"1305\\\" data-end=\\\"1391\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild confidence to clear software testing job interviews and technical assessments.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 26, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 52, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(635, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"POWER BI Interview Questions\",\"hi\":\"POWER BI Interview Questions\"}', 'power-bi-interview-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/43035e4b-a35b-4ec3-95f3-a5d80fa1981e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/43035e4b-a35b-4ec3-95f3-a5d80fa1981e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<\\/p><h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"538\\\" data-end=\\\"559\\\"><\\/h3><p><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"54\\\" data-end=\\\"536\\\">Prepare confidently for Power BI job interviews with this comprehensive course covering beginner to advanced interview questions. Learn key concepts such as Power BI Desktop, Power Query, Data Modeling, DAX functions, dashboards, reports, data visualization, security, and real-world business scenarios. The course includes frequently asked technical questions, practical examples, and expert tips to help you succeed in Power BI developer, analyst, and business intelligence roles.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"538\\\" data-end=\\\"559\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"54\\\" data-end=\\\"536\\\">Prepare confidently for Power BI job interviews with this comprehensive course covering beginner to advanced interview questions. Learn key concepts such as Power BI Desktop, Power Query, Data Modeling, DAX functions, dashboards, reports, data visualization, security, and real-world business scenarios. The course includes frequently asked technical questions, practical examples, and expert tips to help you succeed in Power BI developer, analyst, and business intelligence roles.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:40:08', '2026-06-19 06:56:34', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"561\\\" data-end=\\\"608\\\">By the end of this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"610\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gnkirr\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\" data-end=\\\"665\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of Power BI architecture.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1az8hw5\\\" data-start=\\\"666\\\" data-end=\\\"726\\\">\\r\\nExplain Power BI Desktop, Service, and Gateway components.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11ixwcp\\\" data-start=\\\"727\\\" data-end=\\\"775\\\">\\r\\nCreate and optimize data models for reporting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"13nlt93\\\" data-start=\\\"776\\\" data-end=\\\"821\\\">\\r\\nWrite and analyze DAX formulas confidently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e4eoqs\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\" data-end=\\\"877\\\">\\r\\nUse Power Query for data transformation and cleaning.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1u4iam5\\\" data-start=\\\"878\\\" data-end=\\\"922\\\">\\r\\nDesign interactive dashboards and reports.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"a6m6xp\\\" data-start=\\\"923\\\" data-end=\\\"990\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand relationships, measures, calculated columns, and KPIs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"13t5b8k\\\" data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1057\\\">\\r\\nImplement Row-Level Security (RLS) and data governance concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"p8ni7j\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\" data-end=\\\"1115\\\">\\r\\nAnswer common Power BI interview questions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"d1qhae\\\" data-start=\\\"1116\\\" data-end=\\\"1181\\\">\\r\\nSolve real-world Power BI interview scenarios and case studies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"104q6fw\\\" data-start=\\\"1182\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\nImprove confidence for Power BI Developer and Data Analyst interviews.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qhpmv5\\\" data-start=\\\"1255\\\" data-end=\\\"1327\\\">\\r\\nDemonstrate best practices for performance optimization and reporting.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<p data-start=\\\"561\\\" data-end=\\\"608\\\">By the end of this course, you