ization and reporting.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 18, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 85, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(636, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"PostgreSQL Interview Questions\",\"hi\":\"PostgreSQL Interview Questions\"}', 'postgresql-interview-questions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/34276e25-2495-4d09-b248-b39f498cc52c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/34276e25-2495-4d09-b248-b39f498cc52c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Prepare confidently for PostgreSQL database interviews with this comprehensive course covering essential PostgreSQL concepts, SQL queries, database design, indexing, performance tuning, transactions, normalization, stored procedures, and real-world interview scenarios. Whether you are a beginner, database administrator, backend developer, or data engineer, this course helps you understand PostgreSQL fundamentals and advanced topics commonly asked in technical interviews. Learn practical problem-solving techniques and gain the confidence needed to succeed in PostgreSQL job interviews<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:42:28', '2026-06-18 15:42:05', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"637\\\" data-end=\\\"684\\\">By the end of this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"686\\\" data-end=\\\"1368\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ce7gtz\\\" data-start=\\\"686\\\" data-end=\\\"750\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand PostgreSQL architecture and core database concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1nuv1k7\\\" data-start=\\\"751\\\" data-end=\\\"826\\\">\\r\\nWrite efficient SQL queries using SELECT, JOIN, GROUP BY, and subqueries.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1j1gsi0\\\" data-start=\\\"827\\\" data-end=\\\"897\\\">\\r\\nExplain PostgreSQL data types, constraints, and table relationships.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ndrrcy\\\" data-start=\\\"898\\\" data-end=\\\"952\\\">\\r\\nWork with indexes and optimize database performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19n4xrm\\\" data-start=\\\"953\\\" data-end=\\\"1021\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand transactions, ACID properties, and concurrency control.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1448yge\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\" data-end=\\\"1072\\\">\\r\\nDesign normalized and scalable database schemas.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1o7pfm6\\\" data-start=\\\"1073\\\" data-end=\\\"1143\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage views, functions, triggers, and stored procedures.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1r5dy5j\\\" data-start=\\\"1144\\\" data-end=\\\"1201\\\">\\r\\nHandle backup, restore, and database maintenance tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ki8rxg\\\" data-start=\\\"1202\\\" data-end=\\\"1268\\\">\\r\\nSolve real-world PostgreSQL interview questions with confidence.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1b8ltxy\\\" data-start=\\\"1269\\\" data-end=\\\"1368\\\">\\r\\nPrepare effectively for Database Developer, DBA, Backend Developer, and Data Engineer interviews.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 10, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 46, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(637, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Data Driven Science and Engineering\",\"hi\":\"Data Driven Science and Engineering\"}', 'data-driven-science-and-engineering', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/a20acc4c-cdca-4aea-8e93-dfee2b348890.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/a20acc4c-cdca-4aea-8e93-dfee2b348890.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>This course introduces the principles and practices of using data to solve scientific and engineering problems. Learners will explore data collection, processing, visualization, statistical analysis, machine learning, and predictive modeling techniques. Through real-world case studies and hands-on projects, students will learn how data-driven approaches support decision-making, innovation, optimization, and problem-solving across various engineering and scientific domains<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:46:34', '2026-06-18 00:17:41', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"561\\\" data-end=\\\"613\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"615\\\" data-end=\\\"1320\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"sfr5al\\\" data-start=\\\"615\\\" data-end=\\\"685\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of data-driven science and engineering.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"c42c1f\\\" data-start=\\\"686\\\" data-end=\\\"747\\\">\\r\\nCollect, clean, and preprocess data from multiple sources.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"hqd8sa\\\" data-start=\\\"748\\\" data-end=\\\"824\\\">\\r\\nApply statistical methods to analyze scientific and engineering datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1rlidgx\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\" data-end=\\\"897\\\">\\r\\nCreate meaningful data visualizations for insights and communication.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"snjlr9\\\" data-start=\\\"898\\\" data-end=\\\"959\\\">\\r\\nBuild predictive models using machine learning techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1yz6l64\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\" data-end=\\\"1028\\\">\\r\\nPerform data-driven decision-making for engineering applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"w7330b\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\">\\r\\nDevelop simulation and modeling solutions based on real-world data.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14arw08\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\" data-end=\\\"1171\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate and interpret analytical results to solve complex problems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"hby2cz\\\" data-start=\\\"1172\\\" data-end=\\\"1235\\\">\\r\\nUse industry-standard tools and libraries for data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"c4zywt\\\" data-start=\\\"1236\\\" data-end=\\\"1320\\\">\\r\\nComplete practical projects involving scientific and engineering data workflows.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 11, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 98, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(638, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure in 8 Hours\",\"hi\":\"Azure in 8 Hours\"}', 'azure-in-8-hours', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/0da6f5ed-3517-433f-be9a-9f34f2ce477c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/0da6f5ed-3517-433f-be9a-9f34f2ce477c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>This intensive Azure course is designed for beginners, students, developers, and IT professionals who want to learn Microsoft Azure cloud computing quickly and efficiently. In just 8 hours, you will gain a solid understanding of Azure fundamentals, cloud concepts, core Azure services, storage, networking, security, virtual machines, and deployment techniques. Through practical demonstrations and hands-on examples, learners will develop the skills needed to start working with Azure cloud solutions and prepare for Azure certification pathways<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:48:33', '2026-06-18 22:08:22', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"630\\\" data-end=\\\"682\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1379\\\" data-end=\\\"1398\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ggpmk7\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"745\\\">&nbsp;Understand cloud computing concepts and Azure architecture.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"pcylxb\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\" data-end=\\\"801\\\">\\r\\nNavigate the Azure Portal and manage Azure resources.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7tzstb\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\" data-end=\\\"848\\\">\\r\\nCreate and configure Virtual Machines (VMs).\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gc7fn\\\" data-start=\\\"849\\\" data-end=\\\"904\\\">\\r\\nWork with Azure Storage services and data management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1su6ofl\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\" data-end=\\\"948\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Azure Networking fundamentals.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xdhac2\\\" data-start=\\\"949\\\" data-end=\\\"1006\\\">\\r\\nImplement basic Azure Security and Identity Management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1fxkgcn\\\" data-start=\\\"1007\\\" data-end=\\\"1055\\\">\\r\\nDeploy and manage cloud applications on Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6nbn7k\\\" data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1107\\\">\\r\\nMonitor Azure resources and optimize performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"geyvbj\\\" data-start=\\\"1108\\\" data-end=\\\"1173\\\">\\r\\nUse Azure Resource Groups and resource organization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1wu0d68\\\" data-start=\\\"1174\\\" data-end=\\\"1240\\\">\\r\\nGain foundational knowledge for Azure certification preparation.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"y48xtz\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\" data-end=\\\"1289\\\">\\r\\nBuild and deploy a simple cloud-based project.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gqtsb7\\\" data-start=\\\"1290\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand best practices for scalability, reliability, and cost management in Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 13, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(639, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure Fundamentals\",\"hi\":\"Azure Fundamentals\"}', 'azure-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/42e5435a-a288-4ca5-80fa-59cc9d082f45.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/42e5435a-a288-4ca5-80fa-59cc9d082f45.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"45\\\" data-end=\\\"578\\\">Azure Fundamentals is a beginner-friendly course designed to introduce learners to cloud computing concepts and Microsoft Azure services. This course covers core Azure architecture, compute resources, networking, storage solutions, security, identity management, pricing models, and governance tools. Whether you\'re a student, IT professional, developer, or aspiring cloud engineer, this course provides the foundational knowledge required to start working with Microsoft Azure and prepare for Azure Fundamentals certification exams.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:49:40', '2026-06-19 18:04:51', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"608\\\" data-end=\\\"660\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"662\\\" data-end=\\\"754\\\">✅ Understand the fundamentals of cloud computing and cloud service models (IaaS, PaaS, SaaS)<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"756\\\" data-end=\\\"811\\\">✅ Explain the benefits and use cases of Microsoft Azure<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"907\\\">✅ Identify and work with core Azure services such as Virtual Machines, Storage, and Networking<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">✅ Understand Azure security, compliance, privacy, and identity management concepts<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1054\\\">✅ Configure and manage Azure resources using the Azure Portal<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1056\\\" data-end=\\\"1118\\\">✅ Understand Azure pricing, cost management, and support plans<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1120\\\" data-end=\\\"1209\\\">✅ Learn Azure governance tools including Resource Groups, Policies, and Management Groups<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1211\\\" data-end=\\\"1262\\\">✅ Explore Azure monitoring and management solutions<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1264\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">✅ Prepare confidently for the Microsoft Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900) certification exam<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1352\\\" data-end=\\\"1447\\\">✅ Build a strong foundation for advanced Azure, DevOps, Data Engineering, and AI learning paths<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><h3 data-section-id=\\\"hcpjyq\\\" data-start=\\\"1454\\\" data-end=\\\"1472\\\"><\\/h3><hr data-start=\\\"1449\\\" data-end=\\\"1452\\\">\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 27, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(640, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure Data Lake\",\"hi\":\"Azure Data Lake\"}', 'azure-data-lake', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/eebb954d-49ac-4175-aded-542ca4d63100.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/04-06-2026/eebb954d-49ac-4175-aded-542ca4d63100.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"10irhbc\\\" data-start=\\\"562\\\" data-end=\\\"582\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"40\\\" data-end=\\\"560\\\">Learn how to store, manage, and analyze massive volumes of structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data using Azure Data Lake. This course introduces Azure Data Lake Storage (ADLS), data organization, security, access control, integration with analytics services, and best practices for building scalable data solutions in the Microsoft Azure cloud platform. Participants will gain practical knowledge of data ingestion, storage optimization, and data processing workflows used in modern data engineering projects.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:51:26', '2026-06-19 18:00:57', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"584\\\" data-end=\\\"636\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1386\\\" data-end=\\\"1405\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"638\\\" data-end=\\\"1384\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1thzmz6\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\">&nbsp;Understand the fundamentals of Azure Data Lake and its role in big data architectures.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"114eo0f\\\" data-start=\\\"728\\\" data-end=\\\"790\\\">\\r\\nCreate and configure Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 accounts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"cuz02c\\\" data-start=\\\"791\\\" data-end=\\\"873\\\">\\r\\nOrganize and manage large-scale data efficiently using hierarchical namespaces.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xnfsxr\\\" data-start=\\\"874\\\" data-end=\\\"951\\\">\\r\\nImplement security features, access control, and data governance policies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"169veik\\\" data-start=\\\"952\\\" data-end=\\\"1010\\\">\\r\\nIngest data from multiple sources into Azure Data Lake.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1slxrbt\\\" data-start=\\\"1011\\\" data-end=\\\"1111\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate Azure Data Lake with Azure Synapse Analytics, Azure Databricks, and Azure Data Factory.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1336kaz\\\" data-start=\\\"1112\\\" data-end=\\\"1180\\\">\\r\\nProcess and analyze data for business intelligence and reporting.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6ytsvf\\\" data-start=\\\"1181\\\" data-end=\\\"1244\\\">\\r\\nOptimize storage performance and cost management strategies.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7zuiof\\\" data-start=\\\"1245\\\" data-end=\\\"1302\\\">\\r\\nMonitor and troubleshoot Azure Data Lake environments.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1sjy11y\\\" data-start=\\\"1303\\\" data-end=\\\"1384\\\">\\r\\nBuild end-to-end cloud-based data engineering solutions using Azure services.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 15, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 46, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(641, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"On Board to Azure with John Savill\",\"hi\":\"On Board to Azure with John Savill\"}', 'on-board-to-azure-with-john-savill', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/05-06-2026/2b31d3ab-9524-45ca-8a5c-1ccfa50f3c15.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/05-06-2026/2b31d3ab-9524-45ca-8a5c-1ccfa50f3c15.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"567\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"61\\\">On Board to Azure with John Savill<\\/strong> is a beginner-friendly course designed to help learners understand the fundamentals of Microsoft Azure cloud services and architecture. The course provides a structured introduction to Azure concepts, including cloud computing, core Azure services, networking, storage, security, identity management, and governance. Through practical explanations and real-world scenarios, learners gain the knowledge needed to confidently start their Azure journey and prepare for cloud-related roles and certifications.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:52:31', '2026-06-19 18:30:08', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"596\\\" data-end=\\\"648\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"650\\\" data-end=\\\"1335\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19u8h3b\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\" data-end=\\\"710\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of cloud computing and Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ocdy9a\\\" data-start=\\\"711\\\" data-end=\\\"767\\\">\\r\\nNavigate the Azure Portal and manage Azure resources.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1s0nn0y\\\" data-start=\\\"768\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use core Azure services such as Virtual Machines, Storage, and Networking.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6r5v0c\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"939\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Azure Identity and Access Management using Azure Active Directory.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hcsrrn\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\" data-end=\\\"1003\\\">\\r\\nExplain Azure security, compliance, and governance concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gnwg7h\\\" data-start=\\\"1004\\\" data-end=\\\"1068\\\">\\r\\nDeploy and manage cloud resources using Azure best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"gvoxvf\\\" data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1133\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Azure pricing, cost management, and support plans.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qr06lb\\\" data-start=\\\"1134\\\" data-end=\\\"1187\\\">\\r\\nDesign basic cloud solutions using Azure services.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19gtxvp\\\" data-start=\\\"1188\\\" data-end=\\\"1252\\\">\\r\\nPrepare for Microsoft Azure Fundamentals certification exams.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pw352u\\\" data-start=\\\"1253\\\" data-end=\\\"1335\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Azure learning paths and cloud careers<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 28, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(642, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure Infrastructure Updates\",\"hi\":\"Azure Infrastructure Updates\"}', 'azure-infrastructure-updates', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/7b28b7b7-8625-4632-b434-1bcc68e5d5fe.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/7b28b7b7-8625-4632-b434-1bcc68e5d5fe.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"532\\\" data-end=\\\"553\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"73\\\" data-end=\\\"530\\\">Stay current with the latest developments in Microsoft Azure infrastructure services. This course covers recent Azure updates, enhancements, and best practices across virtual machines, networking, storage, security, monitoring, governance, and cloud management. Learners will gain practical knowledge of new Azure capabilities and understand how to leverage them to improve performance, scalability, reliability, and cost optimization in cloud environments.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:53:33', '2026-06-19 18:11:05', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"554\\\" data-end=\\\"606\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"608\\\" data-end=\\\"1333\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2i9v1h\\\" data-start=\\\"608\\\" data-end=\\\"679\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the latest Azure infrastructure updates and announcements.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1l1hkyk\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">\\r\\nIdentify new features in Azure Virtual Machines, Storage, and Networking.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jzlq9g\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\" data-end=\\\"822\\\">\\r\\nImplement updated security and compliance capabilities in Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19oh7k7\\\" data-start=\\\"823\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and manage Azure monitoring and management services.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"z6b0qh\\\" data-start=\\\"888\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for high availability and disaster recovery.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19z51n8\\\" data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1028\\\">\\r\\nOptimize cloud resources using the latest Azure cost-management tools.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wb7qp0\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1101\\\">\\r\\nUtilize Azure governance features for resource control and compliance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"tkdnrw\\\" data-start=\\\"1102\\\" data-end=\\\"1180\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate infrastructure improvements to enhance performance and scalability.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10h9wh5\\\" data-start=\\\"1181\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\">\\r\\nStay informed about Azure roadmap changes and future enhancements.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"dl04ki\\\" data-start=\\\"1250\\\" data-end=\\\"1333\\\">\\r\\nConfidently manage modern Azure environments using current platform capabilities.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 16, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(643, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Azure ASP NET Core and Blazor from A to Z\",\"hi\":\"Azure ASP NET Core and Blazor from A to Z\"}', 'azure-asp-net-core-and-blazor-from-a-to-z', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/7a59e143-ef47-4e1e-9d16-40e44a7229fe.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/7a59e143-ef47-4e1e-9d16-40e44a7229fe.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"683\\\" data-end=\\\"704\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"67\\\" data-end=\\\"681\\\">Master modern web application development with ASP.NET Core, Blazor, and Microsoft Azure. This comprehensive course takes you from the fundamentals of building web applications to deploying scalable, secure, and cloud-native solutions on Azure. You will learn how to create interactive user interfaces with Blazor, develop powerful backend APIs using ASP.NET Core, integrate databases, implement authentication and authorization, and deploy applications to Azure services. Through hands-on projects and real-world examples, you\'ll gain the skills needed to build enterprise-grade applications from start to finish.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 20:54:46', '2026-06-16 14:16:01', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"706\\\" data-end=\\\"753\\\">By the end of this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"755\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"167h7b4\\\" data-start=\\\"755\\\" data-end=\\\"825\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the architecture and features of ASP.NET Core and Blazor.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"15owyfn\\\" data-start=\\\"826\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\">\\r\\nBuild responsive web applications using Blazor Server and Blazor WebAssembly.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"b2kky1\\\" data-start=\\\"906\\\" data-end=\\\"947\\\">\\r\\nDevelop RESTful APIs with ASP.NET Core.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"17r1j6d\\\" data-start=\\\"948\\\" data-end=\\\"1023\\\">\\r\\nImplement dependency injection, middleware, and configuration management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12thix4\\\" data-start=\\\"1024\\\" data-end=\\\"1092\\\">\\r\\nConnect applications to SQL databases using Entity Framework Core.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1q189f7\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\" data-end=\\\"1150\\\">\\r\\nCreate secure authentication and authorization systems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"rt4y9f\\\" data-start=\\\"1151\\\" data-end=\\\"1240\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate Azure services such as App Service, Azure SQL Database, and Storage Accounts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2xegi6\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\" data-end=\\\"1303\\\">\\r\\nDeploy, monitor, and manage applications on Microsoft Azure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pk58rf\\\" data-start=\\\"1304\\\" data-end=\\\"1370\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for performance, scalability, and security.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"u7ztx6\\\" data-start=\\\"1371\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">\\r\\nBuild and publish a complete cloud-ready web application using ASP.NET Core and Blazor.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 17, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 38, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
