(644, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Looping Techniques for Beginners\",\"hi\":\"Python Looping Techniques for Beginners\"}', 'python-looping-techniques-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/bbc07888-fa14-4597-b915-6e96c4694b0e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/bbc07888-fa14-4597-b915-6e96c4694b0e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"64\\\" data-end=\\\"518\\\">Learn the fundamentals of looping in Python and discover how to automate repetitive tasks efficiently. This beginner-friendly course covers the most commonly used loop structures, including <code data-start=\\\"254\\\" data-end=\\\"259\\\">for<\\/code> loops, <code data-start=\\\"267\\\" data-end=\\\"274\\\">while<\\/code> loops, nested loops, loop control statements, and practical iteration techniques. Through hands-on examples and exercises, you will gain the confidence to write cleaner, more efficient Python programs and solve real-world problems using loops.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 21:01:30', '2026-06-20 15:44:11', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"547\\\" data-end=\\\"599\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"601\\\" data-end=\\\"1277\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1u2klqa\\\" data-start=\\\"601\\\" data-end=\\\"665\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the purpose and importance of loops in programming.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2yrozh\\\" data-start=\\\"666\\\" data-end=\\\"762\\\">\\r\\nUse <code data-start=\\\"672\\\" data-end=\\\"677\\\">for<\\/code> loops to iterate through sequences such as lists, tuples, strings, and dictionaries.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1oe4mjf\\\" data-start=\\\"763\\\" data-end=\\\"821\\\">\\r\\nApply <code data-start=\\\"771\\\" data-end=\\\"778\\\">while<\\/code> loops to execute code based on conditions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"i67e3f\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\" data-end=\\\"896\\\">\\r\\nControl loop execution using <code data-start=\\\"853\\\" data-end=\\\"860\\\">break<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"862\\\" data-end=\\\"872\\\">continue<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"878\\\" data-end=\\\"884\\\">pass<\\/code> statements.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"j5bmm2\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\" data-end=\\\"959\\\">\\r\\nWork with nested loops for handling complex iteration tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xr78kg\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\" data-end=\\\"1032\\\">\\r\\nUtilize built-in functions like <code data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-end=\\\"1003\\\">range()<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"1005\\\" data-end=\\\"1018\\\">enumerate()<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"1024\\\" data-end=\\\"1031\\\">zip()<\\/code>.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"o1xm04\\\" data-start=\\\"1033\\\" data-end=\\\"1090\\\">\\r\\nProcess and manipulate collections of data efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a8bmxw\\\" data-start=\\\"1091\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">\\r\\nWrite Python programs that automate repetitive operations.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ok8qaj\\\" data-start=\\\"1152\\\" data-end=\\\"1212\\\">\\r\\nDebug and optimize loop-based code for better performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"v4yoq2\\\" data-start=\\\"1213\\\" data-end=\\\"1277\\\">\\r\\nBuild practical mini-projects using Python looping techniques.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(645, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Complete React with Redux\",\"hi\":\"Complete React with Redux\"}', 'complete-react-with-redux', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/074e70cb-d169-4f8f-8a4d-32680f50edbf.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/074e70cb-d169-4f8f-8a4d-32680f50edbf.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"51\\\" data-end=\\\"470\\\">Master modern React development and state management with Redux through a hands-on, project-based approach. This course covers everything from React fundamentals to advanced Redux concepts, enabling you to build scalable, maintainable, and high-performance web applications. You will learn component-based architecture, hooks, routing, Redux Toolkit, API integration, and best practices used by professional developers.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"472\\\" data-end=\\\"660\\\">Whether you are a beginner in React or looking to strengthen your frontend development skills, this course provides practical examples and real-world projects to help you become job-ready.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><h2 data-section-id=\\\"1i3o70h\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\" data-end=\\\"685\\\"><\\/h2><hr data-start=\\\"662\\\" data-end=\\\"665\\\">\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 21:06:28', '2026-06-20 12:59:50', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<li data-section-id=\\\"1l7m1xo\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"812\\\">Understand the fundamentals of React and component-based development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fe6j43\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\" data-end=\\\"858\\\">\\r\\nCreate reusable React components using JSX.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kscmv1\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" data-end=\\\"904\\\">\\r\\nManage application state using React Hooks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ujk46n\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\" data-end=\\\"947\\\">\\r\\nImplement navigation using React Router.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"181vhl5\\\" data-start=\\\"948\\\" data-end=\\\"990\\\">\\r\\nHandle forms and user input efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1jv75ed\\\" data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\">\\r\\nUse Redux for centralized state management.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1a87wu6\\\" data-start=\\\"1037\\\" data-end=\\\"1093\\\">\\r\\nWork with Redux Toolkit to simplify Redux development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1mc37e9\\\" data-start=\\\"1094\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">\\r\\nPerform asynchronous operations using Redux Thunk.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lcpdjd\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1191\\\">\\r\\nConnect React applications with REST APIs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1dqs6j1\\\" data-start=\\\"1192\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\">\\r\\nManage loading, success, and error states effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gxniv0\\\" data-start=\\\"1249\\\" data-end=\\\"1290\\\">\\r\\nOptimize React application performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pjuvs6\\\" data-start=\\\"1291\\\" data-end=\\\"1344\\\">\\r\\nStructure large-scale React and Redux applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"t1eic8\\\" data-start=\\\"1345\\\" data-end=\\\"1396\\\">\\r\\nApply modern frontend development best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15yv2wo\\\" data-start=\\\"1397\\\" data-end=\\\"1456\\\">\\r\\nBuild complete real-world projects using React and Redux.\\r\\n<\\/li><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><li data-section-id=\\\"f8v3ph\\\" data-start=\\\"1457\\\" data-end=\\\"1533\\\">\\r\\nPrepare for React developer interviews and professional development roles.<\\/li>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 44, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(646, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python Programming Series\",\"hi\":\"Python Programming Series\"}', 'python-programming-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/07-06-2026/9dacde7a-c2a9-47b7-bb6f-eb0bdfd65091.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/07-06-2026/9dacde7a-c2a9-47b7-bb6f-eb0bdfd65091.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"50\\\" data-end=\\\"666\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"54\\\" data-end=\\\"83\\\">Python Programming Series<\\/strong> is a comprehensive course designed for beginners and aspiring developers who want to learn Python from the ground up. This series covers Python fundamentals, data types, variables, operators, control statements, functions, object-oriented programming, file handling, exception handling, modules, libraries, and real-world project development. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to build applications, automate tasks, analyze data, and prepare for advanced technologies such as Data Science, Machine Learning, and Web Development.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 21:08:31', '2026-06-19 18:11:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"747\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"1508\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11rdl\\\" data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"805\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand Python syntax and programming fundamentals.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zh9fn4\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-end=\\\"867\\\">\\r\\nWork confidently with variables, data types, and operators.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e9cx42\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\" data-end=\\\"919\\\">\\r\\nImplement decision-making and looping structures.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1f30q5d\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" data-end=\\\"971\\\">\\r\\nCreate reusable code using functions and modules.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jgch3t\\\" data-start=\\\"972\\\" data-end=\\\"1027\\\">\\r\\nApply object-oriented programming concepts in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9sd6oe\\\" data-start=\\\"1028\\\" data-end=\\\"1070\\\">\\r\\nHandle files and exceptions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"om2v8y\\\" data-start=\\\"1071\\\" data-end=\\\"1131\\\">\\r\\nUse Python libraries and packages to enhance applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bgadv3\\\" data-start=\\\"1132\\\" data-end=\\\"1185\\\">\\r\\nPerform data manipulation using Python collections.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"coem5j\\\" data-start=\\\"1186\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\">\\r\\nDevelop real-world Python applications and automation scripts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1f7x43x\\\" data-start=\\\"1251\\\" data-end=\\\"1371\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Python domains such as Data Science, AI, Machine Learning, and Web Development.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q63hjg\\\" data-start=\\\"1372\\\" data-end=\\\"1428\\\">\\r\\nDebug, test, and optimize Python programs efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"sc625r\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\" data-end=\\\"1508\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence to solve coding challenges and technical interview questions<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 79, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(647, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python 3 Basics Series\",\"hi\":\"Python 3 Basics Series\"}', 'python-3-basics-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/5cd65561-ecf5-4921-bfa2-210bb4bf9769.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/5cd65561-ecf5-4921-bfa2-210bb4bf9769.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"48\\\" data-end=\\\"612\\\">Python 3 Basics Series is a beginner-friendly course designed to introduce learners to the fundamentals of Python programming. The course covers essential concepts such as variables, data types, operators, input\\/output operations, conditional statements, loops, functions, and basic data structures. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will develop the skills needed to write simple Python programs and build a strong foundation for advanced programming topics such as data science, web development, automation, and artificial intelligence.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p data-start=\\\"48\\\" data-end=\\\"612\\\">Python 3 Basics Series is a beginner-friendly course designed to introduce learners to the fundamentals of Python programming. The course covers essential concepts such as variables, data types, operators, input\\/output operations, conditional statements, loops, functions, and basic data structures. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will develop the skills needed to write simple Python programs and build a strong foundation for advanced programming topics such as data science, web development, automation, and artificial intelligence.<\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 21:09:31', '2026-06-19 18:11:39', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"641\\\" data-end=\\\"693\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"1372\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1h5olvc\\\" data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"749\\\">\\r\\nUnders