(650, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"SSRS Interview Questions and Answers\",\"hi\":\"SSRS Interview Questions and Answers\"}', 'ssrs-interview-questions-and-answers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/s.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/s.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1i3o70h\\\" data-start=\\\"670\\\" data-end=\\\"688\\\"><\\/h2><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"61\\\" data-end=\\\"668\\\">Prepare confidently for SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS) interviews with this comprehensive course. Designed for beginners, database professionals, BI developers, and reporting analysts, the course covers the most frequently asked SSRS interview questions along with detailed explanations and practical examples. You will learn SSRS architecture, report development, data sources, datasets, parameters, expressions, report deployment, subscriptions, security, and performance optimization techniques. This course helps you strengthen both theoretical knowledge and real-world SSRS implementation skills.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 22:01:55', '2026-06-20 21:17:13', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\" data-end=\\\"1561\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"744\\\" data-end=\\\"1540\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"1949we1\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\" data-end=\\\"799\\\">Understand the fundamentals and architecture of SSRS.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1oyslqy\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"889\\\">\\r\\nExplain key SSRS components such as Reports, Data Sources, Datasets, and Report Server.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ak1eec\\\" data-start=\\\"890\\\" data-end=\\\"947\\\">\\r\\nAnswer common SSRS interview questions with confidence.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1z0zo60\\\" data-start=\\\"948\\\" data-end=\\\"1015\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage tabular, matrix, chart, and drill-down reports.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6v4f5c\\\" data-start=\\\"1016\\\" data-end=\\\"1084\\\">\\r\\nWork with report parameters, filters, and expressions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1v2csaj\\\" data-start=\\\"1085\\\" data-end=\\\"1140\\\">\\r\\nImplement report deployment and management processes.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e8ssnv\\\" data-start=\\\"1141\\\" data-end=\\\"1189\\\">\\r\\nConfigure report subscriptions and scheduling.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"3pi2ox\\\" data-start=\\\"1190\\\" data-end=\\\"1239\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand SSRS security roles and permissions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"88hhvr\\\" data-start=\\\"1240\\\" data-end=\\\"1291\\\">\\r\\nOptimize report performance using best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gkr7pu\\\" data-start=\\\"1292\\\" data-end=\\\"1361\\\">\\r\\nTroubleshoot common SSRS issues encountered in real-world projects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"itgv6r\\\" data-start=\\\"1362\\\" data-end=\\\"1447\\\">\\r\\nDemonstrate practical knowledge required for SSRS developer and BI reporting roles.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ogmj7f\\\" data-start=\\\"1448\\\" data-end=\\\"1540\\\">\\r\\nImprove interview readiness for SQL Server, BI Developer, and Reporting Analyst positions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 5, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 42, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(651, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"SMD Soldering\",\"hi\":null}', 'smd-soldering', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/34bd8bfd-02f9-4d3b-9f0b-d81b50239f13.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/34bd8bfd-02f9-4d3b-9f0b-d81b50239f13.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>SMD Soldering Course: Immerse yourself in the world of Surface Mount Device (SMD) soldering through this<\\/p><p>comprehensive course. Develop essential skills and techniques required to solder SMD components onto printed circuit<\\/p><p>boards (PCBs) with precision. Learn about soldering equipment, solder types, and soldering techniques tailored<\\/p><p>specifically for SMD components. Explore the intricacies of solder paste application, component placement, and reflow<\\/p><p>soldering methods using hot air rework stations and soldering irons. Through hands-on exercises and practical<\\/p><p>demonstrations, you\'ll gain confidence in handling small, delicate SMD components and achieving reliable solder joints. Whether you\'re a hobbyist or aspiring electronics professional, this course equips you with the expertise to excel in SMD<\\/p><p>soldering, enabling you to tackle advanced electronics projects and repairs with finesse. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-02 23:12:24', '2026-06-19 17:36:51', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master precise SMD component placement and soldering techniques for reliable PCB assembly and repair<\\/li><li>Apply appropriate soldering equipment, solder types, and reflow methods for various SMD components<\\/li><li>Demonstrate effective solder paste application and reflow soldering using hot air stations and soldering irons<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common SMD soldering issues such as bridging, cold joints, and insufficient solder connections<\\/li><li>Identify and handle delicate SMD components with confidence for electronics prototyping and repair<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for achieving high-quality, durable solder joints in surface mount technology<\\/li><li>Utilize practical skills to assemble complex SMD circuits for hobbyist and professional electronics projects<\\/li><li>Evaluate soldering quality and perform necessary rework to ensure optimal electronic device performance<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 47, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(652, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"PostgreSQL Beginners Postgresql\",\"hi\":\"PostgreSQL Beginners Postgresql\"}', 'postgresql-beginners-postgresql', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/SS.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/SS.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"50\\\" data-end=\\\"557\\\">This course is designed for beginners who want to learn PostgreSQL, one of the world\'s most powerful open-source relational database management systems. You will learn the fundamentals of database concepts, PostgreSQL installation and configuration, creating databases and tables, writing SQL queries, managing data, and working with database relationships. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to build, query, and manage PostgreSQL databases efficiently.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"559\\\" data-end=\\\"829\\\">The course covers essential topics such as SQL commands, data types, constraints, indexes, joins, views, functions, and basic database administration. By the end of the course, students will be able to design and manage databases confidently for real-world applications.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 00:38:46', '2026-06-20 22:10:27', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\\\"><div data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"819ae436-49ff-4690-a26d-700a8550384d\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-5\\\" class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\" data-turn-start-message=\\\"true\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\\\"><p data-start=\\\"856\\\" data-end=\\\"911\\\">After completing this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol data-start=\\\"913\\\" data-end=\\\"1715\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"kglnno\\\" data-start=\\\"913\\\" data-end=\\\"983\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of relational databases and PostgreSQL.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5d1kf0\\\" data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"1051\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure PostgreSQL on different operating systems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2t4ooo\\\" data-start=\\\"1052\\\" data-end=\\\"1103\\\">\\r\\nCreate, modify, and manage databases and tables.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"icxa6t\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\" data-end=\\\"1169\\\">\\r\\nUse SQL commands to insert, update, delete, and retrieve data.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14acofr\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\" data-end=\\\"1233\\\">\\r\\nApply constraints and data types to maintain data integrity.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6kobkw\\\" data-start=\\\"1234\\\" data-end=\\\"1299\\\">\\r\\nWork with primary keys, foreign keys, and table relationships.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jl6rkk\\\" data-start=\\\"1300\\\" data-end=\\\"1360\\\">\\r\\nUse JOIN operations to combine data from multiple tables.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14fmtpp\\\" data-start=\\\"1361\\\" data-end=\\\"1411\\\">\\r\\nCreate indexes to improve database performance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uw9ggk\\\" data-start=\\\"1412\\\" data-end=\\\"1477\\\">\\r\\nDevelop views and basic stored functions for reusable queries.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1mzt1ii\\\" data-start=\\\"1478\\\" data-end=\\\"1553\\\">\\r\\nPerform basic PostgreSQL administration and database maintenance tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"n8yc35\\\" data-start=\\\"1554\\\" data-end=\\\"1619\\\">\\r\\nDesign simple database solutions for real-world applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xmcrf\\\" data-start=\\\"1620\\\" data-end=\\\"1715\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence to continue learning advanced PostgreSQL concepts and database development.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-flex border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary w-px flex-1 self-stretch\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\"><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 4, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 44, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(653, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"DAX Interview Questions and Answers\",\"hi\":\"DAX Interview Questions and Answers\"}', 'dax-interview-questions-and-answers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/su.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/su.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"61\\\" data-end=\\\"519\\\">Master DAX (Data Analysis Expressions) used in Power BI, SQL Server Analysis Services (SSAS), and Power Pivot. This course is designed to help beginners and experienced professionals prepare for DAX-related interviews by covering essential concepts, commonly asked interview questions, practical examples, and real-world business scenarios. Learn how to create powerful calculations, measures, calculated columns, and advanced analytical solutions using DAX.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 00:39:50', '2026-06-20 07:09:56', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"546\\\" data-end=\\\"598\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"600\\\" data-end=\\\"640\\\">✅ Understand DAX fundamentals and syntax<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"642\\\" data-end=\\\"697\\\">✅ Differentiate between Measures and Calculated Columns<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"699\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">✅ Work with DAX functions such as SUM, CALCULATE, FILTER, ALL, RELATED, and more<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"781\\\" data-end=\\\"833\\\">✅ Understand Row Context and Filter Context concepts<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"835\\\" data-end=\\\"883\\\">✅ Create advanced business calculations and KPIs<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"885\\\" data-end=\\\"939\\\">✅ Apply Time Intelligence functions for trend analysis<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"941\\\" data-end=\\\"987\\\">✅ Optimize DAX formulas for better performance<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-end=\\\"1037\\\">✅ Solve real-world Power BI reporting challenges<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1104\\\">✅ Answer beginner to advanced DAX interview questions confidently<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1106\\\" data-end=\\\"1191\\\">✅ Prepare effectively for Power BI Developer, BI Analyst, and Data Analyst interviews<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 4, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(654, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Python interview questions answers\",\"hi\":\"Python interview questions answers\"}', 'python-interview-questions-answers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/s.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/s.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ekigvw\\\" data-start=\\\"601\\\" data-end=\\\"622\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"62\\\" data-end=\\\"599\\\">Prepare confidently for Python interviews with this comprehensive course covering the most frequently asked Python interview questions and detailed answers. From Python fundamentals to advanced concepts, you\'ll learn how to explain core programming principles, data structures, object-oriented programming, exception handling, file operations, modules, decorators, generators, and real-world coding scenarios. This course is designed for freshers, software developers, data analysts, and professionals preparing for technical interviews.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 00:42:32', '2026-06-17 12:52:42', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1060\\\" data-end=\\\"1107\\\">By the end of this course, you will be able to:<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1109\\\" data-end=\\\"1163\\\">✅ Answer common Python interview questions confidently<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1165\\\" data-end=\\\"1214\\\">✅ Explain Python concepts with practical examples<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1216\\\" data-end=\\\"1268\\\">✅ Demonstrate strong understanding of OOP principles<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1319\\\">✅ Solve coding and logic-based interview problems<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1321\\\" data-end=\\\"1367\\\">✅ Work effectively with Python data structures<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1369\\\" data-end=\\\"1423\\\">✅ Handle exceptions and file operations professionally<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1425\\\" data-end=\\\"1487\\\">✅ Understand advanced topics such as decorators and generators<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1489\\\" data-end=\\\"1535\\\">✅ Improve problem-solving and debugging skills<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1537\\\" data-end=\\\"1602\\\">✅ Prepare for technical rounds in software development interviews<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1604\\\" data-end=\\\"1671\\\">✅ Increase your chances of success in Python-related job interviews<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(655, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Administrative Law Concepts full course\",\"hi\":null}', 'administrative-law-concepts-full-course', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 2, 2026, 10_32_45 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 2, 2026, 10_32_45 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Administrative Law Concepts course: In this course, we will learn about administrative law concepts, including\\r\\nrulemaking, adjudication, judicial review, due process, and agency functions. Gain a solid understanding of how\\r\\nadministrative agencies operate and are regulated.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 02:36:23', '2026-06-14 22:44:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Understand the principles and functions of administrative agencies in government operations and regulation\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply legal frameworks to analyze rulemaking processes and agency decision-making procedures\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Evaluate the role of adjudication within administrative agencies and its impact on stakeholders\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Interpret judicial review standards to assess agency actions and ensure legal compliance\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Explain due process rights and procedural safeguards in administrative hearings and investigations\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify key concepts of administrative law including rulemaking, enforcement, and oversight mechanisms\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze the balance between agency authority and public accountability in administrative law\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop skills to navigate and interpret administrative regulations and legal statutes<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 31, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(656, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Selling Logos online and earn money\",\"hi\":null}', 'selling-logos-online-and-earn-money', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 2, 2026, 10_40_12 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/02-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 2, 2026, 10_40_12 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Selling Logos online course, in this course youâ€™ll learn how to successfully sell logos online and earn money by\\r\\nleveraging your design skills. Whether you\'re a beginner or an experienced designer, this course provides essential\\r\\ninsights on how to create logos that attract buyers on various online platforms. Weâ€™ll start by exploring the\\r\\nfundamentals of logo design and how to make logos that are not only visually appealing but also marketable. You\'ll\\r\\ndiscover the best platforms to sell your logos, such as freelance websites, online marketplaces, and specialized logoselling sites. The course also covers pricing strategies to ensure your work is competitive while maximizing your\\r\\nearnings. Additionally, weâ€™ll dive into building a professional portfolio, showcasing your work in a way that attracts\\r\\nclients, and marketing yourself effectively through social media and other channels. You\'ll learn the differences between\\r\\nselling pre-made logos and offering custom designs, as well as important legal considerations like copyrights and\\r\\nlicensing. By the end, you\'ll be equipped with the tools and knowledge to start earning money by selling logos online<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 03:55:06', '2026-06-20 08:59:21', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>&nbsp;Develop marketable logo designs that attract online buyers using effective branding and visual identity skills\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Identify the best online platforms such as freelance websites and marketplaces to sell logos successfully\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply pricing strategies to maximize earnings while remaining competitive in the online logo marketplace\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create a professional portfolio that showcases logo design skills and attracts potential clients and buyers\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Market logo designs effectively through social media, online channels, and digital marketing techniques\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Differentiate between selling pre-made logos and offering custom logo design services to increase sales opportunities\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Understand legal considerations including copyrights, licensing, and intellectual property rights in logo sales\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize design tools and software to produce high-quality, appealing logos tailored for online sale<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 29, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(657, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Smart Phone Motherboard Repairs\",\"hi\":null}', 'smart-phone-motherboard-repairs', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/03-06-2026/ae2abd2c-296b-4b44-a0b8-b7434c73e873.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/03-06-2026/ae2abd2c-296b-4b44-a0b8-b7434c73e873.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Smartphone Motherboard Repairs Course: Delve into the intricate world of smartphone motherboard repairs through<\\/p><p>this specialized course. Gain comprehensive knowledge and hands-on skills to diagnose and fix motherboard issues in<\\/p><p>various smartphone models. Learn about circuitry, chipsets, and components, and understand common problems like<\\/p><p>water damage, power issues, and connectivity failures. Master advanced techniques for soldering, reflowing, and<\\/p><p>replacing components on the motherboard. Explore software troubleshooting, firmware updates, and data recovery<\\/p><p>methods specific to motherboard repairs. Through interactive lessons, practical exercises, and real-world simulations,<\\/p><p>you\'ll develop the expertise to tackle complex motherboard repairs with confidence. Whether you\'re a technician or<\\/p><p>aspiring to enter the field, this course equips you with the specialized knowledge to excel in smartphone motherboard<\\/p><p>repairs. MovilOne Phone Repair<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-03 13:54:06', '2026-06-19 15:31:45', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Diagnose and troubleshoot complex smartphone motherboard issues using advanced diagnostic tools and techniques<\\/li><li>Perform precise soldering, reflowing, and component replacement on various smartphone motherboards<\\/li><li>Identify and repair common problems such as water damage, power failures, and connectivity issues in smartphones<\\/li><li>Apply firmware updates, software troubleshooting, and data recovery methods specific to smartphone motherboards<\\/li><li>Understand circuitry, chipsets, and component functions to facilitate accurate repairs and replacements<\\/li><li>Utilize real-world simulations and practical exercises to enhance hands-on repair skills and confidence<\\/li><li>Implement safety protocols and best practices during delicate motherboard repair procedures<\\/li><li>Analyze motherboard failure patterns to develop effective repair strategies and solutions<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 29, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 41, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
