 unit (PSU), identify common power-related faults, safely disassemble the TV, remove the defective board, install a replacement board, and verify proper operation. The course covers safety procedures, troubleshooting techniques, board compatibility checks, and post-repair testing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"537\\\" data-end=\\\"556\\\"><\\/h3><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex justify-end\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-05 14:20:37', '2026-06-17 04:02:49', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"557\\\" data-end=\\\"609\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1231\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"1229\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qtkbm9\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"679\\\">&nbsp;Understand the role of the power supply board in Philips LCD TVs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14zt21f\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\" data-end=\\\"738\\\">\\r\\nIdentify common symptoms of power supply board failure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"in0pfa\\\" data-start=\\\"739\\\" data-end=\\\"796\\\">\\r\\nFollow electrical safety precautions during TV repair.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1kn4c4r\\\" data-start=\\\"797\\\" data-end=\\\"866\\\">\\r\\nDisassemble a Philips LCD TV without damaging internal components.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6tuh5z\\\" data-start=\\\"867\\\" data-end=\\\"931\\\">\\r\\nLocate and inspect the power supply board and its connectors.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qw4l90\\\" data-start=\\\"932\\\" data-end=\\\"986\\\">\\r\\nSelect a compatible replacement power supply board.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1r3q1y4\\\" data-start=\\\"987\\\" data-end=\\\"1047\\\">\\r\\nRemove and replace a faulty power supply board correctly.\\r\\n<\