4\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\"><\\/use><\\/svg><\\/button><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/form><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 85, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(675, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Data Science\",\"hi\":null}', 'data-science', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/72934062-887e-4cf3-99f7-0419235d0e50.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/72934062-887e-4cf3-99f7-0419235d0e50.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This Data Science course introduces learners to the complete data science lifecycle, from data collection and cleaning to analysis, visualization, and predictive modeling. Students will explore statistical concepts, machine learning fundamentals, data visualization techniques, and practical tools such as Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Scikit-learn. Through hands-on projects and real-world datasets, learners will gain the skills needed to extract meaningful insights and support data-driven decision-making.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-06 21:09:29', '2026-06-20 05:50:31', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1y4f6nz\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\" data-end=\\\"720\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Data Science and its applications across industries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14wlosa\\\" data-start=\\\"721\\\" data-end=\\\"792\\\">\\r\\nCollect, clean, and preprocess structured and unstructured datasets.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"s60crr\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\" data-end=\\\"873\\\">\\r\\nPerform exploratory data analysis (EDA) using Python and statistical methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"twmd9l\\\" data-start=\\\"874\\\" data-end=\\\"930\\\">\\r\\nCreate insightful data visualizations and dashboards.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1keq00k\\\" data-start=\\\"931\\\" data-end=\\\"1021\\\">\\r\\nApply machine learning algorithms for classification, regression, and clustering tasks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rt4nvv\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\" data-end=\\\"1090\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate and improve predictive models using performance metrics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kiuc3t\\\" data-start=\\\"1091\\\" data-end=\\\"1181\\\">\\r\\nUse popular Data Science libraries such as Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Scikit-learn.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"keuab4\\\" data-start=\\\"1182\\\" data-end=\\\"1251\\\">\\r\\nInterpret analytical results and communicate findings effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"a69ge7\\\" data-start=\\\"1252\\\" data-end=\\\"1325\\\">\\r\\nWork with real-world datasets to solve business and research problems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"rxuuak\\\" data-start=\\\"1326\\\" data-end=\\\"1404\\\">\\r\\nBuild an end-to-end Data Science project portfolio for career advancement.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 77, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(676, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"advanced MySQL Database\",\"hi\":\"advanced MySQL Database\"}', 'advanced-mysql-database', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/a2372810-e7c8-4891-a574-a53f8d7b0d0b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/06-06-2026/a2372810-e7c8-4891-a574-a53f8d7b0d0b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>The Advanced MySQL Database course is designed for learners who want to master database design, optimization, administration, and advanced SQL techniques. This course covers complex queries, stored procedures, triggers, views, indexing strategies, database security, performance tuning, backup and recovery, and replication. Through practical exercises and real-world projects, learners will develop the skills needed to manage enterprise-level MySQL databases efficiently and securely.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>The Advanced MySQL Database course is designed for learners who want to master database design, optimization, administration, and advanced SQL techniques. This course covers complex queries, stored procedures, triggers, views, indexing strategies, database security, performance tuning, backup and recovery, and replication. Through practical exercises and real-world projects, learners will develop the skills needed to manage enterprise-level MySQL databases efficiently and securely.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-06 21:18:48', '2026-06-20 00:55:38', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"thh8t5\\\" data-start=\\\"613\\\" data-end=\\\"674\\\">Design and implement scalable relational database schemas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wzfcxe\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"757\\\">\\r\\nWrite advanced SQL queries using joins, subqueries, CTEs, and window functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15m99tq\\\" data-start=\\\"758\\\" data-end=\\\"829\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage stored procedures, functions, triggers, and views.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dtozer\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"902\\\">\\r\\nOptimize database performance using indexes and query analysis tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fyylc5\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"985\\\">\\r\\nImplement database security through user roles, privileges, and access control.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ck68n2\\\" data-start=\\\"986\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nPerform backup, recovery, and disaster management operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19yi39u\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1115\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and manage MySQL replication for high availability.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4f000l\\\" data-start=\\\"1116\\\" data-end=\\\"1172\\\">\\r\\nMonitor and troubleshoot database performance issues.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gxhg55\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\" data-end=\\\"1237\\\">\\r\\nManage large datasets efficiently in enterprise environments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"63uusj\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\" data-end=\\\"1303\\\">\\r\\nBuild and administer production-ready MySQL database systems.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"thh8t5\\\" data-start=\\\"613\\\" data-end=\\\"674\\\">Design and implement scalable relational database schemas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wzfcxe\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"757\\\">\\r\\nWrite advanced SQL queries using joins, subqueries, CTEs, and window functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15m99tq\\\" data-start=\\\"758\\\" data-end=\\\"829\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage stored procedures, functions, triggers, and views.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dtozer\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"902\\\">\\r\\nOptimize database performance using indexes and query analysis tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fyylc5\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" data-end=\\\"985\\\">\\r\\nImplement database security through user roles, privileges, and access control.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ck68n2\\\" data-start=\\\"986\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nPerform backup, recovery, and disaster management operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19yi39u\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1115\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and manage MySQL replication for high availability.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"4f000l\\\" data-start=\\\"1116\\\" data-end=\\\"1172\\\">\\r\\nMonitor and troubleshoot database performance issues.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gxhg55\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\" data-end=\\\"1237\\\">\\r\\nManage large datasets efficiently in enterprise environments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"63uusj\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\" data-end=\\\"1303\\\">\\r\\nBuild and administer production-ready MySQL database systems.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 24, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
