(677, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"C Programming Series\",\"hi\":\"C Programming Series\"}', 'c-programming-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/61d6f7ad-01a3-4da0-bdfb-8c1c7d596e8e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/61d6f7ad-01a3-4da0-bdfb-8c1c7d596e8e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"601\\\" data-end=\\\"620\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"65\\\" data-end=\\\"599\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"69\\\" data-end=\\\"93\\\">C Programming Series<\\/strong> is a comprehensive beginner-to-intermediate course designed to teach the fundamentals of C programming. This course covers essential programming concepts such as variables, data types, operators, control structures, functions, arrays, pointers, strings, structures, file handling, and memory management. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will develop the skills needed to write efficient C programs and build a strong foundation for advanced programming and software development.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-07 00:45:09', '2026-06-16 21:59:36', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"621\\\" data-end=\\\"673\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"1507\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"131gs0\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"753\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of C programming language and its applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"110qek1\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nInstall and configure a C development environment.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e6uwxo\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"860\\\">\\r\\nWrite, compile, and debug C programs effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qeg95u\\\" data-start=\\\"861\\\" data-end=\\\"928\\\">\\r\\nUse variables, data types, operators, and expressions correctly.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pgzwsk\\\" data-start=\\\"929\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">\\r\\nImplement decision-making and looping statements in programs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"13nfdj3\\\" data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use functions to develop modular programs.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wraxk8\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1109\\\">\\r\\nWork with arrays, strings, and multidimensional arrays.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1vk9m6w\\\" data-start=\\\"1110\\\" data-end=\\\"1177\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand and utilize pointers for efficient memory management.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ov193g\\\" data-start=\\\"1178\\\" data-end=\\\"1225\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manipulate structures and unions.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jes9br\\\" data-start=\\\"1226\\\" data-end=\\\"1272\\\">\\r\\nPerform file input\\/output operations in C.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"h284fu\\\" data-start=\\\"1273\\\" data-end=\\\"1320\\\">\\r\\nApply dynamic memory allocation techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"aryvdr\\\" data-start=\\\"1321\\\" data-end=\\\"1400\\\">\\r\\nDevelop real-world console-based applications using C programming concepts.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1vkzdce\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\" data-end=\\\"1507\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong programming foundation for learning C++, Java, Python, and other programming languages.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol><h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1509\\\" data-end=\\\"1528\\\"><br><\\/h3>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(678, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Cocos2d JS v3 Series\",\"hi\":\"Cocos2d JS v3 Series\"}', 'cocos2d-js-v3-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/3e0bc89b-2f36-47d6-956e-9ff978402417.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/3e0bc89b-2f36-47d6-956e-9ff978402417.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\" data-end=\\\"565\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"65\\\" data-end=\\\"544\\\">This course is designed to teach game development using Cocos2d-JS v3, one of the most popular JavaScript-based 2D game development frameworks. Students will learn the fundamentals of game programming, scene management, sprites, animations, physics, audio integration, user input handling, and game deployment. Through hands-on projects and practical examples, learners will build interactive 2D games while gaining a strong understanding of JavaScript game development concepts.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-07 00:47:04', '2026-06-17 16:43:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"566\\\" data-end=\\\"618\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"620\\\" data-end=\\\"1379\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pxqu6l\\\" data-start=\\\"620\\\" data-end=\\\"681\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the architecture and features of Cocos2d-JS v3.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"aq87fp\\\" data-start=\\\"682\\\" data-end=\\\"743\\\">\\r\\nSet up and configure a Cocos2d-JS development environment.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1mka3x4\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\" data-end=\\\"800\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage game scenes and layers effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qjbjcm\\\" data-start=\\\"801\\\" data-end=\\\"854\\\">\\r\\nWork with sprites, animations, and visual effects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"scf1us\\\" data-start=\\\"855\\\" data-end=\\\"910\\\">\\r\\nImplement touch, mouse, and keyboard input handling.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1toiepu\\\" data-start=\\\"911\\\" data-end=\\\"970\\\">\\r\\nIntegrate sound effects and background music into games.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"3l3nqz\\\" data-start=\\\"971\\\" data-end=\\\"1024\\\">\\r\\nApply physics and collision detection in 2D games.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"f1l2v5\\\" data-start=\\\"1025\\\" data-end=\\\"1085\\\">\\r\\nManage game states, scoring systems, and user interfaces.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qai7ra\\\" data-start=\\\"1086\\\" data-end=\\\"1137\\\">\\r\\nOptimize game performance for different devices.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"gpivmk\\\" data-start=\\\"1138\\\" data-end=\\\"1206\\\">\\r\\nBuild and deploy complete 2D games for web and mobile platforms.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"181a4fv\\\" data-start=\\\"1207\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">\\r\\nDevelop real-world game projects using industry-standard practices<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 84, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(680, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Cocos2d x v2 JavaScript Series\",\"hi\":\"Cocos2d x v2 JavaScript Series\"}', 'cocos2d-x-v2-javascript-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/70050e29-d85a-4bd3-ad9c-f99dd6ca2f5a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/70050e29-d85a-4bd3-ad9c-f99dd6ca2f5a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"485\\\" data-end=\\\"651\\\"><\\/p><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"75\\\" data-end=\\\"483\\\">Learn game development with Cocos2d-x v2 using JavaScript from the ground up. This course is designed for beginners and aspiring game developers who want to create 2D games for desktop and mobile platforms. You will explore the Cocos2d-x framework, understand game architecture, work with sprites, animations, scenes, layers, physics, audio, and user input, and build complete game projects using JavaScript.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-07 00:49:36', '2026-06-17 16:43:01', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"1087\\\" data-end=\\\"1106\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"677\\\" data-end=\\\"1085\\\"><li data-section-id=\\\"b3e5mn\\\" data-start=\\\"677\\\" data-end=\\\"722\\\">Introduction to Cocos2d-x v2 and JavaScript\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1v8qpyc\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\" data-end=\\\"763\\\">\\r\\nSetting up the development environment\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"103qqo\\\" data-start=\\\"764\\\" data-end=\\\"807\\\">\\r\\nUnderstanding scenes, layers, and sprites\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ifm778\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" data-end=\\\"848\\\">\\r\\nWorking with game assets and resources\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fox0i9\\\" data-start=\\\"849\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">\\r\\nHandling user input and touch events\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cg91vb\\\" data-start=\\\"888\\\" data-end=\\\"928\\\">\\r\\nCreating animations and visual effects\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xizxkm\\\" data-start=\\\"929\\\" data-end=\\\"963\\\">\\r\\nImplementing collision detection\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2cq5e2\\\" data-start=\\\"964\\\" data-end=\\\"1007\\\">\\r\\nAdding sound effects and background music\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zjujpy\\\" data-start=\\\"1008\\\" data-end=\\\"1050\\\">\\r\\nManaging game states and scoring systems\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12d5rrb\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\" data-end=\\\"1085\\\">\\r\\nBuilding and publishing 2D games\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(681, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Bootstrap 3 Series\",\"hi\":\"Bootstrap 3 Series\"}', 'bootstrap-3-series', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/3942b802-abe9-4cfb-a6c7-cbddbe749666.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/3942b802-abe9-4cfb-a6c7-cbddbe749666.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\" data-end=\\\"552\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"63\\\" data-end=\\\"531\\\">This Bootstrap 3 Series is designed to help beginners and web developers build responsive, mobile-first websites quickly and efficiently. The course covers Bootstrap 3 fundamentals, including the grid system, typography, navigation components, forms, buttons, panels, tables, modals, and responsive utilities. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, learners will gain the skills needed to create professional and responsive web interfaces using Bootstrap 3.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-07 00:50:34', '2026-06-20 06:33:57', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"553\\\" data-end=\\\"605\\\">By the end of this course, students will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1324\\\" data-end=\\\"1343\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"607\\\" data-end=\\\"1322\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"c1uf4b\\\" data-start=\\\"607\\\" data-end=\\\"680\\\">&nbsp;Understand the fundamentals of Bootstrap 3 and its framework structure.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1c50wgk\\\" data-start=\\\"681\\\" data-end=\\\"743\\\">\\r\\nCreate responsive layouts using the Bootstrap 3 grid system.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1fvo9h7\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\" data-end=\\\"815\\\">\\r\\nDesign mobile-friendly websites that adapt to different screen sizes.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1s97l42\\\" data-start=\\\"816\\\" data-end=\\\"883\\\">\\r\\nUse Bootstrap typography,