(691, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Excel dynamic arrays essentials\",\"hi\":\"Excel dynamic arrays essentials\"}', 'excel-dynamic-arrays-essentials', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/ffd63a18-96c2-4f2d-a7de-17b279cf0ed6.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/ffd63a18-96c2-4f2d-a7de-17b279cf0ed6.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"615\\\" data-end=\\\"634\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"77\\\" data-end=\\\"613\\\">Master the power of Excel Dynamic Arrays and transform the way you work with data. This course introduces the modern dynamic array functions available in Excel, helping you create smarter, faster, and more efficient spreadsheets. You will learn how to use functions such as FILTER, SORT, SORTBY, UNIQUE, SEQUENCE, RANDARRAY, and more to automate data analysis and reporting tasks. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, you\'ll gain the skills needed to manage large datasets, build dynamic reports, and improve productivity.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-09 18:14:12', '2026-06-16 23:17:57', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"635\\\" data-end=\\\"687\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"689\\\" data-end=\\\"1351\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1gvxydl\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\" data-end=\\\"746\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamentals of Dynamic Arrays in Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q2nzoa\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\" data-end=\\\"818\\\">\\r\\nCreate formulas that automatically spill results into multiple cells.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ddghjp\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\" data-end=\\\"886\\\">\\r\\nUse the <strong data-start=\\\"829\\\" data-end=\\\"839\\\">FILTER<\\/strong> function to extract specific data dynamically.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"15oamc7\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\" data-end=\\\"958\\\">\\r\\nApply <strong data-start=\\\"895\\\" data-end=\\\"903\\\">SORT<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"918\\\">SORTBY<\\/strong> functions to organize data efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dud8f5\\\" data-start=\\\"959\\\" data-end=\\\"1013\\\">\\r\\nGenerate unique lists using the <strong data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1003\\\">UNIQUE<\\/strong> function.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q9mjn8\\\" data-start=\\\"1014\\\" data-end=\\\"1089\\\">\\r\\nCreate sequences and sample datasets with <strong data-start=\\\"1058\\\" data-end=\\\"1070\\\">SEQUENCE<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"1075\\\" data-end=\\\"1088\\\">RANDARRAY<\\/strong>.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fboql9\\\" data-start=\\\"1090\\\" data-end=\\\"1151\\\">\\r\\nCombine dynamic array functions for advanced data analysis.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"j8uzdb\\\" data-start=\\\"1152\\\" data-end=\\\"1200\\\">\\r\\nBuild interactive and automated Excel reports.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6bz168\\\" data-start=\\\"1201\\\" data-end=\\\"1256\\\">\\r\\nReduce manual spreadsheet tasks and improve accuracy.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1y8xck0\\\" data-start=\\\"1257\\\" data-end=\\\"1351\\\">\\r\\nApply modern Excel techniques in business, finance, reporting, and data management projects.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\\\"ntj9mr\\\" data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1372\\\"><br><\\/h3>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(692, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"AutoCAD dynamic blocks for architecture\",\"hi\":\"AutoCAD dynamic blocks for architecture\"}', 'autocad-dynamic-blocks-for-architecture', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/0d06a6ba-b4c6-424f-8d19-dddb27d5ba0e.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/0d06a6ba-b4c6-424f-8d19-dddb27d5ba0e.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"bykqlh\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\" data-end=\\\"614\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"84\\\" data-end=\\\"589\\\">Learn how to create and use Dynamic Blocks in AutoCAD to improve architectural drafting efficiency and accuracy. This course covers the fundamentals of dynamic block creation, parameters, actions, visibility states, stretch functions, and reusable architectural components such as doors, windows, furniture, and fixtures. Through practical examples and real-world projects, you will learn how to build intelligent drawing elements that reduce repetitive work and streamline architectural design workflows.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-09 18:17:28', '2026-06-17 01:39:43', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1070\\\" data-end=\\\"1122\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1124\\\" data-end=\\\"1173\\\">✅ Create professional Dynamic Blocks from scratch<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1175\\\" data-end=\\\"1243\\\">✅ Use parameters and actions to make blocks intelligent and flexible<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1245\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">✅ Design adjustable doors, windows, and architectural components<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1311\\\" data-end=\\\"1365\\\">✅ Reduce drawing time through reusable block libraries<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1367\\\" data-end=\\\"1424\\\">✅ Improve consistency and accuracy in architectural plans<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1426\\\" data-end=\\\"1485\\\">✅ Apply visibility states for multiple block configurations<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1487\\\" data-end=\\\"1550\\\">✅ Create scalable and customizable furniture and fixture blocks<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1552\\\" data-end=\\\"1616\\\">✅ Optimize AutoCAD workflows for architectural drafting projects<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1618\\\" data-end=\\\"1674\\\">✅ Build a personal library of smart architectural blocks<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1676\\\" data-end=\\\"1745\\\">✅ Increase productivity in residential and commercial design projects<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(693, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"golang Memory management\",\"hi\":\"golang Memory management\"}', 'golang-memory-management', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/38bc6456-7150-417b-99c0-3c7642258905.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/38bc6456-7150-417b-99c0-3c7642258905.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to memory management in Go (Golang). You will learn how Go handles memory allocation, stack and heap management, garbage collection, pointers, escape analysis, and performance optimization techniques. Through practical examples and real-world scenarios, you\'ll understand how to write efficient, scalable, and memory-safe Go applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to memory management in Go (Golang). You will learn how Go handles memory allocation, stack and heap management, garbage collection, pointers, escape analysis, and performance optimization techniques. Through practical examples and real-world scenarios, you\'ll understand how to write efficient, scalable, and memory-safe Go applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-09 19:27:15', '2026-06-09 21:11:53', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"qsbtil\\\" data-start=\\\"515\\\" data-end=\\\"577\\\">Understand the fundamentals of memory management in Golang.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11zdvop\\\" data-start=\\\"578\\\" data-end=\\\"636\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between stack and heap memory allocation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sxtsav\\\" data-start=\\\"637\\\" data-end=\\\"711\\\">\\r\\nExplain how Go\'s garbage collector works and its impact on performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ic6fzt\\\" data-start=\\\"712\\\" data-end=\\\"772\\\">\\r\\nUse pointers effectively while maintaining memory safety.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rxmqzo\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\" data-end=\\\"834\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand escape analysis and optimize memory allocation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cd5amo\\\" data-start=\\\"835\\\" data-end=\\\"907\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and prevent common memory-related issues in Go applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gix4vl\\\" data-start=\\\"908\\\" data-end=\\\"969\\\">\\r\\nMonitor and profile memory usage using Go profiling tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xbddcp\\\" data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"1053\\\">\\r\\nOptimize application performance through efficient memory management techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3znsy4\\\" data-start=\\\"1054\\\" data-end=\\\"1109\\\">\\r\\nBuild scalable and high-performance Go applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12kr3pl\\\" data-start=\\\"1110\\\" data-end=\\\"1199\\\">\\r\\nApply best practices for writing memory-efficient Go code in production environments.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"qsbtil\\\" data-start=\\\"515\\\" data-end=\\\"577\\\">Understand the fundamentals of memory management in Golang.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"11zdvop\\\" data-start=\\\"578\\\" data-end=\\\"636\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between stack and heap memory allocation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sxtsav\\\" data-start=\\\"637\\\" data-end=\\\"711\\\">\\r\\nExplain how Go\'s garbage collector works and its impact on performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ic6fzt\\\" data-start=\\\"712\\\" data-end=\\\"772\\\">\\r\\nUse pointers effectively while maintaining memory safety.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rxmqzo\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\" data-end=\\\"834\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand escape analysis and optimize memory allocation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cd5amo\\\" data-start=\\\"835\\\" data-end=\\\"907\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and prevent common memory-related issues in Go applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li