(694, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"What is Data Structure by C++\",\"hi\":\"What is Data Structure by C++\"}', 'what-is-data-structure-by-c', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/19f972c4-0167-4437-9367-8316a0745290.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/19f972c4-0167-4437-9367-8316a0745290.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concepts of Data Structures using C++. Students will learn how data is organized, stored, and managed efficiently in computer memory. The course covers essential linear and non-linear data structures, their implementation in C++, and practical applications in software development. Through hands-on coding exercises and real-world examples, learners will develop problem-solving skills and understand how data structures improve program efficiency and performance.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concepts of Data Structures using C++. Students will learn how data is organized, stored, and managed efficiently in computer memory. The course covers essential linear and non-linear data structures, their implementation in C++, and practical applications in software development. Through hands-on coding exercises and real-world examples, learners will develop problem-solving skills and understand how data structures improve program efficiency and performance.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-09 19:36:25', '2026-06-18 23:41:27', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1q8tqu9\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\" data-end=\\\"721\\\">Understand the fundamentals of data structures and their importance in programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1yxjjog\\\" data-start=\\\"722\\\" data-end=\\\"782\\\">\\r\\nImplement data structures using C++ programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bh8jpb\\\" data-start=\\\"783\\\" data-end=\\\"846\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiat