(695, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Routing Switching Arabic\",\"hi\":\"Routing Switching Arabic\"}', 'routing-switching-arabic', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/49433612-63fc-451f-9bb9-9303d6714b2c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/49433612-63fc-451f-9bb9-9303d6714b2c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Routing and Switching concepts in Arabic, designed for networking beginners and IT professionals. Learners will explore how data travels across networks, how switches and routers operate, and how to configure and troubleshoot network devices. The course covers LANs, WANs, IP addressing, VLANs, routing protocols, switching technologies, and basic network security concepts using practical demonstrations and real-world networking scenarios.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Routing and Switching concepts in Arabic, designed for networking beginners and IT professionals. Learners will explore how data travels across networks, how switches and routers operate, and how to configure and troubleshoot network devices. The course covers LANs, WANs, IP addressing, VLANs, routing protocols, switching technologies, and basic network security concepts using practical demonstrations and real-world networking scenarios.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-09 19:50:35', '2026-06-10 00:07:51', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"ut0h71\\\" data-start=\\\"625\\\" data-end=\\\"679\\\">Understand the fundamentals of computer networking.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"19pl5tx\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\" data-end=\\\"744\\\">\\r\\nExplain the roles of routers and switches in modern networks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"iol8c3\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\" data-end=\\\"791\\\">\\r\\nConfigure basic router and switch settings.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-