(705, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"New Trigonometry\",\"hi\":\"New Trigonometry\"}', 'new-trigonometry', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/f3f0cb94-9142-44c5-9141-94df54043e1b.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/f3f0cb94-9142-44c5-9141-94df54043e1b.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concepts of Trigonometry and their applications in mathematics, science, engineering, and technology. Learners will explore angles, trigonometric ratios, identities, equations, graphs, and problem-solving techniques. Through practical examples and interactive exercises, students will develop a strong understanding of how trigonometry is used to analyze relationships between angles and sides in triangles and real-world situations.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concepts of Trigonometry and their applications in mathematics, science, engineering, and technology. Learners will explore angles, trigonometric ratios, identities, equations, graphs, and problem-solving techniques. Through practical examples and interactive exercises, students will develop a strong understanding of how trigonometry is used to analyze relationships between angles and sides in triangles and real-world situations.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 03:45:16', '2026-06-18 05:25:09', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"2kr34h\\\" data-start=\\\"592\\\" data-end=\\\"658\\\">Understand the basic principles and importance of trigonometry.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tpsa60\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\">\\r\\nCalculate trigonometric ratios such as sine, cosine, and tangent.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ocidwq\\\" data-start=\\\"728\\\" data-end=\\\"787\\\">\\r\\nSolve right-angle and non-right-angle triangle problems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"21e77d\\\" data-start=\\\"788\\\"