(706, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"New Precalculus Science\",\"hi\":\"New Precalculus Science\"}', 'new-precalculus-science', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/6e54f371-9bec-4556-a04c-85a7880c8018.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/6e54f371-9bec-4556-a04c-85a7880c8018.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a strong foundation in Precalculus by bridging the gap between algebra, geometry, trigonometry, and calculus. Learners will explore functions, graphs, polynomial and rational expressions, exponential and logarithmic functions, trigonometric concepts, sequences, and analytical problem-solving techniques. The course is designed to prepare students for advanced studies in calculus, engineering, physics, data science, and other STEM fields through practical examples and real-world applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a strong foundation in Precalculus by bridging the gap between algebra, geometry, trigonometry, and calculus. Learners will explore functions, graphs, polynomial and rational expressions, exponential and logarithmic functions, trigonometric concepts, sequences, and analytical problem-solving techniques. The course is designed to prepare students for advanced studies in calculus, engineering, physics, data science, and other STEM fields through practical examples and real-world applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 03:49:24', '2026-06-19 22:46:10', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"7ozt4l\\\" data-start=\\\"643\\\" data-end=\\\"709\\\">Understand the fundamental concepts of precalculus mathematics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"45cs5m\\\" data-start=\\\"710\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze and graph various types of functions and their properties.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kxwhvz\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"850\\\">\\r\\nSolve polynomial, rational, exponential, and logarithmic equations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1nm45hg\\\" data-start=\\\"851\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\">\\r\\nApply trigonometric functions and identities to mathematical problems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"tkt1ry\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\" data-end=\\\"999\\\">\\r\\nInterpret and model real-world situations using mathematical functions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1rwwgql\\\" data-start=\\\"1000\\\" data-end=\\\"1058\\\">\\r\\nWork with sequences, series, and mathematical patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pl6n82\\\" data-start=\\\"1059\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">\\r\\nDevelop analytical and critical-thinking skills for complex problem solving.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u8kss3\\\" data-start=\\\"1139\\\" data-end=\\\"1214\\\">\\r\\nUse graphical and algebraic methods to solve equations and inequalities.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1iwrupd\\\" data-start=\\\"1215\\\" data-end=\\\"1292\\\">\\r\\nPrepare effectively for calculus, physics, engineering, and STEM programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9tmmdy\\\" data-start=\\\"1293\\\" data-end=\\\"1382\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong mathematical foundation for advanced scientific and technical studies.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"7ozt4l\\\" data-start=\\\"643\\\" data-end=\\\"709\\\">Understand the fundamental concepts of precalculus mathematics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"45cs5m\\\" data-start=\\\"710\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze and graph various types of functions and their properties.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kxwhvz\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"850\\\">\\r\\nSolve polynomial, rational, exponential, and logarithmic equations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1nm45hg\\\" data-start=\\\"851\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\">\\r\\nApply trigonometric functions and identities to mathematical problems.\\r\\n<\\/l