(707, NULL, NULL, 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"New Physics Science\",\"hi\":\"New Physics Science\"}', 'new-physics-science', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/6f34e67b-3d0a-4672-9197-199efece2056.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/6f34e67b-3d0a-4672-9197-199efece2056.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Physics, covering the fundamental principles that govern matter, energy, motion, and forces in the universe. Learners will explore key topics such as mechanics, thermodynamics, waves, electricity, magnetism, optics, and modern physics. Through practical examples, scientific experiments, and problem-solving exercises, students will develop analytical thinking skills and gain a strong foundation for advanced studies in science, engineering, and technology.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Physics, covering the fundamental principles that govern matter, energy, motion, and forces in the universe. Learners will explore key topics such as mechanics, thermodynamics, waves, electricity, magnetism, optics, and modern physics. Through practical examples, scientific experiments, and problem-solving exercises, students will develop analytical thinking skills and gain a strong foundation for advanced studies in science, engineering, and technology.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 03:52:53', '2026-06-18 07:09:21', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/ul><ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Physics, covering the fundamental principles that govern matter, energy, motion, and forces in the universe. Learners will explore key topics such as mechanics, thermodynamics, waves, electricity, magnetism, optics, and modern physics. Through practical examples, scientific experiments, and problem-solving exercises, students will develop analytical thinking skills and gain a strong foundation for advanced studies in science, engineering, and technology.<\\/li><li>Course Outcomes<\\/li><li>By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/li><li>Understand the fundamental laws and principles of physics.<\\/li><li>\\r\\nAnalyze motion, forces, work, energy, and power using scientific methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nApply Newton\'s Laws of Motion to real-world situations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nExplain concepts of heat, temperature, and thermodynamics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUnderstand wave behavior, sound, and light phenomena.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nAnalyze electrical and magnetic systems and their applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nSolve numerical and conceptual physics problems effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nInterpret experimental data and scientific observations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nApply physics concepts to engineering, technology, and everyday life.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced studies in physics and other STEM fields.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Physics, covering the fundamental principles that govern matter, energy, motion, and forces in the universe. Learners will explore key topics such as mechanics, thermodynamics, waves, electricity, magnetism, optics, and modern physics. Through practical examples, scientific experiments, and problem-solving exercises, students will develop analytical thinking skills and gain a strong foundation for advanced studies in science, engineering, and technology.<\\/li><li>Course Outcomes<\\/li><li>By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"x1o4uj\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\" data-end=\\\"695\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the fundamental laws and principles of physics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"anmn1\\\" data-start=\\\"696\\\" data-end=\\\"772\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze motion, forces, work, energy, and power using scientific methods.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6wilqy\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\" data-end=\\\"831\\\">\\r\\nApply Newton\'s Laws of Motion to real-world situations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"2ciqak\\\" data-start=\\\"832\\\" data-end=\\\"893\\\">\\r\\nExplain concepts of heat, temperature, and thermodynamics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pav80\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\" data-end=\\\"950\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand wave behavior, sound, and light phenomena.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1x7ylzu\\\" data-start=\\\"951\\\" data-end=\\\"1017\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze electrical and magnetic systems and their applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1o1xu33\\\" data-start=\\\"1018\\\" data-end=\\\"1081\\\">\\r\\nSolve numerical and conceptual physics problems effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15oxwtr\\\" data-start=\\\"1082\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">\\r\\nInterpret experimental data and scientific observations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1wvhmzc\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1214\\\">\\r\\nApply physics concepts to engineering, technology, and everyday life.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1cisdga\\\" data-start=\\\"1215\\\" data-end=\\\"1299\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced studies in physics and other STEM fields.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 10, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(708, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"New Organic Chemistry\",\"hi\":\"New Organic Chemistry\"}', 'new-organic-chemistry', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/34627d37-4c04-46f4-bc9b-4a490b030f93.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/09-06-2026/34627d37-4c04-46f4-bc9b-4a490b030f93.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Organic Chemistry, focusing on the structure, properties, reactions, and synthesis of carbon-containing compounds. Students will learn about hydrocarbons, functional groups, reaction mechanisms, stereochemistry, and organic synthesis techniques. Through practical examples, molecular models, and problem-solving exercises, learners will develop a strong foundation for careers and advanced studies in chemistry, medicine, pharmacy, biotechnology, and related sciences.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Organic Chemistry, focusing on the structure, properties, reactions, and synthesis of carbon-containing compounds. Students will learn about hydrocarbons, functional groups, reaction mechanisms, stereochemistry, and organic synthesis techniques. Through practical examples, molecular models, and problem-solving exercises, learners will develop a strong foundation for careers and advanced studies in chemistry, medicine, pharmacy, biotechnology, and related sciences.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 03:56:29', '2026-06-20 01:24:35', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"dno6l7\\\" data-start=\\\"646\\\" data-end=\\\"708\\\">Understand the fundamental principles of organic chemistry.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"pye4ud\\\" data-start=\\\"709\\\" data-end=\\\"774\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and classify organic compounds and functional groups.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1k78p2z\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\" data-end=\\\"843\\\">\\r\\nExplain molecular s