(709, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Inserting New Worksheet in excel\",\"hi\":\"Inserting New Worksheet in excel\"}', 'inserting-new-worksheet-in-excel', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/4b584f65-6837-40f2-909a-769971b245ed.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/4b584f65-6837-40f2-909a-769971b245ed.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to efficiently create, manage, and organize worksheets in Microsoft Excel. Students will learn different methods of inserting new worksheets, renaming sheets, moving and copying worksheets, organizing workbook structures, and improving productivity when working with multiple spreadsheets. The course is ideal for beginners, office professionals, students, and anyone looking to enhance their Excel skills for data management and reporting.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to efficiently create, manage, and organize worksheets in Microsoft Excel. Students will learn different methods of inserting new worksheets, renaming sheets, moving and copying worksheets, organizing workbook structures, and improving productivity when working with multiple spreadsheets. The course is ideal for beginners, office professionals, students, and anyone looking to enhance their Excel skills for data management and reporting.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 04:00:37', '2026-06-18 09:12:24', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"lueje5\\\" data-start=\\\"609\\\" data-end=\\\"672\\\">Understand the purpose and structure of worksheets in Excel.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qlmyur\\\" data-start=\\\"673\\\" data-end=\\\"735\\\">\\r\\nInsert new worksheets using multiple methods and shortcuts.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"3bxxxu\\\" data-start=\\\"736\\\" data-end=\\\"791\\\">\\r\\nRename, delete, and organize worksheets effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id