(710, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Android Eat It New Kotlin\",\"hi\":\"Android Eat It New Kotlin\"}', 'android-eat-it-new-kotlin', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/ee04e8ed-bb83-4bcc-98a1-a8673b5329a8.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/ee04e8ed-bb83-4bcc-98a1-a8673b5329a8.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to build a complete food ordering application, similar to popular food delivery apps, using Kotlin for Android development. Students will learn to design modern user interfaces, manage menus and orders, integrate databases, handle user authentication, and implement real-world app features. Through hands-on projects and practical coding exercises, learners will gain the skills required to develop professional Android applications using Kotlin and Android Studio.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to build a complete food ordering application, similar to popular food delivery apps, using Kotlin for Android development. Students will learn to design modern user interfaces, manage menus and orders, integrate databases, handle user authentication, and implement real-world app features. Through hands-on projects and practical coding exercises, learners will gain the skills required to develop professional Android applications using Kotlin and Android Studio.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 04:04:45', '2026-06-19 20:36:11', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"15lrgxw\\\" data-start=\\\"644\\\" data-end=\\\"714\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Android app development with Kotlin.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13ju28v\\\" data-start=\\\"715\\\" data-end=\\\"760\\\">\\r\\nSet up and use Android Studio efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lj1q34\\\" data-start=\\\"761\\\" data-end=\\\"817\\\">\\r\\nDesign modern and responsive Android user interfaces.\\r\\n<\\/l