(711, NULL, NULL, 46, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Creating New Content Categories\",\"hi\":\"Creating New Content Categories\"}', 'creating-new-content-categories', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/a61714cc-8209-48eb-a3d7-d4f35c3aa19f.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/a61714cc-8209-48eb-a3d7-d4f35c3aa19f.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to create, organize, and manage content categories effectively within a Content Management System (CMS) or Learning Management System (LMS). Participants will learn best practices for structuring content, designing category hierarchies, improving content discoverability, and maintaining a well-organized digital platform. The course includes practical exercises to help learners build scalable and user-friendly content classification systems.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches learners how to create, organize, and manage content categories effectively within a Content Management System (CMS) or Learning Management System (LMS). Participants will learn best practices for structuring content, designing category hierarchies, improving content discoverability, and maintaining a well-organized digital platform. The course includes practical exercises to help learners build scalable and user-friendly content classification systems.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-10 04:14:46', '2026-06-20 13:37:59', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1md8s4e\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"674\\\">Understand the purpose and importance of content categories.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"iuyoop\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"737\\\">\\r\\nCreate new content categories within a CMS or LMS platform.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"axfufp\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"808\\\">\\r\\nOrganize content using logical category structures and hierarchies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9ig87n\\\" data-start=\\\"809\\\" data-end=\\\"871\\\">\\r\\nApply naming conventions and categorization best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vqd5k2\\\" data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"922\\\">\\r\\nManage parent and child categories effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"i6opbi\\\" data-start=\\\"923\\\" data-end=\\\"973\\\">\\r\\nImprove content navigation and user experience.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"w19f4u\\\" data-start=\\\"974\\\" data-end=\\\"1034\\\">\\r\\nMaintain consistency across content organization systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pw2xt\\\" data-start=\\\"1035\\\" data-end=\\\"1085\\\">\\r\\nTroubleshoot common category management issues.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"72fv2y\\\" data-start=\\\"1086\\\" data-end=\\\"1152\\\">\\r\\nOptimize content discoverability through proper classification.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"oa4745\\\" data-start=\\\"1153\\\" data-end=\\\"1214\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nImplement scalable category structures for future growth.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1md8s4e\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\" data-end=\\\"674\\\">Understand the purpose and importance of content categories.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"iuyoop\\\" data-start=\\\"675\\\" data-end=\\\"737\\\">\\r\\nCreate new content categories within a CMS or LMS platform.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"axfufp\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\" data-end=\\\"808\\\">\\r\\nOrganize content using logical category structures and hierarchies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9ig87n\\\" data-start=\\\"809\\\" data-end=\\\"871\\\">\\r\\nApply naming conventions and categorization best practices.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vqd5k2\\\" data-start=\\\"872\\\" data-end=\\\"922\\\">\\r\\nManage parent and child categories effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"i6opbi\\\" data-s