(712, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Blockchain Development Fundamentals in 2024\",\"hi\":null}', 'blockchain-development-fundamentals-in-2024', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/abda3f13-c15a-4904-b5e3-2d18610f7f20.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/10-06-2026/abda3f13-c15a-4904-b5e3-2d18610f7f20.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Blockchain Development course, in this course we will delve into the fundamentals of blockchain technology, including<\\/p><p>decentralized ledgers, consensus mechanisms, and smart contracts. Through hands-on projects and tutorials, you\'ll learn<\\/p><p>how to develop decentralized applications (DApps) using popular blockchain platforms like Ethereum and Hyperledger.<\\/p><p>From building and deploying smart contracts to integrating blockchain solutions into existing systems, you\'ll gain the<\\/p><p>skills needed to become a proficient blockchain developer. Whether you\'re new to blockchain or seeking to advance your<\\/p><p>skills, this course will provide you with the knowledge and expertise to thrive in the rapidly evolving field of blockchain<\\/p><p>development.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-11 00:17:04', '2026-06-20 02:11:42', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Develop and deploy smart contracts on Ethereum and Hyperledger blockchain platforms using Solidity and Chaincode<\\/li><li>Design and implement decentralized applications (DApps) with practical blockchain development skills and real-world use cases<\\/li><li>Understand consensus mechanisms like Proof of Work and Proof of Stake to ensure blockchain security and integrity<\\/li><li>Integrate blockchain solutions into existing systems for enhanced transparency, security, and decentralization<\\/li><li>Analyze blockchain architecture and choose appropriate platforms for specific business and development needs<\\/li><li>Utilize blockchain development tools, frameworks, and APIs to streamline smart contract creation and deployment<\\/li><li>Apply best practices for blockchain security, testing, and debugging to ensure robust decentralized applications<\\/li><li>Develop scalable, efficient, and secure blockchain solutions tailored to industry-specific requirements<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(713, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Strategic planning for startups step by step\",\"hi\":null}', 'strategic-planning-for-startups-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 11_26_41 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 11_26_41 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the essential skills for driving startup success with our comprehensive online course, Strategic Planning for\\r\\nStartups Step by Step. Designed for aspiring entrepreneurs and business leaders in the Middle East and beyond, this\\r\\ntraining course provides a structured approach to developing effective business strategies. Gain the confidence and\\r\\nexpertise needed to turn innovative ideas into sustainable, profitable ventures. Completing this certified course will\\r\\nenhance your professional skills and support your career growth in the competitive world of business. In this online\\r\\ncourse, you will learn how to craft a solid strategic plan tailored to startup needs. The curriculum covers key concepts\\r\\nsuch as market analysis, competitive positioning, goal setting, resource allocation, and risk management. You will also\\r\\nexplore practical tools and frameworks to implement and monitor your strategic initiatives effectively. What you will\\r\\nlearn: - How to conduct comprehensive market research and competitor analysis - Techniques for defining clear,\\r\\nachievable business objectives - Methods for developing actionable strategies aligned with your startup vision -\\r\\nApproaches to resource management and financial planning - Strategies for managing risks and overcoming common\\r\\nstartup challenges - How to measure progress and adjust your plan for continuous growth This course is ideal for earlystage entrepreneurs, business managers, and professionals seeking to strengthen their strategic thinking skills. Whether\\r\\nyou are launching a new venture or scaling an existing startup, this training course provides valuable insights to support\\r\\nyour success. Why choose this course on our platform: - High-quality, professionally developed content tailored for\\r\\nMiddle East startups - Interactive learning modules and real-world case studies - Access to expert instructors and\\r\\nongoing support - A certified course that bolsters your professional profile - Flexible online format designed to fit your\\r\\nbusy schedule Career opportunities after completing this course include roles such as startup founder, business\\r\\nstrategist, project manager, or business consultant. The skills gained will position you for leadership roles and help you\\r\\nmake informed decisions to accelerate your career growth. Upon successful completion, you will receive a recognized\\r\\ncertificate, validating your expertise in strategic planning for startups. This certification can be a valuable asset in your\\r\\nprofessional development and entrepreneurial journey in the dynamic Middle East business landscape.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-11 15:31:53', '2026-06-19 19:45:56', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop comprehensive market research and competitor analysis skills for startup success\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Create clear, achievable business objectives aligned with startup vision and growth strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design actionable strategic plans focusing on resource management, financial planning, and risk mitigation\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement monitoring tools to measure progress and adapt strategies for continuous startup growth<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(714, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"SaaS business strategy for startup founders\",\"hi\":null}', 'saas-business-strategy-for-startup-founders', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 12_02_04 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 12_02_04 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets to building a successful SaaS business with our comprehensive online course designed specifically for\\r\\nstartups and founders. This training course provides essential insights into SaaS business strategy, enabling\\r\\nentrepreneurs in Saudi Arabia, the Middle East, and beyond to navigate the competitive online market. Gain the\\r\\nprofessional skills needed to develop scalable business models, attract investors, and grow your SaaS company\\r\\nsustainably. Completing this certified course will enhance your career growth prospects, positioning you as a\\r\\nknowledgeable leader in the dynamic world of SaaS. What you will learn: - Core principles of SaaS business models and\\r\\nrevenue streams - Strategies for customer acquisition and retention in a competitive online environment - Effective\\r\\npricing strategies and value proposition development - Key metrics and KPIs to measure SaaS business performance -\\r\\nBest practices for scaling your SaaS startup sustainably - How to leverage technology and innovation for business growth\\r\\n- Marketing and sales strategies tailored for SaaS products - Funding and investment readiness for SaaS startups Who\\r\\nthis course is for: - Aspiring entrepreneurs and startup founders in the SaaS industry - Business professionals seeking to\\r\\nenhance their SaaS strategy expertise - Investors interested in understanding SaaS business models - Anyone aiming to\\r\\nadvance their career in tech and online business development Why choose this course on our platform: Our platform\\r\\noffers industry-leading training courses that combine practical insights with real-world applications. With a focus on\\r\\nbusiness growth and professional skills, this certified course provides the tools you need to succeed in the competitive\\r\\nSaaS landscape. Benefit from expert instructors, comprehensive content, and flexible learning options designed to fit\\r\\nyour busy schedule. Career opportunities: Completing this training course opens doors to various career paths, including\\r\\nSaaS product manager, business development manager, startup founder, or strategic consultant. It equips you with the\\r\\nknowledge to lead innovative SaaS ventures or contribute effectively to the growth of existing SaaS organizations.\\r\\nCertificate: Upon successful completion, you will receive a professional certificate that validates your expertise in SaaS\\r\\nbusiness strategy. This recognized credential can significantly boost your credibility, support your career advancement,\\r\\nand demonstrate your commitment to continuous professional development in the online business sector.<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-11 16:07:47', '2026-06-11 16:41:54', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Identify key SaaS business models and revenue streams for startups and entrepreneurs\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop effective customer acquisition and retention strategies in competitive SaaS markets\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply pricing strategies and value propositions to maximize SaaS business profitability and growth\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Analyze SaaS performance metrics and KPIs to optimize business operations and scalability<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(715, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Habits of successful CEOs for business growth\",\"hi\":null}', 'habits-of-successful-ceos-for-business-growth', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 12_51_41 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 12_51_41 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets of business success with our comprehensive online course, Habits of Successful CEOs for Business\\r\\nGrowth. Designed for aspiring entrepreneurs, managers, and business professionals, this training course provides\\r\\npractical insights and strategies used by top CEOs worldwide. By mastering these habits, you can drive your\\r\\norganizationâ€™s growth, enhance your professional skills, and accelerate your career development. In this course, you\\r\\nwill learn how to develop and implement effective leadership practices, make strategic decisions, foster innovation, and\\r\\nbuild resilient teams. Key topics include time management techniques, effective communication, goal setting, and\\r\\ncultivating a growth mindsetâ€”all essential skills for leading a successful business in todayâ€™s competitive\\r\\nenvironment. This course is ideal for entrepreneurs, business managers, aspiring leaders, and anyone interested in\\r\\ngaining a deeper understanding of executive-level habits that foster business expansion and long-term success. Whether\\r\\nyou are looking to improve your leadership capabilities or prepare for higher responsibilities, this training course offers\\r\\nvaluable knowledge to help you succeed. Why choose this course on our platform? We provide high-quality,\\r\\nprofessionally developed content that combines theoretical frameworks with real-world case studies. Our courses are\\r\\nflexible and accessible, allowing you to learn at your own pace while earning a recognized certificate upon completion.\\r\\nEnhance your professional profile and stand out in the Middle East, Saudi Arabia, UAE, and beyond with this certified\\r\\ncourse focused on business growth and leadership excellence. Upon completing this course, you will receive a certificate\\r\\nthat validates your expertise in adopting effective CEO habits. This certification can boost your career prospects, open\\r\\ndoors to new opportunities, and demonstrate your commitment to continuous professional development in the\\r\\ncompetitive world of business. Take the first step towards transforming your leadership skills and driving business\\r\\nsuccess today. Enroll now and leverage this opportunity to advance your career with a trusted, certified online course.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-11 16:56:40', '2026-06-15 21:45:49', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop strategic decision-making skills to drive business growth and competitive advantage using CEO habits\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply effective time management techniques to enhance productivity and organizational efficiency in a leadership role\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement innovative practices and foster a growth mindset to promote business expansion and resilience\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Cultivate strong communication and leadership skills to build high-performing teams and influence stakeholders<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 14, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(716, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Handling text files in Java for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Handling text files in Java for beginners\"}', 'handling-text-files-in-java-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 04_39_25 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/11-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 11, 2026, 04_39_25 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Enhance your programming skills with our comprehensive online course, \\\"Handling Text Files in Java for Beginners.\\\"\\r\\nDesigned specifically for aspiring developers in the Middle East and beyond, this training course provides a solid\\r\\nfoundation in managing text files using Java, one of the most popular programming languages. Whether you\'re starting\\r\\nyour programming journey or seeking to strengthen your professional skills, this certified course will empower you to\\r\\nhandle real-world data processing tasks efficiently. Throughout this training course, you will learn essential techniques\\r\\nfor reading, writing, and manipulating text files in Java. Gain practical experience with file handling APIs, error handling,\\r\\nand best practices to write clean, efficient code. This course ensures you develop the necessary skills to integrate file\\r\\nmanagement capabilities into your Java applications, boosting your confidence and competence as a programmer. This\\r\\ncourse is ideal for beginners in programming, students, or professionals looking to expand their Java expertise. If you\'re\\r\\ninterested in building a career in software development, data analysis, or back-end programming within the Middle East,\\r\\nthis course provides the foundational knowledge you need to advance. Why choose this course on our platform? We offer\\r\\nexpert-led training, flexible online access, and a focus on practical skills that meet industry standards. Our certified\\r\\ncourse ensures your learning is recognized by employers, enhancing your professional profile and opening doors to new\\r\\ncareer opportunities. Completing this course will prepare you for roles such as Java Developer, Software Engineer, and\\r\\nData Processor. It also serves as a stepping stone for further specialization in programming and software development.\\r\\nUpon successful completion, you will receive a recognized Certificate of Achievement, validating your skills in handling\\r\\ntext files in Java. Enroll today to advance your programming career and unlock new professional opportunities in the\\r\\ndynamic Middle East tech industry. SDET QA <\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Enhance your programming skills with our comprehensive online course, \\\"Handling Text Files in Java for Beginners.\\\"\\r\\nDesigned specifically for aspiring developers in the Middle East and beyond, this training course provides a solid\\r\\nfoundation in managing text files using Java, one of the most popular programming languages. Whether you\'re starting\\r\\nyour programming journey or seeking to strengthen your professional skills, this certified course will empower you to\\r\\nhandle real-world data processing tasks efficiently. Throughout this training course, you will learn essential techniques\\r\\nfor reading, writing, and manipulating text files in Java. Gain practical experience with file handling APIs, error handling,\\r\\nand best practices to write clean, efficient code. This course ensures you develop the necessary skills to integrate file\\r\\nmanagement capabilities into your Java applications, boosting your confidence and competence as a programmer. This\\r\\ncourse is ideal for beginners in programming, students, or professionals looking to expand their Java expertise. If you\'re\\r\\ninterested in building a career in software development, data analysis, or back-end programming within the Middle East,\\r\\nthis course provides the foundational knowledge you need to advance. Why choose this course on our platform? We offer\\r\\nexpert-led training, flexible online access, and a focus on practical skills that meet industry standards. Our certified\\r\\ncourse ensures your learning is recognized by employers, enhancing your professional profile and opening doors to new\\r\\ncareer opportunities. Completing this course will prepare you for roles such as Java Developer, Software Engineer, and\\r\\nData Processor. It also serves as a stepping stone for further specialization in programming and software development.\\r\\nUpon successful completion, you will receive a recognized Certificate of Achievement, validating your skills in handling\\r\\ntext files in Java. Enroll today to advance your programming career and unlock new professional opportunities in the\\r\\ndynamic Middle East tech industry. SDET QA <\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-11 20:48:28', '2026-06-20 19:38:19', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Understand Java file handling APIs for reading and writing text files effectively using Java programming language<\\/p><p>Apply best practices for error handling and exception management in Java text file operations<\\/p><p>Develop Java programs to manipulate, process, and analyze data stored in text files for real-world applications<\\/p><p>Integrate Java text file management techniques into software development projects to enhance data processing capabilities<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Understand Java file handling APIs for reading and writing text files effectively using Java programming language<\\/p><p>Apply best practices for error handling and exception management in Java text file operations<\\/p><p>Develop Java programs to manipulate, process, and analyze data stored in text files for real-world applications<\\/p><p>Integrate Java text file management techniques into software development projects to enhance data processing capabilities<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 14, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0,