(719, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Microphone Systems\",\"hi\":null}', 'microphone-systems', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/1003cab7-25fd-401f-b7b1-12599b897339.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/1003cab7-25fd-401f-b7b1-12599b897339.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Microphone course in hindi, In this course we will learn about Microphone technology, applications, and techniques for<\\/p><p>capturing and processing audio signals.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 01:52:24', '2026-06-20 19:43:04', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master different types of microphones and their applications in professional audio recording and live sound setups<\\/li><li>Apply effective microphone placement and techniques to optimize audio capture quality in various environments<\\/li><li>Identify and troubleshoot common microphone issues to ensure clear and consistent audio signals<\\/li><li>Utilize audio processing tools and methods to enhance microphone recordings for broadcast, music, and film production<\\/li><li>Understand the principles of microphone technology, including polar patterns and frequency response for better sound selection<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for maintaining and handling microphones to prolong equipment lifespan and performance<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 13, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(720, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Regular expressions in Java 2024\",\"hi\":\"Regular expressions in Java 2024\"}', 'regular-expressions-in-java-2024', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/79b24666-13a3-46f8-9427-6c3a6e0da0c4.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/79b24666-13a3-46f8-9427-6c3a6e0da0c4.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Regular Expressions (Regex) in Java, enabling learners to efficiently search, validate, extract, and manipulate text data. Students will explore the <code data-start=\\\"259\\\" data-end=\\\"276\\\">java.util.regex<\\/code> package, including the <code data-start=\\\"300\\\" data-end=\\\"309\\\">Pattern<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"314\\\" data-end=\\\"323\\\">Matcher<\\/code> classes, and learn how to create powerful pattern-matching solutions for real-world applications. The course covers character classes, quantifiers, capturing groups, boundary matchers, validation techniques, and advanced regex features used in modern Java development. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to process text, validate user input, and build robust Java applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Regular Expressions (Regex) in Java, enabling learners to efficiently search, validate, extract, and manipulate text data. Students will explore the <code data-start=\\\"259\\\" data-end=\\\"276\\\">java.util.regex<\\/code> package, including the <code data-start=\\\"300\\\" data-end=\\\"309\\\">Pattern<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"314\\\" data-end=\\\"323\\\">Matcher<\\/code> classes, and learn how to create powerful pattern-matching solutions for real-world applications. The course covers character classes, quantifiers, capturing groups, boundary matchers, validation techniques, and advanced regex features used in modern Java development. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will gain the skills needed to process text, validate user input, and build robust Java applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:08:09', '2026-06-17 04:05:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"iv8ips\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\" data-end=\\\"958\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Regular Expressions and their role in Java applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cmx963\\\" data-start=\\\"959\\\" data-end=\\\"1042\\\">\\r\\nUse the <code data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"979\\\">Pattern<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">Matcher<\\/code> classes to perform regex operations effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ja4lok\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" data-end=\\\"1118\\\">\\r\\nCreate and apply character classes, predefined classes, and quantifiers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1a5vkd1\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1198\\\">\\r\\nImplement capturing groups and backreferences for advanced pattern matching.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"m4ewey\\\" data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1277\\\">\\r\\nValidate user inputs such as email addresses, phone numbers, and passwords.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bui2uc\\\" data-start=\\\"1278\\\" data-end=\\\"1348\\\">\\r\\nExtract, search, replace, and manipulate text using regex patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r1hteo\\\" data-start=\\\"1349\\\" data-end=\\\"1418\\\">\\r\\nHandle regex exceptions and optimize pattern matching performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop real-world Java applications that utilize regular expressions for data processing and validation.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"iv8ips\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\" data-end=\\\"958\\\">Understand the fundamentals of Regular Expressions and their role in Java applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"cmx963\\\" data-start=\\\"959\\\" data-end=\\\"1042\\\">\\r\\nUse the <code data-start=\\\"970\\\" data-end=\\\"979\\\">Pattern<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"984\\\" data-end=\\\"993\\\">Matcher<\\/code> classes to perform regex operations effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ja4lok\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" data-end=\\\"1118\\\">\\r\\nCreate and apply character classes, predefined classes, and quantifiers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1a5vkd1\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1198\\\">\\r\\nImplement capturing groups and backreferences for advanced pattern matching.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"m4ewey\\\" data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1277\\\">\\r\\nValidate user inputs such as email addresses, phone numbers, and passwords.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1bui2uc\\\" data-start=\\\"1278\\\" data-end=\\\"1348\\\">\\r\\nExtract, search, replace, and manipulate text using regex patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"r1hteo\\\" data-start=\\\"1349\\\" data-end=\\\"1418\\\">\\r\\nHandle regex exceptions and optimize pattern matching performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop real-world Java applications that utilize regular expressions for data processing and validation.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 8, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 46, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(721, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Television Signal Processing\",\"hi\":null}', 'television-signal-processing', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/a9b14bcb-d653-4e62-b049-5487d9f39f41.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/a9b14bcb-d653-4e62-b049-5487d9f39f41.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Television Signals course in hindi, In this course, we will learn about Television Signals, covering their transmission,<\\/p><p>processing, and industry applications.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:13:27', '2026-06-20 19:26:47', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand television signal transmission techniques and standards for effective broadcast delivery<\\/li><li>Apply signal processing methods to enhance television image and sound quality in real-world scenarios<\\/li><li>Analyze television signal components, including modulation, demodulation, and filtering processes<\\/li><li>Implement industry-specific television signal processing tools for broadcasting and production<\\/li><li>Troubleshoot common issues in television signal transmission and reception systems<\\/li><li>Optimize television signal quality using modern processing technologies and equipment<\\/li><li>Evaluate the impact of signal processing on viewer experience and broadcast compliance<\\/li><li>Integrate television signal processing principles into multimedia and digital broadcasting workflows<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(722, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java tokens essentials for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Java tokens essentials for beginners\"}', 'java-tokens-essentials-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/70505770-37fc-48f4-9c0b-ffb72edf2a27.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/70505770-37fc-48f4-9c0b-ffb72edf2a27.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concept of tokens in Java programming. Students will learn about the different types of Java tokens, including keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, and separators. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will understand how Java source code is structured and interpreted by the compiler. The course is designed for beginners who want to build a strong foundation in Java programming and improve their coding skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the fundamental concept of tokens in Java programming. Students will learn about the different types of Java tokens, including keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, and separators. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, learners will understand how Java source code is structured and interpreted by the compiler. The course is designed for beginners who want to build a strong foundation in Java programming and improve their coding skills.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:13:37', '2026-06-20 19:25:59', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1qqzbhx\\\" data-start=\\\"636\\\" data-end=\\\"707\\\">Understand the concept and importance of tokens in Java programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dibr52\\\" data-start=\\\"708\\\" data-end=\\\"810\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and differentiate between Java keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, and separators.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"84of7t\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"870\\\">\\r\\nApply Java naming conventions when creating identifiers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1y5qn5f\\\" data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"923\\\">\\r\\nUse various operators correctly in Java programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ism8zs\\\" data-start=\\\"924\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nRecognize different types of literals and their usage in coding.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"t69o28\\\" data-start=\\\"992\\\" data-end=\\\"1058\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze Java source code by identifying its constituent tokens.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nla28j\\\" data-start=\\\"1059\\\" data-end=\\\"1114\\\">\\r\\nWrite simple Java programs using appropriate tokens.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"166vr2d\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\" data-end=\\\"1190\\\">\\r\\nImprove code readability and maintainability through proper token usage.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1johk41\\\" data-start=\\\"1191\\\" data-end=\\\"1254\\\">\\r\\nDebug common syntax errors related to incorrect token usage.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"j5g460\\\" data-start=\\\"1255\\\" data-end=\\\"1324\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Java programming concepts.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1qqzbhx\\\" data-start=\\\"636\\\" data-end=\\\"707\\\">Understand the concept and importance of tokens in Java programming.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dibr52\\\" data-start=\\\"708\\\" data-end=\\\"810\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and differentiate between Java keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, and separators.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"84of7t\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"870\\\">\\r\\nApply Java naming conventions when creating identifiers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1y5qn5f\\\" data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"923\\\">\\r\\nUse various operators correctly in Java programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ism8zs\\\" data-start=\