(723, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java Printing fundamentals\",\"hi\":null}', 'java-printing-fundamentals', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/e14e43b9-ea91-43fb-b2cd-024fdaf472d3.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/e14e43b9-ea91-43fb-b2cd-024fdaf472d3.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces the essential printing techniques used in Java programming. Learners will explore how to display output using Java\'s print statements, including <code data-start=\\\"237\\\" data-end=\\\"246\\\">print()<\\/code>, <code data-start=\\\"248\\\" data-end=\\\"259\\\">println()<\\/code>, and <code data-start=\\\"265\\\" data-end=\\\"275\\\">printf()<\\/code>. The course covers formatting text, displaying variables, creating user-friendly output, and understanding the role of console output in debugging and application development. Through practical examples and exercises, beginners will gain confidence in presenting information effectively within Java applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:19:49', '2026-06-20 19:26:54', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"uitky4\\\" data-start=\\\"664\\\" data-end=\\\"719\\\">Understand the purpose of output statements in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u23gho\\\" data-start=\\\"720\\\" data-end=\\\"784\\\">\\r\\nUse <code data-start=\\\"727\\\" data-end=\\\"736\\\">print()<\\/code> and <code data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"752\\\">println()<\\/code> methods to display information.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"rf8i2o\\\" data-start=\\\"785\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">\\r\\nApply the <code data-start=\\\"798\\\" data-end=\\\"808\\\">printf()<\\/code> method for formatted output.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1qytsm3\\\" data-start=\\\"838\\\" data-end=\\\"900\\\">\\r\\nDisplay variables, strings, and expressions in the console.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vzgg7l\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\" data-end=\\\"959\\\">\\r\\nFormat numerical and text data using format specifiers.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"n3vmln\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\" data-end=\\\"1008\\\">\\r\\nCreate readable and organized console output.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uw7l1q\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\" data-end=\\\"1062\\\">\\r\\nUse output statements for debugging Java programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1j3utxj\\\" data-start=\\\"1063\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\nCombine text and variables effectively in print statements.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"qifew0\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1188\\\">\\r\\nDevelop simple Java applications with user-friendly output.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8zese0\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\" data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced Java programming concepts involving input and output<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 7, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 54, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(724, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Diamond Pattern in Java for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Diamond Pattern in Java for beginners\"}', 'diamond-pattern-in-java-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/e14e43b9-ea91-43fb-b2cd-024fdaf472d3.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/e14e43b9-ea91-43fb-b2cd-024fdaf472d3.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to pattern programming in Java through the popular Diamond Pattern. Learners will understand how nested loops, spaces, and symbols work together to create symmetrical diamond-shaped outputs. The course covers the logic behind pattern design, step-by-step coding techniques, and practical exercises to strengthen problem-solving and programming skills. By mastering diamond patterns, students will gain confidence in using loops and conditional statements, which are essential for advanced Java programming.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to pattern programming in Java through the popular Diamond Pattern. Learners will understand how nested loops, spaces, and symbols work together to create symmetrical diamond-shaped outputs. The course covers the logic behind pattern design, step-by-step coding techniques, and practical exercises to strengthen problem-solving and programming skills. By mastering diamond patterns, students will gain confidence in using loops and conditional statements, which are essential for advanced Java programming.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:23:32', '2026-06-20 17:47:00', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"5fgfsa\\\" data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"752\\\">Understand the concept of pattern programming in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dji87w\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\" data-end=\\\"810\\\">\\r\\nUse nested loops to create structured output patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1c7gdvy\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"875\\\">\\r\\nDevelop diamond patterns using stars, numbers, or characters.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p0wgcr\\\" data-start=\\\"876\\\" data-end=\\\"937\\\">\\r\\nApply logic for managing spaces and alignment in patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10xbq31\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\" data-end=\\\"1007\\\">\\r\\nDifferentiate between upper and lower halves of a diamond pattern.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"134w2qg\\\" data-start=\\\"1008\\\" data-end=\\\"1065\\\">\\r\\nWrite efficient Java programs for symmetrical designs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"mqy9te\\\" data-start=\\\"1066\\\" data-end=\\\"1121\\\">\\r\\nImprove logical thinking and problem-solving skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1ej7ywn\\\" data-start=\\\"1122\\\" data-end=\\\"1177\\\">\\r\\nDebug and correct common errors in pattern programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1u7b7ec\\\" data-start=\\\"1178\\\" data-end=\\\"1239\\\">\\r\\nCreate customized diamond patterns with different symbols.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17x6m2m\\\" data-start=\\\"1240\\\" data-end=\\\"1319\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a strong foundation for advanced loop and algorithm concepts in Java.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"5fgfsa\\\" data-start=\\\"695\\\" data-end=\\\"752\\\">Understand the concept of pattern programming in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"dji87w\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\" data-end=\\\"810\\\">\\r\\nUse nested loops to create structured output patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1c7gdvy\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"875\\\">\\r\\nDevelop diamond patterns using stars, numbers, or characters.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p0wgcr\\\" data-start=\\\"876\\\" data-end=\\\"937\\\">\\r\\nApply logic for managing spaces and alignment in patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10xbq31\