(725, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Butterfly Pattern in Java for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Butterfly Pattern in Java for beginners\"}', 'butterfly-pattern-in-java-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/62e4b3e6-e3c6-4ff9-b58f-c1712600fb65.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/62e4b3e6-e3c6-4ff9-b58f-c1712600fb65.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches beginners how to create the Butterfly Pattern using Java programming. Learners will explore the logic behind pattern printing, including the use of nested loops, spaces, and symbols to form a butterfly-shaped design. Through step-by-step explanations and practical coding exercises, students will develop a strong understanding of loop structures, pattern algorithms, and problem-solving techniques. The course is ideal for anyone looking to strengthen their Java programming fundamentals through hands-on pattern programming.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches beginners how to create the Butterfly Pattern using Java programming. Learners will explore the logic behind pattern printing, including the use of nested loops, spaces, and symbols to form a butterfly-shaped design. Through step-by-step explanations and practical coding exercises, students will develop a strong understanding of loop structures, pattern algorithms, and problem-solving techniques. The course is ideal for anyone looking to strengthen their Java programming fundamentals through hands-on pattern programming.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:28:18', '2026-06-13 21:01:37', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of pattern programming in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUse nested loops effectively to generate complex patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate butterfly patterns using stars, numbers, or custom characters.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nApply logic for managing spaces and symmetrical designs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDifferentiate between the upper and lower halves of a butterfly pattern.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite clean and efficient Java code for pattern generation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nImprove analytical and logical thinking skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDebug common errors in pattern-printing programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nModify butterfly patterns to create customized designs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build a solid foundation for advanced Java programming and coding interviews.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of pattern programming in Java.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUse nested loops effectively to generate complex patterns.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate butterfly patterns using stars, numbers, or custom characters.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nApply logic for managing spaces and symmetrical designs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDifferentiate between the upper and lower halves of a butterfly pattern.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite clean and efficient Java code for pattern generation.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nImprove analytical and logical thinking skills.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDebug common errors in pattern-printing programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nModify butterfly patterns to create customized designs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build a solid foundation for advanced Java programming and coding interviews.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(726, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Door Animation in 3D Unity Game for Beginners\",\"hi\":\"Door Animation in 3D Unity Game for Beginners\"}', 'door-animation-in-3d-unity-game-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/aa8b4d6a-5be3-466e-8e70-0ed140d459cc.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/aa8b4d6a-5be3-466e-8e70-0ed140d459cc.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to creating interactive door animations in 3D games using Unity. Learners will explore the fundamentals of Unity\'s animation system, object transformations, and scripting techniques required to open and close doors smoothly. Through hands-on projects, students will learn how to create realistic door interactions, trigger animations through player actions, and enhance gameplay experiences. The course is designed for aspiring game developers who want to build practical Unity skills while creating engaging 3D environments.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to creating interactive door animations in 3D games using Unity. Learners will explore the fundamentals of Unity\'s animation system, object transformations, and scripting techniques required to open and close doors smoothly. Through hands-on projects, students will learn how to create realistic door interactions, trigger animations through player actions, and enhance gameplay experiences. The course is designed for aspiring game developers who want to build practical Unity skills while creating engaging 3D environments.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:37:06', '2026-06-20 17:58:39', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1okaafa\\\" data-start=\\\"722\\\" data-end=\\\"777\\\">Understand the basics of door animation in Unity 3D.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8rejvp\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">Create and configure door objects within a Unity scene.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1f50sec\\\" data-start=\\\"837\\\" data-end=\\\"898\\\">Use Unity\'s Animation and Animator components effectively.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sx3d37\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">Implement smooth door opening and closing animations.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13ayp8o\\\" data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1007\\\">Apply C# scripting to control door interactions.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sbl55r\\\" data-start=\\\"1008\\\" data-end=\\\"1072\\\">Create trigger zones for automatic or player-activated doors.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6tzjp2\\\" data-start=\\\"1073\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">Manage animation states and transitions using the Animator Controller.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7nh2by\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1197\\\">Debug and troubleshoot common animation issues.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lddyqv\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\" data-end=\\\"1263\\\">Enhance game environments with realistic interactive elements.<\\/li><li>Develop a complete door animation system suitable for 3D game projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1okaafa\\\" data-start=\\\"722\\\" data-end=\\\"777\\\">Understand the basics of door animation in Unity 3D.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"8rejvp\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\" data-end=\\\"836\\\">Create and configure door objects within a Unity scene.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1f50sec\\\" data-start=\\\"837\\\" data-end=\\\"898\\\">Use Unity\'s Animation and Animator components effectively.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"sx3d37\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">Implement smooth door opening and closing animations.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13ayp8o\\\" data-start=\\\"956\\\" data-end=\\\"1007\\\">Apply C# scripting to control door interactions.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1sbl55r\\\" data-start=\\\"1008\\\" data-end=\\\"1072\\\">Create trigger zones for automatic or player-activated doors.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"6tzjp2\\\" data-start=\\\"1073\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">Manage animation states and transitions using the Animator Controller.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7nh2by\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1197\\\">Debug and troubleshoot common animation issues.<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lddyqv\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\" data-end=\\\"1263\\\">Enhance game environments with realistic interactive elements.<\\/li><li>Develop a complete door animation system suitable for 3D game projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 13, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(727, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Zombie AI 3d game development for beginners\",\"hi\":\"Zombie AI 3d game development for beginners\"}', 'zombie-ai-3d-game-development-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/d37b1015-3012-4f1c-93d1-df36c0267b61.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/d37b1015-3012-4f1c-93d1-df36c0267b61.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to developing intelligent zombie enemies in 3D games using modern game development tools and techniques. Learners will explore the fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in games, including enemy detection, pathfinding, chasing, attacking, and state-based behaviors. Through practical projects and step-by-step guidance, students will build a complete zombie AI system that reacts to player actions, creating engaging and challenging gameplay experiences. This course is ideal for aspiring game developers who want to learn AI programming while creating exciting 3D zombie survival games.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course introduces beginners to developing intelligent zombie enemies in 3D games using modern game development tools and techniques. Learners will explore the fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence (AI) in games, including enemy detection, pathfinding, chasing, attacking, and state-based behaviors. Through practical projects and step-by-step guidance, students will build a complete zombie AI system that reacts to player actions, creating engaging and challenging gameplay experiences. This course is ideal for aspiring game developers who want to learn AI programming while creating exciting 3D zombie survival games.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:40:59', '2026-06-20 17:50:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1fmmljl\\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"849\\\">Understand the fundamentals of AI in 3D game development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15y66a3\\\" data-start=\\\"850\\\" data-end=\\\"915\\\">\\r\\nCreate intelligent zombie characters with realistic behaviors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13lzzcd\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"973\\\">\\r\\nImplement player detection and enemy tracking systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1okw94x\\\" data-start=\\\"974\\\" data-end=\\\"1031\\\">\\r\\nDevelop zombie patrol, chase, attack, and idle states.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1p3jlbn\\\" data-start=\\\"1032\\\" data-end=\\\"1096\\\">\\r\\nUse pathfinding techniques for navigation in 3D environments.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"12gjz7q\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\" data-end=\\\"1146\\\">\\r\\nApply scripting to control zombie AI behavior.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1eq6hm1\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\" data-end=\\\"1194\\\">\\r\\nCreate health, damage, and combat mechanics.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"14qethm\\\" data-start=\\\"1195\\\" data-end=\\\"1247\\\">\\r\\nDebug and optimize AI performance in game scenes.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15leo2t\\\" data-start=\\\"1248\\\" data-end=\\\"1304\\\">\\r\\nDesign engaging zombie survival gameplay experiences.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1l34wcl\\\" data-start=\\\"1305\\\" data-end=\\\"1369\\\">\\r\\nBuild a complete AI-driven zombie enemy system for 3D games.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1fmmljl\\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"849\\\">Understand the fundamentals of AI in 3D game development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15y66a3\\\" data-start=\\\"850\\\" data-end=\\\"915\\\">\\r\\nCreate intelligent zombie characters with realistic behaviors.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"13lzzcd\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"973\\\">\\r\\nImplement player detection and enemy tracking systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1okw94x\\\" data-start=\\\"974\