(729, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Creating animation Video in Unity3D Game\",\"hi\":\"Creating animation Video in Unity3D Game\"}', 'creating-animation-video-in-unity3d-game', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/6a51d577-dbde-4f82-9792-6bfb13f95a7a.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/6a51d577-dbde-4f82-9792-6bfb13f95a7a.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches beginners how to create engaging animation videos within Unity 3D. Learners will explore Unity\'s animation tools, Timeline, Animator Controller, Cinemachine, and camera systems to produce professional-quality animated sequences. Through hands-on projects, students will learn how to animate characters, objects, and environments while creating cinematic game videos and cutscenes. The course is ideal for aspiring game developers, animators, and content creators who want to bring their Unity projects to life through animation.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course teaches beginners how to create engaging animation videos within Unity 3D. Learners will explore Unity\'s animation tools, Timeline, Animator Controller, Cinemachine, and camera systems to produce professional-quality animated sequences. Through hands-on projects, students will learn how to animate characters, objects, and environments while creating cinematic game videos and cutscenes. The course is ideal for aspiring game developers, animators, and content creators who want to bring their Unity projects to life through animation.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 02:50:49', '2026-06-20 20:58:11', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"75b9v1\\\" data-start=\\\"708\\\" data-end=\\\"764\\\">Understand the fundamentals of animation in Unity 3D.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17g6d4r\\\" data-start=\\\"765\\\" data-end=\\\"818\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage character and object animations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-