(730, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"Financial english Vocabulary for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'financial-english-vocabulary-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 12, 2026, 11_24_26 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/12-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 12, 2026, 11_24_26 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Financial english Vocabulary course, in this course Master the specialized language of finance with the Financial English\\r\\nVocabulary Course. Designed for professionals and students in the financial sector, this course covers key terms and\\r\\nexpressions used in accounting, banking, investments, and financial reporting. Learn how to confidently discuss budgets,\\r\\nanalyze financial statements, and understand industry jargon. The course includes practical exercises to improve your\\r\\nability to use financial vocabulary in real-world scenarios such as meetings, presentations, and negotiations. Whether\\r\\nyou\'re preparing for a career in finance or enhancing your expertise, this course provides the essential language tools to\\r\\nexcel in global financial environments. Perfect for building professional fluency!<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 03:28:18', '2026-06-20 16:26:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Enhance financial communication skills using key accounting, banking, investment, and financial reporting terminology for professional clarity and confidence\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply financial English vocabulary effectively in meetings, presentations, and negotiations within banking, finance, and investment sectors\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Interpret and analyze financial statements and reports using specialized financial vocabulary for accurate financial decision-making\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Develop the ability to discuss budgets, financial forecasts, and industry jargon confidently in professional financial environments\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize financial English terminology to improve clarity and precision in financial documentation and reporting\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Build professional fluency in financial English to support career growth in banking, accounting, and investment industries\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Master essential financial vocabulary for effective client communication, financial analysis, and industry-specific discussions\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Strengthen understanding of financial concepts through practical exercises focused on real-world financial scenarios<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 14, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
