(736, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Table Fan wiring connection diagram basics\",\"hi\":\"Table Fan wiring connection diagram basics\"}', 'table-fan-wiring-connection-diagram-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/c73585cc-03c7-4d9b-a5bf-504e91d35205.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/c73585cc-03c7-4d9b-a5bf-504e91d35205.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"imdy0b\\\" data-start=\\\"654\\\" data-end=\\\"675\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"87\\\" data-end=\\\"652\\\">This beginner-friendly course explains the fundamentals of table fan wiring and electrical connections. Learners will understand the internal components of a table fan, including the motor, capacitor, speed control switch, power cord, and wiring terminals. Through easy-to-follow wiring diagrams and practical examples, students will learn how electricity flows through the fan circuit, how speed regulation works, and how to safely troubleshoot common wiring issues. This course is ideal for electrical beginners, appliance repair technicians, and DIY enthusiasts.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 21:46:13', '2026-06-20 13:37:03', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"676\\\" data-end=\\\"728\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"730\\\" data-end=\\\"786\\\">✔ Understand the basic working principle of a table fan.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"788\\\" data-end=\\\"879\\\">✔ Identify table fan components such as motor windings, capacitor, switch, and power cable.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"881\\\" data-end=\\\"938\\\">✔ Read and interpret table fan wiring diagrams correctly.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"940\\\" data-end=\\\"1017\\\">✔ Connect table fan wiring safely according to standard electrical practices.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1019\\\" data-end=\\\"1090\\\">✔ Understand the function of speed control switches and motor windings.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1092\\\" data-end=\\\"1156\\\">✔ Perform basic continuity and wiring checks using a multimeter.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1158\\\" data-end=\\\"1228\\\">✔ Troubleshoot common table fan wiring faults and connection problems.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1230\\\" data-end=\\\"1309\\\">✔ Follow electrical safety procedures while repairing or assembling table fans.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1311\\\" data-end=\\\"1382\\\">✔ Gain confidence in performing basic fan maintenance and repair tasks.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(739, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"godown wiring connection diagram\",\"hi\":\"godown wiring connection diagram\"}', 'godown-wiring-connection-diagram', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/4761cb97-169a-40ea-a161-4f667d41f943.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/4761cb97-169a-40ea-a161-4f667d41f943.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"628\\\" data-end=\\\"647\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"104\\\" data-end=\\\"626\\\">This course is designed for beginners, electricians, technicians, and electrical students who want to learn the fundamentals of godown wiring systems. The course explains the working principle of godown wiring, wiring diagrams, circuit connections, switches, lighting control, distribution boards, safety devices, and practical installation methods. Learners will gain hands-on knowledge of wiring layouts used in warehouses, storage buildings, and industrial godowns, ensuring safe and efficient electrical installations.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 21:53:29', '2026-06-20 12:06:28', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"648\\\" data-end=\\\"700\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"1314\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xttcol\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"765\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the concept and purpose of godown wiring systems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"m3gz13\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\" data-end=\\\"822\\\">\\r\\nIdentify electrical components used in godown wiring.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11ygblq\\\" data-start=\\\"823\\\" data-end=\\\"879\\\">\\r\\nRead and interpret godown wiring connection diagrams.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"w86nyj\\\" data-start=\\\"880\\\" data-end=\\\"932\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand phase, neutral, and earth connections.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1hw01dt\\\" data-start=\\\"933\\\" data-end=\\\"1006\\\">\\r\\nInstall and connect switches, lamps, sockets, and distribution boards.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1b271k5\\\" data-start=\\\"1007\\\" data-end=\\\"1072\\\">\\r\\nDesign lighting circuits for warehouses and storage buildings.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"b93skq\\\" data-start=\\\"1073\\\" data-end=\\\"1130\\\">\\r\\nConnect MCBs, RCCBs, and protective devices correctly.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1p0mrjt\\\" data-start=\\\"1131\\\" data-end=\\\"1190\\\">\\r\\nPerform wiring according to electrical safety standards.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uktivf\\\" data-start=\\\"1191\\\" data-end=\\\"1250\\\">\\r\\nTroubleshoot common wiring faults and connection issues.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1oqh2gq\\\" data-start=\\\"1251\\\" data-end=\\\"1314\\\">\\r\\nComplete a practical godown wiring project with confidence.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(740, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Fluorescent tube light wiring basics\",\"hi\":\"Fluorescent tube light wiring basics\"}', 'fluorescent-tube-light-wiring-basics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"568\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"63\\\">Fluorescent Tube Light Wiring Basics<\\/strong> is a beginner-friendly course designed to teach the fundamental principles of fluorescent tube light installation, wiring, and operation. Learners will understand the function of key components such as the tube light, choke (ballast), starter, holder, switch, and power supply. Through clear wiring diagrams and practical examples, students will gain the knowledge and confidence to safely wire, troubleshoot, and maintain fluorescent lighting systems used in homes, offices, and industrial environments.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 21:54:54', '2026-06-20 12:06:28', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"595\\\" data-end=\\\"647\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"649\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"pvuqdw\\\" data-start=\\\"649\\\" data-end=\\\"712\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the working principle of fluorescent tube lights.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"15cbsog\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\" data-end=\\\"779\\\">\\r\\nIdentify the main components of a fluorescent lighting circuit.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"sieg2q\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\" data-end=\\\"841\\\">\\r\\nRead and interpret fluorescent tube light wiring diagrams.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zzsqf5\\\" data-start=\\\"842\\\" data-end=\\\"916\\\">\\r\\nPerform correct wiring connections for single tube light installations.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vlzp60\\\" data-start=\\\"917\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the role of starters, chokes, and capacitors in the circuit.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8xoylt\\\" data-start=\\\"992\\\" data-end=\\\"1066\\\">\\r\\nFollow electrical safety practices during installation and maintenance.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1lkorhd\\\" data-start=\\\"1067\\\" data-end=\\\"1142\\\">\\r\\nDiagnose common fluorescent tube light faults and troubleshoot problems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1smvv66\\\" data-start=\\\"1143\\\" data-end=\\\"1216\\\">\\r\\nReplace defective components such as starters, chokes, and tube lamps.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wmkd4z\\\" data-start=\\\"1217\\\" data-end=\\\"1290\\\">\\r\\nTest and verify proper circuit operation using basic electrical tools.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12op00b\\\" data-start=\\\"1291\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\">\\r\\nApply practical wiring skills for residential and commercial lighting projects.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(741, NULL, NULL, 38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 19, '{\"en\":\"Voltmeter Connection With Selector techniques\",\"hi\":\"Voltmeter Connection With Selector techniques\"}', 'voltmeter-connection-with-selector-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/e84e1d31-0006-43db-a9cb-ddba64bcc834.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/19-06-2026/e84e1d31-0006-43db-a9cb-ddba64bcc834.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"7v3y6a\\\" data-start=\\\"604\\\" data-end=\\\"623\\\"><\\/h3><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"602\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"23\\\" data-end=\\\"72\\\">Voltmeter Connection with Selector Techniques<\\/strong> is a practical electrical training course that teaches how to connect and operate a voltmeter using a selector switch for single-phase and three-phase electrical systems. Learners will understand selector switch functions, phase-to-phase and phase-to-neutral voltage measurement methods, wiring diagrams, safety procedures, troubleshooting techniques, and real-world industrial applications. The course combines theory with hands-on demonstrations to help students confidently install and test voltmeter-selector switch circuits.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 21:57:51', '2026-06-20 17:28:40', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"624\\\" data-end=\\\"676\\\">By the end of this course, learners will be able to:<\\/p><p>\\r\\n<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"678\\\" data-end=\\\"1357\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uoo27p\\\" data-start=\\\"678\\\" data-end=\\\"747\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the working principle of analog and digital voltmeters.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"lbdfxh\\\" data-start=\\\"748\\\" data-end=\\\"820\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of selector switches and their applications.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4f3grm\\\" data-start=\\\"821\\\" data-end=\\\"873\\\">\\r\\nRead and interpret voltmeter connection diagrams.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1shnj8d\\\" data-start=\\\"874\\\" data-end=\\\"943\\\">\\r\\nConnect a voltmeter with a selector switch in three-phase systems.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4vsbij\\\" data-start=\\\"944\\\" data-end=\\\"1011\\\">\\r\\nMeasure phase-to-phase and phase-to-neutral voltages accurately.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7k0k1m\\\" data-start=\\\"1012\\\" data-end=\\\"1082\\\">\\r\\nFollow electrical safety standards during installation and testing.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"f4gsg1\\\" data-start=\\\"1083\\\" data-end=\\\"1136\\\">\\r\\nTroubleshoot common wiring and measurement errors.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1aqxtdg\\\" data-start=\\\"1137\\\" data-end=\\\"1209\\\">\\r\\nVerify voltage readings and ensure correct selector switch operation.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"126txbr\\\" data-start=\\\"1210\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">\\r\\nApply voltmeter-selector techniques in industrial control panels.\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"134049z\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\" data-end=\\\"1357\\\">\\r\\nPerform practical testing and maintenance of voltage measurement circuits.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
