(747, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"React Js features for beginner\",\"hi\":\"React Js features for beginner\"}', 'react-js-features-for-beginner', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/455ee807-f712-40ea-a9d2-b21cd0beb36c.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/455ee807-f712-40ea-a9d2-b21cd0beb36c.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Discover the powerful features of React JS and learn how to build modern, interactive web applications. This beginner-friendly course introduces the core concepts of React, including components, JSX, props, state management, event handling, hooks, and virtual DOM. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, you will learn how React simplifies user interface development and improves application performance. By the end of the course, you will have the skills needed to create dynamic and reusable web components using React JS.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>Discover the powerful features of React JS and learn how to build modern, interactive web applications. This beginner-friendly course introduces the core concepts of React, including components, JSX, props, state management, event handling, hooks, and virtual DOM. Through practical examples and hands-on projects, you will learn how React simplifies user interface development and improves application performance. By the end of the course, you will have the skills needed to create dynamic and reusable web components using React JS.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-14 04:03:15', '2026-06-20 08:59:38', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"wtotr7\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" data-end=\\\"740\\\">Understand the fundamentals and benefits of React JS.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1vycrr3\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"788\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage reusable React components.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1h9rsoj\\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"8