(749, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Lexical Structure in Python for Beginner\",\"hi\":\"Lexical Structure in Python for Beginner\"}', 'lexical-structure-in-python-for-beginner', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/83c69b9c-a0ae-4d55-a45b-1f8311052e3d.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/83c69b9c-a0ae-4d55-a45b-1f8311052e3d.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the lexical structure of Python, the foundation of writing and understanding Python programs. Learners will explore Python tokens, keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, delimiters, comments, indentation, and naming conventions. Through practical examples and coding exercises, students will gain a clear understanding of how Python interprets source code and how to write clean, readable, and error-free programs. This course provides the essential knowledge required before moving on to advanced Python programming concepts.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces the lexical structure of Python, the foundation of writing and understanding Python programs. Learners will explore Python tokens, keywords, identifiers, literals, operators, delimiters, comments, indentation, and naming conventions. Through practical examples and coding exercises, students will gain a clear understanding of how Python interprets source code and how to write clean, readable, and error-free programs. This course provides the essential knowledge required before moving on to advanced Python programming concepts.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-14 04:12:00', '2026-06-20 07:22:40', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1coa2og\\\" data-start=\\\"731\\\" data-end=\\\"788\\\">Understand the concept of lexical structure in Python.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1x7gaj0\\\" data-start=\\\"789\\\" data-end=\\\"833\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and use Python 