\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"lxhj06\\\" data-start=\\\"827\\\" data-end=\\\"883\\\">Understand the fundamentals of blockchain technology.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1s3hgqb\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\" data-end=\\\"944\\\">\\r\\nExplain how blocks, chains, and distributed ledgers work.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1endtdg\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\" data-end=\\\"1016\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the role of cryptographic hashing in blockchain security.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"l0olsr\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\" data-end=\\\"1068\\\">\\r\\nIdentify different types of blockchain networks.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1i6gjs2\\\" data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1125\\\">\\r\\nLearn how consensus mechanisms validate transactions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hrjl83\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" data-end=\\\"1209\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand the basics of smart contracts and decentralized applications (DApps).\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"zlncj5\\\" data-start=\\\"1210\\\" data-end=\\\"1278\\\">\\r\\nExplore the relationship between blockchain and cryptocurrencies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fhdqgz\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\" data-end=\\\"1348\\\">\\r\\nRecognize the advantages and limitations of blockchain technology.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1gebn9n\\\" data-start=\\\"1349\\\" data-end=\\\"1418\\\">\\r\\nAnalyze real-world blockchain use cases across various industries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"og9bzy\\\" data-start=\\\"1419\\\" data-end=\\\"1504\\\">\\r\\nUnderstand key concepts such as decentralization, transparency, and immutability.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1pufm70\\\" data-start=\\\"1505\\\" data-end=\\\"1576\\\">\\r\\nEvaluate the potential impact of blockchain on future technologies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15t4g6s\\\" data-start=\\\"1577\\\" data-end=\\\"1649\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\