(752, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"WordPress Editor Basics\",\"hi\":\"WordPress Editor Basics\"}', 'wordpress-editor-basics', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/e152be21-3478-4703-936b-bbb36f5474dd.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/e152be21-3478-4703-936b-bbb36f5474dd.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn the fundamentals of the WordPress Editor and discover how to create, edit, and publish professional website content with ease. This beginner-friendly course introduces the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg), covering essential tools for creating pages, posts, images, galleries, buttons, and layouts. Through hands-on practice, learners will understand how to format content, manage media, customize blocks, and build visually appealing web pages without coding. By the end of the course, students will have the confidence to create and manage content effectively in WordPress.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>Learn the fundamentals of the WordPress Editor and discover how to create, edit, and publish professional website content with ease. This beginner-friendly course introduces the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg), covering essential tools for creating pages, posts, images, galleries, buttons, and layouts. Through hands-on practice, learners will understand how to format content, manage media, customize blocks, and build visually appealing web pages without coding. By the end of the course, students will have the confidence to create and manage content effectively in WordPress.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-14 04:25:59', '2026-06-20 05:36:33', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"shltp8\\\" data-start=\\\"724\\\" data-end=\\\"782\\\">Understand the WordPress Editor interface and workflow.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1x3a44v\\\" data-start=\\\"783\\\" data-end=\\\"834\\\">\\r\\nCreate and publish posts and pages in WordPress.\\r\\