(755, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Oracle Database basics for Developers\",\"hi\":\"Oracle Database basics for Developers\"}', 'oracle-database-basics-for-developers', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/b3feb113-d193-45a5-bb40-42eb27d06d38.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/b3feb113-d193-45a5-bb40-42eb27d06d38.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces developers to the fundamentals of Oracle Database and its role in modern application development. Learners will explore database concepts, Oracle architecture, tables, data types, constraints, SQL queries, joins, indexes, views, and database security. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, students will learn how to design, create, manage, and query databases efficiently using Oracle SQL. By the end of the course, participants will have a strong foundation in Oracle Database development and be prepared to work with enterprise-level database applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This beginner-friendly course introduces developers to the fundamentals of Oracle Database and its role in modern application development. Learners will explore database concepts, Oracle architecture, tables, data types, constraints, SQL queries, joins, indexes, views, and database security. Through practical examples and hands-on exercises, students will learn how to design, create, manage, and query databases efficiently using Oracle SQL. By the end of the course, participants will have a strong foundation in Oracle Database development and be prepared to work with enterprise-level database applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-14 04:36:57', '2026-06-20 03:57:45', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of Oracle Database systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nExplain Oracle Database architecture and key components.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate and manage database tables using SQL.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWork with Oracle data types and constraints.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nPerform CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite SQL queries to retrieve and manipulate data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUse filtering, sorting, and aggregation functions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nImplement joins to combine data from multiple tables.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate views and indexes to improve database performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUnderstand database security concepts and user management.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDesign simple relational database schemas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDevelop database-driven applications using Oracle Database best practices.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamentals of Oracle Database systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nExplain Oracle Database architecture and key components.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate and manage database tables using SQL.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWork with Oracle data types and constraints.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nPerform CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nWrite SQL queries to retrieve and manipulate data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUse filtering, sorting, and aggregation functions effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nImplement joins to combine data from multiple tables.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nCreate views and indexes to improve database performance.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nUnderstand database security concepts and user management.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDesign simple relational database schemas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nDevelop database-driven applications using Oracle Database best practices.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 8, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(756, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Solve SQL Problems techniques\",\"hi\":null}', 'solve-sql-problems-techniques', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/131dbf4a-0ebe-4b29-b8d4-82f29eeb6677.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/131dbf4a-0ebe-4b29-b8d4-82f29eeb6677.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Master practical SQL problem-solving techniques used by database developers, analysts, and data professionals. This course focuses on understanding common SQL challenges and applying effective solutions using queries, joins, subqueries, aggregate functions, filtering, grouping, and optimization methods. Through hands-on exercises and real-world examples, learners will build confidence in analyzing data, writing efficient SQL statements, and solving complex database problems.<\\/li><li>Whether you are preparing for interviews, improving database skills, or working with business data, this course provides a structured approach to tackling SQL problems efficiently and accurately.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-15 03:05:12', '2026-06-20 20:01:18', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"t6avwu\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-end=\\\"881\\\">Understand common SQL problem-solving strategies and methodologies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lnmwea\\\" data-start=\\\"882\\\" data-end=\\\"944\\\">\\r\\nWrite accurate SQL queries to retrieve and manipulate data.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1kh2j70\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\" data-end=\\\"1008\\\">\\r\\nUse filtering, sorting, and grouping techniques effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1lz2v0g\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\" data-end=\\\"1071\\\">\\r\\nApply JOIN operations to combine data from multiple tables.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"124ge4v\\\" data-start=\\\"1072\\\" data-end=\\\"1134\\\">\\r\\nSolve complex problems using subqueries and nested queries.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"vgwrsd\\\" data-start=\\\"1135\\\" data-end=\\\"1198\\\">\\r\\nUtilize aggregate functions for data analysis and reporting.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"xe0og0\\\" data-start=\\\"1199\\\" data-end=\\\"1268\\\">\\r\\nHandle real-world database scenarios with practical SQL solutions.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"eekpm\\\" data-start=\\\"1269\\\" data-end=\\\"1336\\\">\\r\\nImprove query performance through basic optimization techniques.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"fak1z1\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\" data-end=\\\"1392\\\">\\r\\nDebug and troubleshoot SQL query errors efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10d5fgm\\\" data-start=\\\"1393\\\" data-end=\\\"1463\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nGain confidence in solving SQL interview and workplace challenges.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 10, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(757, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"React Testing with Mock Functions\",\"hi\":null}', 'react-testing-with-mock-functions', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/ebb8faf8-9918-4e46-8ea6-8d5f376f1b91.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/14-06-2026/ebb8faf8-9918-4e46-8ea6-8d5f376f1b91.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Learn how to effectively test React applications using mock functions and modern testing techniques. This course introduces the fundamentals of React testing, helping developers isolate components, simulate user interactions, and verify application behavior with confidence. You will explore mock functions, spies, stubs, and test-driven approaches using popular testing tools such as Jest and React Testing Library.<\\/li><li>Through practical examples and real-world projects, learners will gain hands-on experience in creating reliable, maintainable, and scalable tests for React components and applications.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-15 03:10:11', '2026-06-20 04:04:46', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1ae69n1\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"814\\\">Understand the importance of testing in React application development.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17fq58y\\\" data-start=\\\"815\\\" data-end=\\\"870\\\">\\r\\nCreate and use mock functions with Jest effectively.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"15arrv0\\\" data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"937\\\">\\r\\nTest React components independently from external dependencies.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"uh2gbd\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\" data-end=\\\"1000\\\">\\r\\nSimulate user interactions and validate component behavior.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"lqif51\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" data-end=\\\"1069\\\">\\r\\nMock API calls and asynchronous operations in React applications.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"9s79hx\\\" data-start=\\\"1070\\\" data-end=\\\"1128\\\">\\r\\nVerify function calls, parameters, and returned values.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"nedao0\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\" data-end=\\\"1186\\\">\\r\\nUse React Testing Library to build user-focused tests.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"7f7f6z\\\" data-start=\\\"1187\\\" data-end=\\\"1255\\\">\\r\\nImprove code quality and application reliability through testing.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"ioki51\\\" data-start=\\\"1256\\\" data-end=\\\"1308\\\">\\r\\nDebug and troubleshoot failing tests efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"kkphag\\\" data-start=\\\"1309\\\" data-end=\\\"1379\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">\\r\\nBuild a complete testing workflow for professional React projects.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 8, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(758, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"C++ New course\",\"hi\":\"C++ New course\"}', 'c-new-course', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/10167c77-58d3-47f8-b6c0-c84f35d360b2.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/10167c77-58d3-47f8-b6c0-c84f35d360b2.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed for beginners who want to learn C++ programming from the ground up. Students will explore the fundamentals of C++, including variables, data types, operators, control statements, functions, arrays, pointers, object-oriented programming concepts, and file handling. Through practical examples and coding exercises, learners will develop problem-solving skills and gain confidence in writing efficient C++ programs. The course provides a strong foundation for software development, competitive programming, and advanced computer science topics.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":\"<ul><li>This course is designed for beginners who want to learn C++ programming from the ground up. Students will explore the fundamentals of C++, including variables, data types, operators, control statements, functions, arrays, pointers, object-oriented programming concepts, and file handling. Through practical examples and coding exercises, learners will develop problem-solving skills and gain confidence in writing efficient C++ programs. The course provides a strong foundation for software development, competitive programming, and advanced computer science topics.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-15 11:42:26', '2026-06-20 02:29:28', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"15gz1wc\\\" data-start=\\\"681\\\" data-end=\\\"740\\\">Understand the fundamentals of C++ programming language.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1fvjo0v\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"789\\\">\\r\\nWrite, compile, and debug basic C++ programs.\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1hior5i\\\" data-start=\\\"790\\