(759, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Google sheets basics for beginners\",\"hi\":null}', 'google-sheets-basics-for-beginners', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 04_45_56 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 04_45_56 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the fundamentals of programming with our comprehensive online course, Google Sheets Basics for Beginners.\\r\\nDesigned specifically for those interested in developing essential professional skills, this training course provides a solid\\r\\nfoundation in using Google Sheets for various programming and data management tasks. Whether you\'re looking to\\r\\nenhance your career growth or gain a valuable certification, this course offers practical knowledge that translates\\r\\ndirectly into workplace success. Throughout this online training course, you will learn how to navigate and utilize Google\\r\\nSheets effectively, including creating formulas, managing data, and automating tasks. The course emphasizes hands-on\\r\\npractice, enabling you to apply your new skills immediately. Key learning points include: - Understanding the interface\\r\\nand features of Google Sheets - Creating and managing spreadsheets for data organization - Using formulas and\\r\\nfunctions for data analysis - Automating repetitive tasks with simple scripting - Collaborating on projects in real-time -\\r\\nApplying basic programming concepts within Google Sheets This course is ideal for beginners in programming, data\\r\\nanalysis, or anyone seeking to improve their productivity with professional spreadsheet skills. It is perfect for\\r\\nprofessionals in finance, marketing, project management, or anyone interested in expanding their digital skill set.\\r\\nChoosing this course on our platform guarantees access to high-quality training delivered by experienced instructors.\\r\\nOur flexible online forma