(762, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"environmental law and policy principles\",\"hi\":null}', 'environmental-law-and-policy-principles', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 06_10_50 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 06_10_50 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Environmental law and policy , in this course offers an in-depth exploration of the legal frameworks and policies\\r\\ngoverning environmental protection. This course provides a comprehensive understanding of environmental regulations,\\r\\nincluding key principles such as sustainable development, climate change mitigation, biodiversity conservation, and\\r\\npollution control. Participants will learn how international agreements and local laws intersect to address pressing\\r\\nenvironmental issues, emphasizing real-world case studies and policy analysis. Additionally, the course delves into\\r\\nenvironmental impact assessments, natural resource management, and environmental justice. By the end, learners will\\r\\ngain practical insights into crafting and implementing policies to safeguard ecosystems, ensuring a sustainable future for\\r\\nall.&nbsp;<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-15 22:16:08', '2026-06-20 00:18:35', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop skills to analyze international environmental agreements and local environmental laws for effective policy implementation\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Evaluate environmental regulations and principles such as sustainable development, biodiversity conservation, and pollution control strategies\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply environmental impact assessment techniques to real-world projects for sustainable resource management\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Design policies that integrate climate change mitigation, environmental justice, and natural resource conservation\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Assess the effectiveness of environmental l