(765, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, NULL, NULL, 39, 19, '{\"en\":\"First time managers succes skills\",\"hi\":null}', 'first-time-managers-succes-skills', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 10_00_20 PM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 15, 2026, 10_00_20 PM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>First time managers succes, in this course gain the essential skills to lead with confidence and competence in your first\\r\\nmanagerial role. In this course, we will learn about the key responsibilities, challenges, and strategies that every new\\r\\nmanager must master. Youâ€™ll explore core leadership principles, effective communication techniques, delegation\\r\\nmethods, performance management, and how to build strong, motivated teams. The course also covers time\\r\\nmanagement, conflict resolution, emotional intelligence, and decision-making to help you thrive in your leadership\\r\\njourney. Through real-world scenarios and practical exercises, youâ€™ll learn how to transition from team member to\\r\\nteam leader while earning the trust and respect of your colleagues. Whether you\'re newly promoted or preparing for a\\r\\nmanagerial position, this course will equip you with the tools and mindset needed for success. Join us now and start\\r\\ndeveloping the leadership foundation that will shape your career as a confident and successful first-time manager<br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-16 02:08:36', '2026-06-20 03:26:36', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ol><li>Develop effective communication skills for team engagement and conflict resolution using practical techniques and active listening.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Apply core leadership principles to motivate teams, build trust, and foster a positive work environment.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Implement delegation strategies to enhance productivity, empower team members, and manage workload efficiently.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>Utilize time management and decision-making tools to prioritize tasks, reduce stress, and increase managerial effectiveness.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 21, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(766, NULL, NULL, 66, 0, NULL, NULL, 37, 19, '{\"en\":\"Underground Space Technology\",\"hi\":null}', 'underground-space-technology', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/61d066d4-5b91-49e7-bdf7-69afc9570f60.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/15-06-2026/61d066d4-5b91-49e7-bdf7-69afc9570f60.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Underground Space Technology course explores the utilization of underground spaces for various applications. Gain<\\/p><p>insights into tunneling, underground construction, geotechnical engineering, underground transportation systems, and<\\/p><p>underground storage facilities. This course covers the design, planning, and management of underground space projects,<\\/p><p>as well as the technologies and techniques involved. Join us to acquire knowledge and skills in harnessing the potential of<\\/p><p>underground spaces and contribute to sustainable urban development. IIT Roorkee July 2018<\\/p>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-16 02:51:11', '2026-06-20 00:06:36', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>Design and plan underground tunnels using advanced geotechnical engineering techniques and sustainable construction methods<\\/li><li>Apply tunneling technologies and excavation techniques for underground infrastructure projects effectively<\\/li><li>Evaluate geological and environmental factors influencing underground space development and management<\\/li><li>Implement safety protocols and risk mitigation strategies in underground construction and transportation systems<\\/li><li>Utilize underground space for transportation, storage, and urban development to optimize land use<\\/li><li>Manage underground project planning, budgeting, and resource allocation for efficient execution<\\/li><li>Integrate innovative underground construction technologies to enhance project sustainability and efficiency<\\/li><li>Assess environmental impacts and develop mitigation strategies for underground space projects<\\/li><li>Apply geotechnical data analysis and modeling to support underground engineering decisions<\\/li><li>Develop maintenance and monitoring plans for underground infrastructure ensuring long-term stability<\\/li><li>Utilize digital tools and software for designing and managing underground space projects<\\/li><li>Implement best practices for underground construction safety, quality control, and regulatory compliance<\\/li><li>Innovate with emerging underground technologies to address urban space constraints and sustainability goals<\\/li><li>Collaborate effectively with multidisciplinary teams to deliver complex underground space projects<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 19, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 61, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(767, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 34, '{\"en\":\"C Programming from Scratch\",\"hi\":\"शुरुआत से C प्रोग्रामिंग\"}', 'c-programming-from-scratch', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/Image (2).png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/Image (2).png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-end=\\\"1418\\\">This online C++ programming course is an excellent opportunity for anyone who wants to build a strong foundation in programming from the beginning. Specially designed for students, professionals, and technology enthusiasts, the course helps learners develop practical and professional programming skills to advance their careers. Through this training program, participants will learn the C++ language from basic concepts to advanced techniques, including data types, operators, control flow, functions, overloading, recursion, classes, objects, inheritance, and the Standard Template Library (STL). The course also focuses on problem-solving, practical projects, code optimization, and bug fixing, enabling learners to apply their knowledge effectively in real-world scenarios. It is ideal for students, IT professionals, and entry-level technical candidates who want to strengthen their programming expertise and improve career opportunities. The platform provides high-quality training, guidance from experienced instructors, and an effective learning environment to ensure strong technical understanding. After completing the course, learners will be able to perform better in projects and technical interviews and will receive an internationally recognized certificate, including recognition in the Middle East, which validates their technical competence and enhances professional credibility and career growth.-<strong data-start=\\\"1420\\\" data-end=\\\"1443\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">CS Engineering Gyan<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-end=\\\"1418\\\">This online C++ programming course is an excellent opportunity for anyone who wants to build a strong foundation in programming from the beginning. Specially designed for students, professionals, and technology enthusiasts, the course helps learners develop practical and professional programming skills to advance their careers. Through this training program, participants will learn the C++ language from basic concepts to advanced techniques, including data types, operators, control flow, functions, overloading, recursion, classes, objects, inheritance, and the Standard Template Library (STL). The course also focuses on problem-solving, practical projects, code optimization, and bug fixing, enabling learners to apply their knowledge effectively in real-world scenarios. It is ideal for students, IT professionals, and entry-level technical candidates who want to strengthen their programming expertise and improve career opportunities. The platform provides high-quality training, guidance from experienced instructors, and an effective learning environment to ensure strong technical understanding. After completing the course, learners will be able to perform better in projects and technical interviews and will receive an internationally recognized certificate, including recognition in the Middle East, which validates their technical competence and enhances professional credibility and career growth.-<strong data-start=\\\"1420\\\" data-end=\\\"1443\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\">CS Engineering Gyan<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-16 13:47:51', '2026-06-16 18:10:36', 0, '0', '{\"en\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-end=\\\"77\\\">Understand the fundamental concepts of programming and start coding with C++.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"79\\\" data-end=\\\"148\\\">Build complex programs using data types, operators, and control flow.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"150\\\" data-end=\\\"221\\\">Solve programming problems using functions, overloading, and recursion.<\\/p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"223\\\" data-end=\\\"306\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">Develop object-oriented programming skills using classes, objects, and inheritance.<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>प्रोग्रामिंग की मूलभूत अवधारणाओं को समझें और C++ के साथ कोडिंग शुरू करें।<\\/p><p>डेटा टाइप्स, ऑपरेटर, और कंट्रोल फ्लो का उपयोग कर जटिल प्रोग्राम बनाएं।<\\/p><p>फ़ंक्शंस, ओवरलोडिंग, और रिकर्सन का प्रयोग कर प्रोग्रामिंग समस्याओं का समाधान करें।<\\/p><p>क्लासेस, ऑब्जेक्ट्स, और इनहेरिटेंस का उपयोग कर ऑब्जेक्ट-ओरिएंटेड प्रोग्रामिंग कौशल विकसित करें।<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
