(769, NULL, NULL, 37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Java collections framework step by step\",\"hi\":\"Java collections framework step by step\"}', 'java-collections-framework-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 16, 2026, 11_27_51 AM.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/ChatGPT Image Jun 16, 2026, 11_27_51 AM.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the comprehensive Java Collections Framework step by step, an essential training course designed to elevate\\r\\nyour programming skills. Whether you are a beginner or an experienced developer, this online course provides in-depth\\r\\nknowledge of Javaâ€™s powerful collections API, enabling you to write efficient, scalable, and high-performance\\r\\napplications. This certified course is tailored to support your career growth and help you stay competitive in the evolving\\r\\ntechnology landscape of the Middle East and beyond. Throughout this training course, you will learn how to effectively\\r\\nutilize various collection classes such as lists, sets, maps, and queues. You will also gain practical experience in\\r\\nimplementing algorithms using Java Collections, understanding their underlying principles, and optimizing your code for\\r\\nreal-world applications. The course emphasizes hands-on exercises, real-life examples, and best practices to ensure you\\r\\nacquire professional skills that are directly applicable in the workplace. This course is ideal for aspiring programmers,\\r\\nsoftware developers, and IT professionals seeking to deepen their understanding of Java programming. It is also suitable\\r\\nfor those preparing for certification exams or aiming to enhance their technical portfolio with a valuable skill set.\\r\\nChoosing this course on our platform guarantees access to high-quality training delivered by industry experts. Our\\r\\nflexible online format allows you to learn at your own pace, with comprehensive support and resources to facilitate your\\r\\nlearning journey. Additionally, earning a recognized certificate upon completion can significantly boost your professional\\r\\nprofile and open doors to new career opportunities. Career prospects after completing this Java Collections Framework\\r\\ncourse include roles such as Java Developer, Software Engineer, Backend Developer, Technical Consultant, and\\r\\nApplication Programmer. The skills gained will position you for growth in the competitive Middle East tech market and\\r\\nbeyond. Enroll today to advance your programming expertise, earn a professional certification, and take a significant\\r\\nstep toward achieving your career aspirations in the dynamic world of software development. SDET QA <\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Discover the comprehensive Java Collections Framework step by step, an essential training course designed to elevate\\r\\nyour programming skills. Whether you are a beginner or an experienced developer, this online course provides in-depth\\r\\nknowledge of Javaâ€™s powerful collections API, enabling you to write efficient, scalable, and high-performance\\r\\napplications. This certified course is tailored to support your career growth and help you stay competitive in the evolving\\r\\ntechnology landscape of the Middle East and beyond. Throughout this training course, you will learn how to effectively\\r\\nutilize various collection classes such as lists, sets, maps, and queues. You will also gain practical experience in\\r\\nimplementing algorithms using Java Collections, understanding their underlying principles, and optimizing your code for\\r\\nreal-world applications. The course emphasizes hands-on exercises, real-life examples, and best practices to ensure you\\r\\nacquire professional skills that are directly applicable in the workplace. This course is ideal for aspiring programmers,\\r\\nsoftware developers, and IT professionals seeking to deepen their understanding of Java programming. It is also suitable\\r\\nfor those preparing for certification exams or aiming to enhance their technical portfolio with a valuable skill set.\\r\\nChoosing this course on our platform guarantees access to high-quality training delivered by industry experts. Our\\r\\nflexible online format allows you to learn at your own pace, with comprehensive support and resources to facilitate your\\r\\nlearning journey. Additionally, earning a recognized certificate upon completion can significantly boost your professional\\r\\nprofile and open doors to new career opportunities. Career prospects after completing this Java Collections Framework\\r\\ncourse include roles such as Java Developer, Software Engineer, Backend Developer, Technical Consultant, and\\r\\nApplication Programmer. The skills gained will position you for growth in the competitive Middle East tech market and\\r\\nbeyond. Enroll today to advance your programming expertise, earn a professional certification, and take a significant\\r\\nstep toward achieving your career aspirations in the dynamic world of software development. SDET QA <\\/p>\"}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-16 14:13:41', '2026-06-20 22:03:24', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Master Java Collections API for efficient data storage and retrieval in real-world applications<\\/p><p>Implement Java List, Set, Map, and Queue interfaces to optimize software performance and scalability<\\/p><p>Apply algorithms using Java Collections to solve complex programming problems effectively<\\/p><p>Analyze and optimize Java collection code for high-performance, scalable, and maintainable software solutions<\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Master Java Collections API for efficient data storage and retrieval in real-world applications<\\/p><p>Implement Java List, Set, Map, and Queue interfaces to optimize software performance and scalability<\\/p><p>Apply algorithms using Java Collections to solve complex programming problems effectively<\\/p><p>Analyze and optimize Java collection code for high-performance, scalable, and maintainable software solutions<\\/p>\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 21, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(770, NULL, NULL, 37, 0, NULL, NULL, 35, 19, '{\"en\":\"Unity Photon online multiplayer game\",\"hi\":null}', 'unity-photon-online-multiplayer-game', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/3b15c03d-cb07-4628-a145-637b112a30b5.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/3b15c03d-cb07-4628-a145-637b112a30b5.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<ul><li>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to developing online multiplayer games using <strong data-start=\\\"193\\\" data-end=\\\"202\\\">Unity<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"207\\\" data-end=\\\"249\\\">Photon PUN 2 (Photon Unity Networking)<\\/strong>. Students will learn how to create real-time multiplayer experiences, synchronize players and game objects across networks, manage game rooms and matchmaking, implement player authentication, and optimize network performance. Through hands-on projects, learners will build a fully functional multiplayer game and gain practical experience in networked game development for desktop and mobile platforms.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-16 20:05:05', '2026-06-20 13:11:58', 0, '0', '{\"hi\":null}', '{\"en\":\"<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"n033kq\\\" data-start=\\\"749\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"752\\\" data-end=\\\"796\\\">Understand Multiplayer Game Architecture<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"wfec16\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\" data-end=\\\"887\\\">\\r\\nExplain client-server and peer-to-peer networking concepts used in multiplayer games.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"10mt9lq\\\" data-start=\\\"889\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"892\\\" data-end=\\\"923\\\">Integrate Photon with Unity<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"927\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"mhzq6c\\\" data-start=\\\"927\\\" data-end=\\\"991\\\">\\r\\nConfigure and connect Unity projects to Photon Cloud services.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"140yb2w\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\" data-end=\\\"1103\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"996\\\" data-end=\\\"1034\\\">Implement Multiplayer Connectivity<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1038\\\" data-end=\\\"1103\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"13hgqdb\\\" data-start=\\\"1038\\\" data-end=\\\"1103\\\">\\r\\nCreate and manage game rooms, lobbies, and matchmaking systems.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"etv9s4\\\" data-start=\\\"1105\\\" data-end=\\\"1241\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1108\\\" data-end=\\\"1136\\\">Synchronize Game Objects<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1140\\\" data-end=\\\"1241\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"bl1lti\\\" data-start=\\\"1140\\\" data-end=\\\"1241\\\">\\r\\nDevelop real-time player movement, animations, and object synchronization across networked clients.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"17zxz0y\\\" data-start=\\\"1243\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1246\\\" data-end=\\\"1283\\\">Handle Multiplayer Gameplay Logic<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1287\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1yutohj\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\" data-end=\\\"1374\\\">\\r\\nImplement RPCs (Remote Procedure Calls), event systems, and networked game mechanics.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1v1kcj1\\\" data-start=\\\"1376\\\" data-end=\\\"1473\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1379\\\" data-end=\\\"1401\\\">Manage Player Data<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1405\\\" data-end=\\\"1473\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"h6xv31\\\" data-start=\\\"1405\\\" data-end=\\\"1473\\\">\\r\\nStore and synchronize player information, scores, and game states.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"gmhd7w\\\" data-start=\\\"1475\\\" data-end=\\\"1597\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1478\\\" data-end=\\\"1510\\\">Optimize Network Performance<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1514\\\" data-end=\\\"1597\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"1cmwxds\\\" data-start=\\\"1514\\\" data-end=\\\"1597\\\">\\r\\nReduce latency, minimize bandwidth usage, and improve multiplayer responsiveness.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"1d33jy7\\\" data-start=\\\"1599\\\" data-end=\\\"1734\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1602\\\" data-end=\\\"1646\\\">Develop Cross-Platform Multiplayer Games<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1650\\\" data-end=\\\"1734\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"14ykx1l\\\" data-start=\\\"1650\\\" data-end=\\\"1734\\\">\\r\\nBuild and deploy multiplayer games for PC, Android, and other supported platforms.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"zv7agv\\\" data-start=\\\"1736\\\" data-end=\\\"1863\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1739\\\" data-end=\\\"1782\\\">Debug and Test Multiplayer Applications<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1786\\\" data-end=\\\"1863\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"cvaw59\\\" data-start=\\\"1786\\\" data-end=\\\"1863\\\">\\r\\nIdentify and resolve common networking issues using Photon debugging tools.\\r\\n<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/li><li data-section-id=\\\"165xcy6\\\" data-start=\\\"1865\\\" data-end=\\\"2012\\\">\\r\\n<strong data-start=\\\"1869\\\" data-end=\\\"1910\\\">Create a Complete Multiplayer Project<\\/strong>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1915\\\" data-end=\\\"2012\\\">\\r\\n<ul><li data-section-id=\\\"126nrk8\\\" data-start=\\\"1915\\\" data-end=\\\"2012\\\">\\r\\nDesign, develop, and publish a fully functional online multiplayer game using Unity and Photon.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"hi\":null}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 12, 0, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 46, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(771, NULL, NULL, 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 19, '{\"en\":\"Mobile computing step by step\",\"hi\":\"Mobile computing step by step\"}', 'mobile-computing-step-by-step', NULL, NULL, 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/Mobile.png', 'public/uploads/main/files/16-06-2026/Mobile.png', '0.00', NULL, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the potential of mobile computing with this comprehensive online course designed for aspiring professionals and\\r\\ntechnology enthusiasts alike. As mobile devices continue to revolutionize the way we communicate, work, and access\\r\\ninformation, gaining expertise in mobile computing is essential for career growth in the dynamic field of Computer\\r\\nScience. This training course offers a structured pathway to develop critical skills, enhance your professional profile, and\\r\\nstay ahead in the competitive technology landscape. In this course, you will learn: - The fundamentals of mobile\\r\\ncomputing and its architecture - Mobile application development techniques for Android and iOS platforms - Mobile\\r\\nsecurity best practices and data protection strategies - Cloud integration and mobile network management - Emerging\\r\\ntrends such as 5G, IoT, and wearable technology - How to troubleshoot common issues in mobile environments - Best\\r\\npractices for designing user-friendly and efficient mobile applications This course is ideal for students, IT professionals,\\r\\nsoftware developers, and anyone interested in expanding their knowledge of mobile computing. Whether you are looking\\r\\nto enhance your current skills or pivot your career into mobile app development, this training provides the essential\\r\\nfoundation and advanced insights needed to succeed. Choosing this course on our platform guarantees access to expertled instruction, practical exercises, and a certified course recognized by industry professionals. Our user-friendly online\\r\\nformat allows flexibility to learn at your own pace, making it easier to balance your studies with other commitments.\\r\\nUpon completion, you will be well-equipped to pursue various career opportunities, including mobile application\\r\\ndeveloper, mobile security analyst, systems analyst, and network administrator. This certified course can significantly\\r\\nboost your professional skills and open doors to new roles in the expanding field of mobile computing. Get certified today\\r\\nand take a strategic step forward in your career. Our recognized certification enhances your resume and demonstrates\\r\\nyour commitment to continuous learning in the fast-evolving world of Computer Science and mobile technology. Trouble\\r\\nFree <\\/p>\",\"hi\":\"<p>Unlock the potential of mobile computing with this comprehensive online course designed for aspiring professionals and\\r\\ntechnology enthusiasts alike. As mobile devices continue to revolutionize the way we communicate, work, and access\\r\\ninformation, gaining expertise in mobile computing is essential for career growth in the dynamic field of Computer\\r\\nScience. This training course offers a structured pathway to develop critical skills, enhance your professional profile, and\\r\\nstay ahead in the competitive technology landscape. In this course, you will learn: - The fundamentals of mobile\\r\\ncomputing and its architecture - Mobile application development techniques for Android and iOS platforms - Mobile\\r\\nsecurity best practices and data protection strategies - Cloud integration and mobile network management - Emerging\\r\\ntrends such as 5G, IoT, and wearable technology - How to troubleshoot common issues in mobile environments - Best\\r\\npractices for designing user-friendly and efficient mobile applications This course is ideal for students, IT professionals,\\r\\nsoftware developers, and anyone interested in expanding their knowledge of mobile computing. Whether you are looking\\r\\nto enhance your current skills or pivot your career into mobile app development,