(11, 'Privacy', '{\"en\":\"Privacy Policies\"}', '{\"en\":\"We’re here with you every step way!\"}', '{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-sm-12 ui-resizable\\\" data-type=\\\"container-content\\\"><div class=\\\"breadcrumb_area\\\" style=\\\"background-image: url(https:\\/\\/curiasity.com\\/public\\/frontend\\/infixlmstheme\\/img\\/new_bread_crumb_bg.png);\\\" data-type=\\\"component-blank\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-lg-12 ui-resizable\\\"><div class=\\\"breadcam_wrap\\\"><h4>Privacy Policies <\\/h4><p>Home \\/ We’re here with you every step way! <\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-resizer\\\" title=\\\"Drag to resize\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"ui-resizable-handle ui-resizable-none\\\" style=\\\"z-index: 90;\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"col-sm-12 ui-resizable\\\" data-type=\\\"container-content\\\"><div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-sm-6 ui-resizable col-lg-1\\\" data-type=\\\"container-content\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"col-sm-6 ui-resizable col-lg-10\\\" data-type=\\\"container-content\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"347\\\" data-start=\\\"325\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><br><strong data-end=\\\"345\\\" data-start=\\\"327\\\">Privacy Policy<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"663\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">Thank you for choosing <strong data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Curiasity<\\/strong>. Your privacy is important to us, and we want you to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how you can control your information.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"804\\\" data-start=\\\"665\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">By using Curiasity, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of our website and services.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"809\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"842\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"842\\\" data-start=\\\"813\\\">1. Information We Collect<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"883\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We collect information in three ways:<\\/p><ol data-end=\\\"987\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"912\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\"><p data-end=\\\"912\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\">Information you provide<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"953\\\" data-start=\\\"913\\\"><p data-end=\\\"953\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\">Information collected automatically<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"987\\\" data-start=\\\"954\\\"><p data-end=\\\"987\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\">Information from third parties<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ol><hr data-end=\\\"992\\\" data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"997\\\">1.1 Information You Provide to Us<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"1076\\\" data-start=\\\"1036\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">When you use Curiasity, you may provide:<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"1103\\\" data-start=\\\"1078\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1101\\\" data-start=\\\"1078\\\">Account Information<\\/strong><\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"1172\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1106\\\">Name<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1130\\\" data-start=\\\"1113\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1130\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\">Email address<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"1131\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"1133\\\">Password<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1172\\\" data-start=\\\"1144\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1172\\\" data-start=\\\"1146\\\">Profile details (optional)<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"1200\\\" data-start=\\\"1174\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1198\\\" data-start=\\\"1174\\\">Learning Information<\\/strong><\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"1325\\\" data-start=\\\"1201\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"1235\\\" data-start=\\\"1201\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1235\\\" data-start=\\\"1203\\\">Courses you access or complete<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1284\\\" data-start=\\\"1236\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1284\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\">Progress, quizzes, assignments, certificates<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1325\\\" data-start=\\\"1285\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1325\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\">Messages, reviews, or discussion posts<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1327\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1350\\\" data-start=\\\"1327\\\">Payment Information<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1353\\\" data-start=\\\"1350\\\">If you purchase a course, we collect basic order details (e.g., name, billing info).<br data-end=\\\"1440\\\" data-start=\\\"1437\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1440\\\">Payment processing (cards\\/UPI\\/etc.) is handled securely by our payment partners. We do NOT store full credit card numbers.<\\/strong><\\/p><p data-end=\\\"1724\\\" data-start=\\\"1568\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1591\\\" data-start=\\\"1568\\\">Support Information<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1594\\\" data-start=\\\"1591\\\">When you contact us for help, we may collect your email, messages, error reports, or other details needed to resolve your request.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"1729\\\" data-start=\\\"1726\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"1778\\\" data-start=\\\"1731\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1778\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\">1.2 Information We Collect Automatically<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"1836\\\" data-start=\\\"1780\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">When you browse Curiasity, we may automatically collect:<\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"1986\\\" data-start=\\\"1838\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"1852\\\" data-start=\\\"1838\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1852\\\" data-start=\\\"1840\\\">IP address<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1880\\\" data-start=\\\"1853\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1880\\\" data-start=\\\"1855\\\">Device type and browser<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1916\\\" data-start=\\\"1881\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1916\\\" data-start=\\\"1883\\\">Pages visited and actions taken<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1956\\\" data-start=\\\"1917\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1956\\\" data-start=\\\"1919\\\">Approximate location (country\\/city)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"1986\\\" data-start=\\\"1957\\\"><p data-end=\\\"1986\\\" data-start=\\\"1959\\\">Cookies and tracking data<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"2053\\\" data-start=\\\"1988\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">This helps us improve performance, security, and user experience.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"2058\\\" data-start=\\\"2055\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"2101\\\" data-start=\\\"2060\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2101\\\" data-start=\\\"2063\\\">1.3 Information From Third Parties<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"2279\\\" data-start=\\\"2103\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We may receive limited information if you sign in using third-party platforms (e.g., Google login).<br data-end=\\\"2205\\\" data-start=\\\"2202\\\">This may include your name, email, or profile info based on your settings.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"2284\\\" data-start=\\\"2281\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"2322\\\" data-start=\\\"2286\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2322\\\" data-start=\\\"2288\\\">2. How We Use Your Information<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"2344\\\" data-start=\\\"2324\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We use your data to:<\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"2794\\\" data-start=\\\"2346\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"2380\\\" data-start=\\\"2346\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2380\\\" data-start=\\\"2348\\\">Create and manage your account<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2432\\\" data-start=\\\"2381\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2432\\\" data-start=\\\"2383\\\">Provide access to courses and learning features<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2479\\\" data-start=\\\"2433\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2479\\\" data-start=\\\"2435\\\">Track your progress and issue certificates<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2513\\\" data-start=\\\"2480\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2513\\\" data-start=\\\"2482\\\">Process payments and receipts<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2568\\\" data-start=\\\"2514\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2568\\\" data-start=\\\"2516\\\">Improve platform functionality and user experience<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2639\\\" data-start=\\\"2569\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2639\\\" data-start=\\\"2571\\\">Send account updates, notifications, or important service messages<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2668\\\" data-start=\\\"2640\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2668\\\" data-start=\\\"2642\\\">Provide customer support<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2708\\\" data-start=\\\"2669\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2708\\\" data-start=\\\"2671\\\">Prevent fraud and maintain security<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2709\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2711\\\">Personalize content and recommendations<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2794\\\" data-start=\\\"2753\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2794\\\" data-start=\\\"2755\\\">Analyze usage to improve our services<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"2834\\\" data-start=\\\"2796\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We <strong data-end=\\\"2809\\\" data-start=\\\"2799\\\">do not<\\/strong> sell your personal data.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"2839\\\" data-start=\\\"2836\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"2879\\\" data-start=\\\"2841\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2879\\\" data-start=\\\"2843\\\">3. How We Share Your Information<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"2927\\\" data-start=\\\"2881\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We may share data only in the following cases:<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"3028\\\" data-start=\\\"2929\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2949\\\" data-start=\\\"2929\\\">With Instructors<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2952\\\" data-start=\\\"2949\\\">For courses you access (excluding your email), to help them improve content.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"3165\\\" data-start=\\\"3030\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3056\\\" data-start=\\\"3030\\\">With Service Providers<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3059\\\" data-start=\\\"3056\\\">Trusted partners who help us process payments, analytics, emails, hosting, customer support, and security.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"3247\\\" data-start=\\\"3167\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3193\\\" data-start=\\\"3167\\\">With Legal Authorities<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3196\\\" data-start=\\\"3193\\\">If required by law, regulation, or safety concerns.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"3387\\\" data-start=\\\"3249\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3276\\\" data-start=\\\"3249\\\">During Business Changes<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3279\\\" data-start=\\\"3276\\\">If Curiasity undergoes acquisition, merger, or restructuring, your data may transfer as part of the process.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"3481\\\" data-start=\\\"3389\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3410\\\" data-start=\\\"3389\\\">With Your Consent<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3413\\\" data-start=\\\"3410\\\">We only share data outside these conditions if you explicitly agree.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"3486\\\" data-start=\\\"3483\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3488\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">4. Cookies &amp; Tracking<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"3553\\\" data-start=\\\"3517\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We use cookies and similar tools to:<\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"3675\\\" data-start=\\\"3555\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"3584\\\" data-start=\\\"3555\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3584\\\" data-start=\\\"3557\\\">Remember your preferences<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3607\\\" data-start=\\\"3585\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3607\\\" data-start=\\\"3587\\\">Keep you logged in<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3631\\\" data-start=\\\"3608\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3631\\\" data-start=\\\"3610\\\">Improve performance<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3651\\\" data-start=\\\"3632\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3651\\\" data-start=\\\"3634\\\">Analyze traffic<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3675\\\" data-start=\\\"3652\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3675\\\" data-start=\\\"3654\\\">Personalize content<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"3784\\\" data-start=\\\"3677\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">You can control cookies through your browser settings, but disabling them may affect website functionality.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"3789\\\" data-start=\\\"3786\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"3813\\\" data-start=\\\"3791\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3813\\\" data-start=\\\"3793\\\">5. Data Security<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"4053\\\" data-start=\\\"3815\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We use appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your information.<br data-end=\\\"3903\\\" data-start=\\\"3900\\\">However, no online system is completely secure. If you believe your account has been compromised, contact us immediately at <strong>info<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"4052\\\" data-start=\\\"4027\\\"><a data-end=\\\"4050\\\" data-start=\\\"4029\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">@curiasity.com<\\/a><\\/strong>.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"4058\\\" data-start=\\\"4055\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"4080\\\" data-start=\\\"4060\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4080\\\" data-start=\\\"4062\\\">6. Your Rights<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"4133\\\" data-start=\\\"4082\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">Depending on your location, you may have rights to:<\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"4301\\\" data-start=\\\"4135\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"4164\\\" data-start=\\\"4135\\\"><p data-end=\\\"4164\\\" data-start=\\\"4137\\\">Access your personal data<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"4198\\\" data-start=\\\"4165\\\"><p data-end=\\\"4198\\\" data-start=\\\"4167\\\">Update or correct information<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"4222\\\" data-start=\\\"4199\\\"><p data-end=\\\"4222\\\" data-start=\\\"4201\\\">Delete your account<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"4257\\\" data-start=\\\"4223\\\"><p data-end=\\\"4257\\\" data-start=\\\"4225\\\">Opt out of emails or marketing<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"4301\\\" data-start=\\\"4258\\\"><p data-end=\\\"4301\\\" data-start=\\\"4260\\\">Manage cookies and tracking preferences<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"4394\\\" data-start=\\\"4303\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">You can update most information directly through your account settings or by contacting us.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"4399\\\" data-start=\\\"4396\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"4428\\\" data-start=\\\"4401\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4428\\\" data-start=\\\"4403\\\">7. Children’s Privacy<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"4667\\\" data-start=\\\"4430\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">Curiasity is not intended for individuals under the age of 13 (or the legal age in your region).<br data-end=\\\"4529\\\" data-start=\\\"4526\\\">We do not knowingly collect data from children.<br data-end=\\\"4579\\\" data-start=\\\"4576\\\">If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us to have it removed.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"4672\\\" data-start=\\\"4669\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"4711\\\" data-start=\\\"4674\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4711\\\" data-start=\\\"4676\\\">8. International Data Transfers<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"4882\\\" data-start=\\\"4713\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">Your information may be stored or processed in countries where our servers or partners are located.<br data-end=\\\"4815\\\" data-start=\\\"4812\\\">We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your data.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"4887\\\" data-start=\\\"4884\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"4920\\\" data-start=\\\"4889\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4920\\\" data-start=\\\"4891\\\">9. Changes to This Policy<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"5121\\\" data-start=\\\"4922\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We may update this Privacy Policy periodically.<br data-end=\\\"4972\\\" data-start=\\\"4969\\\">If changes are significant, we will notify you via email or through our website.<br data-end=\\\"5055\\\" data-start=\\\"5052\\\">Continued use of the platform means you accept the updated policy.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"5126\\\" data-start=\\\"5123\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"5148\\\" data-start=\\\"5128\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"5148\\\" data-start=\\\"5130\\\">10. Contact Us<\\/strong><\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"5239\\\" data-start=\\\"5150\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding your privacy, you can reach us at:<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"5269\\\" data-start=\\\"5241\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">📧 <strong>info<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"5269\\\" data-start=\\\"5244\\\"><a data-end=\\\"5267\\\" data-start=\\\"5246\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">@curiasity.com<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p><p data-end=\\\"5364\\\" data-start=\\\"5271\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We’re committed to protecting your data and ensuring a transparent, safe learning experience.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', '/privacy', 1, 1, NULL, '2026-01-14 18:21:43', 'public/frontend/infixlmstheme/img/banner/cta_bg.jpg', 1, 0),
