ent<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2625\\\" data-start=\\\"2584\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2625\\\" data-start=\\\"2586\\\">Infringe intellectual property rights<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2678\\\" data-start=\\\"2626\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2678\\\" data-start=\\\"2628\\\">Attempt to hack, disrupt, or misuse the platform<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"2719\\\" data-start=\\\"2679\\\"><p data-end=\\\"2719\\\" data-start=\\\"2681\\\">Harass instructors or other learners<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-end=\\\"2813\\\" data-start=\\\"2721\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">We may remove content, restrict features, or disable accounts that violate these guidelines.<\\/p><p data-end=\\\"2954\\\" data-start=\\\"2815\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">Content you submit (reviews, comments, discussion posts) must be your own and must not contain personal or sensitive data unless necessary.<\\/p><hr data-end=\\\"2959\\\" data-start=\\\"2956\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><h5 data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2961\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2963\\\">5. Your Content Rights<\\/strong><\\/h5><h5 data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"2991\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">You retain ownership of the content you post on Curiasity.<\\/h5><p data-end=\\\"3173\\\" data-start=\\\"3051\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\">By posting content (reviews, discussions, assignments, etc.), you grant Curiasity a worldwide, non-exclusive license to:<\\/p><ul data-end=\\\"3289\\\" data-start=\\\"3174\\\" data-type=\\\"component-text\\\"><li data-end=\\\"3198\\\" data-start=\\\"3174\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3198\\\" data-start=\\\"3176\\\">Display your content<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3241\\\" data-start=\\\"3199\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3241\\\" data-start=\\\"3201\\\">Store and reproduce it on our platform<\\/p><\\/li><li data-end=\\\"3289\\\" data-start=\\\"3242\\\"><p data-end=\\\"3289\\\" data-start=\\\"3244\\\">Use it to maintain and improve ou