(449, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 2 Creating Basic Flows', 'This video will get you started with creating basic flows in Power Automate: the tutorial walks you through an example of creating a flow to send an email to someone using Outlook 365.', 'https://youtu.be/WaK3BO4hGo4', 'Youtube', NULL, '16.13', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:12:37', '2026-01-17 05:12:37', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(450, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 3 Creating triggered flows', 'This tutorial will show you how to write a flow which runs on a trigger. For the example used for this video, this trigger will be someone adding a new recipe to a specified folder in OneDrive, which will then cause Power Automate to send a notification email out.', 'https://youtu.be/1-yYCDSM8WQ', 'Youtube', NULL, '7.45', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:13:54', '2026-01-17 05:13:54', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(451, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 4 The Compose action and debugging', 'This tutorial shows how you can create a text file in OneDrive when someone selects a file in SharePoint. The flow you\'ll create uses a Compose action (one of the most important in Power Automate) to bring the information you want to export together, before using a OneDrive action to create a text file. You\'ll also learn about the limitations of debugging in Power Automate, and how to get round these.', 'https://youtu.be/wIbGLrg5rg8', 'Youtube', NULL, '17.48', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:15:06', '2026-01-17 05:15:06', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(452, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 5 Variables and Basic Arrays', 'This tutorial is the first of a series of 3. It explains what variables are in Power Automate and how to use them, and also gives example of setting and collapsing arrays. The next two tutorials in the series will show how to tidy up flows to make them neater and more elegant, and how to add conditions to test expressions in flows.', 'https://youtu.be/Y0ZoJOUoR30', 'Youtube', NULL, '22.02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:16:22', '2026-01-17 05:16:22', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(453, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 6 Tidying Up Flows', 'This tutorial will show you how to make flows easier to read (and also more efficient). You\'ll learn how to group actions together using Scope, how to create branches in flows and how to work with expressions more efficiently. Note that you should watch the previous tutorial on variables and arrays before watching this one (this is the second tutorial in a mini-series of three).', 'https://youtu.be/pxfqHpEbHp8', 'Youtube', NULL, '12.05', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:17:22', '2026-01-17 05:17:22', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(454, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 7 Conditions', 'This tutorial will show you how to add conditions to flow, whether using the simple Condition action to test between two possibilities or the more complicated Switch action to test between multiple mutually exclusive options.', 'https://youtu.be/pOSai63-OQE', 'Youtube', NULL, '11.43', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:18:52', '2026-01-17 05:18:52', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(455, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 8 Working with tables', 'This tutorial will show how to load data from Excel tables, SharePoint lists, Outlook (for example, lists of emails) and OneDrive (for example, lists of files and folders). The tutorial also shows how to select only the columns you need, and how to present the information in an HTML table.', 'https://youtu.be/CnUWRyUS9A0', 'Youtube', NULL, '33.03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:20:15', '2026-01-17 05:20:15', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(456, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 9 Sorting and Filtering using OData', 'This tutorial shows how you can use OData to sort and filter tables of rows returned from online cloud-based apps like SharePoint and Excel 365, and why you should want to do this.', 'https://youtu.be/so3oXOo7lsM', 'Youtube', NULL, '27.33', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:21:44', '2026-01-17 05:21:44', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(457, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 10 Apply to Each loops', 'This tutorial will explain some of the things about Power Automate which may have been puzzling you, such as:\r\n- why Power Automate keeps randomly embedding your actions in Apply to Each loops\r\n- how you can copy dynamic content into an expression for subsequent editing\r\n- the syntax of expressions, on what all those question-marks mean\r\nThe tutorial explains how to create and use Apply to Each loops in Power Automate, using the example of looping over the rows in an Excel table.', 'https://youtu.be/kEa27SAmkMA', 'Youtube', NULL, '19.24', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:23:28', '2026-01-17 05:23:28', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(458, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 11 Error Handling', 'This video shows how to handle errors in Power Automate flows. While it contains some complicated expressions, it will give you a good understanding into creating JSON expressions (as well as in the best way to implement error-handling).', 'https://youtu.be/nzZjdO8qd0k', 'Youtube', NULL, '23.10', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:24:21', '2026-01-17 05:24:21', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(459, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 12 Approvals', 'This video shows how you how to create an approvals process. For our example when someone adds a film to a suggested watch list, you (or someone else) will be able to accept or reject the recommendation, giving your reasons. This acceptance or rejection (with the corresponding reason) will be flagged in SharePoint and the person who added the film will receive a notification of the result.', 'https://youtu.be/rnEqrWAanxM', 'Youtube', NULL, '34.06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:25:40', '2026-01-17 05:25:40', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(460, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 13a Automating Forms', 'This video shows how to write flows to run when someone fills in a form that you\'ve created. The cloud-based Forms application only exposes one trigger and one action, so there\'s not too much that you can do to automate forms using flows, but this tutorial also gives a handy introduction to how to create and distribute surveys using the easy-to-use Forms application.', 'https://youtu.be/w3P7su1NqRc', 'Youtube', NULL, '19.27', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:26:40', '2026-01-17 05:26:40', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `course_id`, `course_type`, `start_date`, `start_time`, `end_date`, `end_time`, `status`, `chapter_id`, `quiz_id`, `name`, `description`, `video_url`, `host`, `bu`, `duration`, `is_lock`, `is_quiz`, `unlock_date`, `unlock_days`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `position`, `is_assignment`, `assignment_id`, `lms_id`, `old_file_size`, `file_size`, `file_id`, `editor`, `scorm_title`, `scorm_version`, `scorm_identifier`) VALUES
(461, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 13b Automating Power BI Desktop', 'This video shows how you can create Power Automate buttons in Power BI reports, which run flows when you click on them. The example in this tutorial shows how you can email the current data in the filter context for a visual to someone just by clicking on a button embedded in a report.', 'https://youtu.be/QEl_mPjmVHo', 'Youtube', NULL, '21.06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:29:27', '2026-01-17 05:29:27', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(462, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 13c Automating Teams', 'This video shows how you can create a flow to interact with Teams. The example used is to listen for specific keywords mentioned in a Teams channel, and post updates to another channel when these designated keywords are mentioned.', 'https://youtu.be/M7ombMzIGvI', 'Youtube', NULL, '15.23', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:30:27', '2026-01-17 05:30:27', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(463, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 14 Child flows solutions and inputs', 'This video shows how you can delegate your error-handling to a separate flow, and then call this child flow when an error is triggered. Along the way you\'ll also learn about passing inputs to triggers and about creating solutions.', 'https://youtu.be/7VW-Hn7J8lw', 'Youtube', NULL, '17.06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:31:32', '2026-01-17 05:31:32', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(464, 181, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 236, NULL, 'Part 15 Tracked Properties', 'This video shows how you can create tracked properties for any action, using them for this example to time how long an action takes to run.', 'https://youtu.be/NafP7QIw3_Y', 'Youtube', NULL, '11.01', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-17 05:32:32', '2026-01-17 05:32:32', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
