(932, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Basic Tutorial for Beginners 1', 'In this AutoCAD 3D basics training tutorial for beginners we will learn AutoCAD basic 3D commands step by step from scratch. This is AutoCAD basic 3d drawing tutorial. AutoCAD 3D basics taught in this tutorial are how to convert 2D shapes to 3D, How to use press pull command, How to change 3D UCS, visual styles, views, orbit.', 'https://youtu.be/Vm_fQom-Rm8', 'Youtube', NULL, '19.22', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 02:58:16', '2026-03-17 02:58:16', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(933, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'L 2 - AutoCAD 3D Mechanical Drawing Tutorial 1', 'In this tutorial we will practice some 3D modeling exercises based on what we learn in previous  For one of the object we will learn to create perfect flawless 3D rib in AutoCAD. In this tutorial we will use 3D AutoCAD commands such as presspull, extrude, union, substract, copy edges and so on.', 'https://youtu.be/U3kGINzBO-k', 'Youtube', NULL, '28.46', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:02:42', '2026-03-17 03:02:42', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(934, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Basic Tutorial for Beginners 2', 'In this AutoCAD 3D basics tutorial we will learn next set of AutoCAD 3D commands such as Extrude, extrude editing , UCS Face, FilletEdge, Box, ChamferEdge, Presspull Editing, 3D Mirror, 3D Align, 3D Rotate, 3D Fillet, 3D Chamfer.', 'https://youtu.be/-pOa6XIVhU0', 'Youtube', NULL, '17.30', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:11:44', '2026-03-17 03:11:44', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(935, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Mechanical Drawing Tutorial 2', 'This is AutoCAD 3D mechanical modeling drawing exercises tutorial for beginners.', 'https://youtu.be/R1fU0hCfMkg', 'Youtube', NULL, '11.06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:13:12', '2026-03-17 03:13:12', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(936, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Mechanical Drawing Tutorial 3', 'This is AutoCAD 3D tutorial for beginners Mechanical . AutoCAD 3D practice drawing.', 'https://youtu.be/WgzpfKcwwO8', 'Youtube', NULL, '12.38', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:16:00', '2026-03-17 03:16:00', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(937, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2023 3D Tutorial for Beginners', 'This tutorial shows how to create you first 3D object in AutoCAD 2023 step by step from scratch. AutoCAD commands used in this tutorial are Box, Copy Edges, Press Pull, Solid Union, Line, Circle, Join. This is AutoCAD 3D Modeling Tutorial.', 'https://youtu.be/UyFJevWzhCk', 'Youtube', NULL, '21.14', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:19:07', '2026-03-17 03:19:07', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(938, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Revolve Command', 'AutoCAD 3D Revolve Command. In this AutoCAD 3D Basic Tutorial for Beginners - 3 we will learn all the options from Revolve Command. Revolve options covered in this tutorial are Axis start point, axis end point, object, x, y, z, mode solid and surface. This also shows how to create surface and solid revolve.', 'https://youtu.be/pHtNJX-VHXQ', 'Youtube', NULL, '13.49', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:20:42', '2026-03-17 03:20:42', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(939, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2022 3D Modeling Practice Drawing AutoCAD 3D Revolve Command Practice', 'AutoCAD 2022 3D Modeling Practice Drawing | AutoCAD 3D Revolve Command Practice. In this AutoCAD 3D Drawing Tutorial we will solve one exercise based on what we learn in previous AutoCAD 3D Revolve Command Tutorial [ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHtNJX-VHXQ ] theory lecture. We will create this AutoCAD 3D mechanical drawing step by step from scratch.', 'https://youtu.be/0iBOL65W2ow', 'Youtube', NULL, '13.32', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:21:53', '2026-03-17 03:21:53', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(940, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Sweep Command Tutorial Complete Sweep Twist Multiple profiles Path Surface', 'AutoCAD 3D Sweep Command Tutorial Complete | Sweep Twist, Multiple profiles, Path, Alignment, Basepoint, Surface. This tutorial shows how to use sweep command in AutoCAD step by step. All the options such as twist, basepoint, scale, alignment are shown. AutoCAD commands used in this tutorial are line, ucs, join, circle, rectangle, sweep, shell, trim', 'https://youtu.be/kTLcbfOWw2g', 'Youtube', NULL, '08.03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:23:40', '2026-03-17 03:23:40', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(941, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Practice Drawing for Sweep Command AutoCAD 3D Modeling Paper Clip Cotter Pin Tutorial', 'AutoCAD 3D Practice Drawing for Sweep Command | AutoCAD 3D Modeling Paper Clip & Cotter Pin Tutorial. This tutorial shows step by step how to create cotter pin & paper clip in AutoCAD 2015 using sweep command.', 'https://youtu.be/Z7eO79IxW8Y', 'Youtube', NULL, '07.17', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:24:58', '2026-03-17 03:24:58', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(942, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD Advanced 3D Modeling Tutorial', 'AutoCAD Advanced 3D Modeling Tutorial. AutoCAD 3D Advanced Tutorial. In this AutoCAD 3D tutorial we will use combination of surface modeling and 3D modeling to create this complex part step by step from scratch.', 'https://youtu.be/xSk0kJdTZo8', 'Youtube', NULL, '11.36', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:26:36', '2026-03-17 03:26:36', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(943, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Loft Command Tutorial Complete AutoCAD Loft Path AutoCAD Loft Guides', 'AutoCAD 3D Loft Command Tutorial Complete | AutoCAD Loft Path | AutoCAD Loft Guides. This tutorial shows how to use loft command in AutoCAD step by step. All the loft command tool options such as path, cross section only and guides are covered. Shell command is used to create hollow part.', 'https://youtu.be/-csG9hukV0w', 'Youtube', NULL, '06.59', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:27:41', '2026-03-17 03:27:41', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(944, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2023 3D Tutorial for Beginners 2', 'AutoCAD 2023 3D Tutorial for Beginners - 2. In this AutoCAD 3D drawing modeling tutorial we will create funnel 3D model step by step from scratch. We will mainly use AutoCAD 3D loft command.', 'https://youtu.be/2ORHavad_wU', 'Youtube', NULL, '17.25', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:28:42', '2026-03-17 03:28:42', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(945, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Practice Drawing for Loft Command AutoCAD 3D Mechanical Drawing Bottle Screw Driver', 'AutoCAD 3D Practice Drawing for Loft Command | AutoCAD 3D Mechanical Drawing Modeling Bottle & Screw Driver. This tutorial shows how to create 3D mechanical object such as screw driver & bottle step by step using Loft command in AutoCAD 3D. Other AutoCAD commands used in this tutorial are rectangle, circle, move in z axis, loft, line in inches, units, fillet, revolve, presspull.', 'https://youtu.be/8PCFt1O7EL8', 'Youtube', NULL, '09.58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:29:53', '2026-03-17 03:29:53', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(946, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 3D Helix Command Tutorial Complete Spiral Curve Command Helix Along Path Spring Threads', 'AutoCAD 3D Helix Command Tutorial Complete | Spiral Curve Command, Helix Along Path, Spring, Threads. This tutorial shows how to create helix and other objects such as spiral curve, helix along path, spring, conical helix and threads in AutoCAD step by step. AutoCAD commands used in this tutorial are helix, sweep, surface sweep, twist, extract edges.', 'https://youtu.be/hBRFk9K8OZY', 'Youtube', NULL, '05.50', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:31:26', '2026-03-17 03:31:26', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(947, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2022 3D Tutorial for Beginners', 'AutoCAD 2022 3D Tutorial for Beginners. In this AutoCAD 3d tutorial for beginners, we will learn AutoCAD 3D modeling basics by creating 3D drawing step by step from scratch. AutoCAD 3D drawing practice.', 'https://youtu.be/ewhcG-tUNzk', 'Youtube', NULL, '13.01', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:32:26', '2026-03-17 03:32:26', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(948, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2020 3D Tutorial for Beginners', 'AutoCAD 2020 3D Tutorial for Beginners. This tutorial shows how to make 3D objects in AutoCAD 2020 step by step from scratch. This is a AutoCAD 2020 3D drawing modeling tutorial. We will learn AutoCAD 2020 3D basics and AutoCAD 2020 3D settings in detail.', 'https://youtu.be/h2YvBMOV_j4', 'Youtube', NULL, '11.31', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:33:56', '2026-03-17 03:33:56', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(949, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2018 3D Tutorial for Beginners', 'AutoCAD 2018 3D Tutorial for Beginners. This tutorial shows step by step, how to create 3D object in AutoCAD 2018 from scratch. AutoCAD commands used in this tutorial are circle, line, tangent line, presspull, change ucs plane, move, offset, presspull cut. Topics covered in this tutorial are:\r\nAutoCAD 2018 3D tutorial\r\nAutoCAD 2018 3D drawing\r\nAutoCAD 2018 3D modeling workspace\r\nAutoCAD 2018 3D modeling tutorial\r\nAutoCAD 2018 3D modelling', 'https://youtu.be/wY3rezjj9es', 'Youtube', NULL, '10.27', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:35:41', '2026-03-17 03:35:41', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(950, 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 259, NULL, 'AutoCAD 2018 3D Dimensioning Tutorial', 'AutoCAD 2018 3D Dimensioning Tutorial. This tutorial shows how to place dimensions for 3D object in AutoCAD 2018 step by step. Even though this video is made with AutoCAD 2018, you can also follow these procedures for other version of AutoCAD. Briefly topics covered in this tutorial are:\r\n- How to place dimensions on 3D Object.\r\n- How to change scale of dimension for proper visibility.\r\n- How to change plane for dimensions on different surfaces.\r\n- How to rotate UCS icon.\r\n- How to move UCS Icon.\r\n- How to align UCS icon.\r\n- How to make layer for center line.\r\n- How to create center lines.', 'https://youtu.be/ZJk4-fLFzsI', 'Youtube', NULL, '14.10', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 03:36:55', '2026-03-17 03:36:55', 999999, 0, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
